#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityLocation.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Put your Techniques to the test in these risky Obstacle Courses and be rewarded with "
"Tokens to spend.\n"
"\n"
"[b]An entry cost is required per attempt.[/b]"
msgstr ""
"在这些危险的障碍路线上考验自己的技巧，完成挑战即可赚取代币。\n"
"\n"
"[b]每次挑战都需支付入场费。[/b]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityLocation.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unique Trails"
msgstr "特殊小径"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityLocation.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[b]Unlock specialty content[/b] around the game by completing Unique Trails that gain "
"access to hidden locations around Melvor.\n"
"\n"
"[b]Maps are required to be found prior to attempting.[/b]"
msgstr ""
"走完特殊小径，即可前往梅尔沃各地的隐藏地点，[b]解锁游戏中的特色内容[/b]。\n"
"\n"
"[b]找到对应的地图后，才能挑战该小径。[/b]"

