#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Overgrowth grants +1 On Hit & On Cut quantity. One stack is consumed per full Cut. "
msgstr "过度生长效果使每次命中和砍伐的产出数量+1。每完成一次完整砍伐，消耗1层效果。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Major 2"
msgstr "主要加成2"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hitting a weakspot deals (0.1 * Max HP + 3) damage"
msgstr "命中弱点时造成（0.1 * 最大生命值 + 3）点伤害"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Major 3"
msgstr "主要加成3"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Major 4"
msgstr "主要加成4"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Shatter grants +200% Bonus Product Quantity and +100% Bonus Skill XP"
msgstr "破碎效果提供+200%额外产品数量和+100%额外技能经验"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to observe [color=#FFD16D]Meteor Shower[/color] and "
"[color=#FFD16D]Starfall[/color] events in Firemaking"
msgstr ""
"解锁在生火时观测[color=#FFD16D]陨石雨[/color]和[color=#FFD16D]星落[/color]事件的能力"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to obtain [color=#FFD16D]Fireflies[/color] while burning Logs in "
"Firemaking"
msgstr "解锁在生火时燃烧原木获得[color=#FFD16D]萤火虫[/color]的能力"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Offerings[/color] toggle in Beastcrafting for Beast "
"Weapons and Beast Armour, allowing you to offer your crafted Item in return for a "
"potential gift."
msgstr ""
"解锁兽工造物站中野兽武器和野兽盔甲的[color=#FFD16D]星象祭品[/color]开关。开启后，你可以"
"献上制作的物品，有机会获得一份回礼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Sacrificial Anvil[/color] in Smithing, allowing you to "
"sacrifice your smithed item in return for extra Skill XP, GP or a rare Collectable"
msgstr ""
"解锁锻造中的[color=#FFD16D]献祭砧台[/color]，让你可以献祭锻造出的物品，换取额外的技能经"
"验、金币或稀有收藏品"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Smelting -> Star Forge[/color] in Smithing, allowing to you "
"create Alloy Bars such as Ironsteel or Dragonrune"
msgstr ""
"解锁锻造中的[color=#FFD16D]熔炼 -> 星辰熔炉[/color]，可用于制作铁钢、龙符文等合金锭"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Jewellery[/color] in Crafting"
msgstr "解锁制造中的[color=#FFD16D]星象珠宝[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Night Sprints[/color] in Agility."
msgstr "解锁灵巧中的[color=#FFD16D]夜间冲刺[/color]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Catalyst Toolbelt Slot[/color] in Herblore"
msgstr "解锁草药学中的[color=#FFD16D]催化剂工具带栏位[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You study the stars carefully, but they remain silent."
msgstr "你仔细观察群星，可它们始终一言不发。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation offers no insight this time."
msgstr "这一次，星座没能给你带来任何启示。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whatever message the stars held has slipped away."
msgstr "群星原本想传达的信息，如今已无从知晓。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You sense a faint presence among the stars, but it quickly fades."
msgstr "你隐约感觉到群星间有什么存在，但那股气息很快便消散了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation's light flickers without revealing its secrets."
msgstr "星座的光芒闪烁不定，却始终没有透露半点秘密。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wait patiently for a sign, but none arrives."
msgstr "你耐心等待着某种征兆，可始终没有动静。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You almost discern a message before it vanishes from your thoughts."
msgstr "你差一点就领悟了其中的信息，可转眼间，那点灵光便消失得无影无踪。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#. [待复核] Excel 里该行原文已被破坏，译文按行序对应，请核对
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation politely declines to elaborate."
msgstr "星座客气地表示：无可奉告。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#. [待复核] Excel 里该行原文已被破坏，译文按行序对应，请核对
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You feel certain the stars judged your attempt. They offer no further comment."
msgstr "你确信群星已经对你的尝试做出了评价。只是它们不打算告诉你结果。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Even the stars have off days."
msgstr "就连群星也有状态不佳的时候。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You continue to observe the stars, confirming that they are indeed stars."
msgstr "你继续观察群星，最终确认了一件事：它们确实是星星。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Deedree Observation"
msgid_plural "Deedree Observations"
msgstr[0] "狄德利观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that talking to plants helps. They refuse to comment on whether the "
"plants listen."
msgstr "群星坚称，和植物说话确实有用。至于植物听不听得进去，它们拒绝发表评论。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation warns that the tallest tree always wins an argument with a blunt axe."
msgstr "星座警告你：拿着钝斧头跟参天大树较劲，赢的总是树。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars reveal that weeds are simply crops with exceptional confidence."
msgstr "群星告诉你，杂草不过是自信过头的庄稼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars suggest that planting today is wiser than promising you'll plant tomorrow."
msgstr "群星建议，别光想着明天再种，今天就把种子播下去吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every mighty Oak Tree was once a seed that ignored terrible "
"advice."
msgstr "星座声称，每棵参天橡树都曾是一粒不听馊主意的种子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars quietly remind you that chopping the tree before collecting the fruit is "
"rarely the optimal strategy."
msgstr "群星悄悄提醒你，还没摘果子就把树砍了，通常不是什么明智之举。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Terra Observation"
msgid_plural "Terra Observations"
msgstr[0] "泰拉观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why you're not mining Coal right now."
msgstr "群星很好奇，你现在怎么不去挖煤炭？"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars insist that hitting the rock harder is a valid mining strategy."
msgstr "群星坚称，挖矿时用力敲总不会错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellations insists you are one Geode away from finding that rare item."
msgstr "星座坚称，只要再开一块晶洞石，你就能找到那件稀有物品。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder how staring at them all night helps build Strength."
msgstr "群星不明白，盯着它们看一整晚，究竟能让你的力量提升多少。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that a high Strength level won't save you from the Coal "
"mines."
msgstr "星座提醒你，就算力量等级再高，进了煤矿也未必能轻松应付。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars stare back at you."
msgstr "群星也在盯着你看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ameria Observation"
msgid_plural "Ameria Observations"
msgstr[0] "艾美利亚观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars whisper that fish are far less cooperative once they realize they're on the "
"menu."
msgstr "群星低声告诉你，鱼儿一旦发现自己要被端上餐桌，就不会那么配合了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars suggest drying your firewood before complaining that it won't burn."
msgstr "群星建议你抱怨柴火怎么也点不着之前先把柴晾干。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that cooking the fish is generally easier after you've "
"caught it."
msgstr "星座提醒你，鱼都还没钓上来，就先别惦记着下锅了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that a warm campfire has ended more adventures than any "
"monster."
msgstr "星座坚称，比起凶猛的怪物，一堆暖和的篝火反倒更容易让冒险者打消继续赶路的念头。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a secluded steam within the Shrapnel River."
msgstr "群星指引你来到溪泾深处一条偏僻的溪流。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Stream Fishing spot."
"[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]此次观测解锁了月光溪流钓点。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgid_plural "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgstr[0] "艾美利亚的午夜海湾"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a hidden spot along the Windy Coastline."
msgstr "群星指引你前往风啸海岸的一处隐秘地点。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Midnight Cove Fishing spot."
"[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]此次观测解锁了午夜海湾钓点。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ceedyr Observation"
msgid_plural "Ceedyr Observations"
msgstr[0] "塞迪尔观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every perfect hide once belonged to something that strongly "
"preferred keeping it."
msgstr "星座声称，每一张完美的兽皮，都曾属于一只死活不愿交出它的动物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why creatures are so attached to materials you clearly need "
"for crafting."
msgstr "星座实在想不通，明明是你制作物品需要的材料，那些动物怎么就舍不得交出来呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that chasing wildlife is considerably easier without carrying half "
"your workshop."
msgstr "群星提醒你，追赶野兽的时候，最好别把半个工坊都背在身上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that \"I'll just hunt one more\" has misled countless adventurers."
msgstr "群星坚称，不知多少冒险者都栽在了“再猎一只就收手”这句话上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals that collecting \"just in case\" materials eventually becomes "
"a storage problem."
msgstr "星座告诉你，那些“说不定以后用得上”的材料，攒到最后都会变成仓库的负担。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgid_plural "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgstr[0] "塞迪尔的月光丘陵"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation lights a path towards a hidden opening in the Hills."
msgstr "星座照亮了一条通往丘陵深处隐秘入口的道路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Hills Hunting "
"Location.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]此次观测解锁了月光丘陵狩猎地点。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgid_plural "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgstr[0] "艾丽丹的新月湖"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation points toward a tranquil lake where the water curves like a crescent "
"moon. A hidden shoreline beckons those willing to seek it."
msgstr ""
"星座指向一片宁静的湖泊，弯弯的湖岸宛如一轮新月。隐秘的湖畔正等待着有心前来探寻的人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Crescent Lake Combat Area.[/"
"color]"
msgstr "[color=green]此次观测解锁了新月湖战斗区域。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Iridan Observation"
msgid_plural "Iridan Observations"
msgstr[0] "艾丽丹观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim that yelling while attacking increases accuracy."
msgstr "群星声称，攻击时大喊一声能提高命中率。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that every dent in your armour is a valuable lesson. Preferably "
"someone else's lesson."
msgstr ""
"群星提醒你，盔甲上的每一道凹痕都是宝贵的教训。当然，最好是从别人的盔甲上吸取教训。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation claims that missing your target is not a valid strategy."
msgstr "星座坚称，打不中目标可算不上什么战术。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim every unique weapon began life as \"good enough for now.\""
msgstr "群星声称，每一把独一无二的武器，最初都只是件“先凑合着用”的家伙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars insist that hitting harder is a perfectly valid strategy."
msgstr "群星坚称，打得更狠当然也是一种有效的战术。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Syllia Observation"
msgid_plural "Syllia Observations"
msgstr[0] "希里亚观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every arrow flies true until the wind develops a personality."
msgstr "星座声称，每支箭都能百发百中，除非风突然有了自己的想法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars suggest aiming before celebrating the shot."
msgstr "群星建议，还是先瞄准了再庆祝吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation reminds you that trees rarely volunteer to become arrows."
msgstr "星座提醒你，树木可不会自愿变成箭矢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why arrows are always found in the most inconvenient places."
msgstr "群星很纳闷，为什么射出去的箭总是落在最难捡回来的地方？"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a quiver is merely a very organised collection of future "
"mistakes."
msgstr "星座声称，箭袋不过是把未来可能射偏的箭整整齐齐地收在了一起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation advises remembering that boomerangs are designed to return."
msgstr "星座提醒你，别忘了回旋镖可是会飞回来的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Haemir Observation"
msgid_plural "Haemir Observations"
msgstr[0] "海米尔观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Placeholder to replace."
msgstr "待替换的占位文本。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Arachi Observation"
msgid_plural "Arachi Observations"
msgstr[0] "阿拉奇观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars insist that every spell is perfectly safe until proven otherwise."
msgstr "群星坚称，任何法术都是绝对安全的，除非事实证明并非如此。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why wizards keep writing things down when they can barely "
"read their own spellbooks."
msgstr "星座实在想不通，巫师们连自己的法术书都快看不懂了，怎么还一个劲儿地往上写东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The heavens insist that magical explosions are merely enthusiastic successes."
msgstr "苍穹坚称，魔法爆炸不过是成功得有点太热烈了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every great mage has accidentally cast something they absolutely "
"didn't mean to."
msgstr "群星告诉你，每位伟大的法师都曾失手施放过自己压根不想用的法术。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that staring at it all night won't solve your Rune supply "
"problems."
msgstr "星座提醒你，就算盯着它看一整晚，也解决不了符文不够用的问题。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Astral Learning of Arachi"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Arachi"
msgstr[0] "阿拉奇的星象领悟"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You somehow learn a new form of Magic by simply looking at the stars and pretending to "
"read them or something lol."
msgstr ""
"你不过是盯着星星看了看，装模作样地研究了一番，居然就莫名其妙学会了一种新魔法。哈哈。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral Spells.[/"
"color]"
msgstr "[color=green]此次观测让你掌握了使用星象咒语的知识。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Astral Learning of Hyden"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Hyden"
msgstr[0] "海登的星象领悟"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals an ancient rite. Its celestial words awaken the power of "
"Astral Prayers."
msgstr "星座揭示了一种古老的仪式。来自天穹的神秘祷文唤醒了星象祝祭的力量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral Prayers.[/"
"color]"
msgstr "[color=green]此次观测让你掌握了使用星象祝祭的知识。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hyden Observation"
msgid_plural "Hyden Observations"
msgstr[0] "海登观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that blessed logs burn brighter than ordinary ones. Coincidence, "
"perhaps."
msgstr "群星告诉你，受过祝福的原木烧起来比普通原木更亮。也许只是巧合吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder who first looked at a pile of bones and thought, \"The gods will love "
"this.\""
msgstr "群星很好奇，究竟是谁第一个看着一堆骨头，心想：“众神肯定喜欢这个！”"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insist that divine favour cannot be bought. Offerings, however, are "
"gladly accepted."
msgstr "星座坚称，神明的恩宠可不是花钱就能买来的。不过嘛，祭品倒是来者不拒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims the gods have excellent taste in offerings, though their "
"preferences remain oddly specific."
msgstr "星座声称，众神对祭品的品味相当高雅，只是喜好总有些莫名其妙的讲究。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation observes that the gods rarely explain why they like bones. They "
"simply do."
msgstr "星座发现，众神很少解释自己为什么喜欢骨头。反正就是喜欢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgid_plural "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgstr[0] "维拉的月痕陨坑"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal a crater where moonlight never truly fades. Something ancient still "
"stirs within its scar."
msgstr ""
"群星揭示了一处月光永不消散的陨坑。在那道古老的伤痕深处，某种远古之物仍在蠢蠢欲动。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonscarred Crater Slayer "
"Zone.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]此次观测解锁了月痕陨坑屠杀者区域。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Vale Observation"
msgid_plural "Vale Observations"
msgstr[0] "维拉观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder where your ingredients go when you fail to cook something."
msgstr "群星很好奇，烹饪失败的时候，你的食材究竟都跑哪儿去了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a hearty meal can solve many problems. The remaining problems "
"usually require a weapon."
msgstr "星座声称，饱餐一顿能解决不少问题。至于剩下的问题，通常得靠武器解决。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that eating during a battle is a skill worthy of admiration."
msgstr "星座坚称，能在战斗中抽空吃东西，也是一门值得佩服的本事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that a full stomach is often the first step toward surviving the next "
"encounter."
msgstr "群星告诉你，想在下一场战斗中活下来，第一步往往是先填饱肚子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation claims every meal tastes better after narrowly avoiding defeat."
msgstr "星座声称，刚打了败仗捡回一条命，吃什么都会格外香。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ko Observation"
msgid_plural "Ko Observations"
msgstr[0] "廓尔观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation claims locked doors are merely suggestions."
msgstr "星座声称，门锁只是摆设，想进去总有办法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every graceful landing is built upon countless less graceful ones."
msgstr "群星告诉你，每一次漂亮的落地，背后都有无数次狼狈的摔跤。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why NPCs cannot pickpocket you as well."
msgstr "群星很好奇，为什么NPC就不能反过来扒窃你呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation hints at accepting bribes for more Stealth in return."
msgstr "星座暗示，只要给它点好处，说不定就能帮你提高隐匿值。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why a very specific item seems to constantly appear on random "
"routes."
msgstr "星座实在想不通，为什么某件特定物品总会莫名其妙地出现在随机路线中。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation reminds you that it cannot assist with your Lockpick problem."
msgstr "星座提醒你，开锁工具的问题可别指望它来解决。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tellus Observation"
msgid_plural "Tellus Observations"
msgstr[0] "特鲁斯观测"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that the best defence is letting the monster become someone else's "
"assignment."
msgstr "群星坚称，最好的防御就是把怪物交给别人对付。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every Slayer task looks reasonable until you actually arrive."
msgstr "星座声称，每个屠杀者任务看起来都挺合理，直到你亲自赶到现场。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars reveal that shields are much easier to repair than confidence."
msgstr "群星告诉你，修好一面盾牌，可比找回信心容易多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder if Slayer Masters secretly compete to invent increasingly inconvenient "
"tasks."
msgstr "群星怀疑，屠杀者大师们是不是在暗地里比赛，看谁能想出更折腾人的任务。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that \"just one more monster\" has delayed many journeys home."
msgstr "星座坚称，不知多少冒险者都因为一句“再打一只怪物就回家”，耽误了归程。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every experienced slayer has confidently attacked the wrong "
"monster at least once."
msgstr "群星告诉你，每个经验丰富的屠杀者，都至少有过一次信心满满却打错怪物的经历。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ceedyr's Pathway"
msgid_plural "Ceedyr's Pathways"
msgstr[0] "塞迪尔的指引之路"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[color=orange][b]Ceedyr shines brightly, revealing a path forward.[/b][/color]"
msgstr "[color=orange][b]塞迪尔的光芒愈发明亮，照亮了前方的道路。[/b][/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Iridan's Pathway"
msgid_plural "Iridan's Pathways"
msgstr[0] "艾丽丹的指引之路"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[color=orange][b]Iridan shines brightly, revealing a path forward.[/b][/color]"
msgstr "[color=orange][b]艾丽丹的光芒愈发明亮，照亮了前方的道路。[/b][/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Syllia's Pathway"
msgid_plural "Syllia's Pathway"
msgstr[0] "希里亚的指引之路"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[color=orange][b]Syllia shines brightly, revealing a path forward.[/b][/color]"
msgstr "[color=orange][b]希里亚的光芒愈发明亮，照亮了前方的道路。[/b][/color]"

