#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Seeds of Sustenance - The owner of the Spiced Honey Tavern has been having an issue "
"keeping her pantry stocked, as goods have slowly but surely vanishing in the night. "
"Worried about her customers going hungry, she reached out to you, hoping for a moment "
"of your time."
msgstr ""
"维持生计的种子——香蜜酒馆的老板最近遇到了麻烦，店里存放的东西总在夜里不翼而飞，店里存货不"
"足。她担心客人会挨饿，于是向你求助，希望你能花点时间帮帮她。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Only the best for Lira. I'll need to harvest some fresh produce, then hand it over."
msgstr "既然是利拉，那就要最好的。我去采些新鲜食材，然后给她送过去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These look great, hopefully it'll be enough to last her a while."
msgstr "这些看起来不错，希望能够她撑一段时间。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you walk into the warm tavern, a middle-aged woman rushes by you in a blur, carrying "
"a half dozen tankards of ale, then quickly setting them in front of two excited looking "
"patrons.\n"
"The whole place is buzzing with rowdy energy, but it remains light and warm. Despite "
"all people clamoring for her attention, they quickly fall to silence as Lira holds up "
"her hand. She gives you a warm embrace, then pinches your cheek shortly afterward."
msgstr ""
"当你走进温暖的酒馆时，一位中间女子从你身边匆匆掠过。她手里端着六大杯麦芽酒，将酒快速放到"
"两位兴奋的顾客面前。酒馆内十分热闹，温暖又明亮。周围的人都在叫利拉，但她一抬手，大家立刻"
"安静了下来。她热情地拥抱你，然后轻轻捏了捏你的脸。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's so lovely to see you [i]{0}[/i]. Thank you for coming to see me on such short "
"notice."
msgstr "见到你真是太好了[i]{0}[/i]。谢谢你匆匆忙忙地来见我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Of course, Lira, any time. You sounded urgent in the note you sent me, how can I help?"
msgstr "我肯定随叫随到，利拉。你在便条里好像挺急的，有什么我能帮忙的吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We've been running through our food supply far faster than we should be as of these "
"last few weeks. I don't know where it could possibly be going, but it's a problem."
msgstr "这几周我们的食物用得很快，比正常情况快多了。我不知道都去哪儿了，但肯定有问题。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I can only imagine, looks like you're feeding half the town in here. Business is going "
"well, it'd seem?"
msgstr "我能想到的只有你，现在半个镇子的人都靠你养。生意不错，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Half of Azamire, and a bit from every nearby town, too. If I don't find a way to get "
"some fresh produce, I might have to start turning folks away."
msgstr ""
"不仅仅是阿扎米尔一半的人，还有附近镇子的人。如果找不到新鲜食材，我恐怕只能闭门谢客了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I can always find a bit of time to help out. What do you need the most?"
msgstr "别担心，我会抽时间帮你的。现在你最需要的是什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much... I'd like to cook up some stew. Some potatoes and onions would keep "
"this place happy and fed for quite a while, if it's really not too much trouble."
msgstr ""
"太谢谢你了……我想做点炖菜。如果不太麻烦的话，弄些土豆和洋葱就行，这些就够大家填饱肚子，撑"
"一阵子了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That shouldn't be an issue in the slightest. We'll be back soon!"
msgstr "那完全没问题。我们很快就回来！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you turn to leave the Spiced Honey Tavern, the quieted customers start to stir once "
"again, chattering among themselves or asking for refills on their ever dwindling pints."
msgstr ""
"当你转身离开香蜜酒馆时，原本安静的顾客又开始喧闹起来，他们唠叨闲聊或者呼喊着添酒倒酒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's a large fireplace, it'll take a lot of wood to fill, and a decent bit of effort to "
"get it all burning."
msgstr "店里有个大壁炉，加满的话要不少木材，生火也要费些功夫。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A few folks begin to crowd around the fire, enjoying the warmth, now all that's left is "
"to wait for Lira's stew. [Burn] X/X [Oak Logs] - [Complete Button]"
msgstr ""
"几个人围在炉边烤火；现在大家都在等利拉的炖菜。[Burn] X/X [Oak Logs] - [Complete Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With fresh produce in tow, you make your way back into the Spiced Honey Tavern. A "
"couple of excited looking patrons eye the vegetables, knowing that they'll soon have it "
"cooked and on their table.\n"
"\n"
"Lira beams when she sees you. She motions for you to hand your haul over to a large, "
"bearded man who has an apron half-tied around him."
msgstr ""
"你带着新鲜食材回到香蜜酒馆。几位兴奋的顾客盯着蔬菜，他们知道这些食材很快就能煮好上桌。\n"
"\n"
"利拉看到你十分高兴。她示意你将食材交给一位大胡子男人，他腰上松松垮垮地系着一条围裙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much! We'll get them cleaned up and cooking soon. I don't suppose I could "
"trouble you just a little further..?"
msgstr "非常感谢！我们马上清洗开煮。我能不能再麻烦你一件事……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With...?"
msgstr "什么事……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well... The fire's gone out. It's going to take a bit to wash and cut everything, so if "
"you could get it lit for me, it'd be a huge help."
msgstr "那个……火灭了。我要去洗菜切菜，如果你能帮我把火生起来，那就帮了我大忙了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm on it, but it's going to cost you..."
msgstr "我来生火，不过要收费哦……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Oh..? Well, that's okay, I suppose. You've worked hard, and the tavern is doing well. "
"How much for everything?"
msgstr "啊……？我觉得没问题。你辛苦了，酒馆现在生意不错。这些一共多少钱？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... I'd say at least two bowls, and two tankards, too?"
msgstr "那个……我觉得至少得两碗菜，再加两大杯酒吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"And here I thought you were going to ring me dry for saving my business. You get that "
"fire lit and you can drink until I need to get Rowan to come pick you up off the floor."
msgstr ""
"你救了我的生意，我还以为你会狠狠敲我一笔呢。你把火生起来，想喝多少喝多少，醉了我叫罗文来"
"接你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Lira gestures to the hearth on the far end of the tavern, and several customers move "
"themselves and their tables away to give you plenty of space to work."
msgstr "利拉指向酒馆另一边的壁炉。几位顾客挪开身子和桌子，给你留出足够的空间。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Lira has Rowan and a few customers help haul out a large stew pot which has been filled "
"with all sorts of hearty vegetables, meats, and a dizzying blend of spices that begins "
"to make your mouth water as the pot slowly begins to bubble. As you wait, Lira is true "
"to her word, and you rarely find your tankards less than half full.\n"
"\n"
"After a couple hours of waiting and a few last dashes of several spices, Lira declares "
"her creation finished. Bowls are distributed and a line quickly forms, everyone eagerly "
"waiting to eat their fill. You enjoy yourself as the tavern becomes more rowdy through "
"the night. Before you know it, you find yourself passed out by the fire, and the tavern "
"mostly empty.\n"
"\n"
"That was a good night."
msgstr ""
"在罗文和几位顾客的帮助下，利拉搬出了一口大炖锅。锅里装满了各种蔬菜和肉类，还有各种各样的"
"香料。锅里的汤汁开始慢慢沸腾，让人直流口水。你在等的时候，利拉说话算数，你的酒杯始终都是"
"满的，就没少于半杯。\n"
"\n"
"经过几个小时的等待，锅里又加了几种香料，利拉宣布说菜做好了。大家拿着分发的碗，快速排起长"
"队，迫不及待地想要大饱口福。夜深了，酒馆变得更加热闹，你尽情享受。不知不觉，你在炉火边昏"
"昏睡去，酒馆也快没人了。\n"
"\n"
"真是个美好的夜晚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Packing Lunch"
msgstr "准备午餐"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Packing Lunch - A battle-hardened representative from the Slayers Guild has found "
"himself without the majority of his supplies after a band of robbers stripped him of "
"nearly all his possessions. In shockingly high spirits, the man still wishes to embark "
"on a journey to the nearby Corrupted Farmlands, but will need to restock before he can."
msgstr ""
"准备午餐——屠杀者工会的一位老成员遭遇了一群强盗，随身物品几乎被洗劫一空。但他精神饱满，依"
"然想去附近的腐化农田。在出发前，他需要先准备食物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What would a man like him even like? Fish, maybe?"
msgstr "像他这样的人，喜欢吃什么呢？可能是鱼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully this will be a suitable enough lunch, then Gol can get on his way."
msgstr "希望这份午餐适合他，这样戈尔就能出发了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A nearly bare man stands on the side of the road covered by a terrifyingly small "
"loincloth, laughing heartily as a few folks gawk at his form, then rush by while "
"averting their eyes. He flexes in several positions, showing off his incredibly well-"
"built body and empty scabbard, one of the few things the man seems to own. \n"
"\n"
"Hapren quickly approaches you, then points in the man's direction."
msgstr ""
"一个几乎裸体的男人站在路边，哈哈大笑，身上只有一块小得可怜的缠腰布。一些路人盯着他看，然"
"后又移开视线，匆匆离去。他摆出各种姿势，展示自己健硕的体魄，腰间还挂着一个空空的剑鞘，这"
"似乎是他为数不多的物件了。\n"
"\n"
"哈普伦快速走到你身边，指向那个男人的方向。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[i]{0}[/i], I beg of you, deal with this man."
msgstr "[i]{0}[/i]，求求你，去搞定那家伙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Deal with him? What do you want me to do, stab him?"
msgstr "……搞定他？你想要我怎么做？去捅他一刀？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What?! Heavens, no [i]{0}[/i]! I just want you to talk to him and get him to leave. Or, "
"at the very least, cover up a little."
msgstr ""
"什么？！天哪，当然不是啦[i]{0}[/i]！我只是想要你去跟他说说，让他走。或者，至少让他稍微遮"
"一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And why aren't you doing that already?"
msgstr "你怎么还不去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Look at him! The man looks like a tree uprooted itself from the ground, shed its bark, "
"and is now harassing my good citizens! I'll make it worth your while, so please, go!"
msgstr ""
"看看他！他就像一棵从地里拔出来的树，连皮都没了，现在还在骚扰我们这些好市民！只要你去，我"
"不会亏待你。拜托了，你就去吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah! Another comes to admire Gol's form, yes?"
msgstr "啊！又来一个欣赏戈尔身材的人，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You're an impressive specimen, but no, I'd actually like you to cover up a bit. What "
"brings you around here?"
msgstr "你这身材不错，不过我希望你能稍微遮一遮。你到这儿来干什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, Gol was making his way towards his target when Gol was accosted by bandits!"
msgstr "嗯，戈尔在前往目的地的路上遇到强盗了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh! I'm terribly sorry then, let's see if we can get you some clothes and then..."
msgstr "噢！我很抱歉，我看看能不能先给你弄身衣服，然后……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"HA! Clothes? Nay, they took Gol's supplies and sword! Gol has no need for anything to "
"shield himself from the blows of his enemies."
msgstr ""
"哈！衣服？不用了，那些强盗把戈尔的补给和剑都抢走了！戈尔不需要任何东西来抵挡敌人的攻击。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So you just... walk around like this?"
msgstr "所以你就……这样走来走去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Aye! They robbers took Gol's lunch as well. Once Gol has had a bite to eat, Gol can "
"continue towards his battle!"
msgstr "对！那些强盗把戈尔的午餐也抢了。等戈尔吃点东西，就能继续战斗了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll see if I can rustle something up for you to eat, then."
msgstr "……好吧，那我看能不能给你找点吃的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol pats his stomach expectantly as you walk back towards a somewhat relieved Hapren. "
"He gives you a thumbs up and scurries off, leaving you to deal with Gol yourself."
msgstr ""
"当你往回走的时候，哈普伦松了一口气，戈尔期待地拍了拍肚子。哈普伦向你竖起大拇指，然后就匆"
"匆走了，留你一个人应付戈尔。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I need to make sure the bolts are well-made so they'll hold a man of that size, only "
"way to do that is to do it myself."
msgstr "我得确保这些弩箭足够结实，能应付他这个大块头。看来我只能自己动手了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That should do... I hope."
msgstr "这样应该就可以了……希望可以吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol looks up expectantly as you approach and hand him the fish. One after another, the "
"man sucks them down, then sighs happily. You're not sure if you saw him chew."
msgstr ""
"当你走近并将鱼递给戈尔时，他满怀期待地抬起头。他一条接一条地将鱼吞下，然后满足地叹了口"
"气。你甚至都没见他嚼过。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Better now?"
msgstr "好点了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol was pleased by this little snack! The nice lady from the tavern came by with food "
"as well, but battle shall be Gol's main course!"
msgstr ""
"戈尔对这些“小点心”很满意！酒馆的那位好心女士也送了些食物过来，但战斗才是戈尔的“主菜”！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'd imagine that must have been Lira, yeah? Her food's to die for, but I'd imagine that "
"it'd be hard to pay in your current state."
msgstr ""
"我想那肯定是利拉，对吧？她做的食物美味至极，不过以你现在的情况，恐怕很难付得起钱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Only for now! Gol will make back his fortune tenfold once he has pilfered the nearby "
"dungeon. But Gol is not yet set off."
msgstr "这只是暂时的！等戈尔偷了附近的地牢，就能赚回十倍的财富。但戈尔现在还没出发。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That would have been too easy, yeah? What's stopping you now?"
msgstr "那也太容易了，对吧？你怎么还没走？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Among Gol's possessions was climbing gear that he needed to get to the farmlands. Would "
"you be able to provide some for Gol?"
msgstr "戈尔还缺少一套攀爬装备，这是去农田必须要带的。你能给戈尔提供一套吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Oh, that's easy, I think there was some boots and hooks left in Lira's tavern. Let me "
"go ge-"
msgstr "哦，那简单。我记得利拉的酒馆还有一些靴子和钩子。我去拿——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No, no. Traditional gear will neither fit nor hold Gol's magnificent shape. Topaz Bolts "
"will let me climb just fine."
msgstr "不，不。那些传统的装备不合适，也撑不住壮硕的戈尔。我用黄宝石弩箭就可以爬。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How??"
msgstr "怎么爬？？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The tips will cut into any surface, if slammed hard enough. Then the iron shafts will "
"hold me!"
msgstr "只要力够大，钉尖就能扎进任何表面。然后铁杆就能撑住我！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you sure you don't just want the climbing gear..?"
msgstr "你确定不要那些攀爬装备吗……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The large man just gestures to his body once again, before striking another-admittedly "
"impressive-pose. You leave to fetch the man his bolts."
msgstr ""
"这位大块头再次指了指自己的身体，然后又摆了一个令人印象深刻的姿势。你去给他拿他的弩箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol takes the bolts from you and considers them with a far more meticulous eye than you "
"expected from him. After a while, his face breaks out into a smile as he nods. He claps "
"you on the shoulder hard enough to shake you to your bones, then vows that he will "
"repay you someday. You notice that his loincloth covers even less from behind as he "
"walks away, towards whatever battle he intends to fight.\n"
"\n"
"Hapren and Lira scurry out from inside of the nearby tavern once they see that Gol has "
"departed. Lira asks about the man, seemingly saddened by him not sticking around, as "
"she hoped he'd be able to drink half his weight in ale. Hapren shakes your hand once, "
"thanking you taking care of the man, and says a light prayer hoping that he doesn't "
"return."
msgstr ""
"戈尔拿起你手中的弩箭，细细查看，看得比你想象的更加仔细。过了一会儿，他露出笑容，点了点"
"头。他重重拍了拍你的肩膀，拍得你骨头都快散了。他发誓说一定会报答你。他转身离开，前往他心"
"里的战场。这时你注意到，从背后看，他那块缠腰布确实小得可怜。\n"
"\n"
"哈普伦和利拉看到戈尔离开，从附近的酒馆快步走了出来。利拉问戈尔去哪儿，似乎有些失落。她还"
"想戈尔能够留下，看他喝下相当于一半体重的麦芽酒。哈普伦握了握你的手，感谢你照顾戈尔，低声"
"祈祷戈尔别再回来了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morally Ethical Graverobbing"
msgstr "合乎伦理的盗墓"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Morally Ethical Grave Robbing - A long forgotten city filled with treasure, riches, and "
"secrets beyond compare has just been uncovered... maybe. It's quite possible that "
"there's hardly anything at all down there, but there's only one way to find out!"
msgstr ""
"合乎伦理的盗墓——一座被长久遗忘的城市重见天日，里面或许藏着无与伦比的财宝、财富和秘密……下"
"面也可能什么都没有，但要弄清楚真相，只有一个办法！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Some steel for the heads, and willow logs for the shafts should be plenty strong enough."
msgstr "用钢铁做头，用柳木做柄，应该都结实了吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think this should be plenty to outfit the crew with some new tools."
msgstr "我想这应该够给大家置办一些新工具了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A scattered group of dwarves mills about a half excavated hillside, clutching broken "
"tools and caring for what looks like some nasty burns and singed beards. Funnily "
"enough, they seem more worried about their facial hair than their wounds.\n"
"\n"
"An elderly man in a comically large wizard's hat seems surprised, but also pleased, to "
"see you."
msgstr ""
"挖了一半的山坡上有一群矮人，他们拿着破损的工具，看起来正在处理一些严重的烧伤，连胡子都烧"
"焦了。有趣的是，比起身上的伤，他们似乎更担心自己的胡子。\n"
"\n"
"一位老人戴着一顶大得滑稽的巫师帽，他看到你之后又惊讶又高兴。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Why hello there! Say, are you any handy with a pickaxe? Decently strong enough to move "
"rocks from one location to another, maybe?"
msgstr "你好呀！那个……你会用镐头吗？你应该力气不错，能不能帮忙搬一下石头？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm not too bad at either, but it looks like you've got a whole crew here, why "
"aren't they mining?"
msgstr "嗯，我都还行。我看你这儿的人不少，他们怎么不挖？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Because this talentless hack didn't warn us about the tunnel being trapped. It's a good "
"thing that \"Whudgrath Roksmak's Crew is twice the prize at half the size\"... in case "
"you're lookin' for a crew, stranger."
msgstr ""
"还不是因为这个没用的废物，隧道有陷阱都没提醒我们。好在“伍德格拉斯·洛克斯马克的队伍可以一"
"人顶俩”……陌生人，你是在找队伍吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"How dare you sir? I may have wandered off to inspect a few of the enchanted baubles "
"we've found, but I'm far from talentless. Don't you want to learn if it's even worth "
"digging up this hillside before you do so?"
msgstr ""
"你什么意思？我只是去查看刚刚发现的几件魔法小玩意儿，不是没用的废物。难道你在挖掘这片山坡"
"之前，不想知道这里值不值得挖吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We're dwarves, lad. It's always worth diggin', I just hope my folks can live to tell "
"about it!"
msgstr ""
"我们是矮人，小伙子。挖掘没有什么值不值，我只希望我的人能够活下来，把挖掘的故事讲给别人"
"听！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I thoroughly apologize for my tardiness, but the fact that the ruins are trapped means "
"that there's something inside worth getting at! Most of the trinkets we've unearthed "
"have some kind or form of enchantment as well!"
msgstr ""
"是我来晚了，我深表歉意。既然这些遗迹有陷阱，那里面一定有值得挖的东西！我们挖出来的很多小"
"玩意儿都带着某种魔法！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll let you two just sort this out..."
msgstr "你们俩自己处理吧……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Wait just a sediment. If what Morlin says is true, it sounds like the payday might be "
"worth getting blown up once or twice more."
msgstr "等等，先别急。如果莫林说的是真的，那再炸几次，也是值得的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"More than enough for all of us! I'm more interested in the history of the place than "
"anything else, anyway."
msgstr "里面的东西够我们分了！反正比起别的，我对这个地方的历史更感兴趣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wouldn't mind myself some fancy magic stuff. What do you need from me?"
msgstr "如果能弄些神奇的玩意儿，我也不介意。你需要我做什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"My folks will be fine, but our tools... a little less so. You mind getting us some "
"steel to make more, while we patch ourselves up?"
msgstr ""
"我的人没事，但我们的工具……不太行了。在我们处理伤口的时候，你能不能帮我们找些钢材？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "我尽力吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I have the feeling I'm going to be here a while..."
msgstr "看来我要在这儿待一段时间了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I must nearly be done..."
msgstr "我应该快弄完了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Whudgrath happily takes the materials from you while his crew gathers round. He snaps "
"his fingers towards Morlin, who quickly heats up the material using few blasts of fire "
"magic.\n"
"\n"
"In a terrifying display of efficiency and speed, using their bare hands and some well-"
"placed smacks of their hammers, the dwarves work the material into shape. Once Morlin "
"cools them, they're then fit to whittled shafts. The whole assembly line starts and "
"finishes just seconds after you take the last bit of material from your bag."
msgstr ""
"伍德格拉斯高兴地从你手中接过材料，他的人也围了过来。他向莫林打了个响指。莫林使出火焰魔"
"法，迅速将材料加热。\n"
"\n"
"这群矮人展现出惊人的效率和速度。他们赤手空拳，稳稳地挥动榔头，把材料打成想要的形状。莫林"
"将材料冷却，然后把材料装到削好的柄上。你从背包里取出最后一块材料，短短几秒之后，整个组装"
"过程就完成了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right then! Are we ready to dig?"
msgstr "好了！准备好开挖了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Looks like it! I can only imagine what we could find deeper in... Perhaps more about "
"their way of life? Ties to nearby civilizations?"
msgstr ""
"看来是准备好了！我只想看看，再深点儿会发现什么……或许能进一步了解他们的生活方式？了解他们"
"与周边文明之间的联系？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Booze that has been aging for an untold number of years? New, fancy bits and bobs?"
msgstr "发现陈酿了不知多少年的美酒？发现新奇的小玩意儿？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Am I the only one concerned about there being more traps? Ancient guardians? Diseases "
"that have been lingering for who knows how long? There is a reason this place is a "
"ruin, right?"
msgstr ""
"只有我担心这里可能还有陷阱吗？还有古老的守卫？还有不知潜伏了多久的疫病？这里变成如今的遗"
"迹总是有原因的，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That all sounds like fun to me. Time to strike the earth!"
msgstr "听起来挺有趣的。是时候开始挖了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't suppose I could get you to join them, could I? The sooner this place is dug up, "
"the sooner we can get to exploring it!"
msgstr "我在想，能不能让你加入他们？这里挖得越快，我们就能越早开始探索！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Before you can get a word in, a pickaxe is thrust into your hands by a passing dwarf, "
"followed by a helmet and a water flask. You're spun around and placed in front of a bit "
"of rubble. Time to get to it."
msgstr ""
"你还没开口，一个路过的矮人就将一把镐头塞到你手里，然后又递来一顶头盔和一个水壶。有人把你"
"转过身，推到一堆碎石前。开始干活吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morlin really isn't holding back on asking away, is he?"
msgstr "莫林问起问题来真是一点也不客气，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope that this is everything that Morlin needs to deal with the cursed door."
msgstr "希望这就是莫林应对那扇诅咒之门所需要的一切。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Sweat pours down your brow as a cart pulled behind a large star-nosed mole the crew has "
"affectionately named 'Moley' swings by.\n"
"The crew loads up the rubble you've broken down as you swing your pickaxe once again. "
"But, instead of the typical smack and shock of resistance you're used to when mining, "
"this time, your tool goes THROUGH the rock. A small, unlit cavern lays in front of you. "
"Just as you call out, the clean-up crew crowds around you, yelling about 'rocks and "
"stones,' whatever that means. Shortly after, you're joined by Whudgrath and Morlin, who "
"filter into the cave and immediately start inspecting a large circular door carved into "
"the wall"
msgstr ""
"汗水从你的额头流下来，这时一辆大车从你身边经过。拉这辆大车的是一只巨大的星鼻鼹，大家都亲"
"昵地叫它‘莫利’。\n"
"你凿碎的碎石被装上车，而你再次挥动手中的镐头。但这一次，镐头击打之后并没有像之前那样产生"
"冲击，而是穿透了岩石。一个昏暗的小洞穴出现在你面前。你叫了一声，清理的人都围了上来，嘴里"
"喊着‘岩石和石头’之类的话。不一会儿，伍德格拉斯和莫林也来了。他们进入洞穴，立马开始仔细观"
"察洞壁上的一扇圆形大门。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well done! Looks like you've found... something! We've got some kinda door here, hm?"
msgstr "干得好！看来你发现了……重要的东西！这儿居然有扇门，嗯？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe for a vault?"
msgstr "也许里面是个宝库？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Or to seal something off, perhaps? Either way, it's an exciting find! One that is..."
msgstr "或者里面锁了什么东西？不管怎么样，这个发现真令人兴奋！那么……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is... what, exactly?"
msgstr "那么……里面到底是什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Trapped, I'm afraid. We're going to have to deactivate it before we go any further."
msgstr "恐怕是陷阱。我们要先把陷阱解决了，才能继续往前走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're sure we can't just smack it and run?"
msgstr "你确定我们不能直接打一下，然后赶紧跑吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is that how you blew up last time?"
msgstr "你们上次就是这样把自己炸飞的吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I just like to call it efficiency. I'm coming around to the idea of being blown up, as "
"long as I know it's leading up to a nice payday."
msgstr "这样做是为了效率。只要有大收获，就算被炸飞，我也能接受。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No... this one's a curse, from what I'm able to tell. One that'll take a while to "
"remove."
msgstr "不……我觉得这是个诅咒。要解除诅咒，得花点时间。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh? Well, okay then, I can come back later, once you've sorted that out?"
msgstr "哦？那好吧，等你弄清楚了，我再回来？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Your work is far from done! I'll need you to fetch me some runes required for the spell "
"to lift the curse on the door. I'll have a list done up for you."
msgstr "你的活儿还没干完呢！我需要你去弄些符文，用来解除门上的诅咒。我给你列个清单。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Morlin flicks his hands, and a leaf of paper floats out of his pack and hangs in the "
"air. You can see something already written on it... \"Blindfold, velvet rope, three "
"wheels of cheese...\" But Morlin flicks his hands again and another-blank this time-"
"leaf is produced, while the other immediately combusts. \n"
"\n"
"Words form from nothing, and then the paper floats into your hands. You want to ask "
"about the other list, but decide against it."
msgstr ""
"莫林挥了挥手，一张纸从他的包裹里飞出来，飘在空中。你可以看到纸上写着……“蒙眼布、天鹅绒"
"绳、三块奶酪……”但莫林又挥了挥手，那张纸瞬间烧成灰经，出现了另一张空白的纸。纸上的字慢慢"
"浮现，然后飘落到你手里。你想问问那份清单，但最后还是算了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You are guided down into the dimly lit tunnel as dwarves gather around excitedly, "
"seeing what Morlin has in store. The old wizard gladly takes the runes from you and "
"begins focusing very deeply...\n"
"\n"
"Everyone holds their breath while he works, moving his hands in esoteric swirls and "
"patterns until suddenly, the man... sneezes. But then! With a crack and a flash that "
"bathes the room in cold blue light, a veil of magic slowly rolls off the door and "
"evaporates into the air. Morlin warns everyone not to breathe in the cursed air, and as "
"folks duck and cover their faces with clothes and pulled up shirts, he laughs and swats "
"the air, exclaiming that there's no such thing.\n"
"\n"
"You hold back the urge to take a pickaxe from the wall and stick it into his back as "
"the door slowly rolls into the side of the wall, revealing... a long, cold hallway "
"lined with suits of armor in remarkable condition. At the feet of these, many offerings "
"were laid out ages ago. Withered flowers and fruits have light stains in the stone, "
"almost completely missed because of the small piles of gems, coins, and other small "
"treasures laid out.\n"
"\n"
"Everyone is quite pleased by the discovery, as the immediate payoff is overshadowed by "
"the looming question: What more could lay further below?"
msgstr ""
"你被带入一条昏暗的隧道，矮人们兴奋地围过来，想看看莫林准备了什么。老巫师欣然接过你手里的"
"符文，开始全神贯注……\n"
"\n"
"在他施法时，大家屏住呼吸，看他的双手划出神秘的轨迹和图案。突然，他……打了个喷嚏。接下来！"
"出现一声爆裂响和一道闪光。清冷的蓝光照着四周，一层魔法屏障从门上慢慢落下，消失在空中。莫"
"林提醒大家不要呼吸被诅咒的空气。当大家纷纷躲避并用衣服遮脸时，他笑了起来，挥手驱散空气，"
"说根本就没有诅咒。\n"
"\n"
"你真想取下墙上的镐头，捅进他的后背，但你忍住了。这时，那扇门慢慢滑入墙的一侧，露出了……一"
"条又长又阴的走廊。走廊两边有几套保存完好的盔甲。在盔甲的下面，有许多很久以前留下的祭品。"
"枯萎的花朵和水果在石头上留下了淡淡的痕迹。如果没有那些散落的宝石、钱币和其他小财宝，这些"
"痕迹根本不会被发现。\n"
"\n"
"看到这些，大家都很高兴。但比起眼前的这些，大家不禁在想：再往里走，还有什么呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Life's A Beach"
msgstr "海滩生活"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Life's a Beach - While out for a lovely day of fishing along the Windswept Shores, you "
"managed to find a catch you're not quite sure if you should toss back or not. The "
"grumpy old man is a pain to deal with, but with enough time, he might warm up to you.\n"
"\n"
"Or not."
msgstr ""
"海滩生活——在“风蚀海岸”享受美好的钓鱼时光时，你钓上来一个东西。你不确定该不该把它放回去。"
"那个老头脾气暴躁，不好对付。但花点时间，他可能会对你态度好些。\n"
"\n"
"也可能不会。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe I'll reel it in, whatever it is."
msgstr "不管是什么，我先钓上来看看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait a second, I think I've got something!"
msgstr "等等，好像有东西上钩了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You spend your day relaxing on the coast of the Windswept Shores, enjoying the waves "
"crashing on the beach and sound of wind... sweeping the shore. Like much of the "
"coastline near Azamire, the rocky outcroppings make for dangerous passage for the "
"numerous boats heading up towards the capital, and another victim seems to have dashed "
"itself along the rocks. The shipwreck calls to you, begging you to see what you can "
"pull up from its depths."
msgstr ""
"你一整天都在“风蚀海岸”悠闲度过，欣赏海浪拍打海岸的景象，聆听海风吹过海岸的声音。这里和阿"
"扎米尔附近的很多海岸线一样，裸露的岩石让前往都城的船只面临重重危险。似乎又有一艘船撞上了"
"岩石。这艘船在呼唤着你，叫你去一探究竟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any chance I find something useful? Maybe..."
msgstr "我能找到什么有用的东西吗？或许是……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A DIY recipe?"
msgstr "一份自制配方？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, no... Who'd toss those out into the water?"
msgstr "不，不……谁会把那种东西扔进水里？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A magic bucket?"
msgstr "一个魔法水桶？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No... you can only find those in lakes."
msgstr "不……那种东西湖里才有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe an enchanted book?"
msgstr "或许是一本附魔书？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nah... the pages would be all soggy anyway."
msgstr "算了……纸肯定都湿透了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You continue thinking of strange things you'd never expect to find in the water while "
"you marrily fish away, occasionally dozing off as you pull in fish after fish. You "
"swear that you can see something floating out by the shipwreck, but every time you look "
"closer, you lose sight of it."
msgstr ""
"你一边愉快地钓鱼，一边在想水里可能出现的稀奇东西。你偶尔打个盹儿，钓上来的鱼一条接一条。"
"你发誓自己看到那艘船附近有东西漂着，可每次细看，却什么都没有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wonder if I should toss him back..?"
msgstr "我想是不是该把它放回去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe I shouldn't have asked if I could keep him."
msgstr "也许我不该问能不能把它留下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#. [待复核] Excel 里该行原文已被破坏，译文按行序对应，请核对
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your hook is caught on something! It flails and flops and fights like no other fish "
"you've ever caught before. You think for a moment that you've got the ship itself with "
"as much raw energy as your catch fights back with. As you reel in, you see... A MAN!\n"
"\n"
"Waterlogged and a confusing mix of grumpy and appreciative, the man hacks up half the "
"sea once you've pulled him onto shore."
msgstr ""
"有东西上钩了！跟你之前钓到的其他鱼不一样，这东西挣扎、扑通、反抗。这剧烈的反抗，让你一度"
"认为自己把那艘船钓到了。当你收线时，你看见……是个人！\n"
"\n"
"那个人全身湿透，神情复杂，气恼又感激。你刚把他拖上岸，他就剧烈咳嗽起来，好像要把半个海都"
"咳出来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't suppose you're edible, are you?"
msgstr "你该不会是可以吃的吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'd quite seriously doubt your morals if you thought so. My name's Dixon, and it seems "
"I've just barely survived a shipwreck."
msgstr "如果你这么想，那我严重怀疑你的人品。我叫迪克森。看来我刚刚躲过了一场海难。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do I get to keep you?"
msgstr "我可以把你留下来吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You'd think that you were the one who nearly drowned out there with questions like "
"these. Are you going to tell me where I am?"
msgstr "你这样问，还以为刚才差点淹死的人是你呢。你能不能告诉我，我现在在哪儿？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Currently, you're on my fishing hook, and on the windswept shores."
msgstr "你现在在我的鱼钩上，在风蚀海岸。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Most shores I can think of are windswept, you're going to have to be a touch more "
"specific than that."
msgstr "我能想到的大多数海岸都是风蚀海岸，你要说得再具体一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Oh, my apologies, I didn't quite emphasize that right. I meant the Windswept Shores. "
"Capital letters n' all."
msgstr "噢，抱歉，我刚才没说清楚。我说的是“风蚀海岸”。首字母大写的那种。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Far from my home port then. Mind if I join you for a spell?"
msgstr "这儿离我的母港很远。我可以在这儿待会儿吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I just pulled you out of the sea, and the first thing you can think of doing is fishing?"
msgstr "我刚把你从海里捞上来，你想的第一件事居然是钓鱼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I figured it'd be a good way to get you to pull your damn hook out of my coat."
msgstr "我觉得这是个好办法，可以把你那该死的鱼钩从我的外套上取下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah... right."
msgstr "啊……好吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You simply pluck your hook from the man's jacket, then lean away as he coughs up a bit "
"more water. Among the debris that washed ashore, the man finds a decent enough rod and "
"sits down beside you. Any attempts at further conversation are met with grumbles or "
"silence. Eventually, he asks about the nearest town he could rest in, and you mention "
"Azamire. He returns to his silence shortly after."
msgstr ""
"你直接把鱼钩从那人的外套上取下来，然后退了几步，看着那人继续咳出海水。在冲上岸的东西中，"
"那人找到一根还算凑合的钓竿，坐在你旁边。后来，不管你说什么，那人要么发牢骚，要么不说话。"
"最后，他问你附近有没有能歇脚的城镇，你提到了阿扎米尔。你话一说完，他又沉默了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How do people even use these things?"
msgstr "这些东西到底怎么用？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll stick with a rod for now. Best to give it to Dixon."
msgstr "我还是先用钓竿吧。把它给迪克森好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The man stands and cracks his back, then tosses his catch into a loose bag. He seems to "
"debate if he wants to continue talking to you at all, before he nods."
msgstr ""
"那人站起来，活动一下背部，然后把钓到的东西扔进一个松垮的袋子。他似乎在犹豫要不要继续和你"
"说话。随后他点了点头。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, thank you for pulling me out of the drink. You might be a touch special, but I "
"can't deny that you helped me out of a jam."
msgstr "嗯，谢谢你把我从水里捞起来。你这人有点不一样，但我不得不承认，你确实帮了我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Perhaps it was a little insensitive when I asked if I could eat you."
msgstr "我刚才问能不能吃你，可能让你觉得有点冒犯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And the other thing?"
msgstr "还有呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... I did catch you..."
msgstr "我把你钓上来……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Maybe you should have let me drown."
msgstr "……或许你应该让我淹死。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm just kidding, I'm just kidding... Mostly."
msgstr "我开玩笑的，开玩笑的……都是开玩笑的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Sure, sure. Speaking of catches, I'm sure you'll catch a lot of junk, but if you stick "
"around here, you might find a decent enough net. You may have even found one already."
msgstr ""
"好吧，好吧。说到钓东西，你肯定会钓到很多垃圾，但如果留在这儿，或许还能弄到一张不错的网。"
"没准儿你已经弄到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Interested?"
msgstr "有兴趣吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If you wouldn't mind. Usually they run for a decent bit of gold, but perhaps I could "
"offer you a bit of trade instead?"
msgstr "如果你不介意的话……这些东西通常能卖个好价钱。不过，或许我们可以做个交易，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I think we could make something like that work, I'll let you know. I'll find you in "
"town later?"
msgstr "我觉得可以，我回头再告诉你。我回头到镇上找你吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The man nods, seeming content with that, then heads up the road towards Azamire. Maybe "
"you're already feeling wistful, but the shore feels a little bit lonely without his "
"grumbles beside you."
msgstr ""
"那人点了点头，似乎很满意。随后，那人朝阿扎米尔走去。或许你感觉有点伤感。听不到那人的牢"
"骚，海岸显得有些冷清。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Dixon isn't hard to spot. Shortly after arriving back in Azamire, you find that he's "
"already managed to procure himself a cart and he has started to sell off his catch. You "
"offer up the net and he starts to beam, pleased at the quality of it. He mentions that "
"it'll come in handy as a local tavernkeep just swung by, asking if he'd be interested "
"in providing fresh fish for her tavern in exchange for a place to stay, and a bit of "
"pay on top.\n"
"As several more folks begin to crowd around, asking about his prices, he talks about "
"how they happen to be the highest quality fish from far off lands, and that he's "
"basically losing money selling them at these prices. You start to wonder if you could "
"do the same, considering you've got the exact same fish, from the exact same place."
msgstr ""
"找到迪克森并不难。回到阿扎米尔后不久，你就发现那人已经找到了一辆手推车，开始卖钓到的东"
"西。你把网递给他。他露出笑容，对网的质量很满意。他说这张网正好有用，因为一家当地酒馆的老"
"板娘来找过他，问他愿不愿意给那家酒馆供应鲜鱼，作为交换，他可以有个落脚的地方，还能多赚点"
"钱。\n"
"越来越多的人围过来询问价格。他说，这些鱼都是从很远的地方运来的，品质上等，按现在的价格卖"
"就是在亏本。你开始想，自己是不是也可以这样做，因为你有一样的鱼，这些鱼都来自一样的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Mage in the Making"
msgstr "法师觉醒"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Mage in the Making - A young woman has been trying in vain to cram all of her studies "
"into a few fraught hours before her mentor arrives to town, much to the dismay of Lira "
"and her patrons."
msgstr ""
"法师觉醒——导师即将抵达小镇，一名年轻女子试图在短短几个小时内掌握所有功课，结果却白忙一"
"场。这让利拉和她的顾客都十分头疼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure nothing could possibly go wrong arming her."
msgstr "我想，给她配备武器应该没问题吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right?"
msgstr "对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You hear a cry ring out from the entire tavern followed by several rapid apologies from "
"a distraught lady in the middle of the Spiced Honey Tavern. A concerningly large scorch "
"mark has been left on the floor, with a table or two completely blown to pieces."
msgstr ""
"香蜜酒馆传来一声叫喊，随后一名神色慌张的女子在酒馆里一直道歉。地板上留下了一块巨大的焦"
"痕，还有一两张桌子被彻底炸成了碎片。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sorry! I'm sorry, I- I-, I can pay for that!"
msgstr "对不起！对不起，我……我……我可以赔！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's fine, sugar, I was needing to replace those tables anyway, and you've already done "
"me the favor of turning them into kindling."
msgstr "没关系，亲爱的。这些桌子本来就要换了，你直接帮我把它们变成了柴火。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Still, your floor, it-"
msgstr "可是，你的地板……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rowan was going to mop today anyway, don't fuss over it so much."
msgstr "罗文今天本来就要拖地，别太在意了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know a spell! If I just-"
msgstr "我知道一个咒语！只要我——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think my tavern has seen enough of your magic for now, okay?"
msgstr "你的魔法，我想我的酒馆已经见识够了，好吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[i]{0}[/i], how lovely to see you! A new mage has come to town and I'm sure you'd be "
"able to help her out, yeah?"
msgstr "[i]{0}[/i]，见到你太好了！镇上来了一位新法师，我想你能帮她，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, what? Help her out with-"
msgstr "等等，什么？帮她——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"She says she's practicing! It's lovely, I just need her to do it... not here. Thanks, "
"bye!"
msgstr "她说她在练习！挺好的，只是她能不能别在这儿练？谢谢，再见！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Hi. I'm Magnavous, and I'm... trying to be a mage."
msgstr "……你好。我叫麦格纳沃斯，我……在尝试成为一名法师。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think I've gotten a fair bit of the picture. Your studying is..."
msgstr "我想我大概知道是怎么回事了。你的学习……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rocky, to say the least. But I think I'm getting close!"
msgstr "可以说是困难重重。但我觉得我快成功了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right. Is there anything I can help with?"
msgstr "好吧。有什么我能帮忙的吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, I seem to have run out of air runes, do you have any that you'd be willing to "
"spare?"
msgstr "那个，我的大气符文好像用完了，你那儿有多余的吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll see if I can come up with some."
msgstr "我看能不能给你弄一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You and Magnavous were rushed out of Lira's tavern as you talked and found yourself on "
"the porch. Through the window, Lira continues to give you concerned glances, worried "
"she'll have to fix up the front of her establishment. You usher her away from the "
"building, and ask her to practice in a small glade near town, and that you'll come with "
"some air runes as soon as you can."
msgstr ""
"你和麦格纳沃斯在说话的时候被匆匆赶出利拉的酒馆，被赶到门廊。透过窗户，利拉一直担忧地看着"
"你，担心自己要修缮店面。你示意她离开酒馆，让她去镇子附近的小空地练习，说你会尽快带着大气"
"符文去找她。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I never fancied myself a teacher, but let's take a stab at it."
msgstr "我从未想过自己会成为一名老师，不过就试试吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope she caught all that."
msgstr "希望她都听进去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With the few supplies she had left, it'd seem that Magnavous has turned the serene "
"glade you once adored into a smoking crater. A smouldering tree breaks at the middle "
"and crashes to the ground as you approach."
msgstr ""
"麦格纳沃斯用她剩下的几样东西，把你曾经喜欢的那片宁静小空地变成了一个冒着烟的坑洞。当你走"
"近时，一棵冒烟的树从中间断裂，倒在地上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I suppose no more picnics here for a little while..."
msgstr "看来暂时不能在这儿野餐了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I might be hopeless..."
msgstr "我可能没救了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No, no, not at all! Honestly, your magic seems... shockingly powerful, just a touch..."
msgstr "不，不，不是这样的！说实话，你的魔法看起来……非常强，就是有点……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dangerous to myself and everyone around me?"
msgstr "对我和我周围的人来说，有点危险？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I was going to say 'uncontrolled'. I think you're plenty powerful, the issue is more so "
"with the fact that I think you're starting a little too big."
msgstr "我本来想说的是‘不受控制’。我觉得你已经很强了，问题是你一开始就把动静搞得太大了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Hmm... But starting small would take more runes, and I can't just ask you to fetch me "
"some every time I want to cast a spell."
msgstr "嗯……但如果开始的动静小，就要更多的符文。我不能每次使用咒语都找你要符文吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Have you considered trying to make your own?"
msgstr "你有没有想过自己制作符文？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You can do that?"
msgstr "你能做吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Where did you think they came from?"
msgstr "那你以为那些符文是哪儿来的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't know! I was supposed to have a mentor who'd teach me all of this, but he never "
"turned up."
msgstr "我不知道！本来有位导师来教我，但他一直没出现。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Who was he supposed to be, anyway?"
msgstr "话说回来，他是谁啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I've only heard the stories I've heard in the capital... His name is Morlin, and he's "
"said to be a dashing man."
msgstr "我只在都城听过他的一些传闻……他叫莫林，据说风度翩翩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"He's a master of the arcane, has felled countless beasts and has unearthed some of the "
"most powerful relics ever found..."
msgstr "他是位奥术大师，打败过无数野兽，还发掘了一些最有影响力的遗物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Um... I think I know him."
msgstr "嗯……我想我认识他。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You've met him!? Is he as wonderful as the stories say? My father sent me here to study "
"under him, and I waited for a long while back in town..."
msgstr ""
"你见过他！？他真的像传闻说的那样厉害吗？我父亲送我来这儿拜他为师，我在镇上等了他好久……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I helped him out for a bit at a dig site nearby... A bit eccentric, but definitely "
"talented."
msgstr "我在附近的一个挖掘场帮过他……他有点古怪，但确实有才华。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Did he mention me at all? That he had to be off soon to meet his apprentice?"
msgstr "他有提过我吗？有提过很快要去见徒弟吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Uh... No... But the archaeological site he uncovered seems to be quite promising, "
"there's a good chance he's just busy."
msgstr "呃……没有……不过他发现的那处考古遗址似乎很有前景，他可能只是太忙了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Oh... okay, hopefully that's what it is! Once I can control my magic a bit better, I "
"can go and meet him myself!"
msgstr "噢……好吧，希望是这样！等我能够更好地掌控魔法，我就能自己去找他了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd like to learn how to make my own runes, can you show me?"
msgstr "我想学怎么制作符文，你能教我吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You take out a couple of books you had intended to give her and run through the basics "
"of runecrafting. She seems to absorb the information well, nodding along with your "
"explanations even though it was a foreign concept to her just minutes ago."
msgstr ""
"你拿出原本就打算送给她的几本书，给她讲解符文锻造的基础知识。她领悟得不错，听着你的讲解不"
"断点头，尽管就在几分钟前，这些概念对她来说还是完全陌生的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe she'll be a bit better now?"
msgstr "或许她现在好点了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fingers crossed."
msgstr "但愿吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Magnavous proves to be an exceptionally quick study, and before long she's creating her "
"own air runes with little issue at all. Her propensity to destroy her surroundings with "
"her magic doesn't seem to extend to runecrafting, to which you're incredibly thankful."
msgstr ""
"麦格纳沃斯学得特别快。没过多久，她就能轻松锻造大气符文了。她喜欢用魔法摧毁周围环境，但她"
"在锻造符文时没有这样做。对此，你感到很欣慰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is fantastic! Thank you so much."
msgstr "太棒了！太谢谢你了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's not a problem at all, I'm happy to help."
msgstr "不用谢，能帮你我很高兴。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now, maybe I can start a bit smaller..."
msgstr "或许现在我可以开始尝试更小的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, before you do, how would you feel about using a staff?"
msgstr "那在开始之前，你觉得用法杖怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They helped me focus my magic in the past, but..."
msgstr "以前我用法杖来集中魔法，但……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But..?"
msgstr "但……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My father stopped getting them for me since they got blown up so quickly..."
msgstr "我的法杖很快就炸了，所以我父亲再也不给我买了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I see. Well, maybe now that you'll be trying with spells a little more suitable to your "
"skill level, it'll go a touch better?"
msgstr "我明白了。不过，既然你这次尝试的咒语更适合你的技能等级，说不定情况会好一些呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'll I do if I break it though..?"
msgstr "万一我把它弄坏了怎么办……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll make sure to bring a few spares."
msgstr "我会多带几根备用。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'll try practicing with the smaller spells in the meantime! Oh! And maybe I'll make a "
"couple extra runes..."
msgstr "同时我还会练习小咒语！噢！顺便再多做几个符文……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you leave Magnavous behind in the crater, you hear a reassuring lack of explosions "
"or other generalized destruction."
msgstr "你把麦格纳沃斯留在坑洞里，周围一片寂静，没有爆炸声，也没有其他巨大的破坏声。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely... Surely, teaching her to arm herself can't go wrong."
msgstr "想必……想必没问题吧。教她装备自己总不会有什么问题吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I have faith in her. Kind of."
msgstr "我对她有信心。算是有吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The crater is no better or worse than you left it, which you'll take as progress. You "
"find Magnavous trying to wash away bits of ash and charred trees with a few well-placed "
"water spells. More often than not the spells completely gouge chunks of earth from the "
"ground, but they more-or-less seem to be going where she's aiming, at least."
msgstr ""
"跟你离开时一样，坑洞没什么变化，这也算是一种进步。你发现麦格纳沃斯正试图用几个精准的水系"
"咒语冲洗地上的灰烬和烧焦的树木。这些咒语往往会击碎地面，但它们基本都落在了她瞄准的位置"
"上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hello! I'm getting better, I almost don't destroy everything now!"
msgstr "你好！我好多了，现在几乎不会破坏周围环境！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, that's something! Maybe with these, you'll fare even better!"
msgstr "哦，那不错！也许有了这些，你会更好！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're beautiful! I think these will be perfect for me."
msgstr "真好看！我觉得都很适合我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you, thank you, I try."
msgstr "谢谢，谢谢，我会努力的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Soon enough, I'll be able to meet Morlin, and then I'll be able to become a mage worth "
"speaking about, with all of my own tales and adventures..."
msgstr "很快我就能见到莫林了，到时候我就能成为一名了不起的法师，有我自己的故事和冒险……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "About that..."
msgstr "关于那个……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's a chance your father may have..."
msgstr "你父亲或许……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lied? I know."
msgstr "撒谎了？我知道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know it might be har-"
msgstr "我知道这可能很——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, what? You already know?"
msgstr "等等，什么？你已经知道了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah. I mean, look around. This is what my magic was like after years of practice."
msgstr "是的。我想说，看看四周。这是我苦练多年之后的魔法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I got my family into trouble in the capital dozens of times because of my... studies."
msgstr "因为我的……学习，在都城给家人惹了几十次麻烦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Being exiled out here isn't all bad, and the fact that Morlin is close... Well, just a "
"happy accident, I suppose!"
msgstr "被流放到这儿也未必是坏事，莫林就在附近……嗯，只能说是个“美丽的巧合”！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're still going to go looking for Morlin anyway?"
msgstr "你还要去找莫林吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Why not? With your help, I'm actually starting to become a bit competent, and if he's "
"just found some new big site to work on..."
msgstr "为什么不呢？有你帮忙，我现在也不差了。如果他发现了什么新的大型遗迹……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any hands would be helpful, I'm sure."
msgstr "我想的是，多个人帮忙总是好的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And if you learn a couple things along the way, help him out here and there..."
msgstr "如果你能在过程中学到点什么，再顺便帮帮他……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He might legitimately make me his apprentice!"
msgstr "他可能真的会收我为徒！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's not a half bad idea at all."
msgstr "这主意倒是不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But... before I go... I don't have any more essence. I feel like I'm right on the edge "
"of a breakthrough, could you please get just a bit more for me?"
msgstr "不过……在我出发之前……我的精华没了。我感觉我就快有突破了，你能帮我弄点精华吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You sigh, but head off to fetch some more essence to keep Magnavous's studies going "
"somewhat smoothly. If she claims she's close to a breakthrough, might as well foster it."
msgstr ""
"你叹了口气，但还是动身去弄精华，好让麦格纳沃斯能够顺利学习。既然她说快有突破了，不妨就帮"
"她一把。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you come back with essence for Magnavous, you see that the crater is... "
"substantially better? She looks to you with tears in her eyes, before dropping the "
"remnants of a staff and rushing towards you. She wraps you in a hug as you notice that "
"she managed to-you presume-use a combination of water and air spells to clean the ash "
"and soot from her previous attempts as studying, and remove most of the land back to "
"its original shape.\n"
"\n"
"The land is damaged, but her efforts to fix it are clear as day, and you congratulate "
"her on her training and give her a brief hug back. She thanks you for acting as her "
"first mentor, and says that she thinks she's ready to trouble Morlin. You check over "
"her gear and give her the essence and send her on her way. She turns back a few times "
"as she walks off, waving and paying you more compliments than you feel you deserve. You "
"feel as if you've learned just as much as her, just in a different way."
msgstr ""
"当你带着精华回去找麦格纳沃斯时，你发现那个坑洞……好了很多？她眼含泪花看着你，丢下残破的法"
"杖，向你跑来。她一把抱住你。这时你注意到，她可能用了流水和大气咒语来清洗之前学习留下的灰"
"烬和烟尘，将这里的大部分土地恢复原样。\n"
"\n"
"虽然土地损坏了，但她为修复土地做出的努力都显而易见。你祝贺她的修炼成果，也抱了她一下。她"
"感谢你做她的第一位导师。她说已经准备好去麻烦莫林了。你检查她的装备，把精华给她，送她离"
"开。她边走边回头，向你挥手，不断赞美你。那些赞美的话，你都觉得受之有愧。你感觉自己跟她一"
"样，也学到了很多，只是学习的方式不同。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Harvest Festival"
msgstr "丰收节"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The Harvest Festival - Azamire's Annual Harvest Festival is right around the corner, "
"and everyone is doing their part to help make it as great as it can be. Of course, the "
"town will need your help to make it happen!"
msgstr ""
"丰收节——阿扎米尔年度丰收节即将来临，大家都在尽自己的努力，把节日办好。当然，要做到这一"
"点，小镇需要你的帮助。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm not too sure how much they'll need... let's get quite a bit."
msgstr "具体需要多少，我也不确定……我们多准备点吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope this is enough."
msgstr "希望这些够了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"On one of your many frequent outings to Lira's tavern, Hapren sets his sights on you, "
"and immediately beelines over to where you're seated in the corner. He pushes your "
"books aside and flags Lira down, who immediately catches your eye and gives you a "
"sheepish look. She waves away a serving girl who started to walk over, and takes a seat "
"next to you."
msgstr ""
"你经常去利拉的酒馆。有一次，哈普伦注意到了你，立马朝你坐的角落走过来。他推开你的书，示意"
"利拉过来。利拉马上看了你一眼，有点不好意思。她挥手让走过来的女服务员走开，然后坐在你旁"
"边。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well well well, isn't it funny running into you here?"
msgstr "哎呀，没想到在这儿碰见你？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"When I'm not training or adventuring, I'm basically always here, studying a bit... Why "
"would it be funny to run into me here..."
msgstr "我不修炼或出去冒险的时候，基本上都在这儿，研究点东西……在这儿碰见我有什么奇怪的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, I actually just came in like... two minutes ago. Have you been followin-"
msgstr "等等，我刚刚才进来……两分钟前。你一直在跟着——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The specifics aren't important!"
msgstr "细节不重要啦！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What is important is that you deeply care for this town, just like me, right?"
msgstr "重要的是，你和我一样，都很关心这座小镇，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What do you want?"
msgstr "……你想干嘛？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Harvest Festival is coming up, and we're behind. Please?"
msgstr "丰收节快到了，我们还没准备好。拜托了，好吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...You could have just asked."
msgstr "……你可以直接问我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But where's the fun in that?"
msgstr "但那样有什么意思呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus... it's kinda a lot. Lira needs help too."
msgstr "再说了……事情太多了。利拉也需要帮忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I was kinda the one who told him when you come in here... sorry."
msgstr "你进来的时候，是我告诉他的……抱歉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's okay, but when this is all done, I want enough ale that I cannot walk out of here. "
"Or hear Hapren begging for more assistance."
msgstr ""
"没关系。不过等一切都结束了，我要喝麦芽酒，喝到走不动为止。我可不想听哈普伦求人帮忙了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't ask th-"
msgstr "我没让——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Done."
msgstr "好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Alright, what do you need?"
msgstr "好吧，你需要什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of them go through a whirlwind of planning, talking about decor, food, games, "
"and more while you struggle to both keep up and see your part in it all. Eventually you "
"just settle into the corner and continue pouring over a map you bought off a local "
"surveyor some time ago, until finally, Hapren asks if you caught all of that.\n"
"\n"
"You shake yourself from your stupor and Lira asks if you could bring them enough maple "
"logs to keep the bonfire going, and cook the food for festival. You nod and head out, "
"happy to be away from their prattling."
msgstr ""
"他们俩匆忙地讨论装饰、食物、游戏等筹备安排。你跟不上他们的节奏，也不知道自己能做些什么。"
"最后你干脆回到角落，继续研究你之前从当地调查员手里买来的地图。后来哈普伦问你，他们说的那"
"些你都听进去了没。\n"
"\n"
"你从恍惚中回过神来。利拉问，你能不能弄些枫木原木，让篝火不断燃烧，顺便做些节日要用的食"
"物。你点点头，起身离开，总算能从他们的喋喋不休中解脱了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm going to need you to grow... a bit faster."
msgstr "我需要你长得……快些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They haven't been being very specific about how much stuff they want..."
msgstr "关于具体需要多少东西，他们一直没说清楚……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you drop off the last load of wood, Hapren claps his hands and pats you on the "
"shoulder, pleased with your work."
msgstr "当你卸下最后一批木材时，哈普伦拍了拍手，又拍了拍你的肩膀，对你的工作很满意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well done! It's genuinely kind of startling just how much you can accomplish."
msgstr "干得好！你能做这么多工作，真是令人惊讶。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, if it's for Lira and the festival, I'm happy to do it."
msgstr "都是为了利拉和节日，我很高兴帮忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And for me..?"
msgstr "那为了我呢……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "..."
msgstr "……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Where's Lira at?"
msgstr "……利拉在哪儿？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Right over here, just checking out what you dropped off! These will be great for the "
"food."
msgstr "在这儿，正在看你卸下的东西！这些用来做菜太棒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah? I can't say I've experimented much with the logs I use..."
msgstr "是吗？说实话，我没怎么研究过我用的原木……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"For some dishes, I'd argue it's even more important than the spices you use. These "
"maple logs will give our dish a sweet, smoky flavor."
msgstr ""
"对于有些菜来说，我认为木材比香料更重要。这些枫木原木会给我们的菜增添一股甜甜的烟熏风味。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Speaking of this dish, I assume we're making Azabuns this year?"
msgstr "说到我们的菜，我觉得今年一定要做阿扎小面包。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well of course! We might as well not have the festival at all without 'em! But... we're "
"missing something."
msgstr "那当然！要是没有它，节日干脆也别办了！不过……我们还缺点东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "缺什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, our Harvest Festival is to celebrate... you guessed it, Azamire's harvest, but "
"just like in my pantry, some food has gone missing. But I can't be fussed with that "
"right now."
msgstr ""
"嗯，我们的丰收节是为了庆祝……没错，就是庆祝阿扎米尔的丰收。不过跟我的食物存放室一样，有些"
"食物不见了。但现在我也顾不上这个了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We need a fair bit more corn. I've seen you tending the fields from time to time, is "
"that something you can handle?"
msgstr "我们需要很多玉米。我看你有时候去照料田地，这件事你能处理吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll be back before you know it!"
msgstr "我很快回来！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You set off for the fields, ready to bolster the last bit of Azamire's harvest for the "
"year, with a bit of your own hard work. Hapren looks on expectantly, waiting to see if "
"you say anything about helping him as well, then turns to Lira with a sad face. She "
"only shakes her head and walks away."
msgstr ""
"你前往田地，准备通过自己的辛勤劳动，为阿扎米尔今年的丰收贡献一份力。哈普伦满怀期待地看着"
"你，等着看你会不会帮他，后来一脸沮丧地转头看着利拉。她只是摇了摇头，便走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Take one, cook it, pass it on. Take on, cook it, pass it on..."
msgstr "拿一个，煮了，传下去。拿一个，煮了，传下去……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think that's almost all of them."
msgstr "我想大概就这些了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You enter the tavern and sling several sacks of corn onto the bar, to which Lira "
"immediately jumps up from her stool, inspects several ears, and nods positively towards "
"you. Without a word, she pushes a tankard of ale into your hands, and waits for you to "
"drink it down."
msgstr ""
"你走进酒馆，把几袋玉米扔到吧台上。利拉立马从凳子上跳起来，拿起几穗玉米查看，然后向你点点"
"头。她二话没说，将一大杯麦芽酒塞到你手上，等你喝下去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you, but what's this for?"
msgstr "谢谢，不过这是？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The start of that payment we talked about."
msgstr "这是我们之前说好的报酬，这是第一杯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You know, you ask for ale as payment... often... I know I'm a tavern keeper, but I care "
"for you. Is everything okay at home?"
msgstr "我说，你总是拿麦芽酒当报酬……虽然我是开酒馆的，但我还是担心你。你家里一切都好吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What..? Yes, of course! Your ale is just to die for, and you know I like the house "
"blend more than anything."
msgstr "什么……？当然好啦！你这儿的麦芽酒太好喝了。你也知道，我最喜欢的就是特调款。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you even put in it?"
msgstr "你在里面加了什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, a bit of coriander, hibiscus, juniper berries, orange peel... But I can't tell "
"you the rest of course, I don't want to lose my leverage over you."
msgstr ""
"嗯……加了点香菜籽、芙蓉花、杜松子、橙皮……还有什么，我当然不能告诉你，我可不想失去对你的吸"
"引力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But, speaking of recipes, this corn was the last thing we needed for the Melvor-famous "
"Azabuns!"
msgstr "不过说到配方，这玉米是制作梅尔沃名菜“阿扎小面包”需要的最后一种原料！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'll be calling in some people to help assemble them, but I'll need your help cooking "
"them."
msgstr "我会叫人来帮忙准备，但煮的话还得靠你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't trust these vagabonds to not burn the food, or themselves, but I know you're "
"capable."
msgstr "我不相信那些流浪汉，他们会把食物烧焦，甚至还会把自己烧焦，但我知道你可以的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Lira lets out a loud whistle, and like a well-oiled machine the entire tavern pushes "
"the tables together and drapes several clean cloths over them. It'd look like the start "
"of a banquet if it wasn't for the crates of raw ingredients starting to be distributed "
"among the patrons and the couple dozen more citizens that have started filtering in. \n"
"\n"
"The townsfolk crack open the boxes and barrels of raw food and water and get to work in "
"a show of efficency that shocks you. You wonder if Lira has access to some form of "
"magic to make them work with such a fervor. But as you start to guess at her powers, "
"you see tankards distributed and filled as Lira walks around checking progress. Seems "
"you're not the only one taking drinks as payment."
msgstr ""
"利拉吹了一声响亮的口哨。整个酒馆就像一台高效运转的机器，大家把桌子拼在一起，在桌面铺上干"
"净的布。如果不是把一箱一箱的生鲜食材分发给顾客以及随后陆续进来的几十位市民，这场景看起来"
"就像要举办一场盛宴。\n"
"\n"
"镇民们撬开装有食材和水的箱子和桶，以惊人的效率投入工作。你想，利拉是不是用了什么魔法，大"
"家干活才这么卖力。当你开始猜测她究竟有什么本事时，你看见利拉在人群中走来走去查看进度，给"
"大家分发和倒满酒水。看来，用酒水当报酬的不止你一个。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope these turn out nicely."
msgstr "希望最后的结果令人满意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's see what Hapren thinks."
msgstr "我们看看哈普伦怎么说吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With a good chunk of the town working on them, and a few of Lira's staff helping cook "
"the buns, the work goes faster than expected. It certainly helps that the townsfolk "
"keep the atmosphere lively with several songs while they work and drink, though most of "
"them would be more applicable to working in fields or mines, instead of assembling cute "
"buns.\n"
"\n"
"As you finish, Lira tops off your tankard before she notices someone off near the edge "
"of the tavern. She quickly grabs a tankard from someone nearby who knows better than to "
"argue, and then thrusts it into your hands, then hurries away. You down your fresh "
"drink first, wondering why she gave you another, until-"
msgstr ""
"镇民们齐心协力，还有利拉的几个人帮忙制作面包，进度比预期要快。镇民们一边干活喝酒，一边唱"
"歌，现场气氛十分热闹，尽管这些歌大多更适合在田里或矿井干活的时候唱，而不太适合在制作可爱"
"小面包的时候唱。\n"
"\n"
"你一干完活，利拉就给你的酒杯倒满。这时，她看见酒馆边上有个人。她迅速从旁边一个识趣的人手"
"里拿过一杯酒，塞到你手上，然后就匆匆走了。你把刚倒的酒一饮而尽，心想她为什么又给你一杯，"
"直到——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hello there! How goes the assembly line? Are you free for a second or several?"
msgstr "你好！组装那边的工作怎么样了？你有空聊一会儿吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Thanks Lira."
msgstr "……谢谢你，利拉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nothing, nothing. Think we're about finished up here, what else do you need?"
msgstr "没事，没事。我们这边差不多快完了，你还需要什么吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I've got a lovely idea to light up the town square. I hope to fill some lanterns with "
"some gems from the town's treasury, and when they're lit... I hope it'll glitter "
"beautifully."
msgstr ""
"我有个好办法，能让小镇广场亮起来。我想在提灯里装些小镇宝库里的宝石，等点亮提灯……那时候肯"
"定很美。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That's actually... a pretty good idea. Are you worried about thieves at all, though? "
"Sounds like a lot of loot to be leaving out."
msgstr "这办法确实……很不错。不过，你不怕有盗贼吗？把那么多宝物放在外面。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They'll be under watch, don't you worry. I've already signed off on the gems being "
"used, but there's just one thing..."
msgstr "会有人看守，你放心。我已经同意装宝石了，不过还有一件事……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You don't have the lanterns and want me to make them?"
msgstr "你没有提灯，想让我做？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"This is why I always come to you for help! You're always one step ahead of everyone "
"else."
msgstr "所以我总来找你帮忙嘛！你总是比别人快一步。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll try to be a little less competent in the future."
msgstr "……看来以后我要笨点才行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Last thing, I promise. For this event, that is."
msgstr "我保证，这是最后一件事。我是说，这次活动。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You leave the assembly line behind as they begin to tidy up and return the tavern back "
"to its usual configuration. Hapren calls out several thank yous as you leave, but you "
"don't turn, lest he throw on another task or two should you pay him any further mind."
msgstr ""
"你离开组装现场，这时大家开始打扫收拾，将酒馆恢复原样。你走的时候，哈普伦一直说谢谢，但你"
"没有回头。要是你再搭理他，说不定他还会给你一两件事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Hapren happily takes the lanterns from you, passing them down a line where a few of "
"Azamire's guards-headed by Jass-drop gemstones into the lanterns and get them hung up. "
"People begin filtering into the square as the sun slowly slips below the horizon. You "
"can't help but start getting swept up in the excitement as more and more of the modest "
"town square is filled with decor, food, and life.\n"
"\n"
"People from all walks of life stop by, many from Azamire, but some from the surrounding "
"villages, bringing plenty of their own special dishes, songs, and traditional garb. "
"Many are just variations on one another, but the differences really stand out between "
"each other.\n"
"\n"
"You dance late into the night and-of course-enjoy your fill of Azabuns and other "
"regional delicacies, pleased with your contributions to the festival, even if you "
"really think Hapren should enlist some more help next time."
msgstr ""
"哈普伦高兴地接过提灯，让大伙儿传下去。在杰丝的带领下，几名阿扎米尔守卫将宝石放入提灯，然"
"后挂起来。太阳慢慢沉入地平线，人们开始陆续进入广场。看着各种装饰、食物和人群慢慢出现在原"
"本冷清的广场，你忍不住兴奋起来。\n"
"\n"
"来自各方的人们汇聚在这里，有阿扎米尔的，也有附近村庄的，他们带来了自己特色的美食、歌谣和"
"传统服饰。虽然很多都大同小异，但不同的地方却十分明显。\n"
"\n"
"你跳舞跳到深夜，当然也吃了很多的阿扎小面包和其他地方美食。对于自己在这次节日中的贡献，你"
"很高兴；尽管你真心觉得，哈普伦下次应该多找点人帮忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Setting Down Roots"
msgstr "落地生根"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Setting Down Roots - The Blackthorn Sisters have made one of their frequent appearances "
"in Azamire, but seem to have brought a bit more than their usual cart of goods. What "
"brings them to town today?"
msgstr ""
"落地生根——黑刺姐妹又来到了阿扎米尔，但这次她们带的东西似乎比平时要多。她们今天来干嘛呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wonder what ever happened to this place?"
msgstr "我在想，这里以前发生过什么事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Should be cleaned up enough now. [Talk]"
msgstr "现在应该清理得差不多了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You walk up to the large vine and pelt-covered wagon that has parked itself on the edge "
"of town. You see two familiar faces, Petal and Clove, sisters that stop by and sell "
"herbs, potions, pelts, and meat. They sit in front of an old burned-out house on the "
"back of a large wagon packed with furniture, discussing plans for what their new home "
"should look like."
msgstr ""
"你走向镇子旁边的那辆大马车，车身上缠着藤蔓，还盖着兽皮。你看到了两张熟悉的面孔：佩塔和克"
"洛夫姐妹。她们经常来这儿卖草药、药水、兽皮和肉类。她们坐在一辆装满家具的大马车上，马车停"
"在一栋被烧毁的老房子前。她们商量着新房的样子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looks like you've brought a bit more than potions and meat this time, eh?"
msgstr "看来你们这次带的不止药水和肉类，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's so nice to see you again, it's been too long!"
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你，好久不见了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We finally bit the arrow and decided to set up shop here. It's what Petal wants to do, "
"at least."
msgstr "我们最后决定在这儿开家店。至少，这是佩塔想做的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Come now, you know I'm looking out for the both of us."
msgstr "好了，你知道我这么做是为了我们两个。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Plus, Azamire has always been one of our most lucrative stops. Who knows, with how fast "
"this place is growing, maybe we'll do even better than before!"
msgstr ""
"再说了，阿扎米尔一直是我们生意最好的地方之一。谁知道呢，照这里的发展速度来看，说不定我们"
"的生意会比以前更好！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Azamire might be where I rest, but the woods will always be my home. I can't stay tied "
"down for too long."
msgstr "阿扎米尔或许是我落脚的地方，但森林才是我永远的家。我没法一直待在同一个地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, I hope that we'll be able to do our best to make you feel welcome, regardless of "
"where you may be."
msgstr "好吧，无论你在哪儿，我们都会尽最大的努力，让你感受到我们对你的欢迎。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, don't mind Clove, she's just... trying to appear strong and mysterious."
msgstr "噢，别在意克洛夫，她只是……想装得强大神秘。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You know, she always gets excited whenever we get close to Azamire, starts trying to "
"take down big game to show off to yo-"
msgstr "你知道吗，每次我们要到阿扎米尔了，她就特别兴奋，想去猎杀大猎物，好在你面前炫耀——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Petal, I prefer animals and monsters, but I can make an exception."
msgstr "佩塔，我更喜欢动物和怪物，不过我可以破例一次。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm just teasing you. Just saying that settling down isn't all bad."
msgstr "我在逗你呢。我想说的是，安定下来也不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's certainly worse places to go, I can tell you that."
msgstr "我敢说，肯定还有更糟糕的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though... I can't say you two have picked the most... lovely of spots in Azamire."
msgstr "不过……你们选的这个地方，在阿扎米尔不是……最好的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Your mayor said that we could have the place for free, as long as we got it all fixed "
"up."
msgstr "你们的镇长说，只要我们把这儿修好，就可以免费住。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"There's so much space for a nice little garden in the back as well! I might not have to "
"constantly trek into the woods to get basic herbs anymore."
msgstr "后面还有一大片空地，可以弄个小花园！这样我就不用总去森林找草药了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If only there was some strong, helpful individual who'd be willing to help break down "
"all the rubble..."
msgstr "要是有位强壮的好心人愿意帮忙清理这些碎石就好了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...For a healthy bundle of herbs and meat when we get established?"
msgstr "……等我们安顿下来，会送上一大捆草药和肉作为报酬，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Pass me a shovel, I've got my pickaxe right here."
msgstr "把铲子给我，我正好带了镐头。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Petal claps her hands and motions for Clove to hand you a shovel. She rolls her eyes "
"and scoffs, but noticeably shies away-just a bit-when you take it from her. The house "
"is a mess, but the foundation is still good. With a lot of work, it's in a great spot "
"in town, and could be a wonderful home and shop."
msgstr ""
"佩塔拍了拍手，示意克洛夫把铲子递给你。她翻了个白眼，哼了一声，下意识地往后退了退，虽然只"
"是退了一点。房子虽然破乱，但地基还是好的。房子的地理位置绝佳，只要花点功夫修缮，肯定非常"
"适合居住和开店。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I wonder what Clove might find for dinner. [Provide] X/X [Steel Arrows] - [Fletching "
"Tab Link]"
msgstr "我在想，克洛夫会找什么当晚餐。[Provide] X/X [Steel Arrows] - [Fletching Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These should do nicely. [Talk]"
msgstr "这些应该可以。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Both Petal and Clove work on the house while you break up and remove the rubble. Petal "
"tends to the wild tangle of plants out back, while Clove always seems to be nearby, "
"either breaking down old furniture with a hefty axe, or sweeping up in the spots you've "
"finished. While the two of you work, Clove tries to strike up bits of conversation "
"while Petal stays mysteriously absent, even when she finishes up outside."
msgstr ""
"佩塔和克洛夫负责修整房子，你负责清理碎石。佩塔在屋后打理杂草；克洛夫总是跟着你，要么用斧"
"子砍旧家具，要么打扫你清理过的地方。干活的时候，克洛夫会闲聊几句，而佩塔有点神秘，外面的"
"活儿干完了也看不到她。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I guess sticking around here won't be all bad."
msgstr "我想，留在这里也未必是坏事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No? I don't think so. I get out quite a bit, but it's always nice to have somewhere to "
"come back to."
msgstr "不？我不觉得。我虽然经常出门，但回来有个落脚的地方，还是不错的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It doesn't ever feel... smothering? Knowing that people might wonder where you are, "
"fuss after you..."
msgstr "难道不觉得……压抑吗？想到有人可能会惦记你在哪儿，关心你……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Petal doesn't do that already?"
msgstr "佩塔不就是这样吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, yeah, of course, but she's my sister. I don't know, I guess... I don't want folks "
"to start expecting anything of me."
msgstr "嗯，确实，但我们是姐妹嘛。怎么说呢，我想……我不想别人对我有什么期待。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't think you'll need to worry too much about that. There's plenty of odd folks "
"around here, you'll fit right in."
msgstr "我觉得你不用过于担心。这儿到处都是古怪的人，你会很自在的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gee, thanks, I feel welcome already."
msgstr "呵，谢谢你，我感觉到欢迎了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Any time. I'm kidding, of course, but really, unless you're someone like Lira, who runs "
"the tavern, most people just... go about their days."
msgstr ""
"随时都欢迎。当然，我是开玩笑的。不过说真的，除了像开酒馆的利拉，大多数人都……过得平平淡"
"淡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Plus, you're a hunter, it's kind of normal that you'll head out for days or even weeks "
"at a time, depending on your mark."
msgstr ""
"再说了，你是猎人，你出去一趟就是好几天甚至好几个星期，这也很正常，毕竟狩猎目标不一样嘛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Speaking of which... I don't know the lands too well, I'm used to throwing myself into "
"the woods wherever we travel and just making the best of it."
msgstr "说到这个……我对这儿不太熟。我经常走到哪儿就直接进森林，尽力就行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But... I think I'll actually start being able to hone my craft a bit, sticking in once "
"place for a while... Getting familar with the landscape and hunting grounds."
msgstr ""
"但……如果能在一个地方待一段时间，我或许能好好磨炼一下自己的技能……也能熟悉一下地形和猎场。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I might look around a little bit now, and find us some dinner, actually. If you think "
"you can manage without me, that is."
msgstr "我打算在附近转转，顺便找点东西晚上吃。我是说，如果我不在，你能自己应付的话。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll get by, don't worry."
msgstr "我能应付，别担心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"However... I hope to find us some dinner, too. I know Petal won't let you leave here "
"without feeding you. By any chance, would you happen to have some arrows I could use?"
msgstr ""
"不过……我也想找点东西晚上吃。我知道，佩塔肯定不会让你空着肚子走的。你那儿有没有我能用的"
"箭？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We made a long trek to get here, and I've gone through most of my stock."
msgstr "我们长途跋涉才到这儿，带的东西也快没了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You chuckle at the idea of needing to manage without her, then having her turn around "
"and ask you for help instead. You head out to find some, and as you do, you walk past "
"Petal, who has a dozen or so people in tow, all armed with various tools or carrying "
"lumber. Shockingly efficient, that one."
msgstr ""
"她本该自己应付，结果却转头让你帮忙，你忍不住笑了。你去找箭，经过佩塔时看到她身后跟着十几"
"个人，大家都拿着各种工具或扛着木头。这效率真高啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"This stuff grows worse than most weeds. [Cut] X/X [Ambervine Bush] - [Woodcutting Tab "
"Link]"
msgstr "这东西长得比杂草还多。[Cut] X/X [Ambervine Bush] - [Woodcutting Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looking a bit better now. [Talk]"
msgstr "现在看起来好多了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The arrows you hand to Clove aren't anything special, yet she still takes plenty of "
"time running through a handful of them, inspecting their quality and bend, along with "
"the arrow tips at the end of each, before giving a self-assured nod. She gives a little "
"wave before heading out."
msgstr ""
"你给克洛夫的箭没什么特别，但她还是花了不少时间，仔细检查这些箭的品质、弯曲度和箭头，然后"
"满意地点了点头。她向你挥了挥手，然后就走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You know, where we come from, giving someone arrows for a hunt is as good as a proposal "
"for marriage?"
msgstr "你知道吗，在我们那里，送人箭去打猎，就相当于求婚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Taking an arrow to the shin, I believe it's called, though hardly anyone still believes "
"in that silly custom."
msgstr "有句话这样说，胫骨中了一箭。现在几乎没人相信这种荒唐的习俗了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is that so? And where exactly might that be?"
msgstr "是吗？到底是哪里的习俗呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's from a district in the capital I highly doubt you've gotten to, don't worry about "
"following up on it."
msgstr "是都城的一个区。我敢肯定你没去过那儿，所以别在意了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With your professions, I'm surprised you both came from the capital. What made you turn "
"from the city to being..."
msgstr "以你们的职业来看，没想到你们是从都城来的。是什么让你们离开城市，成了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A couple of women who trek through the boonies and sleep in the dirt?"
msgstr "成了两个在荒野奔波、睡在泥地里的女人？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Something like that."
msgstr "差不多这样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Spend that much time around that many people and see what you think of it after a "
"couple decades."
msgstr "在人群里待着，过个二十年，你就知道是什么感觉了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I think we just wanted out, a bit of room to stretch our legs and see what the world "
"had to offer."
msgstr "我想，我们只是想逃离那里，找个地方放松一下，好好看一看世界。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And now you're settling back down."
msgstr "现在你们又在这儿生根落户了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm sure we'll still go out and visit all the corners of Melvor from time to time, "
"but you know, neither of us are getting any younger."
msgstr "噢，我们肯定还是会出去，去梅尔沃到处看看。但你也知道，我们都不年轻了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"And it's nice to have an occasional bath from time to time. Hard to find that out on "
"the road."
msgstr "偶尔能洗个澡确实不错。出门在外，想找个地方洗澡太难了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I can only imagine. But with how fast your house got put up, I'm sure you could have a "
"whole bathhouse put up in a couple hours if you were so inclined."
msgstr ""
"我完全能想象。不过，你们的房子修得这么快，如果你们真想的话，几个小时就能搭一间浴室。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How'd you get those townsfolk to come and help you so fast?"
msgstr "那些镇民这么快就来帮忙，你是怎么做到的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, those farmers have plenty of pest issues, I hear, and I just so happen to dabble "
"in poisons along with my normal stock of potions."
msgstr "哦，我听说那些农夫想除害虫，而我除了常备的各种药水，恰好也懂一些毒药。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Got anything you think might be handy against... bigger beasts?"
msgstr "有没有什么东西，你觉得可以对付……那些大怪兽？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Not just yet, but I'll keep you in the know. Along with those, I'm working on some "
"herbicides too... took care of most of the tangle in the back, except for those damn "
"Ambervines."
msgstr ""
"暂时没有，不过一有我就告诉你。另外，我还在研制除草剂……屋后的大部分杂草都清理了，就剩下那"
"些该死的琥珀藤了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'd ask Clove to go whack them with that axe of hers, but you seemed to have scared her "
"off. Be a dear, would you?"
msgstr "我本想让克洛夫拿斧子把它们砍了，但你好像把她吓跑了。你能帮我个忙吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You roll your eyes and set to work on the brush behind the house, knocking down the "
"Ambervine where you can. Like Petal claimed, many of the other noxious plants that were "
"back here seem to have withered away."
msgstr ""
"你翻了个白眼，开始清理屋后的灌木，顺便砍了那些琥珀藤。跟佩塔说的一样，这里的其他有害植物"
"似乎大多已经枯萎了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Hopefully Petal hasn't severely poisoned the ground. [Plant] X/X [Sunflower] - [Farming "
"Tab Link]"
msgstr "希望佩塔没有把这块地毒得太重。[Plant] X/X [Sunflower] - [Farming Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Huh, well, I guess the herbalist knows what she's doing. Who'd guess? [Complete Quest "
"Button]"
msgstr "呵，看来这位草药师有两把刷子。谁能想到呢？[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You wipe your brow and just start to lean back against the wall of the house when Clove "
"comes in the newly constructed gate and drops several birds on the ground and sets her "
"bow on a nearby crate."
msgstr ""
"你擦了擦额头，准备靠着屋墙歇会儿。这时，克洛夫从新修的大门走了进来。她将几只鸟扔在地上，"
"把弓放在旁边的一个箱子上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"From smacking rocks to whacking bushes, you truly are a menace to the natural world."
msgstr "从击打岩石到砍伐灌木，你简直就是自然界杀手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Those birds might say the same about you."
msgstr "那些鸟恐怕也这么想你吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't think they'd be saying much of anything at all, anymore. I didn't give them the "
"chance."
msgstr "我想它们应该说不了话了。我根本没给它们说话的机会。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You might have sampled one too many of your sister's potions if you think that bushes "
"are any more talkative."
msgstr "如果你觉得灌木更能说，那你八成是喝多了你妹妹的药水。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Touché."
msgstr "说得对。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you about done brutalizing the shrubbery?"
msgstr "你摧残灌木的活儿都干完了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They'll bother you no longer, m'lady."
msgstr "它们再也不会来烦你了，小姐。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wonderful! Then there's just one final thing for you left to do!"
msgstr "太好了！你还有最后一件事没做！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Where'd the rest of your helpers go?"
msgstr "你的其他帮手去哪儿了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Back to their homes, but they don't get to have dinner here. You do. "
msgstr "回家了，他们没机会在这儿吃晚饭。但你有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus, it'll put a smile on my dear sister's face. You'd like that, wouldn't you?"
msgstr "而且，这还能让我亲爱的妹妹笑一笑。你也希望这样，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Goodness Petal, just get on with it!"
msgstr "天哪，佩塔，快动手吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Like I mentioned, I want to start growing my own herbs, but I know that blight can be a "
"nasty beast to deal with this time of year."
msgstr "我说过，我想自己种草药，但我知道，这个时候如果遇到枯萎病就麻烦了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A few sunflowers can do wonders at holding it and a surprising amount of other types of "
"corruption off."
msgstr "种几棵向日葵效果很好，不仅可以预防枯萎病，还可以有效预防其他疫病。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And how will that put a smile on Clove's face, exactly?"
msgstr "怎么才能让克洛夫开心起来呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They just make me happy... I don't know, always liked 'em."
msgstr "向日葵会让我快乐……怎么说呢，我一直喜欢向日葵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But that hardly matters, the garden is going to be important for keeping any kind of "
"livelihood goin' while we get set up."
msgstr "不过这不重要，在我们安顿下来的这段时间，这片花园是我们维持生计的关键。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just hope Petal's herbicides aren't still lingering around."
msgstr "我只希望佩塔之前用过的除草剂没有残留。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They shouldn't be, but if you start to feel strange, please take extensive notes, I "
"might want to replicate it for my poisons!"
msgstr "不应该呀，但如果你觉得不对劲，请记下来，说不定我能照着调配毒药！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Petal looks a bit too excited at the prospect of you getting sick from her treated "
"land, while Clove occasionally stops by to check if you're feeling off at all before "
"quickly dismissing herself each time."
msgstr ""
"一想到你可能会因为她处理过的土地而生病，佩塔显得很兴奋。克洛夫时不时过来问你有没有不舒"
"服，问完就走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you finish up with the flowers, you catch a whiff of Petal's cooking and let "
"yourself inside. The place isn't 'homey' just yet, but it's far better than the wreck "
"it was just a bit ago, and trust the two of them will give it the final touch-ups it "
"needs.\n"
"\n"
"Clove sets the table and waves you away when you try to help, so you turn to Petal, who "
"brushes past you with three steaming birds balanced on her arm, with a pitcher of... "
"something in the other. \n"
"Using herbs she'd gathered, Petal seasoned the meat to perfection, and Clove produces a "
"few fruits she collected while she was hunting. They pair beautifully with the... "
"concoction that Petal assures you is safe to drink. It's sickly sweet and could be "
"considered tasty, if it weren't for the fact that it leaves you feeling as though "
"you've plunged into an icy lake, but only for a few moments after each sip\n"
"\n"
"Petal pushes your chair towards Clove's every once in a while, and slowly but surely "
"she begins to turn bright red, but plays it off casually. Eventually, you all finish "
"your meals, and Petal takes down a few notes as to how you felt while you drink her "
"beverage. They both thank you for your time, and encourage you to come back once "
"they've set up shop."
msgstr ""
"忙完花草的活儿，你闻到了佩塔做饭的香气，于是自己进了屋。虽然这里还不像家，但跟之前的破败"
"相比，已经好多了。相信她们会完成最后的修整工作。\n"
"\n"
"克洛夫在摆放餐具。看你想帮忙，她挥手让你休息。你转头看着佩塔。佩塔从你身边经过，一只手端"
"着三只热气腾腾的鸟，另一只手提着一壶……不知道什么东西。佩塔用她采的草药给肉调味，味道特别"
"好。克洛夫拿出她在狩猎时采集的果子。这些果子和那壶……喝的很搭。佩塔向你保证，那喝的绝对安"
"全。它的味道甜得腻人。每喝一口都会让你产生一种坠入冰湖的感觉（尽管这种感觉的时间很短），"
"所以也还算美味。\n"
"\n"
"佩塔时不时地将你的椅子往克洛夫那边挪动。克洛夫的脸慢慢红了，但仍然装作没事的样子。吃完"
"后，佩塔记下你喝那壶饮品的感受。她们感谢你的帮助，欢迎你在开店后再来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A Glittering Trap"
msgstr "闪光的陷阱"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A Glittering Trap - Gol has been tasked with taking down a beast near Azamire, and what "
"good would a battle be without a friend by your side?"
msgstr ""
"闪光的陷阱——戈尔接到任务，要去对付阿扎米尔附近的一头野兽。既然要去战斗，身边怎么能没有朋"
"友呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Let's make sure these are sturdy enough to handle... whatever we're fighting. [Provide] "
"X/X [Rune Spear] - [Fletching Tab Link]"
msgstr ""
"我们要确保这些装备足够结实，能够对付……我们要战斗的东西。[Provide] X/X [Rune Spear] - "
"[Fletching Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These look good, let's get Gol. [Talk]"
msgstr "这些看起来不错，我们去找戈尔吧。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A small crowd has gathered around in a tight semi-circle near the front of The Spiced "
"Honey Tavern. There are folks cheering, exclaiming for more or begging to be let into "
"the 'act'. Never one to sit out an exciting moment, you make your way into the throngs "
"of people and find Gol, a towering man with more muscles than sense. He sits under a "
"table and hoists it into the air while several tipsy patrons delicately balance on top "
"of it. He laughs as one of them pours a tankard in his mouth from above, then gently "
"lowers the table back down to the ground. He flexes for the crowd as more people climb "
"onto the table, but he stops mid-pose as his eyes meet yours."
msgstr ""
"香蜜酒馆的前面有一小群人，他们紧紧地围成一个半圆。人群中传来欢呼声，有人起哄说‘再来一"
"个’，有人求着要加入‘表演’。人人都喜欢看热闹。你挤进人群，找到戈尔。他身材高大，肌肉发"
"达，头脑简单。他蹲在桌子底下，将桌子高高举起。几名醉醺醺的顾客小心翼翼地在桌面上保持平"
"衡。其中一名顾客将一大杯酒倒进他嘴里，他笑了，然后轻轻地把桌子放下来。他向大家展示肌肉，"
"这时又有人爬上桌子。当他和你的目光交汇时，他停了下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol must cease his entertainment for now, good people, for Gol has found his friend!"
msgstr "各位，戈尔必须暂停表演了，因为他找到他的朋友啦！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Me?"
msgstr "我？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Of course! You've been instrumental in Gol's rise from a coinless pauper to what he has "
"become today!"
msgstr "当然是你！戈尔从身无分文的穷光蛋变成今天这样，全靠你的帮助！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I will say, you are looking a bit more... put together than last time."
msgstr "说真的，你看起来……比上次好多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That he is! After Gol's travels, he has found many a coin, armed himself better than "
"before, and is now ready to lead his friend to the same riches!"
msgstr ""
"可不是嘛！游历之后，戈尔攒了不少钱，装备也比以前更好了。现在，戈尔准备带上朋友一起去发"
"财！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well... I can't say that I'm not a little interested in what you had in mind, but "
"really, that's not necessary. I'm just happy to see you on your feet, and a bit more "
"clothed than last time."
msgstr ""
"那个……说实话，我有点好奇你是怎么想的，不过这没关系。看到你能站位脚跟，而且穿得也比上次像"
"样些，我就很高兴了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol must insist! Gol has been tasked with slaying a beast just a short jaunt from here, "
"and with your assistance, Gol is sure to be successful once again!"
msgstr ""
"戈尔必须坚持！戈尔接到任务，要去屠杀附近的一头野兽。有你帮忙，戈尔一定能再次成功！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You may not help Gol fight the creature directly, but setting up a site to fight it is "
"very okay!"
msgstr "虽然你不能直接帮戈尔打野兽，但帮忙布置一下场地完全没问题！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh? And what might it be?"
msgstr "哦？到底是什么样的怪兽？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Why remember silly details like the beast's name? Gol only remembers where the beast "
"resides, along with its penchant for gems and shiny things."
msgstr ""
"干嘛要记那些无关紧要的细节，比如野兽的名字？戈尔只记得野兽住在哪里，还有它特别喜欢宝石和"
"闪闪发光的东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'm slightly surprised you used penchant successfully..."
msgstr "……你居然用对了‘特别喜欢’这个词，我有点惊讶……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Depending on the day, I’m not sure I’d use that correctly myself."
msgstr "连我自己有时候都不确定能不能用对。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol is smarter than he looks The brain is a muscle just like all others, and should be "
"exercised to keep it sharp."
msgstr ""
"戈尔比他看起来要聪明。大脑跟身体的其他部位一样，也是一块肌肉，需要通过锻炼来保持敏锐。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"To become smart like Gol, every day, you must split a log with nothing but your head."
msgstr "要想变得像戈尔一样聪明，你每天都要用脑袋劈开一根原木。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Your vision may go fuzzy... and your sense of smell may never be the same. But nothing "
"beats the first time you're able to stoke a fire with wood you've splintered with your "
"own body."
msgstr ""
"你可能会看不清东西……嗅觉也可能变弱。但当你第一次用自己身体劈开的木头生火时，一切都值了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do you understand?"
msgstr "你明白了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "More and more by the minute."
msgstr "越来越明白了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But... concerning training aside, it really is good to see you well, Gol. I'm down for "
"your adventure. What do we need?"
msgstr ""
"不过……抛开修炼不说，看到你没事真是太好了，戈尔。我跟你一起冒险。我们需要准备什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol knew you would be! Gol will lead the way, his sense of direction has been honed as "
"well."
msgstr "戈尔就知道你会来的！戈尔带路，他的方向感也是练过的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But before we depart, Gol would like spears, and many of them."
msgstr "不过在出发前，戈尔需要长矛，很多的长矛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The beast Gol has been entrusted to slay is a slippery one, and we will need to prepare "
"an arena to fight it in."
msgstr "戈尔要去屠杀的那头怪兽特别狡猾。我们需要布置竞技场，准备对战。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'll you be doing in the meantime?"
msgstr "你这段时间打算做什么呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"He will consult with the locals to ensure the best path to the beast. Best of luck, "
"friend."
msgstr "他打算去问问当地人，打听一下寻找那头野兽的最佳路线。祝你好运，朋友。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You watch as Gol dusts himself off and waves to the crowd that has lingered, likely "
"hoping for a bit more amusement before they get on with their days. He calls for Lira "
"with a bit more warmth and familiarity than you were expecting, then the door to the "
"tavern swings shut."
msgstr ""
"你看到戈尔拍了拍身上的灰尘，向周围还没走的人群挥了挥手。这些人可能是想在开始一天的忙碌之"
"前，再多看看热闹。他招呼利拉过来，语气比你预料的更亲切、更熟悉。随后，酒馆的门关了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I feel like I'm arming Gol for war, I hope whatever it is goes down quickly. [Provide] "
"X/X [Rune Javelin] - [Fletching Tab Link]"
msgstr ""
"我感觉自己像在为戈尔备战。我希望这一切快点结束。[Provide] X/X [Rune Javelin] - "
"[Fletching Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll have a problem if this isn't enough. [Talk]"
msgstr "如果这些不够，我们就麻烦了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With your rune spears in tow, you enter the Spiced Honey Tavern and find Gol with "
"several maps laid out in front of him, with a surprisingly methodical route planned out "
"for your journey. Lira comes by and tops off his tankard."
msgstr ""
"你带着符文长矛走进香蜜酒馆，发现戈尔面前有几张地图，上面为你们的旅程规划了一条特别清晰的"
"路线。利拉走过来，给他的酒杯倒满。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, and here's your friend now! You two stay safe, okay?"
msgstr "啊，你的朋友来了！你们两个注意安全，好吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol is always safe, but he will also ensure his friend's safety as well. You have Gol's "
"word."
msgstr "戈尔一直很安全，他也会确保自己的朋友安全。这是戈尔的承诺。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll hold you to that. Best of luck!"
msgstr "我记住你的话了。一切顺利！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You two seem to get along nicely."
msgstr "你们两个似乎相处得不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Lira appreciates Gol's humor and physique in equal measure, along with his ability to "
"drink as much as half her tavern."
msgstr "利拉欣赏戈尔的幽默，也欣赏他的体格，还有他能喝光半个酒馆的酒量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol also helps move things around, from time to time."
msgstr "戈尔偶尔也会帮忙搬东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I feel as if you could help her relocate the whole building if you set your mind to it."
msgstr "我觉得，只要你愿意，你甚至能帮她把整个房子都搬走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The flimsy building would not hold up to Gol's might. Trust Gol. He has tried before."
msgstr "这房子摇摇欲坠，经不起戈尔的威力。相信戈尔。他之前试过。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You impress and terrify me."
msgstr "我佩服你，也怕你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you a building?"
msgstr "你是房子吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...No?"
msgstr "……不是？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Than you have nothing to fear, friend!"
msgstr "那你没什么可怕的，朋友！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol's only enemies are beasts, monsters, and taxes."
msgstr "戈尔的敌人只有野兽、怪物和税收。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not the people that robbed you when we first met?"
msgstr "我们第一次见面时，抢你的那些人呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How'd they pull one over on you, anyway? You're a mountain of a man."
msgstr "他们到底是怎么抢的你？你壮得像座山。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nay. Gol refuses to fight people unless his life depends on it."
msgstr "不。除非有生命危险，否则戈尔不会跟人打架。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol has spilled enough blood of his countrymen, Gol wishes to do so no longer."
msgstr "戈尔手上沾了太多同胞的鲜血，他再也不想这样了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lucky them, I'd say."
msgstr "那他们可真幸运。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Indeed. But this talk has excited Gol. Have you got the spears?"
msgstr "确实。不过，这次交谈让戈尔兴奋起来了。你带长矛了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That I have!"
msgstr "带了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Excellent. These look good, but..."
msgstr "很好。这些看起来不错，不过……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Would you be willing to make some that are also... smaller?"
msgstr "你愿意再做一些……更小的吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hmmm, you mean like javelins?"
msgstr "嗯，你是说标枪那样的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol is not familiar."
msgstr "戈尔不太明白。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're... somewhere between bolts and spears, I'd say."
msgstr "怎么说呢……介于弩箭和长矛之间的那种。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Then yes, that is what Gol desires! Gol will meet you on the outskirts of town when you "
"are done."
msgstr "对，这就是戈尔想要的！等你做好，戈尔在城郊等你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You set off to procure some javelins as well, wondering what kind of beast might need "
"both to take down. You hear a couple passerby call out to Gol, asking if he can spare a "
"moment to help them right an overturned wagon, to which he laughs and asks them to lead "
"the way."
msgstr ""
"你出发去找标枪。你心想，到底是什么样的野兽，要用这些东西才能对付。你听到有几个路人叫戈尔"
"帮忙扶一下翻倒的马车。戈尔笑了笑，让他们带路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope that payout is as good as he claims."
msgstr "希望报酬真像他说的那样丰厚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This should be enough to fill a chest or two. [Talk]"
msgstr "这些应该够装一两个箱子了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The javelins have a good heft, and feel solid enough for whatever Gol intends. You wish-"
"not for the first time-that you had more information about what you'd be fighting, but "
"shockingly feel that Gol has the situation handled. The man's... unique, but certainly "
"capable.\n"
"\n"
"When you meet him, he takes the javelins from you and seems pleased, then leads the way "
"deep into the woods. He seems confident about his heading and leads you to a large "
"outcropping that juts from the sand. "
msgstr ""
"标枪分量很重，特别结实，应该够戈尔用了。你再次感觉，要是你对即将面对的敌人多一点了解就好"
"了。但令你惊讶的是，你感觉戈尔自己就可以应付。那家伙……有些古怪，但确实有本事。\n"
"\n"
"戈尔见到你后，接过你手里的标枪，看起来很满意。随后他就带路向森林深处走去。他似乎很清楚方"
"向，带你走到了一处冒出沙地的巨大岩石。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This will be an excellent place to lure the sea beast to!"
msgstr "这是引诱那头海洋野兽的好地方！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The sand will dry it out, and the rock will give us solid ground to fight upon, as long "
"as the tide is low."
msgstr "退潮时，沙地会吸干野兽身上的水分，这块岩石是我们战斗的坚固堡垒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, you were being literal when you mentioned it being a slippery beast?"
msgstr "噢，你之前说它又湿又滑，说的是字面意思啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye, so Gol was told, at least. A slimy one at that."
msgstr "没错，至少戈尔听说的是这样。而且它还黏糊糊的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Out of water, its eyesight is poor, and the beast is said to be quite daft. Gol hopes "
"to lure it up here from the water after preparing a battleground of sorts."
msgstr "离开水后，它的视力变差，脑子也会变笨。戈尔打算先布置战场，再把它从水里引过来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll leave the spears with you then, I'm sure you've got something in mind?"
msgstr "这些长矛就交给你了，想必你已经有主意了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol is something of a visionary when it comes to these kinds of things."
msgstr "一遇到这种事，戈尔就变得有远见。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol has fallen for many a trap in his day, he knows how to think like these beasts."
msgstr "戈尔没少掉进陷阱，他知道这些野兽的想法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You mentioned it likes shiny things too, hm?"
msgstr "你刚说它还喜欢闪闪发光的东西，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That it does! Again, much like Gol. The beast has good tastes."
msgstr "对！这一点跟戈尔很像。这野兽的品味不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We will make it seem as if a ship carrying riches has run aground, and spilled forth "
"its plunder."
msgstr "我们要制造一种假象：一艘装满财宝的船搁浅了，财宝散落一地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"There are many wrecks along the coast here, we shall bring them here when the tide "
"rises."
msgstr "这片海岸有很多沉船残骸，我们等涨潮的时候把那些残骸弄过来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I uh... Don't think I can move whole chunks of ship, Gol."
msgstr "那个……我觉得我搬不动那么大的残骸，戈尔。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No, no, of course not. You are better for the finer details, friend, Gol will handle "
"the heavy lifting."
msgstr "不，不，当然不用你搬。你更适合做细活儿，朋友。体力活就交给戈尔吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Could you get the gems while Gol finishes up here?"
msgstr "戈尔在这儿忙。你能把宝石拿过来吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sounds like a plan to me! See you soon."
msgstr "听起来是个好主意！一会见。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you head off, Gol sets to work on relocating some of the coastal debris. He sinks "
"his fingers into the spongy wood of the back quarter of a wrecked schooner. It's far "
"from a full boat, sure, but even Gol looks small next to it. His feet sink into the "
"sand as he begins to push, and sure enough, the wreck begins to move-slowly but surely-"
"across the sand."
msgstr ""
"等你离开，戈尔开始搬海岸上的残骸。他将手指插入一艘失事纵帆船的船尾残骸，那木头已经软了。"
"这只是那艘船的一部分，但即便如此，戈尔在它面前也显得很小。他的脚陷入泥沙，开始用力推。果"
"然，那残骸开始动了，在沙滩上慢慢移动。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll make this extra messy, so it glows even brighter."
msgstr "我要把它弄得更乱一点，这样看起来更明显。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This should be everything we need. - [Complete Quest Button]"
msgstr "这些东西应该够了。[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You return to the ambush site with enough gems to fill a small chest and find Gol "
"perched on top of his handiwork. The tide is higher than before, sea foam curls and "
"retreats just over the edge of the outcrop. Gol's scene is extraordinarily convincing, "
"with the wreckage arranged to look as though a ship washed ashore and was split on the "
"rocky outcrop. He even seems to have relocated the mast of another ship and propped it "
"up on the wreck, allowing the tattered sail to tangle itself nicely amongst the debris. "
"You carefully wade through the waist-deep water, avoiding the spears jutting out of the "
"sand, and clamber onto the rocky platform."
msgstr ""
"你带着宝石回到伏击的地方。这些宝石够装一个小箱子了。你发现戈尔蹲在他的“杰作”上。潮水比先"
"前更高了，海浪卷着泡沫，拍打着岩礁的边缘。戈尔布置的场地十分逼真。摆放的残骸看起来就像一"
"艘船被冲上岸，在岩礁上撞碎了。他甚至还拿了另一艘船的桅杆，插在残骸上，破烂的帆布自然地缠"
"绕在残骸周围。海水到了腰，你小心翼翼地走在水里，避开冒出泥沙的长矛，爬上那块岩石。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol... this is scarily good. You've really outdone yourself!"
msgstr "戈尔……这也太棒了。这次比以前还好！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What can Gol say? He has a knack for setting a good scene."
msgstr "戈尔能说什么呢？他本来就擅长布置场景。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The gems look lovely as well. If Gol hadn't assembled this himself, Gol may even wander "
"into this ambush."
msgstr "那些宝石看起来也不错。如果不是戈尔亲手布置的，恐怕他自己也会掉进去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, do your best not to. You mentioned that the beast had a bounty on its head, yeah?"
msgstr "你可千万别进去。你之前说那头野兽有赏金，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That it does! It has been tearing through ships like Gol does ale. That's why Gol had "
"this idea in the first place."
msgstr "对！它破坏船的时候，就跟戈尔喝麦芽酒一样。所以戈尔是最先想到这个办法的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good line of reasoning, I'd say. So... will the gems be enough, do you think?"
msgstr "不得不说，这逻辑不错。那么……你觉得宝石够了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Our hook is good, but Gol thinks we lack bait, still."
msgstr "我们的钩子还行，但戈尔觉得还缺诱饵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol is a bit more keen on the... pugilistic arts, and rarely has the patience for "
"fishing."
msgstr "戈尔更喜欢……拳脚功夫，对钓鱼没什么耐心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol wonders if you know a good way to lure the creature into our ambush."
msgstr "戈尔在想，你有没有什么好法子，能把野兽引到伏击的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If I were to take some Glowfin and cut them up, I'd say the bait would be pretty "
"convincing for a sea-based monster."
msgstr "如果把荧光鳍鱼切成块，拿来当诱饵，对海里的怪物应该很有吸引力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"This does sound promising. Gol will put the finishing touches on our battleground while "
"you handle the bait?"
msgstr "这听起来不错。你来准备诱饵，戈尔最后再完善一下我们的战场，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You nod and set off to gather enough Glowfin bait to lure whatever creature this may be "
"to shore. Gol immediately gets to work on the finer details, putting a surprising "
"amount of care into perfecting the wreck, making it truly look natural."
msgstr ""
"你点点头，动身去收集足够的荧光鳍鱼诱饵，好将野兽引到岸边。戈尔马上开始处理细节，十分仔细"
"地完善残骸，让它看起来自然逼真。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol seems positively buzzing with energy, pleased to see the plan come together. Gol "
"did a phenomenal job making the wreck look natural, which was only further helped by "
"the tide coming through and helping the wreckage sink into the sand. \n"
"\n"
"You do your best to squeeze the glowfin bait's juice all around the chest before "
"tucking it in amongst the gemstones. In the twilight, the chest looks like a burning "
"beacon, with the glowfin juice refracting off the gemstones radiantly.\n"
"\n"
"Gol leads you away from the chest and you scrub your hands in the water, careful to "
"avoid impaling yourself on the spears tucked into the sand all around your ambush site. "
"After an hour or so of waiting in the water, a wet, hulking monster slowly lifts itself "
"out of the sea and half walks, half slithers towards the gem-filled chest. \n"
"\n"
"Gol slaps your shoulder hard enough to dislocate it, silently yelling in excitment "
"before leaping out of the water and towards the beast, who hardly knows what to make "
"out of the golith running towards it. Gol tosses javelin after javelin, their rune "
"blades sinking into the creature's slimy flesh. He narrowly tucks its large, snapping "
"maw as it turns to retreat towards the water. Like a fish on a barb, the angled spears "
"it walked over now impale it and it shrieks, tearing off long, writhing tail in the "
"process. Gol tries his best to keep hold of the creature, but its thick slime coats him "
"entirely, and it just manages to slip back into the ocean, but not unscathed.\n"
"\n"
"Gol is pleased regardless, claiming that the tail is enough to show most of you twos' "
"efforts. True to his word, he finds you in Azamire several days later with your half of "
"the payout, and you feel it was well-worth the time... but part of you wonders if "
"there's a way to track the beast down and take it out once and for all."
msgstr ""
"戈尔显得格外兴奋，对计划的进展十分满意。戈尔做得很好，布置的残骸看起来很自然。潮水来的时"
"候，残骸陷入泥沙，看起来更加自然逼真。\n"
"\n"
"你尽力将荧光鳍鱼诱饵的汁液涂在箱子的四周，然后将箱子塞到一堆宝石里面。在暮色中，箱子就像"
"一座燃烧的灯塔，诱饵汁液在宝石上闪闪发光。\n"
"\n"
"戈尔带你离开箱子。你小心翼翼地在水里洗手，以免被伏击陷阱周围泥沙里的长矛刺伤。在水里等了"
"大约一个小时，一头湿漉漉、庞大的怪物慢慢露出水面。它半走半爬，慢慢靠近装满宝石的箱子。\n"
"\n"
"戈尔重重拍了一下你的肩膀，差点把你的肩膀拍脱臼。他特别兴奋，内心狂叫。他跳出水面，直接向"
"那头野兽扑去。野兽没想到会有这样一个巨人扑过来。戈尔连续扔出标枪，标枪上的符文进入野兽黏"
"糊糊的血肉之中。当野兽转身回到水里的时候，他刚好躲开了那张血盆大口。尖锐的长矛刺入野兽，"
"就像鱼钩上的一条鱼。它尖叫挣扎，扯断了那条不断扭动的长尾巴。\n"
"\n"
"戈尔用尽全力，想要抓住那头野兽。但它身上有厚厚的粘液，戈尔根本抓不住。最终，那头野兽逃回"
"了海里。不过，它也受了伤。戈尔还算满意，毕竟那条尾巴已经足以证明你们二人的努力了。几天"
"后，他果真在阿扎米尔找到你，给了你一半的报酬。你觉得这段时间的辛苦非常值得……但你心想，有"
"没有什么办法能追踪那头野兽，把它彻底消灭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Four Sentries"
msgstr "四位哨兵"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The Four Sentries - Morlin and his crew have made substantial progress in unearthing "
"the lost civilization you helped uncover, but have run into another roadblock. With "
"your help, perhaps you'll finally uncover the city proper?"
msgstr ""
"四位哨兵——莫林和他的人在发掘你之前帮忙发现的那处文明遗迹时，取得了重大进展。但现在又有了"
"新问题。如果你能帮忙，或许最终能够揭开这座城市的奥秘？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're asking for stuff without even seeing me, now..."
msgstr "还没见到我，就跟我要东西……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope this is plenty. [Talk]"
msgstr "希望这些够了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You stumble across Magnavous bumbling through Azamire's square, asking people if "
"they've seen you. Many either shake their heads or mention your various comings and "
"goings, but few have solid answers as to where she could look next. You stand back and "
"watch as she shakes down a couple others, who point you out. She looks pleased to have "
"come across you, and quite a bit more sure of herself than the last time you saw her. "
"She still firmly clutches one of the staves you made her, but she walks far more "
"proudly and confidently."
msgstr ""
"你偶然看见麦格纳沃斯在阿扎米尔广场上乱转，到处问有没有见过你。有人摇头，有人说看到过你，"
"但没人明确告诉她应该去哪儿找你。你站在一旁，看她又问了几个人。那些人指了你。她看见你很高"
"兴。跟上次见她比起来，她看起来自信多了。她手里还紧紧握着你做的那根法杖，走起路来更加昂首"
"挺胸、更加自信。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Having fun standing there and watching me? You could have come and said hello."
msgstr "站在那儿看我挺开心的嘛？你可以直接过来打招呼呀。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You got there eventually! I wanted to see how long it'd take."
msgstr "你总算来了！我还在想，你什么时候才到。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, if you've had your fun, we must make haste! I have so much to show you!"
msgstr "好了，既然你热闹看够了，那就赶紧吧！我有好多东西给你看！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My mentor Morlin has-"
msgstr "我的导师莫林——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, he's officially your mentor now?"
msgstr "等等，他正式成为你的导师了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Indeed! With no small part thanks to your help, but I will catch you up along the way."
msgstr "对呀！多亏了你帮忙。路上我再跟你细说。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The long and short of it-which you'll see when we get there-is that Whudgrath has "
"uncovered what seems to be the gates to the city."
msgstr "简单来说，伍德格拉斯发现了像是城门的东西，等你到了就知道了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But they're locked."
msgstr "但它们都锁着。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But they-"
msgstr "但它们——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, yes, how'd you know?"
msgstr "等等，没错，你怎么知道？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What? Like one of these would ever be simple."
msgstr "什么？这种事哪有那么简单。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Imagine that. You come out to find me and say, \"Hey [i]{0}[/i], things were incredibly "
"easy and straightforward.\""
msgstr "你真敢想。你跑来找我，跟我说：“嘿，[i]{0}[/i]，事情特别简单。”"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"\"We've taken care of all the hard work, come and collect as many armfuls of treasure "
"as you desire.\""
msgstr "“所有的苦活累活我们都干完了，快来拿财宝吧，想拿多少就拿多少。”"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... yeah, when you put it that way...."
msgstr "嗯……好吧，既然你都这么说了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So, what do ya need?"
msgstr "那你需要什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, the stone is getting harder to work through. Morlin thinks that it may be "
"magically enhanced since we're getting closer to the city."
msgstr "莫林觉得可能是因为我们离城市越来越近，岩石被施了魔法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I have a theory that the properties of Dawnsteel may be enough to get through it but..."
msgstr "我推测，要砸开岩石，或许可以利用黎明钢的特性，不过……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With all of my magical studies, I wouldn't say I'm particularly suited for mining work."
msgstr "我研究过很多魔法，但采矿的话，我不太合适。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nothing to be ashamed of. There's a reason Morlin hired a dwarven crew, eh?"
msgstr "没什么好丢人的。莫林雇矮人来干活是有原因的，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll meet you on the edge of town when I'm ready."
msgstr "等我准备好了，就去小镇边找你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You head off in search of enough material to outfit Whudgrath's crew, and then some. No "
"use needing to come back half a dozen times because they needed more tools. Plus, the "
"more useful you make yourself, you could argue in favor of a bigger cut."
msgstr ""
"你出发去找足够的材料，不仅要给伍德格拉斯那帮人做装备，还要留一些。要是他们又缺工具，就不"
"用来回再跑几趟了。而且，你表现得越有用，就能争取更多的报酬。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure this is what I need to do."
msgstr "我确定这是我需要做的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's see if this stops that vapor. [Insert]"
msgstr "看看这能不能止住雾气。[Insert]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With enough Dawnsteel to outfit a small army, you meet up with Magnavous. She takes you "
"out to the dig site, which has seen some drastic changes since you were here last. The "
"hillside has been completely carved away, revealing that most of what you'd seen "
"previously were ancillary buildings, and possibly even a second, more recent town built "
"over the top of it within the last couple hundred years, according to Magnavous.\n"
"\n"
"Whudgrath meets up with you shortly into your tour of the site, and happily takes the "
"Dawnsteel from you. He leads you on a short walk down a carved out recess in the "
"ground, that ends in two massive doors which rival the capital's famous gate. It’s dim, "
"the ceiling not yet fully carved away, but even so you can make out four enormous "
"slouched statues set into the walls, with all of them being about five times your size, "
"even hunched over as they are. They're all quite weathered, but it's still clear to see "
"they were modeled after wizards of their time, each with painted stone robes and "
"outstretched but empty hands. Most noticeably, they are very obviously not human. They "
"all have four arms and long, rectangular faces. Each has a gemstone set into its "
"forehead and seems to emanate a vapor of some kind..."
msgstr ""
"你带着黎明钢和麦格纳沃斯会合。这些钢足够武装一支小军队了。她带你来到挖掘现场。跟你上次来"
"相比，这里的变化很大。山坡已经被彻底挖开，你之前看到的大多是附属建筑。麦格纳沃斯说，这上"
"面可能还有第二座城镇，那是近几百年才修的。\n"
"\n"
"你参观挖掘现场没多久，伍德格拉斯找到你，高兴地收下你带来的黎明钢。他带你走到一条开凿的地"
"下通道，通道尽头有两扇大门，跟都城那扇有名的大门差不多。通道里光线昏暗，顶部还没完全凿"
"开。即便如此，你还是能认出墙上的四尊巨大雕像。它们弯腰弓背，体型相当于你的五倍。那些雕像"
"饱经风霜，但仍能看出雕刻原型是当时的法师。它们穿着绘有纹饰的石袍，双臂展开，两手空空。最"
"引人注意的是，那些雕像显然不是人类。每尊雕像都有四条手臂，脸型又长又方。它们额头上都镶着"
"一颗宝石，似乎在散发某种雾气……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Lovely work you've got here... Don't know if you made these or found 'em, but my boys "
"will appreciate it nonetheless."
msgstr "你这东西真不错……不知道是你自己做的还是找的。我的伙计们肯定会喜欢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Ha! Won't even make you swing a pick this time, think Morlin's got some more important "
"work for ya."
msgstr "哈！这次就不让你用镐头了，我想莫林还有更重要的事交给你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Yeah? Is it down that same tunnel we found past that cursed door, or... is it... this?"
msgstr "什么？是要去那扇被诅咒之门后面的隧道里，还是……就是……这里？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Ah, that little passage! Turns out, that was a teeny little side exit that workers used "
"to use..."
msgstr "啊，那条小通道啊！原来是工人用过的一个侧面小出口……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Think it ended up leading to a bunkhouse or somethin'."
msgstr "好像是通往工人宿舍之类的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We think these doors lead to the city proper."
msgstr "我们推测，这些门通往城市。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And... where our problem lies."
msgstr "而……这就是我们遇到的问题。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'll spare you the finer details, but Whudgrath and his crew have carved out the whole "
"hillside, and we haven't found another way in."
msgstr ""
"细节我就不多说了。总之，伍德格拉斯和他的人把整个山坡都挖空了，我们没找到别的入口。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And I don't assume we can just dig around the doors?"
msgstr "难道我们不能在这些门的周围挖一条路吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Be a pretty terrible gate if we could, hm?"
msgstr "如果这样，那门就没用了，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Much of what Whudgrath’s crew has dug through seems to be more... loose. The stone of "
"the entrance is magically reinforced."
msgstr "伍德格拉斯那帮人挖的地方，大多比较……松散。入口的岩石被施了魔法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morlin has been trying-"
msgstr "莫林一直在试——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And failing."
msgstr "但没成功。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To find a way to undo it. So, we're stuck with the door."
msgstr "要想办法解除魔法。所以，我们被这扇门拦住了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I see. I don't suppose you've tried knocking?"
msgstr "我明白了。你们试过敲门了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It was the first thing Whudgrath did."
msgstr "伍德格拉斯做的第一件事就是敲门。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I blew up a lil' bit."
msgstr "我炸了一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you... okay?"
msgstr "你……没事吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Never better! But now I'm pretty keen on opening it up too. Gotta be something good in "
"there, I'm sure."
msgstr "好得不能再好了！不过我现在也很想打开看看。里面肯定有好东西，我敢肯定。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Set into the four statues are a set of passages, which, roughly translated, talk about "
"being sealed, armed, and adorned."
msgstr "那四座雕像上刻着几段文字，大概是说封印、武装和装饰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, they're wizards, so armed and adorned likely mean... staves and jewelry. As far "
"as sealed though... Maybe it'd stop whatever it is that they're... leaking."
msgstr ""
"既然它们是法师，那武装和装饰可能指的是……法杖和珠宝。至于封印……也许是为了阻止什么东西……泄"
"露出来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Ah, the vapor. Morlin took a look at it earlier, worried it was poisonous. It was "
"magical in nature, but it’s anyone’s guess what it was."
msgstr ""
"啊，是雾气。莫林之前看过，担心雾气有毒。雾气本质上是魔法产生的，但到底是什么，谁也不知"
"道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any clue on how we can plug them up?"
msgstr "有什么办法把它们堵上吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I had a stint in a military company a while back, and it always seemed that the "
"crossbowmen were the best answer to riddling those flimsy little mages with bolts."
msgstr ""
"我以前在军队里待过。当时大家都认为，对付那些身体脆弱的法师，最好的办法是用弩箭射。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ahem."
msgstr "呃哼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Er... no offense."
msgstr "呃……别介意啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The gemstones of the four mages stick out to you, and make the answer feel rather "
"clear. If you're to make bolts to 'seal' them, they'd likely line up with the gemstone "
"motif they have going on. "
msgstr ""
"那四位法师身上的宝石十分引人注目，所以答案就清楚了。要想制作弩箭来‘封印’他们，弩箭的设计"
"可能要跟他们身上的宝石图案一致。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That seems... pretty sensible, though... morbid."
msgstr "这似乎……挺合理的，但……有点恐怖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll give it a shot, then."
msgstr "那我们试一试。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Before you head out, you inspect each of the statues once more while Magnavous and "
"Whudgrath set to work on their own tasks. The site still needs a lot of work. The gate "
"is barely lit by what little sunlight filters in from outside and the few lanterns at "
"its base. You're sure you'll get a better look at the statues when the chamber is fully "
"prepped, but the gemstones still catch the faint cavern light perfectly as you look "
"them over. Topaz, sapphire, ruby, and emerald - all gemstones that'd fit neatly as tips "
"of your bolts.\n"
"\n"
"Feeling self-assured, you head off to prepare to seal the four sentries."
msgstr ""
"出发之前，你又仔细观察了每尊雕像。与此同时，麦格纳沃斯和伍德格拉斯也开始忙手上的活儿。这"
"里还有很多活儿。大门那里光线昏暗，只有外面透进来的微弱日光，以及门底的几盏提灯。你心想，"
"等这里完全收拾好，一定能清楚看看这些雕像。即便洞里光线昏暗，那些宝石依然闪闪发光。黄宝"
"石、蓝宝石、红宝石、祖母绿——在弩箭箭头上镶嵌这些宝石，再合适不过了。\n"
"\n"
"你信心满满，准备封印四尊雕像。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "At least I know I'm helping her confidence."
msgstr "至少我知道，我能帮她找回信心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Drop off the staves. [Talk]"
msgstr "放下木杖。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gemstone-tipped bolts in-hand, you slowly work your way around each of the statues. "
"Each fits in the openings nicely, and lock into place with a firm and resonate snap. "
"Magnavous begins to do the same while Whudgrath holds a lantern aloft. Soon enough, the "
"vapor that twisted and curled up towards the ceiling has been stopped. All at once, the "
"statues seem to heave and twist. Where they once hunched and gaunt, sealing them seems "
"to have changed the stone outright, causing the figures to warp into more imposing, "
"able-bodied versions of themselves."
msgstr ""
"你拿着镶嵌宝石的弩箭，慢慢绕着雕像走。弩箭精准射入雕像上的孔洞，清脆的一声响，箭头嵌入雕"
"像。麦格纳沃斯也开始这样做，伍德格拉斯高举着提灯。没过多久，之前盘旋上升的雾气就消散了。"
"这时，雕像好像动了，扭曲变形。封印之后，原本佝偻枯瘦的雕像完全变了，它们扭曲变形，变得更"
"威武、更强壮。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, that seems promising."
msgstr "看来效果不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Step one down, two more to go. They seem to be in fighting shape..."
msgstr "第一步完成了，还有两步。他们似乎可以随时开始战斗……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Time to arm them."
msgstr "是时候武装了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Now, I'm as game for a scrap as anyone, but you don't find it concerning at all, giving "
"them weapons?"
msgstr "其实我也挺好战的，但要给他们武器，难道你一点儿也不担心吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just me?"
msgstr "只有我这么想吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It feels right. Besides, I'd say they feel more like guardians of this place than "
"combatants."
msgstr "我觉得可以。而且，与其说是战士，我感觉他们更像是这里的守护者。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Right, and... do you think the city's guardians would take too kindly to us plundering "
"their home?"
msgstr "没错。那……如果我们洗劫了这些守护者的家园，他们会乐意吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'll call Morlin in soon, once we determine what we'll arm them with. He'll be able to "
"protect us, if they decide we're a threat."
msgstr ""
"等我们确定给他们的武器，我就把莫林叫来。如果他们认为我们是一种威胁，他可以保护我们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll do my best to appear... friendly. How's my smile?"
msgstr "我会尽力表现得……友好一些。我笑得怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...It reminds me of a dog baring its teeth..."
msgstr "……看起来像一条龇牙咧嘴的狗……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hmm. Maybe a no on the smile then."
msgstr "嗯。那还是别笑了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The four of them look like mages, just like you Magnavous."
msgstr "他们四个看起来像是法师，跟你一样，麦格纳沃斯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"And you made me this delightful staff. Think you could do the same here? One for each "
"of the base elements?"
msgstr ""
"你之前给我做了这根法杖，我很满意。你能不能再做几根一样的？每种元素做一根，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They'd be a bit more like toothpicks for them, no?"
msgstr "对他们来说，这些法杖就像牙签一样，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, Morlin has been teaching me this spell that allows me to take multiple items and "
"combine them into a much larger version of themselves."
msgstr "嗯，莫林一直在教我咒语，可以把几个东西合在一起，变成一个更大的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How oddly convenient... How'd that come up?"
msgstr "这方便得有点奇怪了……你怎么发现这个咒语的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It was in his first published book, \"101 Spells To Make You A Master Wizard!\" I've "
"been trying to get through them all since I got here."
msgstr ""
"在他出版的第一本书里，书名叫“让你成为大巫师的101个咒语”！自从我到这儿，就一直试着把书里"
"的咒语都学一遍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Huh, alright... Seems simple enough. So, you probably just need a couple of each staff, "
"or..?"
msgstr "呵，好吧……听起来挺简单的。所以，你可能只需要几根一样的法杖，还是……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well... I'm not too good at it yet. We've been running all over this dig site for a "
"while now, I haven't had long to practice."
msgstr "那个……我还没练好咒语。我们在挖掘现场跑来跑去，我没什么时间练习。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But you can do it, right?"
msgstr "但你可以做，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes! But... it's just not very efficient yet."
msgstr "对！不过……效率还不是很高。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll get to work then."
msgstr "……那我就开始干活了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Part of you wishes that Morlin could just come do the spell, but deep down, you know "
"it'll be good for Magnavous to do this for her training. At the very least, it'll help "
"her feel a bit more confident, even if it does mean you have to make... substantially "
"more staves."
msgstr ""
"你有点希望莫林能直接过来做这个咒语，但转念一想，这可以让麦格纳沃斯历练。至少，可以让她变"
"得更有自信，尽管这意味着你需要……多做好几根法杖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know, that old man makes a good point..."
msgstr "你知道，那老头说的有道理……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope this works...  [Complete Quest Button]"
msgstr "希望这能行得通……[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you hand the staves to Magnavous one by one, they slowly but surely get combined "
"into one. Eventually, they get big enough that Whudgrath and his crew take over in "
"holding them, and then placing them into the statues’ hands. When the four of them are "
"armed, they slam them into the ground and the orb at the end of each begins to glow.\n"
"\n"
"Morlin enters, and lets out a low whistle when he sees the progress that has been made."
msgstr ""
"你将法杖一根一根递给麦格纳沃斯。那些法杖慢慢合在一起。最后，它们变得足够大。伍德格拉斯和"
"他的人接过来，把它们放到雕像的手中。当四座雕像都武装完毕，他们将法杖砸向地面，每根法杖顶"
"端的圆球亮了起来。\n"
"\n"
"莫林走进来，看到眼前的场景，轻轻吹了一声口哨。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My my my, I see you all have been making good progress!"
msgstr "哎呀，看来进行得不错嘛！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That we have! And what have you been up to?"
msgstr "确实不错！你最近在忙什么呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Taking a nap!"
msgstr "睡了一觉！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've been here for... quite a while."
msgstr "我在这儿待了……很长一段时间。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Do you see this beard? Just how old do you think I am? You've got to stay well rested "
"at my age."
msgstr "看到这胡子了吗？你觉得我多大年纪？到了我这个年纪，要休息好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Plus, my apprentice is becoming quite capable! Thank you for helping her out, by the "
"way. Both here, and before she found her way to the site."
msgstr "而且，我徒弟现在可能干了！顺便，谢谢你帮她。无论是在这儿，还是她来这儿之前。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I think Azamire would be a burning crater if I didn't, but it's my pleasure. She's "
"quite capable."
msgstr "如果我不帮她，阿扎米尔恐怕就是一个冒着烟的大坑了。不过，我乐意帮她。她很能干。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That she is!"
msgstr "确实能干！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Enough about me, we've only got one more thing to do before we're done!"
msgstr "不说我了，在彻底结束之前，我们还有一件事要做！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That's right, but I have no idea what to adorn them in. They've already got... robes, "
"kind of."
msgstr "没错，但我不知道怎么装饰他们。他们已经……有长袍之类的东西了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is where a master wizard comes into play, children."
msgstr "孩子们，是时候请出大巫师了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're clearly missing their swag, as the kids say."
msgstr "用年轻人的话说，他们显然没有“范儿”。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've never heard a kid say that."
msgstr "我没听哪个年轻人说过。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Neither have I."
msgstr "……我也没听过。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Have to say I'm in agreement."
msgstr "不得不说，我同意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, you clearly aren't hip, like old man Morlin. Behold!"
msgstr "那你确实不够时髦，不像老头莫林。瞧好了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Morlin throws back his robes to show off a concerning amount of jewelry. Dozens of "
"necklaces, bracelets, and rings adorn his body. They sparkle brilliantly in the low-"
"light, so much so that you worry you'd be blinded if it was any brighter in the cavern. "
"He goes on to talk about how most keep it far too simple, limiting themselves to only a "
"few enchanted pieces of jewelry at a time, but that a master wizard such as himself "
"isn't held back by such limitations. Whudgrath asks if they can just use his jewelry, "
"to which he scoffs. He glances over the statues and produces a list.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Much like last time he tried to make a list, the first page is cryptic, detailing "
"something about an excitable lizard housekeeper and her many cleaning adventures, but "
"he burns it before you can get more than a glance as to its contents. He hands the "
"veritable laundry list of jewelry to you, and assures you that your efforts will be "
"reflected in your cut of... whatever may lie inside."
msgstr ""
"莫林掀开长袍，露出琳琅满目的珠宝。他身上挂了几十条项链、手链和戒指。这些珠宝在昏暗中闪闪"
"发光。如果洞里再亮一点，恐怕你的眼睛都要瞎了。他说，大多数人都太朴素了，每次最多只戴几件"
"附魔珠宝。而像他这样的大巫师，没有这种限制。伍德格拉斯问能不能用一下他身上的珠宝，他轻蔑"
"地笑了。他扫视了那些雕像，掏出了一张清单。\n"
"\n"
"跟他上次尝试列清单一样，第一页模糊不清，大概是讲一位兴奋的蜥蜴管家以及她的种种清洁冒险。"
"但还没等你看清上面的内容，他就烧了。他把那张长长的珠宝清单递给你，保证你的付出会有一份……"
"至于具体是什么，就不知道了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Everyone begins layering on the amulets as best they can, taking wild guesses as to how "
"many and where they should be placed. The four statues begin to look positively gaudy "
"by the time you finish, and you start to wonder if it would have been better to use the "
"same enlargement spell as you used for the staves... just as the first of the four "
"begins to stir.\n"
"\n"
"The adornments melt into their stone skin, and each statue's eyes begin to light up one "
"by one, shining with an eerie energy. Magnavous ducks behind you, and Whudgrath behind "
"her, while Morlin waves his staff menacingly at the statues. You all sit in a tense "
"silence as seconds feel as if they stretch into minutes. The statues slam their staves "
"into the ground once again, this time eliciting a shriek from... Morlin, your mighty "
"protector.\n"
"\n"
"In tandem, the statues take position by the colossal gate, and each hammers their staff "
"against it one after another, the whacks shaking the cavern enough to knock you all to "
"your knees. When the sentries cease, they begin to push arduously against it, the bolts "
"you pressed into them fragmenting and shooting out from the gaps in their facades, "
"letting the vapor they held back rise towards the cavern's ceiling once more. \n"
"\n"
"Slowly but surely, the gate grinds open, and the statues don't let up until the doors "
"scrape to a halt. With that, they wander into the darkness, leaving you all behind, "
"wondering what lies beyond the gate."
msgstr ""
"大家开始努力贴护身符。至于贴多少、贴在哪儿，全靠胡乱猜测。贴完以后，那四座雕像看起来相当"
"俗气。你心想，如果再用一次将法杖变大的咒语，会不会好些……这时，其中一座雕像动了。\n"
"\n"
"那些装饰物融入雕像的岩石皮肤，雕像的眼睛陆续亮了，闪着诡异的光。麦格纳沃斯躲到你身后；伍"
"德格拉斯躲到麦格纳沃斯身后；莫林气势汹汹地挥着法杖，指着雕像。你们紧张得不敢说话，一秒就"
"像一分钟那么长。雕像再次将法杖重重砸向地面。这一次……莫林，你们那位强大的守护者，竟然尖叫"
"一声。\n"
"\n"
"与此同时，雕像来到大门前，用手里的法杖连续击打大门。撞击声让整个洞震动，你们都纷纷跪在地"
"上。这些守卫停止击打，然后开始用力推门。插入他们身体的弩箭断裂，从雕像表面的缝隙飞出。原"
"本止住的雾气再次升起来，向着洞顶弥漫开来。\n"
"\n"
"大门慢慢打开，发出刺耳的摩擦声。直到这些门停止不动，雕像才停下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Sealed Grove"
msgstr "被封印的树林"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The Sealed Grove - The leader of Azamire's forces has some concerns about a nearby "
"grove that seems tainted by some kind of dark energy. With the situation beginning the "
"spiral out of control, she has called in the best Azamire has to offer."
msgstr ""
"被封印的树林——阿扎米尔军队的首领担心附近的一片树林，那儿似乎受到了某种黑暗力量的侵蚀。眼"
"看局势即将失控，她召集了阿扎米尔最强的队伍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These trees almost grow faster than I can chop them down!"
msgstr "这些树长得太快了，我砍不过来！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think I see a clearing up ahead! [Push]"
msgstr "前面好像开阔了！[Push]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"On a stroll by what was once the Soothsayer's Grove, you find yourself startled as a "
"blue vine whips out and lashes itself around your ankles. Startled by the intrusion, "
"you barely have the chance to think about how this was meant to be a 'safe path' until "
"you're hoisted up into the air and tossed around. Suddenly, a tall, dark-haired woman "
"jumps out from the darkness and cleaves the vines in two with a single swipe of her "
"sword, sending you back towards the ground, where you land with a thud."
msgstr ""
"当你走过曾经的“预言家之林”，一根蓝色的藤蔓突然冒出来，缠住你的脚踝，你吓了一跳。你还没想"
"这条原本‘安全的路’怎么会有这种东西，整个人就被拖到半空，甩来甩去。突然，一名高个子黑发女"
"从黑暗里跳出来，一挥剑就把藤蔓砍成两段。砰的一声，你落到地上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Ow... Thank you... I think? What are you doing so far from Azamire, Jass? Aren't the "
"militia lost without you?"
msgstr ""
"哎哟……谢谢你……我觉得？杰丝，你从阿扎米尔跑这么远来干什么？你不在，那些民兵不会乱吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What are you doing near the Soothsayer's Grove? Haven't you seen all the signs I've put "
"up?"
msgstr "你来预言家之林附近做什么？你没看到我立在那儿的牌子吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do the signs say, \"Beware dangerous sentient vines?\""
msgstr "牌子上写的是“有藤蔓怪，当心危险”吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No, they say, \"Danger,\" and \"Stay Out!\" Someone or something, is causing everything "
"around this place to go absolutely wild."
msgstr "不，写的是“危险”和“禁止进入”！有什么人或什么东西让这里的一切彻底失控。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You should really consider my sign idea, it's a lot less vague."
msgstr "你应该考虑一下我刚说的牌子标语，比你那清楚多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Would you have stayed out if that's what they said instead?"
msgstr "如果真这么写，你还会进去吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"...No, I would have thought that I could have handled some silly little vines. Point "
"taken."
msgstr "……会。我会觉得，我可以对付几根可笑的小藤蔓。明白了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "这儿到底怎么回事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I wish I knew. Every attempt I've made to get closer to the grove has been met with "
"vines, trees and the occasional monster."
msgstr "我也想知道。我每次想靠近那片树林，就会遇到藤蔓、树木，有时还会遇到怪物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, no one throws me in the air and gets away with it! Plus, I ought to help you, "
"since you saved me."
msgstr "哼，没人能把我扔到半空还能全身而退！再说了，你救过我，我应该帮你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can you keep me on the ground if I cut a path through to the grove?"
msgstr "如果我开出一条通往那片树林的路，你能确保我不离开地面吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I've done it once already, haven't I? Grab an axe, we're going to make some kindling "
"out of this grove."
msgstr "我已经做过一次了，不是吗？拿斧头，我们要把这片树林砍了烧火。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As if it heard Jass's threat, more vines snaked out from the underbrush and towards "
"you. True to her word, Jass takes a firm stance and chops through them like a butcher "
"hacking through meat, giving you an opening to make your way towards the grove."
msgstr ""
"好像听到了杰丝的威胁，更多的藤蔓从灌木丛里冒出来，朝你们这边来。杰丝说到做到，稳稳站好，"
"像屠夫剁肉一样砍断藤蔓，为你开出了一条通往树林的路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely Gol will be able to handle... Whatever is in this forest."
msgstr "戈尔应该能应付……这树林里的任何东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Back into the woods we go. [Talk]"
msgstr "我们回到树林。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The bushes and trees are thick, and for every one you chop down, it feels as though "
"three more shoot up in their place. Their rapid growth would be a lot more impressive "
"if it wasn't for its murderous intent. How they stay out of sight is a mystery, but as "
"you cut deeper into the tangle of plants, thunderous bellows and growls sound from "
"nearby creatures you feel lucky not to encounter.\n"
"\n"
"You do your best to make your way inward, and eventually, the outer thicket gives way "
"to a calmer bit of forest. Jass catches her breath and wipes the vegetation from her "
"sword and armor. The two of you stand on a ridgeline surrounding a deep crater, filled "
"with plantlife you've never seen anywhere else. It almost looks like a jungle, with "
"dark trees towering from the pit and threatening to spill out. All manner of dark "
"shadows prowl through the vegetation, and you're very happy to be far above it, at "
"least for now."
msgstr ""
"灌木和树木密密麻麻，砍一棵长三棵。如果不是隐藏杀意，这生长速度确实令人惊叹。他们是如何不"
"被发现的，没人知道。当你走进这片杂乱的林子，附近传来震耳的咆哮声和低吼声。幸运的是，你没"
"有遇到这些东西。\n"
"\n"
"你努力向里面走，穿过茂密的丛林，最后来到一片宁静的树林。杰丝喘了口气，擦去剑上和盔甲上的"
"枝叶。你们站在一道山脊上，下面是一个深坑。坑里长满了你们从未见过的植物。整个坑看起来就像"
"一片丛林。坑里的树木阴暗高大，仿佛就快出来了。各种黑影在丛林中穿梭。幸好你们站得高，至少"
"现在是安全的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're not going to like what I have to say."
msgstr "接下来我要说的话，你可能不喜欢听。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We are going to have to go down there, aren't we?"
msgstr "我们要下去，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What? No, absolutely not. You can practically see the evil leaking out of the grove."
msgstr "什么？不行，绝对不行。你也看见了，那片丛林有邪恶的东西出来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're going to have to cut out way back out."
msgstr "我们要原路返回。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Honestly, I like the sound of that a lot better than wandering down there. But why'd we "
"come in here in the first place, then?"
msgstr "说实话，与其到那下面去，我更喜欢这个主意。但我们当初为什么要进来呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I wanted to see for my own eyes how much the jungle in the crater had progressed, "
"before we did."
msgstr "我想亲眼看看，在我们行动之前，坑里的丛林成什么样了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's not good. The crater itself was barren at first, except for a singular pale, "
"twisted tree in the very center. This whole jungle has sprouted up in just a few days..."
msgstr ""
"情况不太好。这个坑原来寸草不生，只有最中间长了一棵弯弯曲曲的白树。短短几天，这片丛林就长"
"出来了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The thicket around the crater-which we just hacked through-as at least four times as "
"dense as the other day."
msgstr "坑周围的丛林，就是我们刚才砍的那一片，比前几天茂密了至少四倍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You said there was just a single tree in the center of the crater? That feels... odd. "
"Wasn't this place meant to be a grove at one point?"
msgstr "你说坑的中间有棵树？这感觉……有点怪。这里以前不是一片树林吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Years ago, yes. Until this place was turned into a logging camp and cleared out. Never "
"really had any issues until..."
msgstr "很多年前是。后来这里改成了伐木营，树都被砍光了。一直没出过什么问题，直到……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whatever started happening here."
msgstr "这里发生了一些事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye."
msgstr "对。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"When we get out, we'll make a plan on what to do about this place. For now, are you "
"ready head back?"
msgstr "等我们出去再商量怎么处理这个地方。现在，你准备好回去了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll use my other arm this time."
msgstr "这次我会用另一只手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of you cut through the thicket back the way you came, and found less resistance "
"exiting than entering. You make your way to Azamire, and started to form a plan while "
"recharging in Lira's tavern. You set yourselves on sealing the grove, keeping whatever "
"may be inside the crater locked away, and hopefully preventing the spread of the outer "
"thicket as well.\n"
"\n"
"As you start to wonder who might be helpful, in slaying corrupted beasts and dealing "
"with wild plants before finally sealing the grove, Lira-who has clearly been listening "
"in-swings by and recommends Gol and Petal for the first steps, and Morlin for the last. "
"Without a word from either of you, she sends a couple of her patrons to fetch them. "
"Sure enough, the two of them are more than up for the challenge, and recommend dealing "
"with the beasts first, then tending to the thicket before sealing it. This works out "
"well, as Magnavous sends a message back on Morlin's behalf, saying that he'll come as "
"soon as he's able to return his sense of gravity-whatever that means."
msgstr ""
"你们原路返回，穿过丛林。你们发现，回去比进来更轻松。你们回到阿扎米尔，在利拉的酒馆里一边"
"休息一边想办法。你们的目标是封印那片树林，将坑里的所有东西都封锁起来，设法阻止外面那片丛"
"林继续蔓延。\n"
"\n"
"要屠杀腐化的野兽，要应付野蛮的植物，最后还要封印树林。当你们考虑找谁帮忙的时候，一直在旁"
"边听的利拉走了过来。她建议第一步和第二步找戈尔和佩塔帮忙，第三步找莫林帮忙。你们还没说"
"话，她就让几位顾客去找他们了。不出所料，其中两个人欣然接受挑战，建议先解决野兽，再处理丛"
"林，最后封印。事情进展顺利。莫林让麦格纳沃斯传回消息，说他一旦找回重力感（不知道具体是什"
"么意思），就马上过来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This bait positively reeks, but that's kind of the point."
msgstr "这诱饵太臭了，但臭就对了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's see if we can find ourself some monsters. [Bait]"
msgstr "看看能不能引出怪物吧。[Bait]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Excited by the prospect of a new challenge, Gol grips the Dawnsteel javelins tightly, "
"sets off into the outer thicket, and is seemingly swallowed by the vegetation, quickly "
"dipping out of sight. Petal quickly pulls out her poisons while Jass prepares to cut "
"her way through the vines until you hear Gol... laughing?\n"
"\n"
"Much less concerned for his safety, the three of you eventually make it to a clearing "
"where the plants seem to be retreating from him. Gol lays atop the corpse of a beast "
"several orders of magnitude larger than the mountain of a man, making it even larger "
"than the three of you. "
msgstr ""
"面对即将到来的新挑战，戈尔特别兴奋。他紧握着黎明钢标枪，走进外面的丛林。草木似乎把他吞没"
"了，他很快就不见了。佩塔马上拿出毒药，杰丝准备砍掉藤蔓。这时，你们听到戈尔……在笑？\n"
"\n"
"你们不太担心他的安全。你们三人最终走到了一块空地，这里的植物好像都在躲着他。戈尔躺在一头"
"野兽的尸体上。戈尔像山一样魁梧，但那野兽比他还要大几倍，甚至比你们三人加在一起还要大。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol quite enjoyed that little bout!"
msgstr "戈尔很享受那场小搏斗。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's a shame about the wee beastie, though."
msgstr "不过，这小东西变成这样，有点可惜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What, were you hoping for more of a fight?"
msgstr "怎么，你还没打够吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol respects his opponent greatly, it did the best it could."
msgstr "戈尔非常尊重对手。那头野兽已经尽了全力了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The thicket impeded it as much as it does the rest of us. Nature is very much not in "
"harmony here."
msgstr "这片丛林阻碍了它，也阻碍了我们。这里的自然环境一点也不和谐。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The creature was in pain, Gol did his best to free it."
msgstr "那头野兽当时很痛苦，戈尔尽力帮它解脱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That's... very noble of you. It's clear that something is off here, but... I figured it "
"was kind of the opposite."
msgstr "你……太高尚了。这里明显有点不对劲，不过……我原本以为情况相反。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I haven't seen much yet, but it'd make sense that this is more of a matter of "
"corruption than nature running wild."
msgstr "我还不太明白，不过这看起来更像是腐化在作怪，而不是自然失控了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'd best seal this as fast as we can. It will only get worse."
msgstr "我们最好尽快封印起来。否则，情况会更糟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's no way of driving the corruption out?"
msgstr "没办法消除腐化吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'd need to be five times the herbalist I am, and that's just if it's a poison or plant-"
"based corruption."
msgstr "那我这个草药师要再强五倍，而且它必须是毒药或植物类的腐化。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It could be magic, which I can't do much of anything about."
msgstr "这可能是魔法，我也没办法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You're doing plenty, and we're lucky to have you here. Sealing the grove will be more "
"than enough for now."
msgstr "你已经做得够多了，有你是我们的幸运。现在只要封印这片丛林就好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As long as we're able to halt its growth, having a single crater in the middle of the "
"woods locked away should be fine, until we figure out how to fix it."
msgstr ""
"在我们找到最终的解决办法之前，只要能阻止它继续生长，把林子里的那个洞封起来就可以了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol recommends putting up some better signs though."
msgstr "不过，戈尔建议多放几块像样的牌子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "See? Gol and I are on the same page, Jass."
msgstr "你看？戈尔和我想的一样，杰丝。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though, on second thought I'm not sure if that's a good thing."
msgstr "不过转念一想，这到底是不是件好事，我也不好说。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... ugh."
msgstr "我……唉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"So, we can't just throw Gol into the forest and hope that he's able to get every single "
"one of the corrupted beasts."
msgstr "所以，我们不能把戈尔扔进森林，指望他把那些腐化的野兽全部消灭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No, but it was good to come. We let Petal get her potions and herbs ready. She "
"mentioned needing a fair bit of time to prepare to tame the outer thicket."
msgstr ""
"这样不行，但这次来还是有收获的。我们让佩塔准备好药水和草药。她说要控制外面的那片丛林，需"
"要多点时间准备。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That's right. I'm making a special brew for this... My hope is that I can stunt the "
"plants' growth, not just poison the land into inhabitability. Not to mention it'd take "
"a lot more poison for that."
msgstr ""
"没错。我在做一种特别的药水……我希望能抑制植物的生长，而不是用毒药把这片土地变成无法生存的"
"地方。况且，那需要的毒药多得多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"While you work on that, Gol and I can bait the creatures back into the crater. That way "
"when we seal it, they'll be locked inside."
msgstr "你做你的，戈尔和我可以把那些东西引回洞里。等我们把洞封印了，它们就出不来了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sounds sensible. We'll let you know if Morlin manages to find us as well."
msgstr "听起来可以。如果莫林找到我们，我们会通知你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The corpse that Gol left behind was staggeringly large, so anything less than bait that "
"is equally large won't do. I'll see what I can come up with, then come back to camp."
msgstr ""
"戈尔留下的那具尸体大得惊人。除非用一样大的诱饵，否则根本没用。我先想办法弄点东西，然后再"
"回营地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Rosemary is normally pretty pleasant. Will it really repel monsters with Petal's "
"solution?"
msgstr "迷迭香一般挺讨人喜欢的。用佩塔的法子，真的能驱赶怪物吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll let her know I'm about done. [Talk]"
msgstr "我会告诉她，我快弄好了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Giant Fish Bait packed in your spare bag sounded fine and dandy, until you realized "
"that you'd have to walk along the edge of the rampant forest. Gol, by some miracle or "
"stroke of luck, just so happened to be nearby when one of the same beasts as before "
"just about grabbed you in its massive jaws. It let out a terrifying howl, and followed "
"after the two of you. Worried about your pace, eventually Gol decided to throw you over "
"his shoulder and run towards the edge of the crater as the vegetation pulls out of "
"Gol's path, which would have felt a lot more disheartening if it weren't for the scores "
"of eyes following after you. \n"
"\n"
"As the two of you crash through the treeline, you toss the bait-filled bag and send it "
"careening into the crater. Gol dashes to the side and doesn't stop running, even as the "
"beasts go lurching over the edge towards the pack. He doesn't set you down until the "
"forest stops moving, which you don't mind one bit. Eventually, you deem it safe to "
"return to camp, and do so quickly."
msgstr ""
"把巨型鱼饵装进你的备用包听起来不错，可当你意识到自己要沿着那片疯狂蔓延的森林边缘走时，就"
"不行了。不知道是奇迹还是运气好，之前那头野兽差点用血盆大口咬你的时候，戈尔恰好就在附近。"
"它发出一声恐怖的咆哮，跟在你们身后。戈尔怕你太慢，最后决定把你扛在肩上，向洞边跑去。两边"
"的草木向后退，给戈尔让路。如果不是身后有无数双眼睛盯着你们，这场面或许更加令人沮丧。\n"
"\n"
"你们冲出树林，你将那包诱饵甩了出去，滚进了洞里。戈尔迅速闪到一边，继续奔跑。那群野兽跌跌"
"撞撞地翻过洞边，扑向那袋诱饵。直到森林不再晃动，他才把你放下来。对此，你一点也不介意。过"
"了一会儿，你觉得可以安全回营地了，于是便赶快回去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Friend, Gol fears your bait was a bit more effective than intended!"
msgstr "朋友，戈尔怕你的诱饵比预想更有效。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But it worked! I hope. There shouldn't be more than a couple stragglers if anything."
msgstr "但它确实有效！希望吧。就算有漏掉的，最多就一两个"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol thinks you should work on your cardio before trying something like that again."
msgstr "戈尔觉得，下次这样做之前，你应该先练练身体。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I only got to see a glimpse of it, but it was rather entertaining."
msgstr "我只瞄了一眼，但那场面确实挺有意思的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's kinda cute how small you look cradled in Gol's arms."
msgstr "你在戈尔的怀里看起来小小的，还挺可爱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wasn't cradled, I was heroically and tactically placed on his shoulder."
msgstr "不是怀里，是肩上，英勇、有战术的那种。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If anything, the elevated position was probably even better for making sure the "
"corrupted wildlife smelled the bait."
msgstr "而且，高一点可能更能让那些腐化的野兽闻到诱饵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It was a smart plan, Gol just wishes you communicated it ahead of time."
msgstr "计划确实不错，不过戈尔希望你下次能提前说一声。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry Gol, it was a kind of... improvised plan."
msgstr "不好意思戈尔，这算是……临时计划。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, one way or another, I think we're about ready for the next step. Petal?"
msgstr "总之，不管怎么说，我想我们已经准备好进行下一步了。佩塔？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[i]{0}[/i], you're rather handy on the farm, no? I remember you helping me with my "
"garden."
msgstr "[i]{0}[/i]，你在农场干得不错，对吧？我记得你帮过我打理花园。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Clove still loves the sunflowers, by the way."
msgstr "顺便提一下，克洛夫还是喜欢向日葵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I believe that if you plant rosemary along the rim of the crater, with a bit of a boost "
"from one of my infusions, it should be more than enough to keep most of the critters at "
"bay while Morlin seals the grove."
msgstr ""
"我觉得，如果你在洞边种上迷迭香，再加上我的药剂，应该足以抵挡大多数小动物了。这时候，再让"
"莫林把那片树林封印了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems like a good plan to me. But... has Morlin gotten here yet?"
msgstr "这办法听起来不错。不过……莫林到了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The man with the bushy beard floated into the sky!"
msgstr "那满嘴胡子的家伙都飘到天上去了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is he... okay?"
msgstr "他……没事吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"He said he would be, still just dealing with some issues from his spell, apparently."
msgstr "他说没事，看来只是在处理咒语留下的一些问题。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He'll be back... eventually."
msgstr "他会回来的……迟早而已。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You look to Petal and Gol, who shrug-seemingly not too concerned with the flyaway "
"wizard. You make your way back through the growth once again, the hacking motion and "
"dodging of vines becoming quite routine at this point."
msgstr ""
"你看向佩塔和戈尔，他们耸了耸肩，似乎并不担心那位飘走的法师。你再次穿过那片丛林，非常熟练"
"地砍伐和躲避藤蔓。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The runes the old man is asking for... This barrier seems like some nasty work."
msgstr "那老头要的符文……这道屏障看起来不太好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we're finally ready to put up the barrier. [Complete Quest Button]"
msgstr "我想，我们终于可以布置屏障了。[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you finish planting the last bit of rosemary into the ground, Petal comes by and "
"dashes it with her solution, making the seed instantly spring up and twist into a much "
"larger bright blue version of itself. Being next to it starts to make your eyes water, "
"and as you turn your head and cough, you notice Jass and Gol hacking their way through "
"the thicket, clutching vials of Petal's mix that should halt the growth of the plants.\n"
"\n"
"Just then, a scream comes from the sky, and hurtles towards Gol. Morlin the Mage seems "
"to-just barely-slow himself as he reaches Gol, and quickly settles into his arms as the "
"large man catches him."
msgstr ""
"当你种下最后一棵迷迭香时，佩塔走过来，洒下她的药剂。那粒种子瞬间长了出来，扭扭曲曲，变成"
"了一棵亮蓝色的巨大迷迭香。你在旁边开始流泪。当你转头咳嗽时，你看见杰丝和戈尔正在丛林里砍"
"伐。他们拿着佩塔的几瓶药剂，这些药剂应该可以抑制草木的生长。\n"
"\n"
"就在这时，天上传来一声尖叫，冲向戈尔。在快要撞到戈尔的时候，法师莫林勉强慢了一些，直接落"
"到戈尔的怀里，被戈尔一把接住。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#. [待复核] Excel 里该行原文已被破坏，译文按行序对应，请核对
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I was wondering when you might turn up. We just finished up with our part, you were "
"just about late."
msgstr "我还在想你什么时候出现呢。我们刚忙完，你来的真是时候。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A Morlin is never late, nor is he early. He arrives precisely when his anti-gravity "
"spell decides to send him hurtling towards the ground and straight into this strong "
"man's arms."
msgstr ""
"莫林不迟到，也不早到。他的反重力咒语决定让他冲回地面并直接落到这位壮汉怀里的时候，他就恰"
"好到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Also, I must say, this is exquisitely comfortable. You all really should try this."
msgstr "另外，我不得不说，这感觉真舒服。你们都应该试试。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "One of us already has."
msgstr "已经有人试了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Then good, shall we get this all wrapped up then? What do you need of this masterful "
"mage?"
msgstr "很好，那我们就把这事儿办了吧？这位大法师能为你做些什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can you call yourself a master if you can't control your spell?"
msgstr "连自己的咒语都控制不了，还自称大法师。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Considering I haven't seen anyone so much as levitate more than a couple feet off the "
"ground, I'd have to say yes."
msgstr "我没见过有谁能让物体离地漂浮几英尺，我觉得这称呼没问题。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we're about ready to seal the grove. Petal?"
msgstr "看来我们可以封印这片树林了。佩塔？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We have a bit more of the solution to halt the thicket's growth outside of the crater, "
"but just about. Did either of you see any more beasts?"
msgstr "我们还有能抑制洞外面丛林生长的药剂，应该够了。你们俩看到还有野兽吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not one! [i]{0}[/i]'s bait did its job well."
msgstr "没了！[i]{0}[/i]的诱饵效果不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, well, good, because I seem to have misplaced... all of my runes."
msgstr "啊，那好……因为我好像把……我所有的符文弄丢了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How?!"
msgstr "怎么会？！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"How do you think you would keep hold of your worldly possessions while flying towards "
"the ground, hm?"
msgstr "你说在冲向地面的时候，怎么才能保住身上的东西呢，嗯？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please, [i]{0}[/i]?"
msgstr "拜托了，[i]{0}[/i]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gol can send the old man back into the sky if you'd like, friend! Gol does not need a "
"spell for this."
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，戈尔可以把这老头送回天上，朋友！戈尔不需要什么咒语"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No! No no no. Please, could you fetch me some runes? I need a bit of time to "
"reacclimate to the ground..."
msgstr "不！不不不。拜托，你能帮我弄些符文吗？我需要点时间来重新适应地面……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You glare at the old wizard before finally letting out a sigh and asking for a list of "
"runes he needs for the spell. He goes to produce a page from his bag, but realizes that "
"it is also missing, so he opts to just list them aloud instead, with little fanfare."
msgstr ""
"你生气地看着老巫师，然后叹了口气，问他要咒语需要的符文清单。他从包里掏出一张纸，但发现纸"
"也不见了。于是他干脆直接用嘴说。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"On your way back through the thicket-hopefully for the final time-you notice that "
"Petal's solution must be working. The blue vines from before seem... placated, and "
"barely twitch as you walk by, taking care not to step on them. You make it past the "
"worst of the vegetation with little issue, and find yourself back on the rim of the "
"crater. \n"
"\n"
"You find Morlin tied to a tree, the rope seeming to be the only thing stopping him from "
"drifting back skyward. He happily takes the runes from you and gets to work while the "
"rest of the crew finishes applying the last of Petal's solution to the most agitated "
"bits of the forest. With a shout, Morlin claps his hands and a dome begins to "
"materialize over the lip of the crater. Jass starts putting up new signs, taking advice "
"from Gol all the while. Soon enough, warnings of a deadly barrier, evil beasts, and a "
"corrupted array of flora lay below, along with certain death.\n"
"\n"
"As you peer through the translucent barrier, you see that the jungle below looks wild "
"and untamed, just as before. You hope that one day, you'll be able to return to "
"discover what made it grow so rampant in the first place, and maybe even fix it, if "
"you're lucky.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"你再次穿过丛林，希望这是最后一次了。你发现佩塔的药剂明显奏效了。之前那些蓝色的藤蔓好像……"
"被安抚了，你经过的时候一动不动。但你还是小心翼翼地走，没踩它们。你顺利穿过最危险的那片草"
"木，回到洞边。\n"
"\n"
"你发现莫林被绑在树上。好像全靠那根绳子，他才没飘回天上。他高兴地接过符文，然后就开始捣"
"鼓。这时，其他人将佩塔的药剂洒在森林中最躁动的那片区域。杰丝开始布置新的警示牌，还不时听"
"取戈尔的建议。没过多久，警示牌就立好了，上面写着“有致命屏障”、“有凶恶野兽”、“下面有腐化"
"草木”、“擅入者必死无疑”。\n"
"\n"
"透过那道半透明的屏障，你看到下面狂野的丛林，跟之前一样。你希望有一天能回来找到这片丛林疯"
"狂蔓延的原因；如果运气好的话，或许还能彻底解决。\n"
"\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Pointy Preparation"
msgstr "准备尖锐的武器"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A concerned citizen wants to scrape together some semblance of a fighting force for "
"Azamire's defense against any would-be bandits or those black-robed figures looking to "
"finish the job, but she's barely in fighting shape herself."
msgstr ""
"有个忧心镇子的镇民想凑一支像样的队伍，对抗随时可能冒出来的强盗，还有那帮赶尽杀绝的黑袍"
"人，保卫阿扎米尔。可她自己都快挺不住了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just putting some pointy rocks on some wood, nothing too tough."
msgstr "把尖锐的石头绑在木头上，这没什么难的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think they've gotten the idea."
msgstr "我想，他们已经知道怎么回事了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The cinders from the assault on Azamire have only just fizzled out, much like many of "
"the survivors' will to go on. Everyone that remained had lost something. Their homes. "
"Family members. Friends. You and [Companion Name] sit on the soot covered cobbles that "
"once made up the town's main thoroughfare, watching another family carry what little "
"they have left and shuffle out of town, hoping that some nearby village may have been "
"spared. Neither of you blame them.\n"
"\n"
"A woman with a bloodied stump where her hand should have been approaches the two of you "
"and falls to the ground beside you with a sigh."
msgstr ""
"阿扎米尔的硝烟刚刚散去了。很多人幸存了下来，但他们的房子、家人、朋友没了，他们也不想活下"
"去了。你们并不怪他们。\n"
"\n"
"这时一个女人朝你们走了过来。她的一只手没了，血一直流。她叹了口气，一屁股坐在你们旁边。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well. You two headed out as well?"
msgstr "唉。你们也要走吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I can't turn my back on Azamire. Too many folks have done too much for me, growing up."
msgstr "我不能抛下阿扎米尔。从小到大，这里的很多人都很照顾我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Doubt many of 'em are left."
msgstr "他们多半都走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The town still is, though."
msgstr "可小镇还在啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not much of it."
msgstr "小镇也快没了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I take it you're leaving, then? Can't blame you, but this is home for the both of us. "
"Even if... Home's looking a little worse for wear."
msgstr ""
"这么说，你是打算走？我不怪你，但这里是我们俩的家。虽说……现在这个家，已经不成样子了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gods no! No shame to those who are, but those rotters took more than just my hand. "
"Teri... didn't make it."
msgstr "天哪，不！我没有看不起他们，但那群混蛋砍掉的不仅仅是我的手。泰瑞……没能活下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh Jass... I'm so sorry."
msgstr "噢，杰丝……我很抱歉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Fool of a man got between me and one of those wretches' beasts. Seemed like he was "
"going to pull through... but then he didn't."
msgstr "那个傻瓜挡在我和那群畜生的中间。本以为他能挺过来……结果还是没活下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...We'll make them pay, Jass. [Companion Name] and I won't let this go unanswered."
msgstr "……我们会让他们付出代价的，杰丝。[Companion Name]和我不会善罢甘休的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You're not alone in your sentiment. I came by to see if you two might be interested in "
"a little project."
msgstr "这样想的不止你一个。我来就是想问问，你们俩有没有兴趣参与一个小计划。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A couple of people who aren't running for the hills want to fight back. But they're "
"farmers. Builders."
msgstr "有几个人没有跑，他们打算反击。不过他们都是农夫和建筑工。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I used to be pretty good with a bow, but it'd be a bit tough with this hand... or lack "
"thereof."
msgstr "我以前弓拉得好，但现在这只手……已经没了，拉弓很难。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Want us to show them the ropes? Been a little while since I shot a bow, but I can show "
"a couple of farmers where to point it and how not to shoot their friends."
msgstr ""
"要我们教他们吗？我已经好久没拉过弓了，但要教几个农夫怎么瞄准、怎么避免射伤同伴，还是可以"
"的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"...Are you forgetting what happened a couple of years ago? I still feel the need to "
"duck every time you-"
msgstr "……你难道忘了几年前发生的事了吗？每次你……我都想躲。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Okay, fine, [Player Name] can do the teaching, maybe I'll learn something too. Is there "
"anything else that I could help with?"
msgstr "好吧，好吧。[Player Name]来教吧，或许我也能学点什么。还有什么我能帮忙的吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Actually, yes. Like I said, most of these folks hardly know anything outside of their "
"trade. Showing them how to put together a couple of arrows could go a long way towards "
"making them self-sufficient."
msgstr ""
"还真有。就像我刚才说的，这些人除了自己的老本行，几乎什么都不懂。教他们做几支箭，可能今后"
"他们就能自己做了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The three of you chat back and forth for a while, putting together the idea of a lesson "
"plan, putting up some ramshackle targets meant to resemble a humanoid figure, and some "
"scavenged gear. Jass brings back a dozen or so dusty villagers from town who seem to "
"carry a wide range of emotions. Some, determined to fight back against the cloaked "
"figures who destroyed the town, some who looked lost and aimless, and some somewhere in "
"between.\n"
"\n"
"[Companion Name] takes half of them and gets to work showing them how to make bows, "
"something they were always better at than actually firing them, while you take the "
"other half and get to work showing them how to make arrows."
msgstr ""
"你们三人商量了一会儿，制定了一个教学计划，立了几个简单的人形靶子，还准备了一些搜罗来的装"
"备。杰丝从镇上带回来十几个全身是灰的村民。他们怀着不同的想法和情绪。有的坚决要反击那些摧"
"毁小镇的黑袍人，有的迷茫，有的处于这两者之间。\n"
"\n"
"[Companion Name]带走了其中一半人，开始教他们怎么做弓。比起射箭，他们更擅长做弓。你负责剩"
"下的一半人，教他们怎么做箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If I didn't know better, I'd say they were aiming at me."
msgstr "要不是我清楚情况，还真以为他们是冲我来的呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I knew they'd be bad, but wow."
msgstr "我以为他们做不好，但其实还不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Many of the folks picked up your teaching pretty quickly. Even Jass, just managing with "
"a single hand, did a fine job putting together some flight-worthy arrows. [Companion "
"Name]'s lesson seemed to go about as smoothly, and they produced a few bows to share "
"amongst themselves for the next bout of training. The villagers quietly, but excitedly, "
"show off what they managed to make, or laugh about how poorly their creations turned "
"out, depending on their results."
msgstr ""
"很多人学得很快。就连只剩一只手的杰丝也做了几支不错的箭。[Companion Name]那边也很顺利，他"
"们做了几把弓用来练习。村民们在制作的过程中有成功也有失败。成功的时候，他们安静兴奋地展"
"示；失败的时候，他们自己也笑。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you two for all of this, by the way."
msgstr "顺便说一句，谢谢你们所做的一切。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course. It'll be important for us to not get caught out like this again."
msgstr "不客气。重要的是，我们不能再被这样欺负了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#. [待复核] Excel 里该行原文已被破坏，译文按行序对应，请核对
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"This group has a long way to go, still. We had guards, but they lasted all of a few "
"minutes before those things started cutting through the town."
msgstr "大家还有很长的路要走。我们有守卫，但他们只撑了几分钟，那群人就杀进镇子了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's a start, though. And besides, keeping these people busy is just as important as "
"making sure they're trained."
msgstr "这只是开始。再说了，让这些人忙起来和确保他们接受训练，是一样重要的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dwelling on everything that happened... Well, that's no good for anyone."
msgstr "一直纠结已经发生的事……唉，对谁都没好处。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Anyway. Shall we get to shooting?"
msgstr "总之，我们开始射击吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As long as [Companion Name] doesn't stick me with an arrow, sure."
msgstr "只要[Companion Name]别射我身上就行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] glares at you, but you've known them long enough to know there's no "
"real anger there, just like they know you have no malice in your light banter.\n"
"\n"
"Though, you start to think otherwise when the villagers pick up their bows and start "
"trying to hit the targets. You feel as though their arrows pass by you more often than "
"the targets. You get to work quickly, trying to show them how to draw, aim, and fire, "
"before they really hurt someone."
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]瞪了你一眼。你们认识很久了，你知道他没有真的生气，他也知道你只是开玩笑，"
"没有恶意。\n"
"\n"
"不过，当村民们拿起弓，开始尝试射箭的时候，你开始动摇了。你感觉他们朝你射的箭，比朝靶子射"
"的还要多。你赶紧起来，教他们怎么拉弓、瞄准和射击，以免他们真的伤到什么人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You certainly lost a bit of skin from arrows that passed by a bit too close for "
"comfort, but after a while, the villagers' shots start to resemble straight flight "
"paths. A couple folks pick it up faster than the others, among them, [Companion Name], "
"though you still could hardly say you felt safe just yet.\n"
"\n"
"Initially, Jass seemed to be a bit frustrated at not being able to join in the "
"demonstration, but fell into her own role guiding people and repeating your "
"instructions to those that seemed to struggle the first few times around, or giving "
"pointers that even you started to incorporate into your own shots.\n"
"\n"
"By the end of the day, the villagers didn't seem to actively be putting one another in "
"danger, and looked far more determined than they did at the start of the drill, and you "
"entrust them into Jass's tutelage, for better or worse."
msgstr ""
"箭矢从你身边飞过，你差点挂了彩。但很快，村民们就能平稳地射击了。有几个人学得很快，"
"[Companion Name]就是其中一个。尽管如此，你还是很难说已经安全了。\n"
"\n"
"刚开始，杰丝因为不能参加演练有些沮丧，但她很快找到了自己的位置。她指导别人，向那些学得吃"
"力的人反复解说你的话，甚至还提出了不少建议。你自己射击时也用到了这些建议。\n"
"\n"
"一天下来，村民们不会再让彼此陷入危险，跟刚开始训练时相比，变得更加坚定。你把他们交给杰"
"丝，之后是好是坏，就不知道了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fishin' for Trouble"
msgstr "钓鱼钓出大麻烦"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"While out on a fishing trip, a little girl has gone missing with only her fishing pole "
"and a single tooth left behind. Not much to go on, except one small detail. It isn't a "
"human tooth."
msgstr ""
"一个钓鱼的小女孩不见了，只留下了她的鱼竿和一颗牙齿。现场没什么线索，但有一个细节值得注"
"意。那不是人的牙齿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Swords are plenty sharp, that'll do."
msgstr "剑足够锋利，这就够了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope they can figure out how to swing 'em."
msgstr "希望他们知道怎么挥剑。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You just start to drift off to sleep before a frantic pounding at your door makes you "
"jump up and start grabbing for something nearby to protect yourself. Your door opens a "
"bit more gently than you'd expect considering the knocking, and you find [Companion "
"Name] looking worried with a young woman behind her. She holds up something about as "
"thick as your finger with a sickly pale yellow hue."
msgstr ""
"你刚要睡着，一阵急促的敲门声把你惊醒了。你跳起来，抓起身边能当武器的东西。你的门开了，比"
"刚才的敲门声轻多了。你看到[Companion Name]一脸担忧，身后还有一名年轻女子。她手里举着跟你"
"手指一样粗的东西，脸色惨黄。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Her daughter was out fishing near the river and didn't come home for dinner. Sorry to "
"interrupt your sleep, but I figured you'd want to help."
msgstr "她女儿去河边钓鱼，没回家吃晚饭。抱歉打扰你休息了，但我猜你肯定会帮忙的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're not wrong. And the thing you're holding?"
msgstr "你说得没错。你手里拿的是什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Golbin tooth. The only... blood, that was there was blue, so..."
msgstr "哥布林牙齿。现场留下的……血迹是蓝色的，所以……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The girl is okay, at least for now, I'd imagine."
msgstr "我想，那女孩目前应该没事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good, good. Then, just the two of us are headed out?"
msgstr "好，好。那就我们俩去吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Thankfully, no. Jass has been making a bit of progress with her 'militia' and they want "
"to join us."
msgstr "谢天谢地，还有其他人。杰丝的那群民兵最近进步了，他们想跟我们一起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's anyone's guess how many Golbins there will be. It'd be smart to let them come to "
"us."
msgstr "谁也不知道会有多少哥布林。让它们自己找上门，或许是个好办法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What if we set the same scene as... the incident, have Jass's people waiting for them?"
msgstr "如果我们布置一样的……现场，让杰丝的人在那儿等，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Just please... hurry. I'm hopeful my little Ana is safe, but... it's not like they took "
"her for a fun little stroll around the woods. I know she must be so frightened..."
msgstr ""
"拜托了……快点。我希望我的小安娜平安，但……它们把她带走，肯定不是带她去树林玩。我想她现在一"
"定很害怕……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't worry, we'll do everything that we can."
msgstr "别担心，我们会尽力的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You gather your things and leave your bed behind, meeting up with Jass and a couple of "
"folks just outside. Some of them hold the bows [Companion Name] helped them make, some "
"holding new ones they must have created themselves. However, any decent force has "
"variety - archers wouldn't fare well if the Golbins got in their ranks - and their "
"inventiveness hasn't improved in the short time since you helped them last. Jass asks "
"for a couple of new toys for the folks that haven't taken well to the bow."
msgstr ""
"你收拾好东西，出来跟杰丝还有几个人汇合。他们有的拿着[Companion Name]帮忙制作的弓，有的拿"
"着自己新做的弓。不过，一支像样的队伍不能角色单一，毕竟万一哥布林闯进来，弓箭手就麻烦了。"
"况且，自从你上次帮了他们以后，他们在发明创造方面就没什么长进。杰丝想给那些不擅长用弓的人"
"弄些新玩意儿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just catch some fish and don't look suspicious. Easy."
msgstr "去抓几条鱼，别看起来很可以。这简单。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "那是什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The folks take up their new weapons eagerly. Though it has only been a short time since "
"Jass gathered them, the combined militia now totaled a couple dozen. You notice as you "
"hand out swords, though most don't have any conventional fighting experience, these "
"people tend to lean capable. Lumber Workers and farmers who've built functional bodies "
"through years of hard labour. Against a trained fighting force, sure, they'd hardly "
"stand a chance. But against a group of ragtag Golbins? You like their odds."
msgstr ""
"大家立刻拿起新武器。杰丝召集人手还没多久，这支民兵队伍就有二十多个人了。在分发剑的时候，"
"你发现他们大多缺乏正规的战斗经验，但他们确实能干。伐木工和农夫常年辛苦劳作，身体健壮。面"
"对训练有素的军队，他们或许没什么胜算。但面对一群不起眼的哥布林？你觉得他们胜算很大"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Jass, you sure about this?"
msgstr "杰斯，你确定吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They might not have much experience, but the folks that couldn't hit the broad side of "
"a barn - or just otherwise hated trying to use the bows - I've had running drills with "
"sticks and leftover tools."
msgstr ""
"他们虽然没什么经验，但对于那些连大门都射不中或者讨厌用弓的人，我已经让他们用木棍和剩下的"
"工具进行训练了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They got a long way to go, but they know enough to hold their own. I'm not sending them "
"in to die, don't worry."
msgstr "他们还有很长的路要走，但自保没问题了。放心吧，我不会让他们去送死的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Good, good. Azamire can't get much smaller if we want to keep calling ourselves a town. "
msgstr "好，好。阿扎米尔的人再少下去，恐怕就不能称为城镇了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If this ambush goes well, they won't need to fight much. Just need to look scary and "
"grab one or two of the Golbins to tell us where they brought the girl."
msgstr ""
"如果这次伏击顺利，他们就不需要太多的战斗。只要表现得吓人，再抓一两个哥布林，让它们说出小"
"女孩的下落就行了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If everyone's ready, let's head out to the river, then?"
msgstr "既然大家都准备好了，那就出发去河边吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] leads you to the river where the girl went missing. You fondly recall "
"learning to swim with [Companion Name] here, years ago, and wish you were here under "
"less dire circumstances. The militia disperses through the surrounding forest, headed "
"by Jass who quietly gives orders, trying to get people hidden as best she can.\n"
"\n"
"You and [Companion Name] settle in by the riverbank, and pull out your rods, hoping to "
"catch a bit more than just a few fish. You're a bit too nervous for idle conversation, "
"so you both quietly fall into a rhythm, just trying to look like two innocuous people "
"fishing late into the night."
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]带你来到小女孩失踪的河边。你不禁想起多年前跟[Companion Name]在这儿学习游"
"泳的场景。如果不是情况危急，或许你还会在这儿回忆一番。在杰丝的带领下，民兵们分散进入周围"
"的森林。杰丝悄悄下达指令，尽力让大家隐蔽好。\n"
"\n"
"你和[Companion Name]留在河边，取出鱼竿。你们这样做，不是为了钓几条鱼。你有点紧张，没有说"
"话。你们俩静静地进入了某种节奏，就像是两个在深夜钓鱼的普通人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm not going to let [Companion Name] beat me!"
msgstr "我不能输给[Companion Name]！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That should be about all of them."
msgstr "应该就这些了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You worry for a moment that one of the militia members is being too loud before you see "
"it. A group of Golbins, sauntering up with hardly a care in the world, barking orders "
"at one another, trying to surround you and [Companion Name]. It's... more than you "
"expected, and as you start to get up to defend yourself, an arrow sinks right between "
"the leading Golbin's shoulder blades. "
msgstr ""
"你担心其中一名民兵的动静太大了。这时，你看到一群哥布林慢悠悠地走向你和[Companion Name]，"
"它们一副满不在乎的样子，互相叫个不停。这架势……比你预想的要多。正当你起身准备迎战时，一支"
"箭恰好射到了那只领头哥布林的肩膀中间。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone, now!"
msgstr "大家快上！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Make sure to leave a couple breathing!"
msgstr "记得留几个活口！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bet you I'll kill more than you. Try not to die."
msgstr "赌一把，看谁杀得多。你可别先挂了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're on."
msgstr "赌就赌。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name]'s look of anxiety hidden under bravado is quickly replaced with "
"confidence as the woods explode with movement. The militia lets loose a volley of "
"arrows that pepper the unprepared Golbins, scattering them and sending a few more to "
"the ground. What's left of them gather themselves and charge towards you and your "
"friend, or the quickly approaching villagers armed with swords."
msgstr ""
"树林里战斗激烈，[Companion Name]刚才还故作镇定、一脸焦虑，现在立马充满了自信。民兵们箭如"
"雨下，让那些毫无防备的哥布林措手不及，四处逃跑，还有几个倒在了地上。剩下的哥布林重整旗"
"鼓，冲向你和你的朋友，冲向手持利剑的村民。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You look around as the movement begins to settle. The Golbin force was larger than you "
"had anticipated, but your efforts went as well as could be expected. Among the bodies "
"littering the forest floor, from what you could see, only a couple were human, which "
"was better than expected considering their experience.\n"
"\n"
"You rush over as you hear a shout from Jass, who managed to pin a dark green Golbin to "
"ground. The beast would have hardly came up to your hip had it been on its feet, and "
"you could hear it whimpering and begging not to be hurt. It quickly rattles off "
"fragments of information that it thinks could be useful, detailing how its clan was "
"taken over by a rival group led by someone it called the 'Ringleader', its own name - "
"Gloob - and how it really really wants to live. Jass slaps her hand over its mouth and "
"asks it where the girl they kidnapped was, and why they took her. Gloob goes one step "
"further, and says that it'll lead you all there to its nearby camp, and that they were "
"going to try and paint him and sell him off too, whatever that may mean.\n"
"\n"
"You discuss it briefly together, and decide to 'trust' it to do as it says. Surely "
"enough, the camp is close, and the leftover defenders quickly scatter as they see "
"they're vastly outnumbered, leaving their camp behind. You and [Companion Name] quickly "
"find Ana in one of their tents and take her home, while Jass and the militia handle a "
"dozen or so other folks who had been captured from elsewhere throughout the "
"countryside. Ana's mother meets you just outside of Azamire with tears in her eyes, "
"thanking you over and over again for saving her daughter."
msgstr ""
"战斗逐渐平息，你看了看四周。哥布林的数量比你预想的要多，但你们的攻击跟预想的一样好。看着"
"躺在地上的尸体，只有几具是人类的。考虑到大家的战斗经验，这比预想的结果要好。\n"
"\n"
"你听到杰丝大喊一声，赶快跑了过去。杰丝把一只深绿色的哥布林死死按在地上。这野兽要是站起"
"来，恐怕还没你的腰高。它低声抽泣，求你们不要伤害它。为了活命，它说了一些信息。它说，它的"
"氏族被一个敌对氏族控制了，领头的‘幕后头目’叫格鲁布。它还说，自己非常、非常想活命。杰丝打"
"了它的嘴，问它被绑架的小女孩在哪儿，为什么要抓小女孩。格鲁布先开口了。它说带你们去它附近"
"的营地，还说它们原本打算把他涂上颜色，然后卖掉。具体什么意思，不知道。\n"
"\n"
"你们简单商量了一下，决定‘相信’它的话。果然，营地就在附近。营地的守卫发现自己的人太少，丢"
"下营地，迅速逃走了。你和[Companion Name]很快在一个帐篷里找到了安娜，把她带回家。杰丝和民"
"兵们负责处理从其他地方抓到的另外几十个人。在阿扎米尔的外面，安娜的母亲满眼泪水，一遍又一"
"遍地感谢你们救了她女儿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Boarish Bonfire"
msgstr "生篝火烤野猪"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Azamire has slowly but surely begun to get back onto its feet, and that's cause for "
"celebration. The town's impromptu mayor, Hapren, has thought of just the thing to get "
"folks together, a bit of warmth and food in the center of town."
msgstr ""
"阿扎米尔慢慢恢复，值得庆祝一下。小镇的临时镇长哈普伦想了个办法，在镇中心生篝火，提供食"
"物，让大家聚在一起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A little cleanup could go a long way to making things feel a bit more put together."
msgstr "清理一下应该看起来好一点。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looking a lot nicer."
msgstr "现在看起来好多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A handful of people you haven't seen before walk past, likely another group of refugees "
"from one of the nearby villages that fared even worse than Azamire, attacked around the "
"same time. The town's new mayor - the son of the previous mayor that was lost in the "
"attack - welcomes them and directs them towards one of the newly repaired buildings "
"that they were using to shelter people before more buildings could be made to house "
"them. Once he wraps up, he sets his eyes on you and [Companion Name]."
msgstr ""
"几个人从你身边走过。你没见过他们，可能是附近村庄的难民。在那段时间，那些村庄也遭到了袭"
"击，比阿扎米尔还要惨。小镇以前的镇长在袭击中死了，他的儿子成了新镇长。新镇长迎接这些难"
"民，让他们去其中一栋刚刚修缮好的建筑。在其他避难所修好之前，这些建筑暂时用来安置难民。安"
"顿好以后，他看着你和[Companion Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Hey there, you two. I hope that things have been as good as they can be, considering..."
msgstr "嘿，你们俩。希望一切都还顺利，毕竟……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everything?"
msgstr "考虑到眼下的种种情况？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Exactly... There's no easy way to put such a tragedy, huh?"
msgstr "确实……发生了这样的悲剧，不知道怎么说，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There really isn't. You inherited quite the mess, didn't you?"
msgstr "确实是。你接了这个烂摊子，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't suppose either of you would be willing to take over, would you?"
msgstr "你们俩该不会愿意接受吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Afraid not. Never had the decorum to fit into a role like that. "
msgstr "恐怕不行。我可没资格做这些事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Didn't figure. Well, would you two mind helping me out with a little project, then?"
msgstr "我不明白。那你们能不能帮我个忙，参与一个小项目？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you have in mind, exactly?"
msgstr "你具体是怎么打算的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Hapren brings the two of you over to the center of town, which has been piled with "
"debris from Azamire's cleanup efforts. He talks about how he'd love to throw a little "
"gathering for the town, just so folks can get to know one another and feel a bit of "
"normalcy despite how hard the last while has been. A few people try their best to break "
"down the rubble into movable chunks, but progress is slow, and Hapren asks for help "
"before starting to work on the pile himself."
msgstr ""
"哈普伦带你们俩去镇中心，那里堆满了阿扎米尔清理出来的垃圾。他说想办个小聚会，让大家相互认"
"识一下，在经历了那段艰苦日子之后回归正常生活。几个人努力将废墟杂碎，方便搬运。但他们进度"
"很慢。哈普伦向你们寻求帮助，随后自己也去清理了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nothing too flashy, just gotta pull up enough fish to show them how it's done."
msgstr "没必要太夸张，多钓几条鱼上来，让他们见识一下就行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Huh, there really is a lot of junk in the water. Wonder where it's coming from?"
msgstr "呵，水里的垃圾真多。这些东西是从哪儿来的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With you and [Companion Name]'s help, you manage to break up the debris in short order, "
"and Hapren directs much of the salvageable materials to be stored for reconstruction "
"efforts, and the wood that is too mangled to be used to be left in the square to be "
"used for the bonfire.\n"
"\n"
"Just as you set your tools down, a few tired looking folks make their way into the "
"center of town, fishing gear in hand."
msgstr ""
"有你和[Companion Name]帮忙，垃圾很快就清理了。哈普伦下令将还能用的材料收起来，日后重建可"
"以用。至于那些不能用的坏木材，就留在广场上生篝火。就在你们放下工具时，几个人走进了镇中"
"心。他们看起来很累，手里拿着钓鱼工具。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If I couldn't see them swimming around, I'd swear the stock of fish had run dry."
msgstr "要不是看到有鱼在游，我还真以为这里的鱼都没了呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Feels like we're pullin' more junk out of the water than fish."
msgstr "感觉我们从水里捞出来的垃圾比鱼还多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rough day?"
msgstr "今天不太顺？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You could say that. I see that the town square is just about ready, but I'm sorry... "
"It'll take us a week to have enough fish at this rate."
msgstr "算是吧。我看小镇广场快准备好了，但抱歉……照现在的速度，鱼还要一周才能凑够。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Wait, you're using Mackerel Bait, right? Only way I've managed to pull anything out of "
"there."
msgstr "等等，你用的是鲭鱼饵吧？我就是用它钓到东西的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...No. Honestly, don't think I've ever used much more than a worm, really."
msgstr "……我没用过。说实话，我钓鱼一般都用蚯蚓。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, you don't need it, but it sure doesn't hurt."
msgstr "嗯，不是一定要用，但用了肯定没坏处。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Since we're just about done here... While we get things set up, would you mind lending "
"them a hand?"
msgstr "我们这边快忙完了……我们去准备的时候，你能不能给他们搭把手？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] looks to you and searches your face, trying to gauge your reaction. "
"You shrug, and then offer to help. Getting together a bit of bait to help the fishers "
"out, then showing them how to work with the river shouldn't take too long, and it'd be "
"nice for the town to be able to keep itself fed."
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]看着你，观察你的脸，似乎在猜测你的反应。你耸了耸肩，答应去帮忙。弄些鱼饵"
"给渔民，再教他们如何利用河水。这应该花不了多少时间。小镇的人们能自己养活自己，那也挺好"
"的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's no helping it, then!"
msgstr "那就这么办吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe Hapren would appreciate the meat?"
msgstr "或许哈普伦需要这些肉？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You all spend awhile on the pebble bank, sitting and waiting for a fish to bite, as one "
"typically does while fishing. You and [Companion Name] talk to the fishermen for a "
"while and learn that they used to be able to pull out enough fish to feed half the "
"town, even without the bait. When you dump bait in the water, and start using some on "
"your hooks, things pick up, but it's still rather slow. You watch even more junk float "
"by. Bits of tree branches, huge clumps of soil, and then, a dead Golbin. The fishers "
"point out that it's been like this for a few days, minus the Golbins at least."
msgstr ""
"你们在卵石滩上坐了一会儿，像普通的钓鱼者在等待鱼儿上钩。你和[Companion Name]跟渔民聊了一"
"下，听说他们以前捕的鱼可以供应半个镇子，甚至连鱼饵都不用。你把鱼饵扔进水里，在鱼钩上也挂"
"了一点，但进展还是很慢。你看到很多垃圾漂走。有树枝，有大块泥土，还有一具哥布林的尸体。渔"
"民说，除了哥布林的尸体，这种情况已经持续好几天了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Something must be going on up river, this is just odd."
msgstr "上游肯定出了什么事，太奇怪了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You all can keep fishing. Try not to reel in... anything green."
msgstr "你们继续钓吧。可别钓上来……什么绿色的东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're going to go check it out, aren't you?"
msgstr "你们要去看看，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Of course we are. You're coming too, obviously. Unless you want to see me floating by, "
"next?"
msgstr "当然了。你肯定要一起去。除非你想看我漂过去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I haven't shown them how I usually tie my hooks yet, I really-"
msgstr "我还没教他们我平时是怎么绑鱼钩的，我真的——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They stop their protesting as you grab their shoulder and pull them behind you. You "
"know from all your time together they'd never really let you go by yourself, but as "
"they grumble behind you, it's clear they're not pleased about running off to find... "
"whatever is, up river.\n"
"\n"
"After a few minute jaunt upstream, you see it. A massive boar standing over a group of "
"dead Golbins. It pulls against ropes that had been tied to trees along the river, and "
"then thrown over the top of the beast. As you approach it catches sight of you both, "
"assumes and breaks the last of its restrains as it charges towards you!"
msgstr ""
"你抓住他们的肩膀，把他们拉到身后。这时，他们停止了抗议。相处这么久，你知道他们绝不会让你"
"一个人去。但听他们在你身后抱怨，很明显他们不是很乐意去上游寻找……不知道是什么的东西。\n"
"\n"
"向上游走了一会儿，你们看见了一个东西。是一头大野猪站在几具哥布林尸体旁边。它努力挣扎，试"
"图摆脱身上的绳子。那绳子拴在了河边的树上。当你们靠近时，它看见了你们，然后挣断了剩下的绳"
"子，扑向你们！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With the help of some villagers and their carts, you manage to bring back the Golbin's "
"pet taming project. Hapren is shocked, then pleased, as he realizes that this is a far "
"better catch than a few fish from the river.\n"
"\n"
"As the sun sets, the wooden debris from the square is burnt and thick slabs of boar are "
"grilled and given out to everyone in attendance. More and more curious folks poke their "
"heads into the square and are met with warmth and light conversation.  A few folks even "
"start up with light songs as the night progresses and Azamire's paltry stores of booze "
"are enjoyed by those who indulge.\n"
"\n"
"Azamire's attack is far from forgotten, but this quiet moment amongst the survivors "
"does well to begin healing the towns aching wounds."
msgstr ""
"几位村民带着小推车帮忙。在他们的帮助下，你们成功把“哥布林宠物驯化项目”运了回来。哈普伦又"
"惊讶又开心。他知道，这比从河里捞几条鱼好太多了。\n"
"\n"
"夕阳西下，广场上的废木材燃起大火，大块野猪肉在火上烤，然后分给在场的所有人。越来越多好奇"
"的人伸头看向广场，看到熊熊燃烧的篝火，还有轻松交谈的人群。夜色深了，有人轻轻唱起了歌。阿"
"扎米尔的那点酒，大家尽情畅饮。\n"
"\n"
"阿扎米尔遭受的袭击没有被忘记。在这宁静的时刻，幸存者们开始抚平小镇的创伤。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Misty Reconnaissance"
msgstr "迷雾里探路"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gloob and Jass have been 'working' together for a while, and now need your help to "
"launch a daring mission... or stupidly walk into a Golbin's trap."
msgstr ""
"格鲁布和杰丝已经‘合作’了一段时间。现在他们需要你的帮助，去执行一项大胆的任务……或者说，去"
"愚蠢地掉进哥布林的陷阱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I should be able to follow Gloob's schematics easy enough."
msgstr "按照格鲁布的图纸，应该不难。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These should work!"
msgstr "这些应该用得上！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you walk back into Azamire, you feel a swell of pride at the number of newly "
"constructed buildings. They're small, and it hardly takes you long to count them on two "
"hands, but still, Azamire is rebuilding, bit by bit.\n"
"\n"
"Your delight is interrupted by a shriek as you hear a... Golbin run by, chased by the "
"newly appointed Militia Captain - Jass. The chase doesn't last long, and Gloob is held "
"down while Jass berates it, talking about how she's no fool and knows a trap when she "
"sees one."
msgstr ""
"当你回到阿扎米尔时，你看到那些新修的建筑，感觉十分自豪。那些建筑不多，手指都能数得过来。"
"但无论如何，阿扎米尔正在一点点重建。\n"
"\n"
"你正在高兴，突然听到一声尖叫……一只哥布林从你旁边跑过去，新的民兵队长杰丝在后面追。没追多"
"久，格鲁布就被按倒了。杰丝一边骂，一边说自己没那么傻，一眼就看出来是个陷阱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I see that things are going well."
msgstr "看来一切顺利。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "SHE'S GOING TO EAT ME, PLEASE HELP!"
msgstr "她要吃了我，救命啊！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're keeping you here because you were meant to help us, beast!"
msgstr "我们留你一命，是要你帮忙，你这头野兽！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What I said was true! You should be able to sneak into the Ringleader's fortress at "
"night, it'd be fine!"
msgstr "我说的是真的！你们可以晚上潜入幕后头目的堡垒，没问题的！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The guards have wood for brains! You'll see what I mean!"
msgstr "那些守卫都是木脑袋！你们去了就明白了"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We'll do no such thing! We ought to string you up for what your little pack did to Ana!"
msgstr "我们才不去呢！你们那帮家伙对安娜做的那些事，真该把你吊起来！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's happening, exactly?"
msgstr "这到底怎么回事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"This beast, is trying to get us to sneak into its boss's hideout tonight. Says all the "
"Golbins will be out escorting a shipment."
msgstr "这野兽想让我们今晚潜入它老大藏身的地方。它说所有的哥布林今晚都会出去押送东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A shipment of..."
msgstr "押送……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"...humans. That's what the Ringleader wants from all of the Golbin tribes he subjugates!"
msgstr "……人类。幕后头目攻打那些哥布林部落，要的就是这个！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I told you that when you saved me from that group days ago!"
msgstr "几天前你救我的时候，我就告诉你了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you mean, saved you?"
msgstr "你说“就你”，什么意思？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'm... little. Never been useful for much, the other Golbins said. Too 'so-fist-uh-"
"cated', they'd say."
msgstr "我……个子小。其他哥布林都说我没什么用。还说我太‘高雅’了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They were going to tie me up and try to put me in one of the shipments, too, since I "
"wanted to 'act like a human'. "
msgstr "因为我想‘像人一样说话做事’，他们就想把我绑起来，跟那些人类一切运走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And why the blazes would they do that?"
msgstr "他们为什么要这么做？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Because if a tribe doesn't pay up with enough people, the Ringleader takes his tithe in "
"other ways. Turns us into ents. "
msgstr "因为有部落交的人不够，幕后头目就会用其他办法。把我们变成恩特树人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Something about needing a creature's lifeforce. But I wasn't even ever part of that "
"tribe, I got outcast from my own years ago."
msgstr "说是需要生物的生命力。可我不是那个部落的。很多年前，我就被自己的部落赶走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And then they captured you again sometime after the Ringleader took over?"
msgstr "所以，幕后头目控制了部落之后又把你抓了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why were you in the group that attacked us, then?"
msgstr "既然这样，你为什么会在袭击我们的那群东西里面？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"One of the Golbin's fancied himself a knight and wanted to use me as a squire. Carry "
"his weapons n' stuff."
msgstr "有只哥布林说自己是骑士，让我当它的侍从。帮它扛武器什么的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We don't even have knights. But everyone thought it was funny, so they let him until it "
"was going to be time to lump me in with a shipment."
msgstr "我们哪有什么骑士。不过大家觉得挺逗的，都由着他，直到它们要把我一起运走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#. [待复核] Excel 里该行原文已被破坏，译文按行序对应，请核对
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So... You've never even hurt a person?"
msgstr "所以……你没伤害过任何人？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No! I even traded with some of your people up north. I would make stuff, then sell it "
"for books. I learned lots."
msgstr "没有！我还跟你们北方人做过生意呢。我做些东西，卖了换书。我学到了很多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Jass... A moment?"
msgstr "杰丝……借一步说话？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You believe this little green booger, don't you?"
msgstr "这绿色小东西说的话，你不会信了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You manage to pull Jass aside long enough to get her to calm down. She apologies, first "
"to you, then even to Gloob, and says that when she learned that they were capturing "
"people to 'send them somewhere' it sent her over the edge. She asks Gloob to fill you "
"in on what he told her. Every full moon, a bunch of robed figures end up coming to the "
"Ringleader's fortress within the Elder Grove. They come with large, wooden wagons, and "
"leave with people that the surrounding Golbin tribes have captured.\n"
"\n"
"He goes on to say that the Golbins at the fortress leave with the robed figures, "
"escorting them... wherever they go, he doesn't know. With the nearing full-moon, it'd "
"be a great chance to get a peek into the fortress, and that he'd even go, but that he'd "
"need some climbing gear and hooks to scale the fort's outer wall. Either hopefully or "
"foolishly, you decide to trust him, and he details how he'd go about making the "
"equipment. You and Jass decide it'd be good to bring [Companion Name] along as well, "
"and that they'd go over Gloob's memory of the fort to plan the scouting mission while "
"you make the gear."
msgstr ""
"你把杰丝拉到一边，让她冷静下来。她先给你道歉，然后给格鲁布道歉。她说，当她知道抓人是为了"
"‘把他们送到某个地方’的时候，差点崩溃了。她让格鲁布把之前跟她说的，也跟你说一遍。一到满"
"月，就有一群长袍人前往幕后头目位于长者之林的堡垒。他们带着巨大的木马车，离开时带走了周围"
"哥布林部落抓的人。\n"
"\n"
"他接着说，堡垒的哥布林会跟长袍人一起走，护送他们……至于去哪儿，他也不知道。快到满月了，正"
"是潜入堡垒的好机会。他愿意自己去，但要翻过堡垒的外墙，他需要一些攀爬工具和挂钩。不知道是"
"抱着希望还是鲁莽，你决定相信他。他详细说明自己会如何制作这些装备。你和杰丝认为，它最好带"
"上[Companion Name]。他们会根据格鲁布的记忆制定堡垒的侦查计划，而你负责制作装备。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You, Gloob, and [Companion Name] set off into the Misty Thicket on the night of the "
"full moon. Gloob brings you through the woods quickly, and it's tough to keep up with "
"his speed. You and [Companion Name] find yourselves huffing and puffing just outside of "
"the Ringleader's Fortress. In the moonlight, you all see a train of wagons and "
"hobgolbins heading to the north along an old dirt road, but quickly lose track of it as "
"they slip into the dense thicket.\n"
"\n"
"With them gone, the three of you use the gear you prepared and scale the walls, landing "
"quietly on the other side. Gloob brings you to several spots throughout the relatively "
"open grounds. A small, ramshackle prison, with several ents patrolling just outside. "
"You pass by a handful of sleeping areas for the fort's living guards, until you reach a "
"large wooden hut Gloob says is the Ringleader's home. Finally, he leads you to a "
"stockpile of various bits that a Golbin would find valuable, taken as tribute or looted "
"from nearby towns. Hides, half-rotten food, weapons and armor, gold, and most notably, "
"dozens upon dozens of caskets of flammable oil and booze.\n"
"\n"
"You and [Companion Name] wait for Gloob to lead you into an ambush, but the trap never "
"comes. True to his word, once he finishes with the important parts of the fortress, the "
"three of you scale back over the wall and head back to Azamire. When you return, you "
"immediately begin talks with Jass about launching an assault on the fortress with what "
"you've learned, and set plans into motion to get the town ready. Clearing a path to "
"bring wagons to the fort, and securing an exit route for prisoners will be essential "
"before launching an attack. Plus, it gives Jass more time to get her people ready, too."
msgstr ""
"满月那晚，你、格鲁布和[Companion Name]一起进入迷雾丛林。格鲁布走得很快，你们很难跟上。到"
"了幕后头目的堡垒外面，你和[Companion Name]气喘吁吁。在月光下，你们看到一队马车和大哥布林"
"沿着一条老土路向北走，但它们很快就钻进茂密的丛林，没了踪影。\n"
"\n"
"他们走后，你们三人用事先准备好的装备翻过围墙，悄悄来到墙的另一侧。格鲁布带你们在相对开阔"
"的地方转了几圈。这里有一个破烂的小牢房，外面有几个恩特树人巡逻。你们经过几个守卫休息区，"
"到了一间大木屋。格鲁布说，那是幕后头目的住处。最后，他带你们来到堆战利品的地方。这些东西"
"是哥布林的宝贝，有的是贡品，有的是从附近城镇抢来的。这里堆满了兽皮、半腐烂的食物、武器盔"
"甲、黄金，最引人注意的是许多桶易燃的油和酒。\n"
"\n"
"你和[Companion Name]等格鲁布把你们引入伏击，但陷阱始终没有出现。他没有说谎。勘察完堡垒的"
"重要区域，你们三人翻出围墙，返回阿扎米尔。回来之后，你立马和杰丝讨论利用已经掌握的信息，"
"突袭堡垒。你开始制定计划，让小镇做好准备。在突袭之前，要先清理出一条能让马车到达堡垒的道"
"路，为牢房里的人找好撤离路线。此外，这也杰丝有更多的时间调动人手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rocky Rumble"
msgstr "乱石大混战"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The old Northern Road will take Azamire's wagons close to the Ringleader's Fortress, "
"but due to a rockslide, it's unusable. With a bit of effort, it should be usable once "
"again!"
msgstr ""
"要去幕后头目的堡垒，阿扎米尔的马车可以走旧北路。但因为山崩，北路走不了了。稍微清理一下，"
"应该就能走了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Chisel first, then make them into volatile bombs. Easy."
msgstr "先用凿子砸，再做成可以随时爆炸的炸弹。这简单。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't drop them don't drop them don't drop them."
msgstr "别掉了，别掉了，别掉了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gloob - who is now allowed to freely roam the town after your scouting mission proved "
"his loyalty - fetches you and brings you to Jass's newly constructed 'barracks'. In "
"reality, it was just an enclosed room with some storage for gear and a few targets set "
"up, but it was coming along nicely. Within her office, a map of the surrounding lands "
"was laid out, recently purchased from one of the infrequent caravans that just started "
"to come by once again."
msgstr ""
"格鲁布在之前的侦察任务中证明了自己的忠诚，现在可以在镇子里自由活动。他带你来到杰丝新修的"
"‘营房’。实际上，那不过是一个封闭的房间，里面有一些装备，还有几个靶子，整体上不错。她的办"
"公室里有一张周边地区的地图。这是最近从一支商队那里买来的。那些商队不常来，现在又来了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Ah, [Player Name], you're here. We're planning our path to the fortress, but our scouts "
"ran into a bit of a snag."
msgstr "啊，[Player Name]，你来了。我们正在规划前往堡垒的路线，但我们的侦察员遇到麻烦了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh? Is everyone alright?"
msgstr "哦？大家没事吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No one is hurt. But a bit of the Old Northern Road that passes through the Foggy Canyon "
"has been buried under a rock slide. "
msgstr "没人受伤。不过，穿过迷雾峡谷的那段旧北路被落石堵住了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then it seems we should just find another path, no?"
msgstr "我们可以找其他路，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That'd be great, but this is the only feasible way to bring wagons up to the fortress. "
"We'll need them to carry gear, and... wounded, after the battle."
msgstr ""
"要是可以就好了，但这是马车前往堡垒的唯一一条路。我们需要马车运装备，还有……战斗结束后运伤"
"员。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't fret though! I know how to clear it! I just need a bit of help from you."
msgstr "别担心！我知道怎么清理落石！不过，我需要你帮忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just... you and me, clearing a rockslide? How well can you swing a pick?"
msgstr "只有……你和我清理落石？你会用镐头吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No no, I have something far better."
msgstr "不不，我有个更好的办法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gloob gives you the rundown on an idea he's tried before. With a bit of effort, careful "
"chiselling, and sulfur, fire runes could be made into shaped bombs could carefully "
"carve a path through the rockslide. Not only that, he's actually already prepped some "
"runes they traded for, but needs help with the chiselling and then... putting a bit "
"more volatile fire energy into them."
msgstr ""
"格鲁布给你解释他之前试过的一个办法。这需要花点功夫。先仔细凿，加上硫磺，把火符文变成炸"
"弹，在落石的地方开出一条路。不仅如此，他甚至准备了之前交易换来的符文，但还需要有人来凿，"
"然后……往里面注入更多不稳定的火能量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't suppose they're interested in talking this one out."
msgstr "看来他们没兴趣谈这个。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That seems like all of them, for now."
msgstr "目前来看，应该就是他们了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You carefully bring the volatile runes down to the Foggy Canyon along with Gloob and "
"set to work tucking them into the rock. Gloob lights them as you move away, and sure "
"enough, they work exceedingly well. Gloob stands triumphantly as bits of rock pelt the "
"two of you after the series of explosions."
msgstr ""
"你和格鲁布小心翼翼地把那些不稳定的符文带到迷雾峡谷，开始把符文嵌入岩石。你退开后，格鲁布"
"点燃符文。这些符文太有用了。在一连串的爆炸声中，碎石到处飞。格鲁布站在一旁，十分得意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And that is why reading is cool! "
msgstr "所以，读书真好啊！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, what does this have to do with reading?"
msgstr "等等，这跟读书有什么关系？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I got the idea for these bombs after reading about a wizard that was banished from her "
"family for blowing up half her estate. Tough luck, right?"
msgstr ""
"我之所以会想到这些炸弹，是因为读过一个故事：有个巫师把自家庄园的一半炸没了，结果被逐出了"
"家门。真是倒霉，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wow, do you think it was on purpose?"
msgstr "哇，你说她是故意的吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No clue! But it got me thinking about what happens when magic goes wrong, you know?"
msgstr "谁知道呢！不过我在想，要是魔法出错了，会怎么样，你知道吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I should... be a little more careful with fire spells in the future."
msgstr "看来……以后用火咒语的时候，我要更加小心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's always good to practice caution! Shall we get back to bombing the crap out of this "
"canyon now?"
msgstr "谨慎点总没错！那我们就把这峡谷炸个底朝天吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Of course! It actually seems that some of the rocks are already moving out of the way "
"in fear, should be a bit less to handle."
msgstr "当然！有些岩石好像已经被吓到自己走了。我们要炸的应该会少一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "等一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why are the rocks moving?"
msgstr "这些岩石怎么在动？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As the question leaves your lips, several golems rise from the piles of rock, "
"doubtlessly less than pleased with your explosive intrusion on their turf. They seem "
"quite keen on smashing you into the ground so they can return to their nap."
msgstr ""
"你刚说完，几个石魔从石堆里站起来。你们到这儿搞爆炸，它们明显很不高兴。它们似乎就想把你砸"
"进地里，然后回去睡觉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Maybe I should ask someone in the mines..? Nah, what's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "也许我应该去矿井那边问问……？算了，最坏又能怎样呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think that should hold!"
msgstr "我想这样应该行了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The golems now lay crushed at your feet. Gloob held his own well, using his speed to "
"distract them and a few carefully placed bombs to take out a few of his own. As the two "
"of you catch your breath, one of the walls of the canyon cracks and Gloob jumps back "
"and wraps himself around your leg in fear. A massive sheet of stone falls to the ground "
"in front of you. After the dust settles, Gloob removes himself from your leg and clears "
"his throat while dusting himself off."
msgstr ""
"这时，石魔在你脚下碎裂了。格鲁布做得很好。他迅速分散石魔的注意力，小心放了几枚炸弹，成功"
"解决了几个石魔。正当你们俩喘口气的时候，峡谷的一面裂了，格鲁布吓得往后跳，缠在你腿上。一"
"块巨大的石头落在你们面前。等到灰尘没了，格鲁布从你腿上下来，清了清嗓子，拍了拍身上的灰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, uh... That's certainly not great."
msgstr "呃……这可不妙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Shouldn't be hard to break up and move, but if the canyon walls keep collapsing, we'll "
"hardly have a road left here at all."
msgstr "清理岩石不难，但如果峡谷继续崩塌，这儿恐怕就没路了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Or... Even worse, it could come down while people are travelling through. "
msgstr "或者……更糟糕的是，万一有人经过时崩塌，那就麻烦了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Then we've got to support the walls, yeah? I... haven't read much on building stuff "
"like that, yet."
msgstr "看来我们要加固岩壁，对吧？我……没怎么研究过这种工程。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] and I have actually helped out in Azamire's mines a few times through "
"the years."
msgstr "这些年来，[Companion Name]和我在阿扎米尔的矿井帮了几次忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We'll need some rock bolts, which we can make out of steel, then we drive them into the "
"walls."
msgstr "我们需要一些钢做的岩锚，把它们打入岩壁。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You walk Gloob through finding good spots for the bolts, and leave him to mark spots in "
"the canyon that'll work well. Then you start to work out how to create strong enough "
"rock bolts to keep the canyon walls from collapsing in on themselves."
msgstr ""
"你带格鲁布寻找峡谷里适合打岩锚的地方，让他做好标记。然后，你开始研究如何制造足够坚固的岩"
"锚，防止岩壁坍塌。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The sides of the Foggy Canyon hold once you and Gloob finish up hammering the bolts "
"into its walls. Even as you finish up blowing up the last of the rock that remains "
"along the old Northern Road, your handiwork holds, and after you've finished your work, "
"you no longer fear having a sheet of stone land on your head. You look down to the "
"little Golbin by your hand who beams with pride at a job well done, ecstatic to have "
"been able to put his mind to something and see something tangible come out. The two of "
"you head back to Azamire to report a job well done, and that the Northern Road is clear "
"to use once again."
msgstr ""
"你和格鲁布将岩锚打入迷雾峡谷的岩壁，之后岩壁就牢固了。当你炸掉旧北路上的最后几块岩石时，"
"这些岩锚也没动。打完以后，你再也不用担心会有石头落下来砸到头了。你低头看看旁边的小哥布"
"林。他刚刚做得很好，所以特别自豪。因为自己能够专注一件事，亲眼看到实实在在的成果，他很兴"
"奋。你们俩动身返回阿扎米尔，报告任务圆满完成，北路重新恢复畅通。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dungeon Breakout"
msgstr "逃出地牢"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A path must be cleared for the prisoners to get out of the Misty Thicket fortress when "
"you launch the attack against the Ringleader, lest they get caught in the crossfire "
"between you and the fortresses' guard."
msgstr ""
"在对幕后头目发起进攻时，必须给囚犯们找到一条逃离迷雾丛林堡垒的路，避免他们卷入你跟堡垒守"
"卫的交战。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gold coins aren't good enough, eh?"
msgstr "金币还不够，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully Gloob's contacts pull through."
msgstr "希望格鲁比找的人靠得住。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The moon was completely hidden by clouds on the night you found yourself outside of the "
"Ringleader's fortress, yet again. The scouting trips had gotten more frequent, though "
"you only had time to go on a few of them lately. But Jass hadn't brought you out for a "
"scouting mission, this time. The two of you wait for a patrol to pass and she brings "
"you to the covered end of a tunnel. You two climb in and follow it for a while, until "
"hitting what must be the wooden wall of the fortress. Gloob is crouched down here, "
"inspecting the wall, not needing any light to see it clearly."
msgstr ""
"那晚，云把月亮全遮住了。你再一次来到了幕后头目的堡垒外面。侦察活动越来越频繁，但你最近只"
"参与了几次。不过，杰丝这次带你出来不是为了侦察。等巡逻的人走后，她带你来到一条隧道的尽"
"头。你们俩爬进去，向前走了一会儿，然后到了堡垒的木墙。格鲁布蹲下来检查墙壁。就算没有光，"
"他也能看得清清楚楚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not sure how far down the wall goes, but we can't just dig down further."
msgstr "不知道这堵墙到底有多深，但我们没有继续挖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If it goes all the way down to stone, I wouldn't even know how start trying to get "
"through the stone. I'm no rockhound."
msgstr "如果它一直通到岩石，那我可不知道怎么穿过去。我又不是搞地质勘探的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"And forget about keeping it quiet. I know your people have been at this for a while, "
"right? I'm sure moving all this soil is tough."
msgstr ""
"而且，要没有动静是不可能的。我知道你的人已经在这儿折腾了一段时间了，对吧？要搬这么多泥"
"土，不容易吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You'd bet. We've got to carry it all out and then sprinkle it through the woods. If a "
"patrol came across a random pile of dirt, that'd be... suspicious."
msgstr ""
"当然了。我们要全部搬出去，然后洒在树林里。要是巡逻的人发现有泥土，那就会……让人怀疑。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Makes sense. So, you need to get through this wall. Any ideas?"
msgstr "有道理。所以，你需要穿过这堵墙。有什么办法吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, Gloob says he can get a tool to get through it... Right Gloob?"
msgstr "嗯，格鲁布说他能弄到工具穿过去……对吧，格鲁布？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm... know to locate some stuff, from time to time."
msgstr "嗯，我……有时候确实能弄到东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I made a lot of contacts when I was traveling about. We'd have to trade for it."
msgstr "我以前到处跑，认识了很多人。我们要用东西去交换。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What would you... contacts, want?"
msgstr "你那些……认识的人想要什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, they typically deal in silver bars. I think it'd usually be about seven or eight "
"bars, but this tool is special item."
msgstr "嗯，他们一般交易的是银锭。我想大概要七八块，不过这件工具比较特殊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's say ten bars even."
msgstr "那算十块吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ten it is."
msgstr "那就十块。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You ask what the tool even is, and Gloob starts to describe a magical length of metal "
"fashioned after a knife that, when activated, starts to vibrate rapidly. It should be "
"enough to quietly carve away at the wall, albeit slowly. You leave Gloob to his "
"inspection of the wall, and head off to get some silver."
msgstr ""
"你问到底是什么工具。格鲁布向你描述一个奇特的金属东西。那东西的形状像一把刀，一旦启动就会"
"快速震动。用它来悄悄开墙应该可以，虽然速度会慢点。你让格鲁布留下来继续检查墙壁，你去弄些"
"银锭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just press it into the wall and cut, no problem."
msgstr "把它按进墙里切就行，没问题的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't think anyone heard me."
msgstr "我想刚才没人听见我说话。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You hand off the bars to Gloob back in Azamire, and not long after, he shows up on your "
"doorstep, carrying a sheet wrapped around the vibrating knife he described. He happily "
"hands it over."
msgstr ""
"你在阿扎米尔把银锭交给格鲁布。没过多久，他就来找你了，手里拿着一块布，里面是他之前提到的"
"那把会震动的刀。他高兴地把它递给你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thankfully, it shouldn't take you too long to get through with this."
msgstr "还好，做这个应该用不了你太长时间。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Just kinda... press it into the wood and it'll activate. I've marked the hole you need "
"to cut in red paint, okay?"
msgstr "只要……把它按进木头，它就会启动。我用红漆标记了你需要切割的孔洞，明白了吗"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, Gloob. This is really helpful. I know it might feel a bit odd helping us "
"humans out, but I just wanted to let you know that we appreciate your help."
msgstr ""
"谢谢你，格鲁布。这次真的帮了大忙。我知道，帮助我们人类可能会让你觉得有点奇怪，但我想告诉"
"你，我们非常感谢你的帮助。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope that folks aren't giving you too much trouble around town, are they?"
msgstr "希望小镇的人没给你添什么麻烦吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Not at all, actually. Maybe a couple weird looks here and there, sure, but they've been "
"more than welcoming."
msgstr "完全没有。虽然偶尔会有人用奇怪的目光看我，但大家都很热情。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Even your mayor! Sounds like he's going to try and get me set up with a workshop of "
"sorts!"
msgstr "连你们的镇长也是！他似乎想帮我弄一间工作室之类的！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Oh and I'm really starting to grow on Jass, and [Companion Name] is having me do a few "
"things around, and also..."
msgstr "哦，我发现我越来越喜欢杰丝了。[Companion Name]在帮我做一些事，另外……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Gloob starts to run through... more of his social life than you bargained for, and "
"around the twenty minute mark you cough and mention that you really ought to get going "
"to the fortress. Completely oblivious, he wishes you luck, and you set off. Back down "
"at the end of the tunnel, sure enough, Gloob has marked a large cutout for you to "
"follow."
msgstr ""
"格鲁布开始讲述……他的社交生活，比你预想的更多。大约二十分钟后，你咳嗽一声，提醒他你要出发"
"去堡垒了。他一点也没察觉，只是祝你好运，然后你就走了。回到隧道的尽头，果然，格鲁布已经给"
"你标记了一个大切口。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You're able to cut through the wall after a fair bit of effort, and finally, the chunk "
"of wood settles. You set the tool down beside you and decide to leave it there, in case "
"anyone needs to improve upon your work. Once you're done, you carefully leave the "
"tunnel and cover the entrance once again, before reporting back to Jass. She sends for "
"a few people to go continue with the rest of the tunnel and assures you that it'll be "
"ready for when you need to get the prisoners out."
msgstr ""
"经过一番努力，你终于切穿了墙壁，那块木头也稳了。你把工具放在一旁，决定就把它留在那儿，万"
"一有人想改进一下呢。做完以后，你小心离开隧道，再次将入口盖好，然后回去向杰丝复命。她派了"
"几个人去继续完成剩下的隧道工作。她向你保证，等需要转移囚犯的时候，一切都会准备好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tree Trimming"
msgstr "疯狂砍树"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] has been strangely absent lately, and on the rare chance you do see "
"them, they usually quickly excuse themselves. What's going on?"
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]最近总是不见人影，很奇怪。即使偶尔碰见，他们往往会找借口匆匆离开。到底怎"
"么了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good food always makes you feel better."
msgstr "吃点好吃的，心情总会好起来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe I should have gone for something more nutritious..."
msgstr "也许我该吃点更有营养的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Late in the evening, you head to the recently built home for [Companion Name]. It's "
"nothing fancy - like most of the new constructions in Azamire - but all of the folks "
"who've been contributing the most were given priority in separate lodgings, and they've "
"done wonders for bringing back a bit of normalcy.\n"
"\n"
"What hasn't been normal is how little you've seen [Companion Name] lately. You've had "
"plenty of times where you weren't attached at the hip over the years you've known one "
"another, but you know they've been around. It almost feels as if they've been avoiding "
"you.\n"
"\n"
"You knock several times to no avail. Just as you turn to go, you see a limping figure "
"approach, notice you, and then turn away."
msgstr ""
"到了深夜，你前往[Companion Name]新修的房子。这房子很普通，跟阿扎米尔新修的大多数房子一"
"样。但那些贡献最多的人可以优先获得独立住所。是他们的努力，让这里恢复了一丝丝正常。\n"
"\n"
"有点反常的是，你最近见[Companion Name]太少了。在你们认识的这些年，你们并非总是形影不离，"
"但你知道，他们就在你身边。可现在，你感觉他们像在躲着你。\n"
"\n"
"你敲了几下门，没有回应。正当你准备离开时，看到一个身影一瘸一拐地走过来。可一看到你，又转"
"身走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...[Companion Name]?"
msgstr "……[Companion Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ohhhh..! Hello there, ol' buddy ol' pal. I'm just... gonna, go... this way..."
msgstr "噢……！嘿，老兄，老朋友。我……往……这边走啦……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Forgot that I needed to chat with... Hapren! That's right, needed to chat with Hapren."
msgstr "忘了我要去聊聊……跟哈普伦！对，要跟哈普伦聊聊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name], I'm not really sure what's going on, but if I did something, "
"please... Let me know, okay?"
msgstr "[Companion Name]，我不知道到底怎么了。如果我做错了什么，请……告诉我，好吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't forget your birthday or anything, did I? I'm sorry, okay..?"
msgstr "我没忘记你生日什么的吧？对不起，好吗……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name]..."
msgstr "[Player Name]……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, I've just been..."
msgstr "不，我只是……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I..."
msgstr "我……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] turns towards you and wobbles on their feet. Even in the low light, "
"you notice the dark red patch blood on the front of their cloak, and trailing down "
"their arms. You rush towards them and manage to catch your best friend before they hit "
"the ground. You quickly run through a list of places you could bring them before "
"settling on their own place. You quickly fish their key out of their pocket and carry "
"them inside. You'd complain about them being heavy if it weren't for the fact your "
"heart was beating out of your chest, knowing how hurt they are and having no idea on "
"why or how.\n"
"\n"
"Digging through both their supplies and yours, you find enough to get them patched up. "
"Across their chest is a large gash with bits of... wood, sticking out of it? You "
"extract it all, bit by bit, in the lantern light, and stitch them back up before "
"wrapping them in gauze. The rest of their wounds are comparatively minor, and take much "
"less time to deal with, but they are numerous, and in various states of healing, some "
"old, some fresh.\n"
"\n"
"Once you're done, [Companion Name] looks more mummy than person, but they'll live. You "
"cover them up to let them rest, and decide to help along their recovery with their "
"favorite food."
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]转过身，一瘸一拐。即便光线昏暗，你还是注意到他们的斗篷前面有一片暗红色的"
"血迹，鲜血顺着他们的手臂流下来。你冲过去，在你最好的朋友倒下之前接住他们。你脑子里飞速在"
"想能带他们去哪里，最后还是决定把他们送回住的地方。你迅速从他们的口袋里摸出钥匙，把他们带"
"回屋。你还想抱怨一下他们太重了，可你的心跳得太快了，快要从胸口跳出来了。看到他们伤得这么"
"重，你却不知道他们为什么会受伤、是怎么受伤的。\n"
"\n"
"你翻了翻你和他们的东西，找到了足够的东西处理伤口。他们的胸口有一道很深的伤口，里面还插"
"着……木屑？在昏暗的灯光下，你一点点将木屑取出来，缝好伤口，再用纱布包扎。其他伤口比较轻，"
"处理起来很快。但这些伤口很多，愈合的情况不同，有旧伤，也有新伤。\n"
"\n"
"处理完后，[Companion Name]看起来就像木乃伊，但他们还活着。你给他们盖好，让他们休息，决定"
"准备他们最爱的食物，帮助他们康复。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Time for a little bit of payback."
msgstr "是时候“算账”了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're still... moving a bit."
msgstr "他们还在……动。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] manages to quietly eat the cake you give them, and you decide to wait "
"a while before beginning your round of questioning. Once they finish the first half, "
"your questioning begins, and they fake passing out. You roll your eyes, and threaten to "
"take the rest of the cake away and they spring back up, but quickly nurse their wounds "
"after the sudden movement. You ask what happened, how they feel, and what they why "
"they've been avoiding you, but [Companion Name] remains silent for all of it. When you "
"finally ask why they didn't bring you, tears well up in their eyes."
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]静静地吃着你给的蛋糕。你决定先等一会儿，再开始盘问他们。他们刚吃完一半，"
"你准备盘问，但他们就假装昏了过去。你翻了个白眼，威胁说要把蛋糕拿走。他们立刻弹了起来，但"
"因为动作太猛，撕到了伤口。你问他们到底怎么回事、感觉怎么样、为什么要躲着你，但"
"[Companion Name]始终不说话。最后你问他们为什么不带你一起，他们的眼泪都快出来了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... I couldn't put you in danger, [Player Name]."
msgstr "我……我不能让你有危险，[Player Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you mean, you couldn't put me in danger?"
msgstr "什么叫“不能让我有危险”？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you were doing something dangerous, then I especially should have been there!"
msgstr "如果你当时有危险，我刚应该跟你在一起！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What were you thinking?"
msgstr "你到底在想什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That I didn't want to lose you too!"
msgstr "我怕连你也没了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That I had to keep Azamire safe and if I brought you with me, you might not come back!"
msgstr "我必须保证阿扎米尔的安全。如果带上你，你可能就回不来了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We've already lost twenty more people on the route to the Ringleader's fortress in the "
"past couple weeks."
msgstr "过去几个星期，我们去了幕后头目的堡垒，去的路上没了二十个人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"All but two of them were to a single weird ent. Way bigger than the rest, and covered "
"in these weird... talismans."
msgstr ""
"除了两个人，其他人都死在古怪的恩特树人手里。那东西比其他树人都大，身上有古怪的……护符。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's what did this to you?"
msgstr "就是它把你伤成这样的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't want to bring you in case... It had something we couldn't handle."
msgstr "我不想带你去，万一……有什么我们应付不了的情况呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We lost so much in the attack, but at least... I still had you. I couldn't lose you, "
"too."
msgstr "在那场战斗中，我们失去了太多，但至少……我还有你。我不能连你也没了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So you tried to fight it on your own? [Companion Name] why-"
msgstr "所以，你打算一个人去对抗它？[Companion Name]为什么——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just wanted to see it! I've been practicing on the smaller ones all this time."
msgstr "我只是想见识一下！这段时间我一直在用小的树人练手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Tonight, I figured that I could get a look at the big one, learn what it could do, come "
"back to town, and come up with a plan against it."
msgstr "今晚我想去看看那大家伙，看看它到底有什么本事，然后回来想办法对付它。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So... what happened?"
msgstr "所以……到底发生了什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They detail the events of the night. How they came across the creature, and the "
"talismans in its branches flashed with a bright blue light as they tried to run away. "
"How they floated up into the air and were sucked towards the ent while they flailed "
"about in the air, and then how the ent sent them flying after the talismans in its "
"branches flashed bright blue. [Companion Name] was sure they were going to die, until "
"they saw that the talismans in the ent's branches matched the similar charms forming a "
"line in the nearby treeline. The giant ent shuffled back and forth at that line, but "
"wouldn't cross it. Then, they limped all the way back to Azamire.\n"
"\n"
"After a through amount of ridicule and chastisement, you hug them and tell them you're "
"glad they're okay.\n"
"\n"
"In the morning you detail everything that happened to Jass, who gathers up the archers "
"of her militia and send them out with you and a wounded [Companion Name], who leads you "
"to the grove with the giant ent. It seems that it has been joined by several of the "
"smaller ones, but you aren't dissuaded. "
msgstr ""
"他们详细讲述了那晚发生的事。他们是怎么遇到那个大树人的，还有当他们想要逃跑时，大树人树枝"
"上的护符闪起了蓝色的亮光。他们是怎么飘到天上的，在天上挣扎时是怎么吸到大树人那边的，还有"
"在大树人树枝上的护符闪起蓝色的亮光之后，他们是怎么被大树人甩飞的。[Companion Name]以为死"
"定了，直到他们发现大树人树枝上的护符和附近丛林里的那排护身符是一样的。大树人在那排符咒前"
"走来走去，始终不敢过去。后来，他们一瘸一拐地回到了阿扎米尔。\n"
"\n"
"在数落和训斥了他们一顿后，你抱了抱他们，说你很高兴看到他们没事。\n"
"\n"
"早上，你把发生的一切告诉杰丝。杰丝召集了她的弓箭手，让他们跟你一起去。受伤的[Companion "
"Name]也一起去，他带你们前往大树人的那片树林。似乎又多了几个小树人，但你没有退缩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's make them a bit smaller, turned into ash."
msgstr "把它们再变小一点，变成灰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Think that's everything!"
msgstr "应该就是这样了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The ents are all down, and the archers do their best to shoot the talismans out of the "
"trees incase they do... anything bad. [Companion Name] holds their bow at their side, "
"pleased to have gotten a little payback, then kicks at an ent's branch that seems to be "
"trying to crawl away."
msgstr ""
"树人都倒下了，弓箭手努力射击它们身上的护符，以免它们……搞什么坏事。[Companion Name]将弓放"
"在旁边，对刚才的小复仇很满意，然后踢了一下一根树人的树枝，那树枝好像要爬走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you... I'm sorry I tried to play the hero."
msgstr "谢谢你……抱歉，之前是我自作主张。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you didn't... I probably would have. I don't want to lose you either."
msgstr "如果你没有……我可能已经死了。我也不想失去你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please, don't do something like that again, okay? I need you too."
msgstr "求你了，别再做那种事了，好吗？我也需要你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Okay okay... You too, alright? Promise?"
msgstr "好，好……你也是，好吗？答应我？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Promise."
msgstr "我答应你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Me too."
msgstr "我也答应你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems the trees aren't quite 'dead' yet, huh?"
msgstr "看来这些树人还没死透，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Doubt they'll survive being turned into ash, don't you think?"
msgstr "都化成灰了，你觉得它们还能活吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Everyone gathers up the ent parts. They don't seem dangerous anymore, but you do notice "
"that - slowly but surely - they're starting to gain new growth. If you waited long "
"enough, they'd likely become a threat again. The archers help by snapping off new "
"branches and tossing them back into the pile, and occasionally making sure that none "
"have managed to crawl away."
msgstr ""
"大家将树人的尸体堆在一起。它们看起来没什么危险了，但你注意到，它们正在慢慢地重新生长。照"
"这样下去，它们恐怕又会变成威胁。弓箭手帮忙折断那些新长的树枝，扔到尸体堆里。 他们还时不"
"时地留意，确保没有树枝爬走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The last bit of smoke goes out as the final pile of burning ent runs out of fuel. You "
"were almost tempted to start trying to grill something, but the idea of the smoke being "
"evil and getting into the food dissuaded any attempts. [Companion Name] leans against "
"you, both for comfort, and because they are far from recovered from their wounds. You "
"tease them lightly about getting smacked around by kindling, to which they reply by "
"driving the butt of their bow into your foot. You tussel their hair and give them a "
"hug, and tell them that you're glad they're safe."
msgstr ""
"最后一堆树人被烧成灰烬，最后一点烟雾也消失了。你刚刚还想烤点什么东西吃，但一想，这些烟雾"
"有邪恶的味道，如果进入食物就惨了。[Companion Name]靠在你身上，想找点安慰，也因为他们的伤"
"还没好。你取笑说他们被一堆燃烧的东西打得这么惨，他们用弓尾戳了一下你的脚。你揉了揉他们的"
"头发，抱了他们一下，说你很高兴他们平安无事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "In the Thick of It"
msgstr "陷入激战"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Azamire is as ready as it ever will be to take down the Ringleader. The old Northern "
"Road is clear, Jass's crew has finished the tunnel to the prison, and you have defeated "
"the worst of the Misty Thicket's roaming guards. Now, all that's left to do is burn the "
"fortress to the ground."
msgstr ""
"阿扎米尔已经准备好消灭幕后头目。旧北路恢复通畅，杰丝的人挖通了连接牢房的隧道，你也除掉了"
"迷雾丛林里最难搞的巡逻守卫。现在，最后一件事就是把这座堡垒夷为平地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If I want any supplies, I should take them from the cart before the attack starts in "
"earnest."
msgstr "如果需要任何物资，我应该在战斗开始之前，把东西从车上拿下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's time."
msgstr "就是现在。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you walk through Azamire, the town is abuzz with nervous energy. Several wagons are "
"lined up and everyone who isn't fighting have come out to wish you well. Hapren "
"approaches, and mentions that the town has gotten together and prepared some combat "
"supplies into the back of one of the carts for you, and hopes that it helps.\n"
"\n"
"You all set off, and as the sun begins to set, the cold mist of the thicket starts to "
"seep into your clothes. The militia is tense, but ready. There are people to save, and "
"taking out the Ringleader would go a long way towards making everyone safer."
msgstr ""
"你穿过阿扎米尔，小镇里有一种躁动、紧张的气氛。几辆马车排成一排，没有参加战斗的人都出来送"
"你们。哈普伦走过来，说小镇齐心协力，在一辆马车的后箱里为你们准备了一些战斗物资，希望能帮"
"上忙。\n"
"\n"
"你们出发了。夕阳西下，丛林中冰冷的雾气开始钻进你们的衣服。民兵们有点紧张，但都做好了战斗"
"准备。有人等你们去救。如果能除掉幕后头目，大家会安全很多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone's ready?"
msgstr "大家准备好了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's get this done."
msgstr "开始行动吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't have any qualms with this, Gloob?"
msgstr "格鲁布，你有什么疑虑吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I might be green, but I'm no Golbin. Let's take him out."
msgstr "我是绿色的，但我不是哥布林。我们去干掉他。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You okay, [Player Name]?"
msgstr "你还好吗，[Player Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Never better. Plan is the same, still?"
msgstr "我非常好。计划不变，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That's right. The tunnel under the prison is ready to get the prisoners out, and we'll "
"have people posted at the exit."
msgstr "对。牢房下面的隧道已经挖好了，可以转移囚犯。我们会在出口的地方安排人手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As soon as people start escaping down the tunnel, the guards will notice everyone's "
"missing and sound the alarm."
msgstr "一旦有人从隧道逃走，守卫就会发现人不见了，然后拉响警报。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Once that happens, archers will try to hit that stockpile you mentioned with flaming "
"arrows."
msgstr "到那时，弓箭手会用火箭射击你提到的那些战利品。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Should deal with most of the ents inside, and make a ton of noise. You'll be providing "
"the fire, of course, we need several braziers lit."
msgstr ""
"这应该能消灭里面大部分的恩特树人，还能制造很大的动静。当然，你来负责点火。那几个火盆必须"
"有火。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"After that, we head to the gate and hack it down. The archers will keep us covered."
msgstr "之后，我们就冲向大门，把它劈开。弓箭手会掩护我们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And then we're in. Try to avoid the fire, and head for the Ringleader?"
msgstr "然后我们就进去了。避开大火，直接去找幕后头目，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Exactly. Can't miss 'em. Big blue fella, covered in every gaudy fabric he fancies."
msgstr "没错。那家伙很好认。个头高大，蓝色皮肤，身上挂着花里胡哨的布料。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Things are going to get really hectic once this starts."
msgstr "一旦行动开始，场面肯定非常混乱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Stay safe, everyone."
msgstr "大家注意安全。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You too, [Player Name]. You too."
msgstr "你也是，[Player Name]。你也是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you finish your conversation, the fortress's outer wall comes into view. Gloob and "
"small group of the militia break off and head for the tunnel while the rest of you set "
"up on the hillside just outside. Several braziers are set up, and everyone starts to "
"load them with wood while you and [Companion Name] get to work."
msgstr ""
"话刚说完，你们就看见了堡垒的外墙。格鲁布和一小队民兵去隧道那边，其他人在外面的山坡上就"
"位。你们架起几个火盆，大家开始往里面放木柴。你和[Companion Name]也忙起来了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We have to get through this gate!"
msgstr "我们要穿过这道大门！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There! A hole!"
msgstr "看那儿！有个洞！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Alarms start to sound as the militia's arrows are lit. You clutch your weapon in "
"anticipation, wishing you could to go check on the tunnel to see how Gloob's breakout "
"went, but there's no time. The hillside is lit up with the fires you and [Companion "
"Name] started, and hobgolbins on the wall begin to shoot towards you. But it's too "
"late. Burning arrow after arrow soar up and over the wall, towards where you pointed "
"out the stockpile. No one can see over the wall, so it's tough to tell if anyone is on "
"target until a resounding BOOM make you cover your ears, even from this far away.\n"
"\n"
"Many of the defenders are thrown from the wall entirely, and as you and the militia "
"charge, the swordsmen dispatch the stunned hobgolbins that fell on the wrong side of "
"the wall. Arrows start to fall again, as the fort's guards gather themselves, and "
"they're met with your militia's own volleys."
msgstr ""
"警报响了，民兵把箭点燃。你握紧武器，准备迎战。你想去隧道那边，看看格鲁布的突围怎么样。但"
"时间来不及了。你和[Companion Name]点的火照亮了山坡，墙上的大哥布林开始射击你们。但一切都"
"太晚了。一支支火箭飞过高墙，射向你之前提到的战利品。没人能看到墙那边的情况，所以很难判断"
"有没有射中目标。这时，远处传来一声巨响，你赶紧捂上耳朵。\n"
"\n"
"很多守军从墙上掉下来。你和民兵发起冲锋，弓箭手迅速解决从墙上掉下来的、已经昏倒的大哥布"
"林。堡垒的守卫重整旗鼓，再次射箭。与此同时，民兵射箭还击。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "FOR AZAMIRE!"
msgstr "为了阿扎米尔！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't stop running until you hit the gate! "
msgstr "跑啊，别停，向大门那边冲！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We can do this! Push on!"
msgstr "我们能做到！继续前进！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You and [Companion Name] reach the gate first and take out your axes, followed by a "
"small group of other militia members who follow suit and get to work. Another group "
"comes with large shields that they hold with both hands, more table than shield. But "
"they work well as the shield group form a defensive shell around you and overhead, "
"giving you room to work without worrying about an arrow finding its way in your "
"unprotected back."
msgstr ""
"你和[Companion Name]最先冲到大门，拿出斧头。随后，一小队民兵也到了，他们拿出斧头，准备动"
"手。另一队人也到了，双手拿着巨大的盾牌。与其说是盾牌，倒不如说是桌子。不过这些盾牌确实好"
"用。他们在你的周围和头上形成一道防御屏障，你可以安心作业，不用担心被箭射中。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We will not fall. Not this time."
msgstr "我们绝不会倒下。至少这一次，绝不会。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's... done."
msgstr "我们……完成了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The occasional pained grunt, or worse, the painted gurgles of someone who was struck "
"somewhere lethal, dampen your mood. You knew people would fall today. You can only "
"imagine how the people on the hillside are faring. Just as your mind starts to lose "
"focus, thinking about those you'd lose, you see a burning light at the end of your axe. "
"As you pull it back, you realize you're through! You give a cheer that turns into a "
"battlecry, and your group follows suit. A few more axe strikes and enough holes are "
"opened to let Azamire's troops push through the gate.\n"
"\n"
"The fort grounds are... hellish. Most of the ent guardians already crawl on the ground, "
"crying out with groaning wails as they burn, with nearly every structure already "
"completely engulfed in flames. You wonder for a moment if there's even a point of being "
"inside until a massive blue Golbin covered in singed fabric cries out as he locks eyes "
"with you. The rest of the fort's surviving defenders stand in the middle of the blazing "
"stronghold with the Ringleader, smashing weapons against their shields, waiting for "
"orders. "
msgstr ""
"你偶尔听到有人在痛苦地小声叫唤，更糟的是还有人受到致命一击发出痛苦的咯咯声。这些都会影响"
"你的情绪。你知道，今天会有人倒下。你只能想象山坡上的人会面临什么。你开始失去注意力，想起"
"那些你会失去的人。这时，你看到斧头上有燃烧的火光。你把斧头收回来，知道你已经做到了！你欢"
"呼一声，欢呼声又变成了战斗的呐喊声。其他人也跟着喊起来。你们又砍了几下，把大门砍了几个大"
"洞。阿扎米尔的队伍可以进去了。\n"
"\n"
"堡垒里面就像……地狱。很多树人守卫倒在地上，在烈火中痛苦地哀嚎。几乎所有的建筑都陷入了火"
"海。你心想，留在这儿还有什么意义。这时，一个巨大的蓝色哥布林看着你。它发出尖叫声，身上的"
"布料都烧焦了。堡垒剩下的守军和它们的幕后头目站在大火中间。这些幸存的守军用武器敲打盾牌，"
"等待指令。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Humans want to be hand delivered to masters?"
msgstr "人类是想自己送死吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ringleader need new stock, others just ran out."
msgstr "幕后头目需要新货了，之前的那些用完了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Come to me. Time for you to die."
msgstr "到我这儿来。你们的死期到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Keep the rest of them off [Player Name] and [Companion Name]! "
msgstr "别让其他人靠近[Player Name]和[Companion Name]！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Know that we fight not just for those back home, not just to save yourselves..."
msgstr "记住，我们是为了家乡的人而战，也是为了自己而战……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But for everyone we've lost!"
msgstr "更是为了我们已经失去的人！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Together! Go! Now! Kill them all!"
msgstr "一起上！冲啊！就是现在！把它们全部干掉！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name], I'm with you. Trust me! I'll keep you safe!"
msgstr "[Player Name]，我跟你一起。相信我！我会保护你的安全！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Not a single person falters as they stream past you, charging with weapons and heads "
"held high. You don't turn away as you see some being driven through as the Ringleader's "
"forces crash into your own. Time slows as you push through, trusting your people to "
"keep you safe. As you make it through the bodies, the Ringleader stands with a gnarled "
"smirk, holding what must be half a burning tree as its weapon, seemingly unbothered by "
"the flames that flicker up its arm.\n"
"\n"
"You hear people roar in the battle behind you, some in victory, others... likely as "
"their last act of defiance against the opposing force. You steel yourself and step "
"forward, challenging the Ringleader."
msgstr ""
"大家抬起头，拿着武器，从你身边飞快地冲出去。幕后头目的手下也冲了过来。你看见有人的身体被"
"直接撞穿了，但你没有退缩。你继续向前冲，把自己的安全交给战友。此时，时间好像慢了下来。你"
"穿过一句句尸体，终于看见了幕后头目。它歪着嘴，露出狰狞的笑。它握着燃烧的半棵树当武器。火"
"焰爬上它的手臂，但它似乎一点也不在乎。\n"
"\n"
"你听到身后传来一阵阵的呼喊声。有的是胜利的呼叫，有的……或许是面对敌人的最后一次反抗。你镇"
"静下来，继续向前，向幕后头目发起挑战。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Before you lies the broken body of the Ringleader, sickly purple blood spilling from "
"his wounds. You finally spare a glance to those around you, and you realize... it's "
"over. Less than half the attacking force remains, but Azamire's people still stand.  "
"Gloob stands among the militia, deep green body covered in the blue blood of "
"hobgolbins, and he lets out a cheer, one that the remaining militia proudly meet. Jass "
"barks out orders, pointing out wounded with the stump of her arm, then starting to pull "
"one of the wounded towards the gate with her other.\n"
"\n"
"Half a dozen emotions cross [Companion Name]'s face the second you look at them, but "
"most among them all, relief. They embrace you for naught but a moment before heading "
"towards the Ringleader, who barely manages a ragged breath. As you approach, the beast "
"lets out a throaty cackle before it devolves into a choking cough. You ask it two "
"questions. Where did the shipments go, and who are the people it works for?\n"
"\n"
"He just sits and smirks, the flames of his burning fortress dancing in his eyes.\n"
"\n"
"\"They'll come back soon.\""
msgstr ""
"你看见幕后头目全身都是伤，伤口流着恶心的紫色鲜血。你看了看周围，终于意识到……一切都结束"
"了。超过一半的敌人都倒了，而阿扎米尔的战士们依然站着。格鲁布站在民兵队伍中，深绿色的身体"
"上沾满了大哥布林的蓝色鲜血。它大声欢呼，其他民兵也自豪地跟着欢呼。杰丝用残缺的手臂指向受"
"伤的人，大声地发出命令。然后，她又用另一只手将一名伤员拖到大门那边。\n"
"\n"
"你看着[Companion Name]，他们脸上的情绪复杂，但最明显的是轻松了。他们抱了你一下，然后走向"
"奄奄一息的幕后头目。你走过去，那野兽发出一声嘶哑的怪笑，然后又剧烈地咳嗽。你问了它两个问"
"题。它要把那些囚犯运到哪里去？它是为谁做事？\n"
"\n"
"它坐在那里，幸灾乐祸地笑。堡垒的火焰在它的眼睛里跳动。“他们很快就会回来的。”"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sand in the Wind"
msgstr "风中的沙"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"After a short stay back in Amazire, you and [Companion Name] find it hard to rest. "
"There's still so much to be done. The Ringleader was merely the first step."
msgstr ""
"回到阿扎米尔的这段时间里，你和[Companion Name]很难静下心来。还有很多事要做。幕后头目只是"
"开始。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They travelled a long, long way."
msgstr "他们一路上走了好远。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Like, really long."
msgstr "真的，很远。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The day following your attack on the Ringleader's fort is met with a mixture of joy, "
"relief, grief, and... uncertainty. \n"
"While the assault was successful, casualties number in the range of a few dozen, a "
"large blow to the already wavering population of your home.\n"
"\n"
"However, with the number of refugees coming and going nowadays, ebbs and flows in the "
"local populace are getting hard to keep track of. While callous, you are thankful that "
"no one you knew well fell - through a few of the original militia recruits you and "
"[Companion Name] were among the bodies you brought back on the wagons.\n"
"\n"
"Yesterday's events weren't enough to keep you or [Companion Name] down for long, "
"though. The two of you set off back to the fort at first light, searching for tracks of "
"the caravan you saw leave the fort on your first scouting mission. The set of buildings "
"behind their thick wall still smouldered from the night before, reminding you both of "
"the battle."
msgstr ""
"在你们攻击幕后头目堡垒的第二天，大家的心情很复杂，有喜悦，有轻松，有悲伤，还有……迷茫。虽"
"然这次袭击成功了，但还是有几十个人受伤或死亡。小镇的人本来就不多，这些伤亡是很大的打"
"击。\n"
"\n"
"但是，现在难民来来往往，当地人口数量的变化很难追踪。战争很残酷，但你庆幸的是，你认识的人"
"都还活着。在你和[Companion Name]用马车运回来的尸体里，有几个是民兵队伍的新兵。\n"
"\n"
"不过，昨天发生的事并没有让你或[Companion Name]伤心太久。天刚刚亮，你们俩就出发返回堡垒，"
"寻找那只车队。在第一次侦察时，你看到他们离开了堡垒。墙后面的建筑还在燃烧，这让你们想起了"
"昨晚的那场战斗。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Time to stomp around the forest a bit, eh?"
msgstr "去森林里转转吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Heading north... been a while since we've been this far from home."
msgstr "向北走……我们已经好久没走这么远了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You've always wanted to see the world. "
msgstr "你一直想看看外面的世界。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Couldn't ask for better company, either. Though... wish the circumstances were a bit "
"less..."
msgstr "有你陪我，就再好不过了。不过……要是情况没那么……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dour?"
msgstr "严重？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We first scouted the fortress out... what, two weeks back?"
msgstr "我们第一次去侦察堡垒……是两个星期以前吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Feels like it could have been yesterday, or half a year ago."
msgstr "感觉像是昨天，又像是半年前。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's been a long two weeks."
msgstr "这两个星期太长了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Think we'll still be able to track them?"
msgstr "你觉得我们还能找到他们吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With several wagons and a pack of hobgolbins, I don't see them as being particularly "
"sneaky."
msgstr "他们有几辆马车，还有一群大哥布林。我看他们就没想偷偷摸摸的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"And I doubt this stretch of woods sees much traffic, either. Let's see what we can find."
msgstr "再说，这片林子平时恐怕也没什么人经过。看看我们能发现什么吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Sure enough, the prisoner caravan cut a long, winding trail that isn't too hard to "
"follow. Torn up grass and foliage here, a few trees moved aside there. Concerningly, "
"the path looks... well-travelled. You're glad Azamire was able to put a stop to the "
"Ringleader's export of people from the area, but you can't help but wonder how many "
"towns fared a similar fate to your own. "
msgstr ""
"果然，押送囚犯的车队留下了一条长长的、弯弯曲曲的痕迹。要追踪不难。这里的草木被毁了，有几"
"棵树被挪到了一边。令人担心的是，这条路看起来……经常有人走。你很高兴，阿扎米尔成功阻止了幕"
"后头目把人运走。但你忍不住想，有多少城镇跟你的小镇一样，面临同样的遭遇。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fishing & Farming (Mitigating food issues)"
msgstr "钓鱼和农务（缓解粮食问题）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Following the caravan takes you ages. You travel north, out of the Elder Grove and just "
"an hour's walk outside of the town of Hirane until the tracks stop. Several wagons were "
"stopped here and burned, presumably by the hobgolbins bringing them. It seems that "
"several captives were killed, though for what reason, you don't know. From what you're "
"able to gather, the group split into well over thirty different parties, all heading "
"off in different directions. Doubtlessly impossible to follow them all, even without "
"the added difficulty of being much harder to track than the wagons.\n"
"\n"
"You worry for a moment about Hirane's safety until you realize that the golbins would "
"have to have a small army to raze a town of their size. Being situated on the Heartroad "
"- one of the main throughputs to the capitol of Melvor - certainly had its advantages. "
"Being able to trade for finely crafted arms and armor were chief among them, but the "
"Golbin's presence still gave you pause.\n"
"\n"
"You and [Companion Name] decide to head into town, and the general mood of the place "
"is... tense. Folks who seem to be citizens quickly hurry past haggard, haunted-looking "
"villagers. It's a sight you're well acquainted with, though you're surprised to see it "
"here. You and [Companion Name] are quickly approached by a fussy-looking man with a "
"immaculately cared for mustache and a permanent scowl etched on his face."
msgstr ""
"追踪那只车队花了你很长时间。你向北走，离开长者之林，在距离平根小镇一小时路程的地方，痕迹"
"没了。这里停了几辆被烧的马车，想必是押送囚犯的大哥布林做的。似乎还有几名俘虏被杀了，但你"
"不知道具体原因。根据你掌握的信息，这支车队分成了三十多支小队，向不同的地方走了。要追踪每"
"一支小队是不可能的。况且，这些人比马车还难追踪，那就更难了。\n"
"\n"
"你有点担心平根的安全，但转念一想，要毁掉这么大的一个城镇，至少要有一支小军队。平根在心路"
"上，而这条路是通往梅尔沃都城的主干道之一。所以，平根确实有优势。一个主要优势是能够买到精"
"良的武器和盔甲。不过，哥布林的存在还是让你有点担心。\n"
"\n"
"你和[Companion Name]决定去镇上。这里的气氛……很紧张。镇民们行色匆匆地经过那些憔悴、惊恐的"
"村民。你对这一幕很熟悉，只是没想到会在这里看到。这时，一名男子向你和[Companion Name]走"
"来。他留着精心打理的胡须，看起来紧张不安，总是愁眉苦脸。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If you wish to seek refuge within the town's walls, you must go to the registrar's "
"office and submit your documentation."
msgstr "如果你想去墙里面避难，必须先去登记处提交资料。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You can expect a wait time of-"
msgstr "你可能需要等一段时间——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And it's a pleasure to me you too. I am [Companion Name], this is [Player Name]."
msgstr "很高兴见到你。我是[Companion Name]，这是[Player Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...That's usually how a conversation starts, at least."
msgstr "……至少对话的开头应该是这样的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I simply do not have the time for idle-chit chat. You two are just one group of many "
"flowing into town."
msgstr "我实在没时间闲聊。除了你们，还有很多人来这儿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I apologize if I come off as rude, I am simply trying to be as efficient as I can be in "
"these trying times."
msgstr "抱歉，我刚才无礼了。在这样的艰难时刻，我只想尽可能地提高效率。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And what exactly ails your town so?"
msgstr "那么，你们的镇子怎么了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...The same as everywhere, this side of the sands."
msgstr "……和这片沙地另一边的其他地方一样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Cloaked figures attacking with beasts never before seen or heard of."
msgstr "我们被袭击了，一群黑袍人，还有一群没看过、没听过的野兽。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"They're razing farmland, attacking trade caravans, and burning hamlets to the ground."
msgstr "他们破坏农田，袭击商队，还烧了村庄。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'd think we were at war, with how frequent and destructive the attacks are."
msgstr "他们不断袭击，到处破坏，就像打仗一样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Anywhere outside of a walled-in town seems to be fair game to them. That... is, why "
"you're here, no?"
msgstr "在围着围墙的小镇外面，到处都是他们攻击的目标。这……就是你们来这儿的原因吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, yes, but not for refuge. We were tracking a convoy belonging to a group of them "
"from the south, but they dispersed about an hour outside of town."
msgstr ""
"对，但我们不是为了避难。我们在追踪一支车队。他们是从南边过来的。在距离小镇大约一小时路程"
"的地方，他们就散开了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That'd be by... the Elder Grove, no? Nasty business with Golbins down there right now, "
"I hear."
msgstr "那是在……长者之林附近，对吧？听说那儿有哥布林，麻烦得很。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not anymore, thankfully."
msgstr "幸好现在已经没事了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unsurprisingly, Curo had no idea what [Companion Name] was talking about, until the two "
"of you walk him through Azamire's attack on the fortress and the defeat of the "
"Ringleader. While skeptical, he sends out a scouting party to confirm your claims. "
"Through an only slightly more pleasant conversation with the man after a light change "
"in disposition, you learn that people have begun flocking to Hirane out of fear, or "
"lack of options.\n"
"\n"
"They've done what they can, but are quickly being stretched short with many of the "
"nearby villages being attacked, and much of the farmland nearby being abandoned out of "
"fear. When you and [Companion Name] press him for more details, he's dismissive, and "
"says he may be able to help, should you prove useful and your claims of razing the "
"Ringleader's fort prove true."
msgstr ""
"果然，库罗不知道[Companion Name]在说什么。你们俩给他讲阿扎米尔攻击了堡垒，打败了幕后头"
"目，这时他才明白了。他还是有些怀疑，于是派了一支侦察队去确认你们说的话。他的态度缓和了一"
"些，你们又愉快地聊了一下。你得知，因为害怕，或者没有其他选择，人们都来了平根小镇。\n"
"\n"
"他们已经尽力了。但附近很多村庄遭到了袭击，附近的很多农田没有人敢种，平根小镇也快撑不住"
"了。你和[Companion Name]想多问他一些细节，但他并不在意。他说，如果你们能证明自己有用，而"
"且你们真的摧毁了幕后头目的堡垒，那他或许可以帮你们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wow, they're well stocked. That's helpful, at least."
msgstr "哇，他们的物资储备很多嘛。至少这就很有用了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems like they've got it mostly handled, now."
msgstr "看来他们现在基本能够应付了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You and [Companion Name] drop off another package of supplies, hopeful that what you've "
"been able to provide lightens Hirane's burdens a bit. One of the women in charge of the "
"relief tent cheerfully accepts, a bit surprised by the weight of your goods.\n"
"\n"
"Just as you turn to go, Curo approaches you and [Companion Name] with an "
"uncharacteristic smile, holding a leaflet of paper and being flanked by two people who "
"seem to be scouts. He waves off a few people who vie for his attention."
msgstr ""
"你和[Companion Name]又放下一批物资，希望能帮平根减轻一点负担。负责救灾帐篷的一名女性开心"
"地收下物资，对物资的重量有些惊讶。\n"
"\n"
"正当你和[Companion Name]准备离开时，库罗走了过来。他笑得不太正常，手里拿着一张传单，身边"
"还跟着两个人，看样子像是侦察员。他挥了挥手，把几个想引起他注意的人打发走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wasn't expecting the two of you to get to work so quickly."
msgstr "没想到你们俩这么快就开始干活了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Honestly, I only wanted to put you to work since I thought you were full of it, talking "
"about rising up against that fortress."
msgstr "说实话，我只是想给你们找点事做，因为我觉得你们在说谎，说什么攻击堡垒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Believe us now?"
msgstr "现在信了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Believe you? Based on the reports I've gotten, I feel like I best start commissioning "
"portraits of you to hang in the mayor's home."
msgstr "信你们？根据我收到的报告，我觉得我最好找人给你们画几幅肖像，挂在镇长家里。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how a couple of villages out in the boonies managed to mount such a force, "
"but I say, I'm impressed."
msgstr "我不知道你们这些偏远村庄是怎么凑上一支队伍的，不过说真的，我挺佩服的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That fortress being taken care of makes all of us safer."
msgstr "堡垒没了，大家都更安全了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And I'd say... one good deed deserves another, hm?"
msgstr "依我看……好事就该有好报，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"That it does. I already have my people working on providing a report, worry not. "
"They'll bring it to you in a few hours."
msgstr "没错。我已经让手下去报告了，别担心。几个小时内就会交到你手上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Make yourselves at home, I'll have the guards know not to give you any trouble. And "
"uh..."
msgstr "不必拘束，我会交代守卫，不会找你们的麻烦。还有……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not used to doing this... I'm sorry for how we first met."
msgstr "不太习惯这样……我们第一次见面就那样，我很抱歉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Curo purses his lips at that, seemingly a bit lost on what to say after that. He opts "
"for a slight nod and then excuses himself, his caprones following quickly after.\n"
"\n"
"The woman you dropped off your goods with politely, but shyly, asks if the two of you "
"could lend just a bit more help since it sounds like you'll be stuck here anyway. You "
"look to [Companion Name], who just shrugs. Might as well. She quickly leads you off to "
"a nearby cooking tent, where a line of hungry refugees waits eagerly. It seems that the "
"current staff are struggling to keep up."
msgstr ""
"库罗撅了一下嘴，似乎不知道该说些什么。他点了点头，然后就走了，几名随从紧紧跟着他。\n"
"\n"
"刚才接你们物资的那名女子礼貌又害羞地问你们，能不能再帮一下忙，因为你们似乎暂时不会走。你"
"看着[Companion Name]，他只是耸了耸肩。那就帮吧。她立马带你们来到附近一个煮饭的帐篷。那里"
"排着队，饥饿的难民在焦急地等待食物。看样子，现在人手不够了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You and [Companion Name] find yourselves breathless and exhausted after providing as "
"many warm meals as you could. The crowd has been quelled substantially, with only a few "
"stragglers coming up every half an hour or so. The head chef dismisses you, and thanks "
"you dearly for your help, while making sure that you don't leave without a warm meal "
"yourselves.\n"
"\n"
"The two of you start to dig in, right as one of Curo's earlier companions wordlessly "
"jogs up to you and holds out a sealed scroll. Once you take it from his hands, he gives "
"a small salute and turns back the way he came.\n"
"\n"
"You read over the scroll in the dim evening light to see a collection of detailed notes "
"from months of observations. You read of the guard's clashes with armed groups, freed "
"captives, and even a few raids on encampments of the unnamed group. Finally, you find "
"what you're looking for.\n"
"\n"
"You read an entry regarding a skirmish that took Hirane's scouts far to the east, to "
"the edge of a town called Clearwater. The scouts continued to assail a caravan of these "
"armed bandits until a massive sandstorm blew into the region and forced their retreat.\n"
"\n"
"It wasn't much to go off of, but it's a start. The two of you finish your meals quickly "
"and ready yourselves to head east."
msgstr ""
"在发完热气腾腾的食物后，你和[Companion Name]累得气喘吁吁。难民的情绪已经基本稳住了。每隔"
"半小时左右，偶尔会有几个难民来要吃的。主厨让你们去休息，感谢你们的帮忙，叮嘱你们走之前先"
"吃一口热乎的。\n"
"\n"
"你们俩正准备大吃一顿，刚才库伦的一名随从跑到你们面前，没说一句话，把一个封好的卷轴递给"
"你。你接过卷轴。他行了一个礼，转身就回去了。\n"
"\n"
"在昏暗的夜色中，你打开卷轴，里面详细记录了几个月的观察情况。你读到守卫和武装队伍的冲突、"
"获救的俘虏，还有对某个无名组织的几次突袭。最后，你找到了想要的内容。\n"
"\n"
"你读到一条信息，说一次小冲突把平根的侦察员引向了遥远的北边，最后到了一座名叫清水镇的小镇"
"附近。那些侦察员一路追击一群武装匪徒的车队，后来遇到了一场巨大的沙尘暴，他们不得不撤"
"退。\n"
"\n"
"虽然线索不多，但总算是个开始。你们俩迅速吃完饭，准备去东边。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Path to Melvor"
msgstr "通往梅尔沃之路"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"After pouring over the reports from Hirane's scouts, you're sure of one thing. The "
"hooded figures that attacked Azamire and seem to be kidnapping and transporting "
"townsfolk have headed far to the east. To what end, you couldn't even begin to wager a "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"在仔细阅读了平根侦察员的报告之后，你确定了一件事。那些攻击阿扎米尔、绑走镇民的兜帽人，已"
"经往遥远的东边走了。至于他们的目的，你没办法推测。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With enough of these, we should be able to make it to Clearwater!"
msgstr "有了这些信息，我们应该可以到清水镇了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wow... they're... really sweet."
msgstr "哇……它们……真的好甜啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You exit Hirane's gate and find yourself deep within the countryside. You travel east "
"along the Heartroad, knowing that if you go far enough, it should be next to impossible "
"to miss Clearwater. From what you were able to gather from folks in Hirane, Clearwater "
"acts as the major waystation between the east and west sides of the Desert Plains. You "
"heard of many small resting points and hamlets between here and there, but few were "
"notable enough to commit to memory.\n"
"\n"
"The Heartroad is generally well constructed and maintained - even this far from the "
"capitol - but as grass turned to arid soil, and then eventually sand, the Heartroad "
"becomes harder to keep track of. Despite what the locals in Hirane said about there "
"being places to rest between there and Clearwater, most of the buildings you pass are "
"abandoned, swallowed by the sands.\n"
"\n"
"The sun beats down on you overhead in a way you're unfamiliar with except for on "
"Azamire's hottest summer days. There's no reprieve from the heat, just sand stretching "
"out in what seems endless waves of gold."
msgstr ""
"你走出平根的大门，来到一望无际的乡野。你沿着心路向东走。只要一直走，肯定能到清水镇。你听"
"平根的人说，清水镇是沙漠平原的东侧和西侧之间的重要中转点。你听说沿途有很多小的休息站和村"
"庄，但能记住的没几个。\n"
"\n"
"心路离都城很远，但总体上修建和维护得不错。一路上，从草地变成干旱的土地，最后变成沙地，心"
"路上的痕迹越来越难追踪。平根的当地人说，去清水镇的路上有休息的地方，但你经过的大多数建筑"
"都已经荒废，被黄沙吞没了。\n"
"\n"
"头顶的太阳热得很，这种热只有阿扎米尔夏天最热的那段时间才有。烈日下一片空旷，只有无边无际"
"的金色沙浪。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is... a little warmer than I expected."
msgstr "这……比我想的热。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do we have any water left?"
msgstr "我们还有水吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "About one more flask between us. Want it now?"
msgstr "大概还有一壶水。现在要喝吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Already? Wow..."
msgstr "这么快就没了？哇……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I didn't think so few of the waystations would be abandoned. We'd have had to carry "
"more than both our weights in water to make it to Clearwater without stopping..."
msgstr "没想到废弃的中转点这么少。要想直接到达清水镇，我们要带的水比我们俩的重量还要重……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm not saying it's time to panic, but-"
msgstr "我不是说现在就该慌了，不过——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I refuse to lose to the sun, just days after we took down the Ringleader."
msgstr "我才干掉了幕后头目，我可不想输给太阳。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Got an oasis in your back pocket that I don't know about?"
msgstr "你是不是还藏着什么我不知道的“绿洲”啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You grab [Companion Name] and pull her to the side, off the Heartroad and crest over "
"one of the dunes. Your eyes don't deceive you - or your mind can't conjure up "
"particularly appealing mirages - the small green crowns you saw from the road belong to "
"large cacti. You stick one with your knife and a miserably thin trickle of slightly "
"sappy water pours out. It isn't white, and after a small taste, it doesn't seem acidic "
"or leave your tongue tingling. It doesn't seem poisonous, and that's good enough. Beats "
"frying to death, anyway."
msgstr ""
"你抓着[Companion Name]，把她拉到一边，离开心路，翻过一道山丘。你的眼睛没有骗你——或者说，"
"你的脑子无法幻化出什么特别吸引人的海市蜃楼。你在路上看到的绿东西，其实是巨大的仙人掌。你"
"用刀插进一株仙人掌，慢慢流出一点点汁液。那汁液不是白色。你尝了一点，发现不酸，舌头也不"
"痛。看来没毒。这就够了。总比晒死要好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That hurt, but I guess it's fair."
msgstr "虽然很疼，但我想，这也是公平的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You wipe the cactus water from your mouth. The two of you tapped into many of the ones "
"nearby and start to stray from the original patch. You find yourselves giggling and "
"swaying too and fro, despite definitely being more hydrated. You're worried that "
"something may be wrong, but how could it be? You feel so good. [Companion Name] nearly "
"collapses against you in a fit of giggles, the sand undulating in mesmerizing patterns "
"underneath you."
msgstr ""
"你擦掉嘴边的仙人掌汁液。你们俩喝了附近的很多仙人掌，不知不觉就走远了。水分补充好了，但你"
"们咯咯地笑，身体摇摇晃晃。你担心有点不对劲，可到底是什么问题呢？你感觉还不错。"
"[Companion Name]笑得差点倒在你身上。脚下的沙地起起伏伏，形成迷人的图案。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You are the best, you know that, [Player Name]?"
msgstr "你是最棒的，你知道吗，[Player Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nooooooo, no. You are!"
msgstr "不——不。你才是！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No, stop it, stop it. I mean it. I never would have been able to come out all this way "
"if it weren't for you."
msgstr "不，别这样说，别这样说。我是认真的。要不是你，我不可能走这么远。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And nowwwww I feel so so so good."
msgstr "而且我现在……感觉好极了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do you think *hic*, that maybe, the cactus water is..."
msgstr "你说*嗝*，该不会是因为那些仙人掌汁液……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Pffffft. Nooooo. This is how I NORMALLY am. Look at how normal I'm being right now."
msgstr "噗。不会的。我平时就是这样的。你看，我现在多正常呀。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The cacti that stand in front of you now seem... bigger. And they move. But everything "
"is moving, so that's not particularly strange. What is strange is that one of the cacti "
"swing one of it's spiny arms at your head when you try to cut into it with your axe. "
"The needles in the side of your face snap you out of the cactus water's hallucinogenic "
"effects.\n"
"\n"
"Everything around you stops moving, except for the... angry cactus in front of you. And "
"all of the ones behind it. They shift through the sands and reach out with their arms. "
"They're real. You call out to [Companion Name] who seems to be having a similar "
"revelation."
msgstr ""
"眼前的仙人掌似乎……变大了。而且还在动。所有东西都在动，没什么特别奇怪的。但奇怪的是，当你"
"准备用斧头砍一株仙人掌的时候，它挥动长满刺的手臂，打在你的头上。你的脸刺痛无比，这时你从"
"仙人掌汁液造成的幻觉中醒了。\n"
"\n"
"你周围的一切都停了，除了你面前的那株……愤怒的仙人掌。还有它后面的那些。他们在沙里游走，伸"
"出它们的手臂。它们都是真的。你呼唤[Companion Name]，她似乎也发现了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Individually, these aren't too bad."
msgstr "单看这些，也不是什么大麻烦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That was worth free passage for life? Huh."
msgstr "就这，能换来终身免费通行？呵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The cacti's spines are rough to content with, and require a far more protective "
"approach to fighting than you're used to employing, but all is well. The patch of cacti "
"lays slain at your feet, and the... effects of the cactus water seem to have subsided.\n"
"\n"
"You press on to Clearwater, only taking occasional, small sips of the cactus water you "
"collected when you absolutely need to. You're definitely more giggly than usual and "
"sway lightly on your feet, but the worst of the effects never take hold with your "
"moderate approach.\n"
"\n"
"The town of Clearwater is a sight for sore, sun-baked eyes. Your feet ache, your skin "
"is sunburnt, and you're absolutely parched. A small crowd of townsfolk gather about, "
"laughing at your misfortune and warning of some of the dangers you may see deeper "
"within in the desert.\n"
"\n"
"When you ask about the figures, much of the levity is replaced by fear. A good chunk of "
"the population here seems to have come from the abandoned exterior towns fleeing the... "
"Soulsmiths. It feels weird to finally have a name to the group that destroyed your "
"home. Here, dealing with them has been a constant, and the name holds no gravitas. The "
"townspeople say they've seen the caravans head east, towards the capitol, and warn you "
"to stay far away from the eastern Heartroad for now. When you and [Companion Name] tell "
"tales of Azamire and the Ringleader, and your goal of seeing the Soulsmiths brought to "
"justice, it seems like half the town opens their homes to you, keeping you fed and "
"hydrated as you two recover.\n"
"\n"
"After some well-deserved rest, the two of you continue east finally out of the dunes "
"and back into grassy fields. You pass into rockier terrain as you approach the "
"Flinkcrest Highlands. Large jagged boulders dot the rocky soil, jutting out at odd "
"angles."
msgstr ""
"仙人掌的刺不好对付。要对付它们，你要比平时更加注意防御。不过好在一切顺利。那些仙人掌全都"
"倒在了你脚下，而……仙人掌汁液带来的“效果”，似乎也已经消退了。\n"
"\n"
"你继续前往清水镇。万不得已时，你偶尔抿一点收集的仙人掌汁液。你比平时更爱笑，身体也有些摇"
"晃。但你喝的不多，那些最糟糕的“效果”没有出现。\n"
"\n"
"熬过了炎炎烈日，你终于看到了清水镇。此时你的双脚酸痛，皮肤晒伤，非常口渴。一群镇民围了过"
"来。他们嘲笑你的不幸，提醒你注意沙漠更深处可能存在的一些危险。\n"
"\n"
"当你打听那些兜帽人时，气氛从轻松变成了恐惧。这里很多人似乎都是从外面的废弃城镇逃来的，而"
"他们逃跑的原因……是炼魂师。你终于知道了摧毁家园的那群人叫什么，这感觉有点奇怪。这里一直都"
"在对付那些人，所以这个名字听起来并不沉重。镇民们说，他们看到那些车队往东边，也就是都城的"
"方向走了。他们提醒你暂时远离东边的心路。你与[Companion Name]讲述阿扎米尔和幕后头目的故"
"事，还说你们的目标是将炼魂师绳之以法。这时，似乎有一半的镇民为你们敞开家门，给你们吃的喝"
"的，让你们休息。\n"
"\n"
"休息好了以后，你们俩继续向东走，终于走出了沙丘，回到了草地。你们越靠近弗林克克雷斯特高"
"地，路上的石头就越多。地上全是嶙峋的巨石，呈现出各种奇特的角度。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How do you think they... got like that?"
msgstr "你觉得它们……是怎么变成这样的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What, the boulders?"
msgstr "你是说那些巨石吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah. Kinda... random, how they're all over the place, no?"
msgstr "是的。到处都是，有点……奇怪，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Maybe. But what, it's not like someone would haul them out here, right?"
msgstr "……也许吧。不过，不会是有人搬来这儿的吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To what end?"
msgstr "目的是什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With that, [Companion Name] continues to peer over the boulders as the two of you "
"travel along the Heartroad, as if they'd spring to life and tell her where they came "
"from. You've had enough of sentient things that should otherwise not be, so you try to "
"avoid staring too much.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, you arrive at a little inn that seems to have been built into a stone wall and "
"garrison that takes up the expansive entrance of the Broken Pass. The Sleeping Stone is "
"legendary, and for good reason. Not only is it the home of the Slayers Guild for the "
"eastern region of the continent, it attracts world renowned adventurers who wish to "
"venture into the Perilous Peaks to prove themselves to be the best of the best.\n"
"\n"
"The Broken Pass is the quickest way to the capitol, but it's typically travelled by "
"highly armed caravans that can both pay the toll to pass the gate, and can fend off any "
"beasts that travelled down from the mountain proper. When you hear of caravans being "
"rerouted south - around the mountain range - due to a particularly feisty pack of "
"Stonehoppers, you're quick to offer you and [Companion Name]'s services. \n"
"\n"
"The owner of the Sleeping Stone does you one better, saying that if you take care of "
"them, you'll get free passage through the Broken Pass for life. The deal's too good to "
"pass up."
msgstr ""
"你们俩沿着心路继续走，[Companion Name]时不时地探头看看路边的巨石，仿佛那些巨石会活过来，"
"告诉她来自哪里。你对这些本来就不该有意识的东西没兴趣，所以尽量不去多看。\n"
"\n"
"最终，你到了一家小客栈。 这家客栈似乎直接建在石墙里面。旁边是一处要塞，位置在破碎关口宽"
"敞的入口。沉睡之石非常有名，而且名副其实。这里是大陆东部地区“屠杀者公会”的总部，吸引了世"
"界各地的著名冒险者。他们都想进入“险恶山脉”，证明自己是顶尖中的顶尖。\n"
"\n"
"破碎关口是前往都城最快的路，但通常只有装备精良的车队才会走。这些车队付得起通行费，也能够"
"抵御山里的野兽。听说有一群特别凶猛的石跳兽，逼得车队改变方向往南走，绕过大山。你立刻提出"
"要和[Companion Name]一起解决麻烦。\n"
"\n"
"沉睡之石的老板提出了更诱人的条件：只要你能搞定那群家伙，以后就可以终身免费通过破碎关口。"
"这笔买卖太划算了，不能错过。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully this will persuade them to come out and say hello."
msgstr "希望这能引它们现身，打个招呼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ugh. My eyes are watering."
msgstr "呃。我的眼泪都快出来了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You tally up the bodies of the tall, awkward beasts. Stonehoppers were a bit of an odd "
"blend of creatures. They were scaly like a lizard and use a long whip-like tail for "
"stability. They have two large wings that aid them in jumping from rock to rock - hence "
"their name - but they were technically flightless. The 'birds' walk on two powerful "
"legs that they used to kick at their prey, which fortunately made it easy to get them "
"tangled up in traps.\n"
"\n"
"What surprised you about them was their number. It felt like every time you caught one, "
"you'd see two more jumping overhead."
msgstr ""
"你清理那些野兽的尸体。它们又高又笨。石跳兽是一种奇特的生物。他们长着蜥蜴般的鳞片，还有一"
"条鞭子似的长尾巴，用来保持平衡。它们有一对大翅膀，让它们能够在岩石间跳跃。它们的名字就是"
"这样来的。但严格来说，它们不会飞。这些‘鸟’行走时用两条强壮的腿，捕猎时用脚踢猎物。好在这"
"些特点可以让它们轻松落入陷阱。\n"
"\n"
"令你惊讶的是它们的数量。感觉你抓一只，头上又有两只跳过去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're getting a bit more wily the further into the pass we go."
msgstr "我们越往关口里面走，它们就越狡猾。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bigger, too."
msgstr "个头也越大。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And there's so many of them. What do you think they even eat?"
msgstr "而且数量很多。你说它们平时吃什么呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully not us. "
msgstr "但愿吃的不是我们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Speaking of eating... how do you think they taste?"
msgstr "说到吃……你觉得它们吃起来怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Like chicken, hopefully. They're about thirty times the size, though. Hopefully not too "
"stringy, with all their muscles."
msgstr "希望是鸡肉味的。不过，它们的个头是鸡的三十倍大。全身都是肌肉，希望肉别太柴了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But do you think you could eat something that maybe would eat people, if they had the "
"chance?"
msgstr "但你觉得，如果有机会，你会吃那种可能会吃人的东西吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh without a doubt. I wouldn't do it if it ate someone recently, of course."
msgstr "那肯定会啊。不过，如果它刚吃过人，我不会吃。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But what, are you telling me you'd turn down the chance to try dragon?"
msgstr "怎么，难道你会放弃品尝龙肉的机会吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Depends on the type, you know."
msgstr "那得看是什么品种了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Some of them breathe poison, can't imagine that meat would do your body any favors."
msgstr "有些会喷毒，那种肉吃了估计对你的身体没什么好处。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fire-breathing dragons may be a bit burnt tasting..."
msgstr "喷火的龙吃起来可能会有股焦味儿……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"OR their meat is naturally smoked with a perfect sear on the inside... imagine slicing "
"one open and being able to dig in..."
msgstr ""
"或者说，它们的肉是天然熏过的，里面还带着完美的焦香……想象一下，切开一块，直接咬下去……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Just know, there's probably something out there talking about doing the same to you and "
"me."
msgstr "你要知道，或许也有东西在琢磨怎么对付你我呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fair's fair, if you ask me. Eat or be eaten, n' all that. Literally."
msgstr "依我看，这很公平。要么吃，要么被吃，就是这样。字面上的“吃”。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of you go back and forth on what creatures may or may not taste good, chatting "
"idly back and forth as you collect the last of your traps.\n"
"\n"
"As you finish prepping the last of the Stonehoppers you caught, you see one that's "
"easily twice the others' size bounding along the cliffside. It jumps downward and "
"pushes into a cave carved into the rock without paying you any mind. [Companion Name] "
"looks to you eagerly.\n"
"\n"
"You both clamber up the rocky wall of the Broken Pass and nearly catch a taloned foot "
"to the face as another of the beasts head back inside to rest, seemingly not very "
"bothered by your presence. Crawling into a beast den would be ill-advised, especially "
"one that can kick so hard it could shatter your bones and send you bouncing around the "
"cavern's walls. Best to smoke them out."
msgstr ""
"你们俩一边闲聊哪些生物可能好吃，哪些可能不好吃，一边收拾剩下的陷阱。\n"
"\n"
"当你处理完抓住的最后几只石跳兽，你看见一只石跳兽在悬崖边跳跃，它的个头是其他石跳兽的两"
"倍。它向下跳进了岩石上的一个洞穴，根本没注意到你。[Companion Name]急切地看着你。\n"
"\n"
"你们俩努力爬上破碎关口的岩壁。此时，又有一只野兽回到洞穴里休息，似乎根本不在乎你们。它脚"
"上的爪子差点抓到你的脸。爬进野兽窝不是好办法，毕竟这些家伙一脚就能踢碎你的骨头，让你在洞"
"壁上撞来撞去。还是用烟熏吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You really better to taste good."
msgstr "你们最好味道不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How many did I get?"
msgstr "我弄到几只了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The Stonehoppers living within the cave are... much larger than the little ones you "
"managed to catch with your traps. The one that passed by as you were climbing must have "
"done so because it didn't even register you as a threat. Now that their den is filled "
"with smoke and the two of you stand with weapons at the ready, they seem to have "
"changed their minds about whether or not they want to take you seriously."
msgstr ""
"住在洞穴里的石跳兽……比你之前用陷阱抓的那些小东西要大得多。你刚才爬的时候，有一只从你旁边"
"经过。它应该根本没把你当成威胁。野兽窝里面都是烟，你们俩拿着武器站着等。看来，他们已经决"
"定要不要认真对待你们了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Any chance I can go back to catching the comparatively smaller ones, and you can handle "
"these... monsters?"
msgstr "我还有机会回去抓那些小的吗？你来对付这些……怪物？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As long as you pay me, every time we come back through the Broken Pass."
msgstr "只要你给我钱，每次我们回来经过破碎关口时，都要付。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Can hardly say that you earned free passage for life if I get to have all the fun to "
"myself."
msgstr "如果所有的乐子都给我了，那可不能算你可以终身免费通行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Fine then. Let's make it a bet, then. Whichever of us takes down the least cooks dinner "
"of of them, then."
msgstr "行吧。那我们打个赌。谁打的野兽最少，谁做晚饭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hope you brought your apron!"
msgstr "希望你带了围裙！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You're both a touch nervous, despite the friendly wager. It's hard to feel particularly "
"confident when you only come up to the Stonehoppers' thighs, but fortunately, the "
"beasts are mostly leg. As you dodge out of the way of one of their kicks, you flinch "
"when you see the cracks left in the stone where their foot connected.\n"
"\n"
"You're beginning to understand why free passage for life was put on the table. Surely "
"someone would have taken it sooner or later with the inn's usual clientele, but it's no "
"cakewalk, that's for sure."
msgstr ""
"虽然只是一场友好的打赌，你们俩心里都有点紧张。你们的身高才到石跳兽的大腿，确实很难有信"
"心。不过，好在这些野兽的大半个身子都是腿。你躲开踢来的一脚，看到石头上留下的裂痕，感觉有"
"点害怕。\n"
"\n"
"你终于明白，为什么“终身免费通行”会被当作筹码。这家客栈的常客中，迟早会有人接下这桩差事。"
"但可以肯定的是，这差事不简单。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I mean... They won't mind if we borrow them, right?"
msgstr "我是说……借用一下它们，应该没关系吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Suits them right."
msgstr "都是它们自找的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You and [Companion Name] tally up your kills and... somehow, it's a dead tie. You clean "
"your bodies and do a once-over of the den, just to make sure you got them all and "
"neither of you could squeak out a last minute victory, but you really did get them "
"all.\n"
"\n"
"You both throw up your hands and congratulate one another on a job well done and camp "
"out in the Broken Pass, cooking a meal together. Usually you just dig into your travel "
"rations, but this is about as good of a chance as you'll get on the road. With some "
"local herbs and a generous bit of seasoning... yeah, it does taste like chicken. Quite "
"a bit more gamey, and virtually zero fat, but a great meal nonetheless.\n"
"\n"
"You settle into your sleeping roll and watch the embers of the fire float up into the "
"sky."
msgstr ""
"你和[Companion Name]清点各自的战果……结果打成平手。你们清理了尸体，又把野兽窝搜了一遍，确"
"认都抓完了。你们都想在最后一秒反超，但实际上，野兽都抓完了。\n"
"\n"
"你们俩拍拍手，互相祝贺取得的战果，然后在破碎关口扎营，一起做饭。你们平时都简单吃口干粮，"
"但现在是路上改善伙食的好机会。配上当地的草药，撒上足量的调料……嘿，吃起来像鸡肉。野味比较"
"重，几乎没什么油水，但这顿饭还是不错的。\n"
"\n"
"你钻进睡袋，看着火慢慢熄灭，飘到天上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Long way from Azamire."
msgstr "离阿扎米尔好远啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't miss it. Much."
msgstr "我不想那儿。不是很想。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Always felt just a little too small, didn't it?"
msgstr "总觉得那儿太小了，不是吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah, a bit. I'll be happy when we do go back, but I'm not in any rush."
msgstr "是啊，是有点小。我们回去的时候，我会很开心。但现在也不急。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We'll finally be in the capitol, soon. I've dreamed about it ever since I was a kid."
msgstr "我们快到都城了。我从小就一直梦想着这一刻。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Me too. But next time, let's charter a boat, hm?"
msgstr "我也是。不过，下次我们租个船，好吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, without a doubt."
msgstr "噢，没问题。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"After a bit of shuteye, the rest of the trip is... uneventful in a positive way. You "
"pass by the eastern gate to the Broken Pass and tell them how you've dealt with the "
"Stonehoppers and show them proof, to which the guards are both impressed and thankful, "
"and promise to let those at the Sleeping Stone know.\n"
"\n"
"You pass by a few villages along the rest of the Heartroad, many of them clearly "
"prospering due to their proximity to the capitol. As you pass over the Bridge of Kings, "
"you see the grand gates of Melvor before you, with a long trail of people waiting to be "
"let inside.\n"
"\n"
"Through talking with the crowd and a few guards who do their best to keep the peace, it "
"sounds like the city has been under a light lockdown to new travellers because of an "
"influx of smuggled goods. Only those bearing visitor passes or proof of citizenship are "
"allowed entry. Visitor passes are sold for... rather exorbitant amounts.\n"
"\n"
"As a group of pompous aristocrates wave their passes and bottles of wine about "
"flamboyantly. They let out strings of taunts and insults as they walk past the line of "
"those looking to be let into the capitol. You and [Companion Name] look to one another "
"with wry smiles."
msgstr ""
"睡了一会后，接下来的旅程……平静顺利。你们经过破碎关口的东门，告诉守卫说你们解决了石跳兽，"
"还拿出了证明。他们既惊叹又感激，承诺会通知沉睡之石那边的人。\n"
"\n"
"沿着心路继续走，你们经过了几个村庄。因为靠近都城，许多村庄都很繁华。跨过“国王大桥”，你看"
"到了梅尔沃的大门。门口排着长队，都是等待进去的人。\n"
"\n"
"你跟那群人还有努力维持秩序的几名守卫聊了一下，听说因为流入了大量的走私货，这座城市已经封"
"锁了，限制外来者进入。只有持访客通行证或公民身份证明，才能进去。访客通行证的价格……高得离"
"谱。\n"
"\n"
"一群自大的贵族挥着通行证和酒瓶，十分张扬。他们经过排队等待进城的人群，嘴里一直在嘲讽和羞"
"辱。你和[Companion Name]互相看了看，无奈地笑了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You follow the group along for a while until one of the richly dressed men smacks a "
"wide-eyed child on the nose with their pass, then hurries along. The child's mother "
"shouts after them, and the angry line of onlookers finally snaps at the mistreatment. "
"Some of the drunken nobles cower in fear, afraid of the consequences of their own "
"actions, while others egg the crowd on further, clearly enjoying the attention. The "
"guards try to keep the peace, though they are clearly fed up with the 'social elite' as "
"well, judging by their glares.\n"
"\n"
"Taking advantage of the situation, you bump into one of the nobles in the and slip your "
"hand into their coat, withdrawing a sleek sky blue visitor's pass. You keep walking as "
"its original owner shouts after you for daring to touch them, but they're drowned out "
"by the angry mob soon enough. [Companion Name] slides in right beside you, holding one "
"of her own. The two of you open them up, realizing that there's no identifying "
"information that is required, the pass alone is proof enough that you may enter.\n"
"\n"
"Just like that, the gates of the capitol won't stop you. You don't even feel a little "
"bad."
msgstr ""
"你跟着人群走了一会儿，这时一名穿着华贵的男子用通行证打了一个孩子的鼻子，那孩子的眼睛瞪得"
"很大。然后，那名男子就走了。孩子的母亲在后面大声喊。看见孩子受欺负，围观人群的愤怒彻底爆"
"发。一些醉醺醺的贵族害怕了，担心自己的行为会造成什么后果。还有一些贵族煽动情绪，显然很享"
"受被关注的感觉。守卫努力维持秩序，但从他们愤怒的眼睛来看，显然他们烦透了这些‘社会精"
"英’。\n"
"\n"
"趁着混乱，你撞上一名贵族，把手伸进他的外套，掏出了一张天蓝色的访客通行证。这张通行证原来"
"的主人在你后面大喊，骂你摸他，但他的声音很快就被愤怒的人群淹没了。你没有回头，继续走。"
"[Companion Name]溜到你旁边，手里也拿着通行证。你们俩打开通行证，发现上面不需要任何身份信"
"息。单凭这张通行证，你们就可以进城。就这样，都城的大门没能拦住你。你甚至没觉得不好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Big City"
msgstr "大城市"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"By following crumbs of information regarding the group you now know as the Soulsmiths, "
"you've found yourself thrust into the middle of the capitol of Melvor with hardly a "
"clue on what to do or where to go next."
msgstr ""
"顺着关于那群人（现在你知道他们叫炼魂师）的一些线索，你发现到了梅尔沃的都城。接下来该做什"
"么、该去哪儿，你也不知道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Here they come!"
msgstr "他们来了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's grab some feathers and go."
msgstr "拿几根羽毛，走吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You'd heard tales of the capitol many times by those who'd travelled the continent and "
"happened to stop by Azamire for trade or rest, but their stories hardly even begin to "
"scratch just how... much was laid out before the two of you. Thousands of people, many "
"speaking languages that you couldn't even begin to place. Buildings that stretch so "
"high into the sky that you have to crane your neck to fully see. Market stalls filled "
"with an endless number of trinkets and clothes, while some on the other side of the "
"random plaza you'd entered emit smells so strange and tantalizing you involuntarily "
"start to drool.\n"
"\n"
"You try your best to take in everything, excitedly chatting with [Companion Name] as "
"you both try to point out the endless rush of... everything, until you find yourself "
"pushing out of the crowds for the first time. You're thankful for the space, until you "
"feel a strong hand clamp down on your shoulder and yank you backwards. Your hand goes "
"to the weapon at your side until you realize you... walked onto a firing range! An "
"arrow whizzes past your nose as you turn to the person who grabbed you. A tall, tanned "
"man dressed in a gaudy purple cloak and a longbow strapped to his back pulls you out of "
"danger, to [Companion Name] who breathlessly catches up to you."
msgstr ""
"从那些游历大陆的人口中，还有那些为了生意或休息经过阿扎米尔的人口中，你很多次听说关于都城"
"的故事。但他们讲的和你们俩亲眼看到的相比，简直连冰山一角都不算。成千上万的人，很多人说的"
"语言你根本不懂。建筑高耸入云，你要仰起脖子才能完全看清楚。集市摊位上摆满了数不清的小玩意"
"儿和衣物。你来到广场的另一侧，闻到的气味奇特又诱人，让你忍不住流口水。\n"
"\n"
"你努力想要感受眼前的一切，兴奋地和[Companion Name]聊天，指着周围……各种各样的景象。这时，"
"你第一次挤出了人群。你庆幸终于不挤了，突然一只强有力的手抓住你的肩，把你往后拽。你伸手去"
"摸腰间的武器，但你发现自己……进了一个射击场！当你转身去看抓你的人，一支箭从你的鼻子旁边飞"
"过去。抓你的是一名身材高大、皮肤黑黑的男子。他披着一件鲜艳的紫色斗篷，背上背着一把长弓。"
"他帮你摆脱危险，把你交给气喘吁吁赶来的[Companion Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "New to the capitol, I presume?"
msgstr "看来你刚到都城吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"There's a few dozen things I'd recommend to newcomers for their first day, but getting "
"skewered in the middle of the archery contest is not one of them. But meeting me is at "
"the top of the list. Talm. The pleasure is yours."
msgstr ""
"对于刚来的人，我有几十条建议，但不建议“在射箭比赛中被射成串儿”。不过，遇到我是第一条建"
"议。塔尔姆。遇到我是你的荣幸。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... I..."
msgstr "我……我……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There you are! I took my eyes off you for two minutes!"
msgstr "你在这儿啊！我才两分钟没盯住你！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry, I was a bit distracted by... all of this."
msgstr "抱歉，我被……这些吸引了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can't blame you. Melvor is a real bute, ain't it?"
msgstr "不能怪你。梅尔沃的确是个好地方，不是吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It is, you have a wonderful city... Thank you for making sure I wasn't impaled."
msgstr "确实是，你们这城市真棒……谢谢你，我差点就被射穿了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Of course! Can't have one of my golden geese taken out before you get the chance to "
"help me win!"
msgstr "那当然！可不能让你们——我的“金鹅”，在帮我赢得比赛之前就没了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What do you mean?"
msgstr "……你什么意思？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"My lovely wife has shown me a vision. Me on top of the podium, being crowned the winner "
"of this year's archery contest, with the two of you gleefully cheering me on! Under "
"normal circumstances, about a zero percent chance I'd win..."
msgstr ""
"我可爱的妻子给我占卜了一个幻象。我站在领奖台的最高处，获得今年射箭比赛的冠军。你们俩为我"
"欢呼喝彩！正常情况下，我赢的几率几乎是零……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"But, between you two and I, I plan on cheating as much as I possibly can, and the two "
"of you will help me with that."
msgstr "不过我跟你们俩说，我会想尽一切办法作弊，你们俩帮帮我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What makes you think we would do that?"
msgstr "……你为什么觉得我们会帮你？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, first and foremost, Era's visions are never wrong. But secondarily, ask around. "
"Some random noble's family wins this every year, and it's not because they're the most "
"dedicated to their craft, I can tell you that."
msgstr ""
"嗯，首先，艾拉的预知不会错。其次，你们去打听一下。每年赢的都是一些贵族。我敢说，他们能赢"
"不是因为他们的技术有多好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A combination of bribes and the best bows and arrows that money can buy turn mediocre "
"into world-class talent, apparently. And I'm sick of seein' it."
msgstr ""
"看来，只要贿赂，再加上用钱能买到的顶级弓箭，就能把平庸的人变成世界级人才。我真是受够了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"...And let's say we do help you, because we care about the little guy sticking it to "
"the city's nobility oh-so-much, what's in it for us?"
msgstr "……就算我们帮你，我们能得到什么呢？毕竟我们很欣赏你这种敢于挑战城中贵族的小人物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"A reading from my lovely wife, of course. One each. Assuming I win, of course. Trust "
"me, you couldn't afford it, normally."
msgstr ""
"当然是让我可爱的妻子给你们占卜。每人一次。当然，前提是我赢。相信我，正常情况下，你们可付"
"不起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate you making sure that [Player Name] didn't become an archery target, but-"
msgstr "感谢你没让[Player Name]变成靶子，不过——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...You know, a vision might just even help you with your little Soulsmith problem."
msgstr "……你知道吗，或许占卜的幻象还能帮你解决炼魂师的问题。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Talm winks at the two of you and then holds a finger to his lips, clearly giving no "
"further information than he's already provided. Based on how quickly you and [Companion "
"Name] looked to one another at the mention of Soulsmiths, he knew he had you hooked. "
"Without even asking if you'd be interested, he talks about how arrows fashioned with "
"the feathers of a Sea Griffon always seem to find their mark, and would quite fancy "
"having some of the arrows for himself. Unfortunately, he has no feathers, just the "
"location of one that has been terrorizing a few fishing boats.\n"
"\n"
"You and [Companion Name] leave the capitol as quickly as you came, and after a few "
"hours of travel, find the windy cliffside that the nest was said to be. And sure "
"enough, a large pack of the beasts swoop overhead, clearly upset by your arrival."
msgstr ""
"塔尔姆向你们眨了眨眼，然后竖起一根手指放在唇边。显然，他不能再透露更多的信息了。一提到炼"
"魂师，你和[Companion Name]迅速交换了一个眼神。他知道，你们有兴趣了。他甚至没问你们有没有"
"兴趣，就说用海狮鹫羽毛制作的箭矢总能射中目标。他自己也很想有几支这样的箭矢。可惜，他没有"
"羽毛，只知道有一只海狮鹫在恐吓几艘渔船。\n"
"\n"
"跟来的时候一样，你和[Companion Name]快速离开都城。几个小时后，你们找到了巢穴所在的悬崖"
"边。悬崖边风很大。果然，一大群野兽从你们头上飞过。显然，你们的到来让它们很生气。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He'd better win."
msgstr "他最好能赢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll get that reading one way or another."
msgstr "无论如何，我们一定要占卜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Feathers gathered, the two of you make the trek back to the capitol. The city is just "
"as overwhelming as before, but the clear goal of finding Talm again manages to help you "
"push through the enthralling nature of the new sights and smells with ease. Talm is "
"amongst the competitors, warming up. He's doing a remarkable job even without the "
"feathers, nearly splitting his own arrows far down the range, and you begin to wonder "
"why he feels the need to cheat at all."
msgstr ""
"收集到羽毛后，你们俩回到都城。城里的景象还是那么眼花缭乱。但你们有了明确的目标，那就是再"
"次找到塔尔姆。有了这个目标，你们能够轻松应对那些吸引人的新奇景象和气味。塔尔姆正在进行参"
"赛热身。即使没有羽毛，他依然表现得很棒。在远处的靶子上，他的箭几乎可以将自己之前射的箭劈"
"成两半。你不禁在想，他为什么觉得自己需要作弊呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Ah, just who I wanted to see! Hopefully the coastline is one oversized bird safer, "
"thanks to you two?"
msgstr "啊，正巧！多亏了你们俩，海岸少了一只巨鸟，现在更安全了，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Try a pack. We've got your feathers. Now, it'd be nice to know how you-"
msgstr "……是一群。这是你要的羽毛。那么，我想知道你是怎么——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, what am I to do with feathers? I can't very well throw them to the target, you "
"know."
msgstr "唉，我要这些羽毛干什么？总不能直接扔到靶子上，你说是吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I'd appreciate it if you fashioned them into some arrows. Steel tips are fine, that's "
"what everyone else is using, don't want to stick out too much."
msgstr "要是能做成箭，我感激不尽。钢的箭头就行。大家用的都是这种，我不想太太扎眼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, we said that we'd get the feathers, not make them for you."
msgstr "等等，我们说的是弄羽毛，没说还要做箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're an archer, you should know how to do that."
msgstr "你是弓箭手，应该知道怎么做吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, yes, of course I know how, but I have to make sure my aim is true regardless."
msgstr "嗯，对，我当然知道。但无论如何，我要确保能射中目标。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Isn't that what the feathers are for?"
msgstr "羽毛的作用不就是这个吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Remember, we're going up against other cheaters too. Every little advantage counts."
msgstr "别忘了，我们的对手也有作弊的。任何一点小小的优势都很重要。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You don't get your readings if I don't win."
msgstr "我要是没赢，你们就不能占卜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Talm's sing-songy taunt elicts a glare from [Companion Name], but after a brief "
"standoff, she sighs and hauls you away, grumpily beginning to cut some arrow shafts. "
"You get the impression she'd rather use that knife elsewhere, but has decided to "
"behave, for now."
msgstr ""
"听着塔尔姆戏谑地嘲讽你们，[Companion Name]生气地瞪了他一眼。但纠结了一会儿，她叹了口气，"
"把你拉到一边，暴躁地开始削箭杆。看得出来，她更想把那把刀用在别的地方，但眼下还是决定安分"
"一点。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "None of this looks too rare, thankfully."
msgstr "好在，这东西看起来不是很少见。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This better be enough."
msgstr "希望这些够用了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of you make your way back to Talm, this time with a bundle of arrows, to which "
"he recieves with a small and a small, polite show of clapping. He takes one and "
"inspects it carefully, before bending it so far that it snaps in two. He tuts to "
"himself and shoves the splintered arrow back into your hands."
msgstr ""
"你们俩回到塔尔姆那里，这次带了一捆箭。他接过箭，礼貌地轻轻拍了拍手。他取出一支箭仔细查"
"看，然后用力一掰，箭断成两段。他啧了一声，把断了的箭塞回你们手上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Now now, this simply won't do. My bow may also be a bit special. Like I said, I really "
"want to win this. The with the force I'll be sending these arrows down range, they "
"don't stand a chance."
msgstr ""
"哎呀，这样不行啊。我的弓或许也有点特别。我说过，我这次真的想赢。以我射出这些箭的力道，其"
"他人没有机会赢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you want us to do? Make the shafts out of metal, too?"
msgstr "你想让我们怎么做？难道箭杆也要做成金属的吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"No no, of course not. Thankfully, Era came through for us and provided me with a "
"little... somethin' somethin' ahead of time."
msgstr "不不，当然不是。多亏艾拉帮我们，提前给我们弄了个……东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And now, I leave the responsibility to the two of you. No need to thank me."
msgstr "接下来的重任就交给你们俩了。不用谢我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...You'd better win."
msgstr "……你最好能赢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've never been more sure of anything in my life."
msgstr "我这辈子都没这么笃定过。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Talm hands you a scrap of paper that looks more akin to a grocery list than anything "
"that'd directly help win the competition. A handful of ingredients, brought up to "
"temperature and then distilled into a potion called 'True-Shot', could be imbued into "
"the arrows to give them incredible strength and flexibility."
msgstr ""
"塔尔姆递给你一张纸条，看起来更像是一份购物清单，而不是什么能直接帮忙赢得比赛的东西。将几"
"种原料加热，再蒸馏制成一种名为‘精准射击’的药水。把药水涂在箭上，就能有惊人的威力和韧性。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You head back to find Talm, hopefully for the final time. Just as you manage to finish "
"applying the solution, Talm is called to the range to take his shots. Each of his "
"arrows finds their mark at the other side of the range, faster and more powerful than "
"any of his opponents. The competition rages on and gets more fierce as competitors are "
"eliminated. Talm's near permanent smile is slowly replaced by a look of genuine "
"concentration his six remaining competitors do their best to outdo one another. "
"Criteria for each shot begin to change as the distance and size of the targets can no "
"longer be changed. The seven of them started shooting at pea-sized targets a few rounds "
"back, so now, they begin to fire upside-down. On horseback. Blindfolded.\n"
"\n"
"Every few rounds, Talm manages to stick around as another competitor misses their mark. "
"Even knowing how much help Talm is getting, you cannot help but cheer with each shot he "
"lands. Unless he's going up against the best archers the world has even seen, you start "
"to believe they have just as much assistance as he does. Talm makes it to the final "
"round. One target, a hair-thin string gently dangling on the other side of the range. "
"Both him and the other competitor fire at the same time, but Talm's blue-feathered "
"arrow knocks the competitor's arrow out of the air, and severs the string on the other "
"side.\n"
"\n"
"The crowd erupts into cheers, and you find yourself cheering as well, as Talm is "
"brought up to the top of the podium and given a trophy about a quarter of his size. "
"After ample celebration, he finds his way back to you and [Companion Name], and after a "
"combination of gloating and thanks, tells you to find him when you're ready for your "
"rewards."
msgstr ""
"你回去找塔尔姆，希望这是最后一次了。你刚把药水涂在箭上，塔尔姆就被叫去靶场准备射箭。他射"
"出的每一箭都正中靶心，速度和威力比他的所有对手都强。参赛者陆续淘汰，比赛越来越激烈，进入"
"白热化阶段。之前塔尔姆总是一脸笑，现在慢慢变得全神贯注。剩下的六名对手用尽全力，相互比"
"拼。目标距离和大小无法再进行调整，所以每次射击的标准也开始变了。几轮之后，七名参赛者开始"
"射击豌豆大小的目标。所以现在，他们开始用倒立的姿势射击。在马背上。蒙着眼。\n"
"\n"
"每过几轮，当其他参赛者纷纷脱靶时，塔姆尔总能留下来。明知塔姆尔有外力相助，但每次他命中目"
"标，你还是忍不住欢呼。除非他的对手是世界上最厉害的弓箭手，否则你难免会认为，对手获得的外"
"力恐怕和他差不多。塔尔姆成功进入决赛。靶子是一根和头发一样细的线，线轻轻挂在靶场的另一"
"端。他和另一名参赛者同时射出，但塔尔姆那支绿色羽毛的箭在空中将对方的箭击落，割断了另一端"
"的线。\n"
"\n"
"人群开始欢呼，你也忍不住跟着一起欢呼。这时，塔尔姆被带上领奖台，获得的奖杯相当于他身体大"
"小的四分之一。盛大的庆祝活动之后，他回到你和[Companion Name]身边。他说了一些得意和感谢的"
"话，然后让你们在准备好领取奖励以后去找他。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Ivory Athenaeum"
msgstr "象牙藏书院"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"After helping Talm win Melvor's archery competition, you've done your part. Now, it's "
"time for him to honor his side of the deal and hopefully provide information regarding "
"the Soulsmiths."
msgstr ""
"在帮助塔尔姆赢得梅尔沃射箭比赛后，你完成了自己的那部分任务。现在，他该履行约定了，希望他"
"能提供有关炼魂师的信息。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This mission might be next to impossible."
msgstr "这项任务可能几乎是不可能的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now we just... take a little mould of the lock."
msgstr "现在我们只是……做一个锁的小模具。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Even in a city as bustling as Melvor, Talm is a remarkably easy figure to find. After "
"just a few minutes of asking around the range, you find yourself face to face with the "
"tall, smiling man. Without a word he gestures for you to follow him, so you do, "
"trusting he knows what you're after. You're lead deep within the alleys and byways of "
"the capitol, some better, some worse. As you round a corner you find yourself at the "
"back entrance of a brightly painted stone building, door already open for you to enter. "
"As the three of you enter, the door quietly shuts behind you without any prompting.\n"
"\n"
"You're brought before an absolutely stunning woman who greets the three of you with a "
"wordless smile, and gestures for you to sit on cushions laid out in front of her. You "
"do, and the room quickly fills with a twinkling blue fog. You panic for a moment before "
"deciding that they don't seem to mean you harm, and you inhale deeply.\n"
"\n"
"Your vision fades away, then comes back to you as you're flying far overhead a large "
"white building, whose doors seem to suck you in. You fall through the floor of the "
"building and weave through shelf and shelf of books, all the way to a large vault made "
"of a blend of metals and magic you instinctively know as you pass through its walls. "
"Within, you find a gilded tome that seems to glow with power. The moment you touch it, "
"you snap back awake next to [Companion Name]. She seems... upset, seemingly a bit "
"disturbed by whatever she saw."
msgstr ""
"在梅尔沃这座繁华的城市里，要找到塔尔姆很简单。四处打听了一会儿，你就看到了那个身材高大、"
"面带微笑的男人。他没说一句话，示意让你跟着他。你照着做，相信他清楚你的来意。他带你走进都"
"城巷道的深处，一路上的环境时好时坏。转过一个角落，你来到一栋颜色鲜艳的石头建筑的后门。门"
"已经开了，正等你们进去。等你们三人进去，身后的门自己就悄悄关上了。\n"
"\n"
"你被带到一名惊艳的女子面前。她没说话，笑着和你打招呼，然后示意你坐在她前面的垫子上。你坐"
"下来，房间里很快就飘满了闪着微光的蓝色雾气。你有点惊慌，但心想他们似乎没有恶意，于是便深"
"吸了一口气。\n"
"\n"
"你的视线慢慢模糊，然后又慢慢清楚。这时，你飞在高高的空中，下面是一栋巨大的白色建筑。那栋"
"建筑的大门仿佛要把你吸进去。你落下来，穿过那栋建筑的地板，在一排排的书架之间穿梭，最后到"
"了一个大宝库。当你穿过宝库的墙壁，直觉告诉你这个宝库是金属和魔法混合构成的。宝库内，你发"
"现了一本闪着力量光芒的镀金古书。在你触碰古书的一瞬间，你突然惊醒，身边是[Companion "
"Name]。她看起来……不太高兴，似乎被她看见的景象困住了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What... was that? Did you see the same thing, [Companion Name?]"
msgstr "那……是什么？你看到了吗，[Companion Name?]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I uh... doubt it. What'd you see?"
msgstr "呃，我……好像没看到。你看到什么了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A large white building with what was almost a maze under it, and then a vault."
msgstr "一栋巨大的白色建筑，下面好像有个迷宫，还有一个宝库。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah. You saw the Abyssal Vault, did you?"
msgstr "啊。你看到深渊宝库了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Best of luck getting inside, I've only been a few times, myself."
msgstr "那祝你好运，进去可不容易，我自己只去过几次而已。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era, you can't spoil it. That's half the fun."
msgstr "艾拉，别剧透啊。这才是有趣的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They have much ground to cover, and little time."
msgstr "他们要走的路还很长，可时间不多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Isn't that right, [Companion Name]?"
msgstr "你说对吧，[Companion Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you mean? [Companion Name] are you alright?"
msgstr "你这是什么意思？[Companion Name]，你没事吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... will be, I promise."
msgstr "我……会没事的，我保证。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's this about a vault?"
msgstr "什么宝库？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Since my dear already spoiled the surprise, it sounds like you two need to engage in a "
"little..."
msgstr "既然我亲爱的已经把惊喜剧透了，看来你们俩要来一场小小的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Heist. Of sorts. Should be a cakewalk."
msgstr "抢劫。算是吧。应该很简单。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We just got to town. I don't think jail is on my list of places I'd like to see."
msgstr "我们才刚到镇上。我可不想去监狱玩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It shouldn't have to be, if you're careful."
msgstr "只要小心点，就没事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The vault requires a key, but before you can make one, you'll have to obtain a mold of "
"the lock."
msgstr "宝库需要钥匙，但在制作钥匙之前，你得先弄到锁的模具。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"And if we were to do something so unscrupulous, which we aren't by the way, how are we "
"to know you wouldn't turn us in?"
msgstr ""
"再说了，如果我们真做了这种不光彩的事——当然我们不会做，我们怎么知道你不会转头就把我们举报"
"了呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If you're after information on the Soulsmiths, and it has lead you to the vault, "
"stopping you would be... unwise."
msgstr "既然你们在找炼魂师的线索，现在线索指向了宝库，那不去的话……可不明智。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Feel free to try and gain lawful access to the vault if you wish, I promise you it "
"would not be fruitful."
msgstr "如果你们愿意，可以用正当手段进入宝库。不过我保证，这样不会有什么收获。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And how do the two of you know about them? And that we're... interested?"
msgstr "你们俩怎么知道这些的？又怎么知道我们……有兴趣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era and I indulge in the visions she can provide quite often, really. "
msgstr "艾拉和我确实经常沉浸在她呈现的幻象中。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "One of them showed you two, and through that, what you've been up to."
msgstr "其中一个幻象有你们俩，我们就知道你们最近的动向。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And what you must face. Go now, return when you've gotten what you need."
msgstr "还有你们必须面对的挑战。去吧，等拿到需要的东西再回来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"And with that, Talm helps Era up and takes her to a room behind a nearby curtain. It "
"doesn't seem like you're invited. You check on [Companion Name] once again, about the "
"vision she had. She gently, tells you that she'll talk about it later, just that it was "
"a bit scary. \n"
"\n"
"The two of you wander around the city, a bit less awestruck than when you first "
"arrived, and soon enough, find yourselves on the doorstep of the Ivory Athenaeum. From "
"what you learn, speaking with some of the guests and staff, it'd seem that the titanic "
"structure holds the largest compilation of humanity's knowledge ever created, with a "
"near endless number of books on every subject one could think of.\n"
"\n"
"You ask about the lower floors, and learn that they are restricted to the general "
"public, needing a direct invitation from the King himself to be let inside, since the "
"books down there contain dangerous information. The process of obtaining an invitation "
"is told to you through a long, well-rehearsed deluge of information. What sticks out to "
"you is the time involved. An average of thirty years for those prestigious enough to be "
"allowed a chance. Too long."
msgstr ""
"说完，塔尔姆扶起艾拉，把她带进附近一道帘子后面的房间。好像没让你们一起去。关于她看见的幻"
"象，你再次询问[Companion Name]。她低声说等会儿再细讲，只是那幻象有点吓人。\n"
"\n"
"你们俩在城中闲逛，没有刚来时那么惊叹。没过多久，你们来到象牙藏书院的门前。你们跟这里的访"
"客和工作人员交谈，听说这座宏伟的建筑里有人类有史以来最庞大的知识汇编。这里面的书数不胜"
"数，涵盖人们所能想象的所有领域。\n"
"\n"
"你询问底层的情况，得知那里不对公众开放。要想进去，需要国王本人的直接邀请，因此那里的书中"
"有危险的信息。他们向你介绍获得邀请的流程。那一长串的介绍就像是反复排练过的，滔滔不绝。你"
"最关心的是需要的时间。即使是有机会获得邀请的名门望族，平均也要等三十年。太久了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The vision proved particularly useful, didn't it?"
msgstr "那段幻象确实很有用，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This looks about right. Back down we go."
msgstr "看来就是这里。我们下去吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You want to let out a cheer as the Abyssal Vault comes into view, but you obviously "
"know better than that. You put [Companion Name] up on your shoulders and she slowly but "
"surely presses a wedge of clay into the arcane locking mechanism. The vault is exactly "
"as it appeared in your vision, and you do your best to memorize the magic that courses "
"through it as [Companion Name] deals with the mould. You know from your vision that "
"you'll have to imbue the key with the same magic for it to actually work when you come "
"back and let yourself in.\n"
"\n"
"Now that you've properly mapped out the route to the vault, you're able to get back to "
"the entrance with little trouble. Understandably, the patrolling guards are both few "
"and number and a bit inattentive, it's not like many people would be crazy enough to "
"try this. You and [Companion Name] make it back out of the Ivory Athenaeum, and finally "
"allow yourself to breathe."
msgstr ""
"看见深渊宝库的时候，你很想欢呼一下，但你当然知道，现在不能欢呼。你把[Companion Name]扛在"
"肩上，她稳稳地将一块黏土挤进秘锁装置。宝库和你在幻象里看到的一模一样。[Companion Name]忙"
"着制作模具，你则尽力记住流转其中的魔力。你从幻象里得知，得给钥匙注入同样的魔力，等你们回"
"来时，它才能真正打开这扇门。\n"
"\n"
"现在，通往宝库的路线已经摸清，回到入口倒没费多少工夫。巡逻的守卫不仅人数少，还有些心不在"
"焉。这也难怪，毕竟没几个人会疯到来干这种事。你和[Companion Name]终于走出象牙藏书院，这才"
"敢松口气。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can't believe it!"
msgstr "真不敢相信！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I can't believe we'll have to do it again."
msgstr "……真不敢相信，我们还得再来一趟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We already made it in once, what's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "都成功进去过一次了，还能出什么大事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't even want to humor that question with a guess."
msgstr "这种问题，我连猜都不想猜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We'll be fineeee, I'm sure of it. 50 gold say we make it back down there without a "
"problem."
msgstr "肯定没事的啦，我有把握。我赌50金币，咱们肯定能顺顺利利再下去一趟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How about we bet bail on it, hm? I can't even imagine how many years we'd get."
msgstr "要不赌保释金，怎么样？我都不敢想，抓住了得判多少年。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, you don't need to imagine. Because we just did it! Let's get started on that key, "
"hm?"
msgstr "好了，不用想。咱们这不是成功了吗！来做那把钥匙吧，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You take the mould and start to jot down everything you'll need onto a piece of paper. "
"Everything for the perfect alloy to match the material of the vault, along with what "
"you remember of the magical barrier that surged through the exterior of the vault."
msgstr ""
"你拿出模具，开始在纸上记下需要的东西。要配出和宝库材质一致的合金，材料一样都不能少。还有"
"宝库外层涌动的魔法屏障，你也把记得的细节一一写了下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't think he's going to let us out of here."
msgstr "我看他是不会放我们出去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry, big fella."
msgstr "对不住了，大家伙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Sure enough, the patrols and traps seem to be exactly the same as the first time you "
"came down here. It isn't particularly a surprise, but it still lets you relax a bit as "
"you slink through the endless rows of bookshelves, back to the door of the vault. Your "
"dark clothes and molded face-mask restrict your breathing a little bit, but on the off-"
"chance that someone sees you, you'll be glad for the anonymity it provides.\n"
"\n"
"You reach up and slide your key into the lock, and with a clunk - one that's a bit "
"louder than you would have hoped for - the Abyssal Vault door cracks open, just a "
"pinch. You and [Companion Name] slip inside and find row after row of plinths, holding "
"not just books, but what look like dangerous phials of liquid, weapons, and maps. "
"[Companion Name] whispers across the vault to you."
msgstr ""
"果然，巡逻和陷阱的布置，看起来和你们上次来时一模一样。这倒不算意外，不过，当你们悄悄穿过"
"一排排望不到头的书架，再次摸到宝库门前时，你还是稍稍放松了些。深色衣服和贴脸的面具让你有"
"点喘不过气。不过，万一真被人看见，你会庆幸有这身打扮遮住身份。\n"
"\n"
"你抬起手，把钥匙插进锁孔。咔嗒一声，比你希望的响了那么一点，深渊宝库的大门裂开了一道窄"
"缝。你和[Companion Name]溜了进去。里面一排排陈列台上摆着的，不只有书，还有一瓶瓶看着就危"
"险的液体，以及武器和地图。[Companion Name]在宝库那头压低声音问你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's the title of the book again? There's dozens of them."
msgstr "那本书叫什么来着？这里有好几十本呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I didn't see... It was just bound in black leather, and gilded with gold. Bout... this "
"big."
msgstr "我没看见……只知道是黑皮封面，镶着金边。大概……这么大。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll let you know if I see it. Don't die."
msgstr "找到了我叫你。可别死了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You too."
msgstr "你也是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of you quickly search through the displayed items until you find what you're "
"looking for. The black, gilded tome from your vision. Amongst everything else in the "
"vault, you'd almost call it unassuming. \n"
"\n"
"It hums with some unknown magic, and you give it a ginger touch with your hand. When "
"you don't immediately get vaporized by some unknown power, you lift it from its resting "
"place and crack it open. The first page says... Something in a language you've never "
"seen before. You snap it closed and gently wave it for [Companion Name] to see. She "
"carefully crosses the vault and takes the book, and the two of you head back to the "
"entrance. However, the moment your hand touches the metal of the door to push to back "
"open, it snaps shut. A loud hum fills the room, along with what sounds like an alarm "
"outside of the vault.\n"
"\n"
"As you look to [Companion Name], a large golem seems to coalesse from the ground, made "
"of the same alloy as the rest of the vault. [Companion Name] readies her weapon, and "
"you follow suit."
msgstr ""
"你们飞快地翻找陈列的物品，终于找到了要找的东西。正是幻象里那本镶着金边的黑色厚书。和宝库"
"里的其他东西比起来，它甚至算得上不起眼。\n"
"\n"
"书里涌动着某种未知的魔力，发出低低的嗡鸣。你小心翼翼地伸手碰了碰。既然没有当场被什么神秘"
"力量化成灰，你便把书拿了起来，轻轻翻开。第一页写着……一种你从没见过的文字。你啪地合上书，"
"轻轻晃了晃，示意[Companion Name]看过来。她小心穿过宝库，接过书，你们一起往入口走去。然"
"而，你的手刚碰到金属门，想把它推开，门就猛地合上了。响亮的嗡鸣充斥着整个房间，宝库外似乎"
"也响起了警报。\n"
"\n"
"你转头看向[Companion Name]，只见一具巨大的魔像正从地面凝聚成形，身上的合金和宝库其他地方"
"的材质一模一样。[Companion Name]握紧武器，你也做好了战斗准备。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Agility??] X/X [Agility?]"
msgstr "[Agility??] X/X [Agility?]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As the golem falls and melts back into the floor, the door to the vault blessedly "
"clicks open once again. You and [Companion Name] gather yourselves to see... roughly "
"fifty guards running in your direction down the hall, likely with many more behind them."
msgstr ""
"魔像倒下，重新融进地面。谢天谢地，宝库的门也咔嗒一声，再次打开。你和[Companion Name]刚缓"
"过劲，就看见……走廊里大约有五十名守卫正朝你们冲来，后面恐怕还跟着更多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You owe me fifty gold!"
msgstr "你欠我50金币！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I said we'd get down here safe. I didn't say anything about getting back out!"
msgstr "我说的是能平安下来。可没说能平安出去！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now run!"
msgstr "快跑！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of you begin scaling the bookshelves outside of the vault and run as fast as "
"you can. Fearful of destroying the collection, the guards refuse to fire upon you but "
"give chase back down the halls, slowed by the same traps meant to stop intruders. The "
"tops of the shelves have just as many, if not more traps."
msgstr ""
"你们攀上宝库外的书架，撒腿狂奔。守卫怕毁了藏品，不敢朝你们开火，只能沿着走廊一路追赶。那"
"些原本用来拦住入侵者的陷阱，反倒拖慢了他们的脚步。书架顶上的陷阱也一点不少，甚至可能更"
"多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of you run like your lives depend on it, because they likely do. Every time "
"you're singed by a magical barrier or narrowly dodge a guardsman's pike, you just think "
"about how many lifetimes you'd likely spend in Melvor's jails. That is, if they didn't "
"just outright execute you. You make sure not to hurt anyone, because murder wouldn't "
"likely get you any better treatment if you were to be captured.\n"
"\n"
"By some miracle, you manage to make it to the stairwell leading up out of the lower "
"floors. Stunned guardsmen scramble to bring their weapons at the ready - clearly not "
"anticipating any intruders actually making it back to the entrance - and the two of you "
"manage to burst back out into the main floor of the athenaeum.\n"
"\n"
"You rush outside and into the throngs of people being evacuated outside. Guards point "
"and shout at the two of you as you melt into the crowds but fail to give chase as you "
"quickly slip deeper and deeper into the mass of concerned citizens. The two of you find "
"yourselves at the edge of a canal and jump in, swimming under the water all the way to "
"an exposed sewer grate. You let yourselves inside and strip off your disguises and toss "
"them into the water, both silent as the adrenaline slowly works it way through your "
"bodies. You quietly laugh and lean against the wall of the sewer with a sick squelch "
"you don't even notice. You did it. You got out, somehow."
msgstr ""
"你们拼了命地跑，毕竟这多半真是在逃命。每次被魔法屏障燎一下，或是险险躲过守卫的长枪，你都"
"会想到，要是落网，自己大概得在梅尔沃的牢里蹲上几辈子。前提是，他们没有直接把你处死。你尽"
"量不伤到任何人。真被抓住了，再背上一条人命，只会更惨。\n"
"\n"
"简直是奇迹，你们竟然跑到了通往上层的楼梯间。守卫显然没料到入侵者还能活着跑回入口，愣了一"
"下，才手忙脚乱地举起武器。趁着这工夫，你们冲回了藏书院的主层。\n"
"\n"
"你们冲到外面，混进正在疏散的人群。守卫指着你们大喊，可你们转眼就钻进了人群深处。四周都是"
"惶惶不安的市民，他们根本追不上来。你们来到一条运河边，纵身跳下，潜在水里，一直游到一处露"
"在外面的下水道栅口。钻进下水道后，你们脱下伪装，扔进水里。两个人都没说话，方才逃命时的那"
"股亢奋劲还没过去。你低低地笑了起来，往下水道墙上一靠。黏糊糊的一声响，你却浑然不觉。你们"
"做到了。不管怎么说，总算逃出来了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unfortunate Teller"
msgstr "倒霉的占卜师"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"After the miraculous heist of the Abyssal Vault, it's time to return to Era and Talm. "
"Maybe they'll be able to tell you something about the book you managed to steal, "
"considering you haven't the slightest clue on what it says."
msgstr ""
"你们奇迹般地从深渊宝库偷出了东西，现在该回去找艾拉和塔尔姆了。偷来的书上写了什么，你一个"
"字也看不懂。也许他们能告诉你些什么。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I doubt Talm will let us take his equipment after this. The recipe won't do us any good "
"afterwards."
msgstr "这事过后，塔尔姆恐怕不会让我们把他的器材拿走。到时候，有配方也派不上用场。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As useful as it might otherwise be..."
msgstr "虽然这东西本来还挺有用的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] flicks the gilded tome open and closed, looking at it from every angle "
"she can, and trying a few different pages. Like you, she hasn't the foggiest clue about "
"what the book says, and the place that would likely know, is still searching high and "
"low for it. You and [Companion Name] have left your little sewer hideaway and sure "
"enough, the disguises you donned before the heist worked. No one comes to put you in "
"shackles and haul you off to some dark dungeon. As far as anyone else is concerned, "
"you're just one of the many thousands of tourists to the capitol.\n"
"\n"
"You head back to Era and Talm's home and find it... in flames. Talm worriedly tries to "
"douse the flames with many other passerby, until a capitol mage buries the building "
"under a deluge of water. You rush to Talm. Your presence gives him pause, and he "
"gestures for you two to follow him."
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]把那本镶金边的厚书翻来覆去地看，打开又合上，还换着翻了几页。和你一样，她"
"也完全看不懂。至于那个可能看得懂的地方，现在还在满城找这本书。你和[Companion Name]离开了"
"下水道里的临时藏身处。果然，行动前那身伪装没白穿。没人过来给你们戴上镣铐，拖进什么暗无天"
"日的地牢。在旁人眼里，你们不过是都城成千上万游客中的两个。\n"
"\n"
"你们回到艾拉和塔尔姆家，却发现那里……着火了。塔尔姆正和一群路人焦急地扑火，直到一名都城的"
"法师召来倾盆大水，将整栋房子浇了个透。你连忙跑向塔尔姆。看见你，他愣了一下，随后示意你们"
"跟上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Come on. We need to see what's left!"
msgstr "快来。得看看还剩下什么！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm, what happened? Is Era with you?"
msgstr "塔尔姆，出什么事了？艾拉和你在一起吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No! She's... she's been taken."
msgstr "没有！她……她被抓走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "She knew she would be, of course... We just didn't know when."
msgstr "当然，她早就知道会有这么一天……我们只是不知道具体是什么时候。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The visions aren't always... precise. Come with me, please."
msgstr "幻象不总是那么……准确。跟我来，求你们了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The urgency and pain in his voice spur you and [Companion Name] to follow. The three of "
"you push into the smoking building and find the back room drenched, but relatively "
"untouched by the flames. The room is a disaster and there's signs of a scuffle that are "
"clear even despite the water and fire. Talm sighs, but seems more calm than he was "
"before the two of you arrived.\n"
"\n"
"He opens a chest tucked in a corner and pulls out what seems to be alchemy equipment. "
"He laments how Era will feel about him giving away trade secrets, but shows you how to "
"make the same vision-inducing smoke you inhaled before your heist, saying that it "
"should be able to help the three of you find Era. You think about bringing up the book, "
"but figure it can wait for now."
msgstr ""
"他的声音里满是焦急和痛苦，你和[Companion Name]赶紧跟上。你们三个挤进还在冒烟的房子。后面"
"的房间被水浇透了，倒没怎么被火烧到。屋里一片狼藉。即使又烧又淹，打斗过的痕迹还是清清楚"
"楚。塔尔姆叹了口气，不过，比起你们刚来时，他似乎冷静了些。\n"
"\n"
"他打开角落里的一个箱子，取出一些像是炼金器材的东西。他念叨着，要是艾拉知道他把秘方传了出"
"去，不知会怎么想。不过，他还是教了你调制那种能让人看见幻象的烟的方法，也就是你们潜入宝库"
"前吸入的那种。他说，这应该能帮你们找到艾拉。你本想提一提那本书，又觉得还是先等等吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Defeat] X/X [Soulsmith Novice] - [Combat Tab Link]"
msgstr "[Defeat] X/X [Soulsmith Novice] - [Combat Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Talm crowds around as you burn the large pouches of the specialized herbal blend. It "
"doesn't seem as strong as the last time you had it, and you're unsure of if you did "
"something wrong or if it's just part of a building tolerance.\n"
"\n"
"Nevertheless, you find yourself feeling much of the same sensation as before, but this "
"time, you float over a small, ramshackle hut deep within what you presume are Melvor's "
"slums. The only distinguishing characteristic is a single crescent-shaped grey marking "
"by its door. As you come back to, Talm blinks his eyes, seemingly coming back to "
"reality as well. [Companion Name] holds her hands over her face, waving the smoke away "
"and asking if you two saw what you needed to."
msgstr ""
"你点燃几大包特制的草药混合料，塔尔姆也凑了过来。这次的烟似乎没有上次那么浓烈。你不确定是"
"自己哪一步做错了，还是身体已经开始适应它了。\n"
"\n"
"不过，那种熟悉的感觉还是来了。只不过这次，你飘在一间破旧小屋上方。小屋藏得很深，你猜那里"
"应该是梅尔沃的贫民窟。唯一能认出来的，就是门边那道灰色的月牙形标记。你回过神时，塔尔姆眨"
"了眨眼，似乎也刚从幻象中清醒。[Companion Name]用手挡着脸，挥开烟雾，问你们有没有看到要找"
"的东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You didn't use the smoke, [Companion Name]?"
msgstr "你没吸入那些烟雾吗，[Companion Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I will if I need to... but..."
msgstr "有必要的话，我会的……不过……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd really rather not."
msgstr "我实在不太想。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's understandable, I'm sorry, I didn't think about..."
msgstr "能理解。对不起，我没想到……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's okay, really."
msgstr "没关系，真的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I saw a building out in the slums. There were... probably hundreds just like it. I'm "
"sorry, but that's all I got."
msgstr "我看见贫民窟里有间房子。那样的房子……大概有几百间。抱歉，我只看到了这些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It's okay. The Sightsmoke shows you... whatever you need to see. Era would know how to "
"explain it better."
msgstr "没事。视觉之烟会让你看见……你需要看见的东西。艾拉比我会解释。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But don't worry, I saw the path to the area. Just point out if you can, okay?"
msgstr "不过别担心，我看到了去那一带的路。到时候认出来了，就指给我看，好吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The three of you set off, leaving the burned building behind. Talm leads you through "
"the city with such ease and purpose you get the feeling he's been here a long, long, "
"time. As you travel, the people you see become less friendly, and more dirty. "
"Desperate. The slums were doubtlessly going to be here, like any other large city, but "
"to see them up close was a staunch difference to when you first arrived in the capitol "
"a few weeks ago.\n"
"\n"
"Rougher looking folks give you a large berth when they lock eyes with Talm. The "
"generally friendly man now walks with murderous intent, his bow now set aside for a "
"longsword and shield that he carries openly. He looks back to you frequently, making "
"sure you're looking out for the shack as diligently as he'd hope for. And sure enough, "
"you see it. The crescent shaped by the door - just like in your vision - is so loud to "
"your eyes, you almost don't understand how [Companion Name] and Talm don't see it.\n"
"\n"
"You point it out, and without a word, Talm approaches the door and sends it off its "
"hinges with a startlingly powerful kick. You eye [Companion Name], who charges in right "
"behind him. Swords clash almost immediately."
msgstr ""
"你们三个动身，把烧毁的房子留在身后。塔尔姆带着你们穿过城市，熟门熟路，连半点犹豫都没有。"
"你感觉，他在这里一定住了很久。越往前走，遇到的人就越不友善，身上也越脏。眼里满是绝望。和"
"其他大城市一样，这里当然也会有贫民窟。可真走进来，亲眼看到这一切，和几周前刚到都城时的感"
"觉简直天差地别。\n"
"\n"
"那些看着不好惹的人，一对上塔尔姆的眼睛，便远远让开。这个平日里和气的人，此刻浑身都是杀"
"气。他已经收起弓，明晃晃地拿着长剑和盾牌往前走。他频频回头看你，确认你还在认真寻找那间小"
"屋。果然，你看见了。门旁的月牙和幻象里一模一样。它在你眼里醒目得不得了，你几乎不明白，"
"[Companion Name]和塔尔姆怎么会看不见。\n"
"\n"
"你指了指。塔尔姆一声不吭地走上前，一脚踹开了门，力道大得惊人，连门轴都被踹脱了。你看向"
"[Companion Name]，她已经紧跟着他冲了进去。刀剑碰撞声几乎立刻响起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Just like you remember, all that time ago. Hooded figures with beasts you've never seen "
"or heard of, clash with you and your companions. However, unlike back at Azamire, you "
"don't fall. You drive them back into the building, where more of their beasts "
"materialize from nothing, following a few quickly spoken words and a flash of light. "
"They bare down on you, but you push them back, again and again, until the last of the "
"hooded figures falls.\n"
"\n"
"You worry about the commotion until you realize that... the guards likely don't make it "
"out this far.\n"
"\n"
"You search the building and find many of Era's things. Books and scrolls in a similar "
"script to the gilded tome you took from the Abyssal Vault, and many others in different "
"writing that seems to flow and move like water on the page. But the woman herself "
"doesn't seem to be here. Talm slams his fist into a nearby table in anger, splintering "
"the wood.\n"
"\n"
"You look to the man, who hardly seems to notice the few small cuts he took to his arms "
"and side. He doesn't look back to you as he reaches a hand out to one of the dead "
"figures. Their body begins to contort, cracking and lurching with sickening jolts, as "
"the body seems to right itself once again. The man rises, standing on his feet once "
"again despite several wounds that should have left him as nothing but a corpse.\n"
"\n"
"[Companion Name] says it before you can. Soulsmith. Talm turns to you both, finally "
"snapping out of his pure drive to find his wife. He sputters out an apology, and "
"promises to explain everything, he just needs a little time. He begs you to come back "
"in just a little bit, if you can stomach it. [Companion Name] backs away slowly before "
"pushing into you, bringing you both outside, leaving the man alone. "
msgstr ""
"和你记忆里，那场许久之前的灾难一样。戴着兜帽的人带着你从未见过、甚至从未听说过的野兽，和"
"你们厮杀起来。不过，这次和在阿扎米尔时不同。你没有倒下。你把他们逼回屋内。几句急促的咒语"
"过后，光芒闪过，更多野兽凭空出现。它们扑向你，可你一次又一次将它们击退，直到最后一个戴兜"
"帽的人倒下。\n"
"\n"
"你还在担心闹出这么大动静会不会惹来麻烦，随即意识到……守卫多半根本不会来这么偏的地方。\n"
"\n"
"你搜查屋子，找到了不少艾拉的东西。有些书和卷轴上的文字，和你从深渊宝库拿来的镶金边厚书很"
"相似。另一些则用不同的文字写成，字迹仿佛流水，在纸面上缓缓游动。可艾拉本人似乎不在这里。"
"塔尔姆愤怒地一拳砸向旁边的桌子，砸裂了木板。\n"
"\n"
"你看向他。他胳膊和腰侧挨了几下，留下几道小伤口，可他似乎根本没在意。他没有回头，只是向其"
"中一具尸体伸出手。那具尸体开始扭曲，骨头咔咔作响，伴着令人作呕的抽搐，一点点重新挺了起"
"来。那人站起身，再次用双脚立在地上。可他身上有好几处伤口，随便哪一处都足以让他死的透透"
"的。\n"
"\n"
"[Companion Name]抢在你前面开了口。炼魂师。塔尔姆转向你们，这才从一心寻找妻子的执念里回过"
"神来。他结结巴巴地道歉，保证会把一切解释清楚，只求你们给他一点时间。他恳求你们，过一小会"
"儿再回来，只要你们还受得了。[Companion Name]慢慢退后，随后推着你一起出了门，把他独自留在"
"屋里。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Starlit Sky"
msgstr "星光满天"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Talm has revealed himself to have some form of control over the dead, just like the "
"Soulsmiths who burned your home. While he may hold no love for them after the "
"kidnapping of Era, he has a lot to explain. Quickly."
msgstr ""
"塔尔姆显露出了某种操纵死人的能力，和烧毁你们家园的炼魂师一样。艾拉被掳走后，他或许确实恨"
"透了他们。但他还有一大堆事情需要解释。越快越好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] and you are still reeling from Talm's reveal. What is he? What'd he do "
"to that Soulsmith? If he has the same powers as them, why is he against them? The two "
"of you bounce questions off one another in an endless, confusing jumble of words until "
"you realize you have none of the answers, and can hardly even begin to guess.\n"
"\n"
"There's only one way to learn. You both enter the shoddy hut on the edge of Melvor's "
"slums, weapons in hand, and find Talm right where you left him. His hands are covered "
"in blood as he seems to be patching the least damaged clothes of the hooded figures "
"together, piling them on top of the... walking corpse until it resembles a living "
"person. Talm seems almost surprised to see you again, manages a few attempts of "
"pleading his allegiance, but then sucks in a deep breath and just... tells you to ask "
"away."
msgstr ""
"你和[Companion Name]还没从塔尔姆刚才露的那一手里缓过来。他到底是什么人？他对那个炼魂师做"
"了什么？如果他和他们有一样的力量，又为什么要与他们为敌？你们俩你一言我一语，越说越乱，问"
"题却一个接一个。直到最后才发现，谁也答不上来，连猜都无从猜起。\n"
"\n"
"想弄清楚，只有一个办法。你们拿着武器，重新走进梅尔沃贫民窟边缘那间破屋。塔尔姆还在原来的"
"地方。他双手沾满鲜血，似乎正把那些兜帽人身上破损较少的衣服拼凑起来，一层层套在那具……行尸"
"身上，直到它看起来像个活人。塔尔姆看见你们回来，似乎还有些意外。他试着解释了几句，想让你"
"们相信他是自己人，随后深吸一口气，只说……想问什么，就问吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why'd you turn on the Soulsmiths?"
msgstr "你为什么背叛炼魂师？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I... I didn't turn on them, I've never been on. I'm a Summoner. A very old one, at that."
msgstr "我……我没背叛他们。我从来就不是他们的人。我是个召唤师。而且，已经活了很久。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My clan has... had, similar powers to this upstart band of wannabes."
msgstr "我的氏族有……曾经有过和这帮刚冒头的半吊子相似的力量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The things we could do back in the day... The Soulsmiths don't even come close. Yet."
msgstr "想当年，我们能做到的那些事……炼魂师还差得远。至少现在是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you evil?"
msgstr "你是坏人吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I've been called devilish. And I am currently enthralling the corpse of my enemy to "
"take me to my kidnapped wife."
msgstr ""
"倒是有人说过我不是个好东西。而且，我眼下确实正在操纵敌人的尸体，让他带我去找被绑走的妻"
"子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But, for the intention of your question, no. I'm not."
msgstr "不过，我知道你真正想问什么。不是，我不是坏人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"If anything, I'm rather aligned against the Soulsmiths, and most who seek to use "
"Summoning, for that matter."
msgstr "真要说起来，我反对炼魂师。其实，大多数想动用召唤术的人，我都反对。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You said you're old. How old?"
msgstr "你说自己活了很久。到底多久？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I was around before... this capitol. And the one before it. Era too."
msgstr "这座都城还没建起来的时候……我就在了。上一座也是。艾拉也一样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How?"
msgstr "怎么做到的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What I, and the clan you know as the Soulsmiths use, is a form of magic called "
"Summoning. You've likely heard bits and pieces of it since you started your journey."
msgstr ""
"我，还有你们所说的炼魂师一族，使用的都是一种叫作召唤术的魔法。你们踏上旅途以来，应该零零"
"碎碎听说过一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Summoning is broken into many different disciplines. My clan is gone, but our "
"discipline, clearly, is not."
msgstr "召唤术分成很多不同的流派。我的氏族已经不在了，可显然，我们这一派的法术还在流传。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What they use is an offshoot of what I use. My people were called Lifebinders. People "
"after us will call it something else."
msgstr ""
"他们用的，是我这一派的分支。我的族人被称为生命缚誓者。以后的人，可能又会换个叫法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I can more-or-less reverse the effects of aging, and I've done so for myself and Era "
"for many... many years."
msgstr "我基本上能逆转衰老。这么多……这么多年来，我一直在给自己和艾拉用这种法术。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's the book we got from the Abyssal Vault?"
msgstr "我们从深渊宝库拿来的，到底是什么书？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well it's..."
msgstr "这个嘛……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Go on then."
msgstr "说啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Promise not to be mad?"
msgstr "先保证不生气？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...sure?"
msgstr "……行？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You raided one of the most secure locations in the capitol for... what's basically a "
"children's history book."
msgstr "你们闯进都城戒备最森严的地方之一，拿回来的……基本上就是一本给小孩子看的历史书。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Next question. Can you use that summoning magic on yourself? Because you might need to."
msgstr "下一个问题。你那召唤术能用在自己身上吗？因为你可能马上就用得着了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You clearly knew parts of what our visions were going to be. You didn't think to tell "
"us THAT?"
msgstr "你明明提前知道，我们会在幻象里看到些什么。就没想着把这事也告诉我们？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's an IMPORTANT children's history book!"
msgstr "这是一本很重要的儿童历史书！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It details one of the most defining events in our world's history... I... literally "
"cannot tell you what, though. The few of us from... Those times, are magically bound "
"against it."
msgstr ""
"它详细记载了一件对我们这个世界影响极其深远的大事……不过，我……真的没法告诉你们是哪一件。我"
"们这几个从……那个年代活下来的人，都受了魔法束缚，不能说。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Era can help you with reading it more than I can, but suffice to say, if you want to "
"learn about the Soulsmiths and what they want to do, this book is as good as you're "
"going to get for now."
msgstr ""
"要读懂这本书，艾拉比我更能帮上忙。不过，你们只要知道，如果想了解炼魂师，还有他们到底想干"
"什么，眼下没有比这本书更好的线索了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Why us? For... all of this."
msgstr "……为什么是我们？为什么……这些事都落到我们头上？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Era's visions may have holes, and may be hard to interpret at times, but they're never "
"wrong."
msgstr "艾拉看到的幻象或许不完整，有时候也很难解读，但从来不会错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"From what I've seen... I needed to help you. The whole thing with the archery contest, "
"meeting you two... It wasn't an accident."
msgstr "从我看到的情况来说……我得帮你们。射箭比赛的事，还有认识你们两个……都不是巧合。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, I didn't expect you to try and get yourself shot, but beyond that, all planned "
"out. For what, I cannot say."
msgstr "当然，我没料到你会差点让人射上一箭。除此之外，都安排好了。至于为什么，我不能说。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right. Magic binding."
msgstr "好吧。魔法束缚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Now. This thrall is about as pretty as I can make him. Shall we see if he can take us "
"to Era?"
msgstr "好了。这具尸仆，我也只能收拾成这样了。看看他能不能带我们找到艾拉吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You caught [Companion Name]'s flinch when Talm said that Era's visions are never wrong. "
"But why? What'd she see? You've tried asking, gently, over the last couple of weeks, "
"but you've hardly gotten anything other than it being 'bad'.\n"
"\n"
"Talm utters a command in a language you cannot understand to the thrall, and it "
"shutters for a moment, before walking off at a leisurely pace. The three of you follow "
"close behind until you get to the main gates of the capitol. You flinch as you approach "
"the guards and Talm pulls the thrall between you and him. He takes on a drunken sway "
"and starts slurring gibberish as the guard looks your party over. The woman pinches her "
"nose and remarks that you 'smell like death' and waves you off.\n"
"\n"
"You do your best to wipe off the thrall's blood that leaked through his pilfered robes "
"once you're out of eyeshot, cursing quietly to yourself. The thrall leads you far out "
"of town and out into the countryside. Once you hit the treeline of a nearby forest, "
"Talm curses and releases his command of the thrall, who slumps to the ground. He says "
"he knows where they went.\n"
"\n"
"You're lead to a large stone tower that blends well into the rocky landscape. It once "
"had a large wooden door that now lays splintered in a dozen large chunks on the ground. "
"Talm exclaims that they attacked his 'real' home, and that the security system was set "
"off."
msgstr ""
"塔尔姆说艾拉的幻象从不会错时，你注意到[Companion Name]瑟缩了一下。为什么？她到底看到了什"
"么？过去几周，你也试着小心地问过几次，可除了“很糟糕”，几乎什么也没问出来。\n"
"\n"
"塔尔姆用你听不懂的语言，对尸仆下了道命令。它抖了一下，随后不紧不慢地走了出去。你们三个紧"
"跟其后，一直来到都城的大门前。快走到守卫面前时，你不由得缩了一下。塔尔姆把尸仆拉到你和他"
"中间。他装出一副醉醺醺的样子，摇摇晃晃，嘴里含糊地胡言乱语，任由守卫打量你们。女守卫捏着"
"鼻子，嫌你们“一股死人味”，挥手赶你们走了。\n"
"\n"
"离开守卫的视线后，你一边低声咒骂，一边尽力擦掉沾到身上的血。那些血从尸仆偷来的袍子里渗了"
"出来。尸仆带着你们远离城镇，走进乡野。走到附近一片森林的边缘时，塔尔姆骂了一声，解除了对"
"尸仆的控制。它顿时瘫倒在地。他说，他知道他们去哪儿了。\n"
"\n"
"他带着你们来到一座巨大的石塔前。塔身藏在岩石遍布的地形中，几乎融为一体。这里原本有扇巨大"
"的木门，如今却碎成十几大块，散落在地。塔尔姆惊呼，他们袭击了他“真正的家”，还触发了防御机"
"关。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Having dodged your way through an impressive array of traps, you slowly made it up to "
"the tower's uppermost floor. Era lays in a pool of blood at the foot of a large arcane "
"telescope, made of a metal you can't even begin to place."
msgstr ""
"一路躲过一连串令人咋舌的陷阱后，你们慢慢登上了石塔的顶层。艾拉倒在一架巨大的魔法望远镜"
"下，身下满是鲜血。那架望远镜是金属制的，可用的是什么金属，你完全认不出来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...None of you will live to regret this."
msgstr "……我会让你们悔不当初。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Seeing Era on the ground, Talm wordlessly launches himself against the group of "
"Soulsmiths occupying the floor, not seeming to pay any mind to whether or not you and "
"[Companion Name] join him. Of course, you follow right behind. Soulsmiths deserve no "
"quarter."
msgstr ""
"看见倒在地上的艾拉，塔尔姆一言不发，直扑占据这一层的炼魂师，似乎根本没在意你和"
"[Companion Name]会不会跟上。当然，你们紧随其后。对炼魂师，没必要留情。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What does Era wish for us to see?"
msgstr "艾拉想让我们看什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh... oh my..."
msgstr "天啊……这……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You lower your weapon as your last opponent falls, with [Companion Name] finishing up "
"right after you. Talm pushes a Soulsmith against the wall of the ringed tower and the "
"man brings his hands up in fear. He chokes out a plea for his life before Talm rams his "
"blade into the man's chest and into the stone behind him, pinning him to the wall.\n"
"\n"
"The three of you breathe silently, taking in the sight around you before... a slight "
"cough sounds from over by the telescope. Talm leaves his weapon in the wall and runs "
"over to his wife's body, immediately reaching out to perform... some form of magic on "
"her, like he did with the man back in the shack. You and [Companion Name] turn away "
"from them, leaving the couple to their privacy, or as much as they can have, "
"considering the circumstances."
msgstr ""
"最后一个对手倒下，你放下了武器。[Companion Name]也紧接着解决了她那边的敌人。塔尔姆把一个"
"炼魂师逼到圆塔的墙边，那人惊恐地举起双手。他刚哽咽着开口求饶，塔尔姆的剑便刺穿了他的胸"
"膛，又刺进背后的石墙，将他钉在墙上。\n"
"\n"
"你们三个一时无言，喘着气，望着眼前的一切。忽然……望远镜那边传来一声轻咳。塔尔姆连剑也顾不"
"上拔，径直跑向妻子，立刻伸出手，对她施展……某种魔法，就像刚才在小屋里对那具尸体做的一样。"
"你和[Companion Name]转过身，尽量给这对夫妻留点独处的空间。至少，这种情况下能留多少算多"
"少。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So... me..."
msgstr "真……乱……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What was that, my love?"
msgstr "你说什么，亲爱的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Messy... You have all... Gotten the place so bloody..."
msgstr "好乱……你们几个……把这里弄得到处都是血……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... Yes. Sorry."
msgstr "我……是。对不起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hur... hurry up."
msgstr "快……快点。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry dear."
msgstr "抱歉，亲爱的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] and you look at each other, grimacing a bit as the following silence "
"is punctuated by the sounds of tearing flesh and sickening gurgles. You feel a bit "
"faint listening to Talm work on his... not dead wife. If one can reverse the effects of "
"aging then... perhaps mending wounds falls under that domain as well. You see "
"[Companion Name] shoot a glance in their direction then quickly avert her eyes, "
"clutching her mouth after a quiet heave. You think better of it.\n"
"\n"
"You nearly leap out of your skin when you feel a couple of light taps on your shoulder "
"and come face to face with the incredibly pale visage of Era. Her wounds stitched "
"together, the only remnant of them being the tears in dress from which any number of "
"weapons pieced her. \n"
"\n"
"She welcomes you to her home and starts to apologize for the mess, before then "
"frowning, realizing your part in its current state. The fact that she was on death's "
"door just moments ago seemingly not bothering her in the slightest. If they're truly as "
"old as Talm claims, you wonder how many times someone could have crossed a similar "
"scene.\n"
"\n"
"Era gestures for [Companion Name] and has Talm bring a chair over, to which she "
"practically slumps in. She runs her hands over the book with fondness, then gives a few "
"directions for adjustmenting telescope. She invites the both of you to use it."
msgstr ""
"你和[Companion Name]面面相觑，不由得皱起脸。随后的寂静里，不时传来血肉撕裂声，还有令人反"
"胃的咕噜声。听着塔尔姆给他那位……还活着的妻子疗伤，你有点头晕。既然连衰老都能逆转，那……治"
"好伤口，或许也在这种法术的能力范围内。你看见[Companion Name]往那边瞥了一眼，随即赶紧移开"
"目光，捂着嘴，低低干呕了一声。你决定还是别看了。\n"
"\n"
"肩膀忽然被轻轻拍了两下，你差点吓得跳起来。一回头，正对上艾拉苍白得吓人的脸。她的伤口已经"
"愈合，只剩裙子上被各种武器刺破的口子，还能看出她刚才伤得有多重。\n"
"\n"
"她欢迎你们来家里做客，刚要为屋里的凌乱道歉，又皱起眉头，想起来你们也出了一份力。至于几分"
"钟前还在鬼门关前转悠这件事，她似乎一点也没放在心上。如果他们真像塔尔姆说的那么长寿，你不"
"禁好奇，这样的场面，他们究竟经历过多少次。\n"
"\n"
"艾拉朝[Companion Name]示意，又让塔尔姆搬来一张椅子，整个人几乎瘫了进去。她爱惜地抚过书"
"页，又告诉你们该怎么调整望远镜。随后，她请你们两个都来看看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars stretch out before you, incalculable in number. As you peer up at them "
"through Era's telescope, they twist and turn in so many beautiful arrays and patterns "
"you almost want to weep. As you try to commit them to memory, they dance ever so "
"carefully out of reach again and again. You take breaks when the floor beneath you "
"sways like the gentle rocking of a ship at sea. [Companion Name] takes your place in "
"these bits of downtime. You chat here and there with Era and Talm, who both look at you "
"with a degree of fondness that comes off as... almost warm, though the feeling almost "
"feels misplaced.\n"
"\n"
"The sight is punctuated by that of Talm's new thralls, the broken bodies of the "
"Soulsmiths being twisted to work on... repairs and cleanup. The sight is as macabre as "
"it is absurd. A pair of thralls mop up after one another in a circle, each trying to "
"clean the trailing blood from their comrade. You shudder at the sight. When one of the "
"thralls tries to remove Talm's sword from the wall and ends up tearing its arm out of "
"its socket. \n"
"\n"
"You nearly faint. Talm curses softly, and Era simply chuckles. You make note to never "
"get on either of their bad sides. Ever. You know the Soulsmiths are truly wretched and "
"you'd never spill a tear over them, but the level of... flippance that Era and Talm "
"have at seeing their undead bodies lerch about feels unnerving, at least for now.\n"
"\n"
"You rest and recuperate in their home, taking turns with [Companion Name], peering "
"through the telescope and trying to glean insight from the stars. Once the thralls were "
"disposed of and the traps turned off, the tower really was nice. Though, some of the "
"things you saw may sit with you for a long while."
msgstr ""
"星辰在你眼前铺展开来，多得数也数不清。透过艾拉的望远镜仰望星空，群星流转，交织出无数美丽"
"的图案，几乎让你想落泪。可每当你想把它们记住，它们便轻巧地舞开，一次又一次，怎么也抓不"
"住。脚下的地板开始摇晃，仿佛置身海上轻轻摇荡的船只。这时你便歇一会儿，换[Companion Name]"
"来看。你们时不时和艾拉、塔尔姆聊上几句。两人看着你们的眼神带着几分喜爱，几乎称得上……温"
"暖，只是这份温暖总让你觉得有点不合时宜。\n"
"\n"
"毕竟，旁边还有塔尔姆新收的尸仆。那些炼魂师残破的身体被驱使着扭动起来，忙着……修缮和打扫。"
"这场面既瘆人，又荒唐。两具尸仆绕着圈，一个跟着另一个拖地，都在擦对方一路淌下来的血。看得"
"你直打寒战。其中一具尸仆想把塔尔姆的剑从墙上拔出来，结果把自己的胳膊从肩头扯了下来。\n"
"\n"
"你差点晕过去。塔尔姆低低骂了一声，艾拉只是轻笑。你默默提醒自己，以后绝对别惹这两个人。绝"
"对。你知道炼魂师坏透了，也绝不会为他们掉一滴眼泪。可看着他们死后的身体踉踉跄跄地走来走"
"去，艾拉和塔尔姆却如此……不当回事，还是让你心里发毛。至少现在是这样。\n"
"\n"
"你们留在他们家休息调养。你和[Companion Name]轮流使用望远镜，想从星辰中看出些门道。等尸仆"
"被处理掉，陷阱也都关了，这座塔其实还挺不错。不过，有些画面，你恐怕很久都忘不掉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Cold Plunge"
msgstr "寒地探秘"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars have finally shown you what you needed to see. A lone cold point, deep within "
"the mountain range west of the capitol. That is your next target."
msgstr ""
"群星终于为你指明了方向。都城西边的群山深处，有一处孤零零的寒冷所在。那就是你的下一个目的"
"地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Melting alone won't do it. We'll need to hack away at the ice, too."
msgstr "光把冰融化还不行。还得动手凿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think I can just about crack the door open."
msgstr "我看应该能把门撬开一道缝了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Your head feels fuzzy, at each breath - if you even are still breathing anymore - feels "
"shaky and labored. You've grown far more accustomed to Era's telescope, but it still "
"makes you feel as if something within your very being is shifting after long enough. "
"You can practice astrology without it, but as you've learned through numerous "
"conversations, Era's telescope is special. While Talm's summoning domain is Soul, Era's "
"is knowledge and divination. You can't even begin to imagine what kind of creatures she "
"can bring forth. The smoke and telescope are just two tools that allow her to "
"practice.\n"
"\n"
"And now you have done so as well. Similarly to how you felt with the Sightsmoke, you "
"feel as if you raise from the tower and pass through its walls. You grasp for the "
"shingled roof, but your hands pass through it without so much as grazing it. You careen "
"up into the sky, far beyond the tower and up amongst the clouds. Your body rights "
"itself, and you feel yourself slingshot towards the Broken Pass, then turn north, to an "
"inlet in the mountains covered with frost and snow. As you shoot towards a stone door "
"carved into the cliffside, you close your eyes... and end up back on the floor of the "
"tower.\n"
"\n"
"You are covered in ice, and your teeth chatter violently, but you feel so... so warm."
msgstr ""
"你脑子里昏昏沉沉，每次呼吸都又费力又不稳，如果你现在还在呼吸的话。你已经渐渐习惯使用艾拉"
"的望远镜，可看得久了，还是会觉得身体深处有什么东西在悄悄变化。不用它也能研习星象学。不"
"过，聊过这么多次，你已经知道，艾拉的望远镜很不一般。塔尔姆的召唤术专攻灵魂，艾拉则擅长知"
"识和占卜。你实在想象不出，她能召唤出什么样的生物。烟雾和望远镜，只是她施展这门法术的两种"
"工具。\n"
"\n"
"如今，你也学着用上了。和吸入视觉之烟时一样，你感觉自己从塔里飘了起来，穿过了墙壁。你伸手"
"想抓住铺着木瓦的屋顶，手却直接穿了过去，连碰都没碰到。你猛地冲上天空，将石塔远远甩在下"
"方，一头扎进云间。身体重新稳住，你感觉自己像被弹弓射了出去，直奔断裂山口，随后转向北方，"
"飞向群山中一处覆满霜雪的凹地。眼看就要撞上崖壁凿出的石门，你闭上眼睛……再睁眼时，人已经回"
"到了石塔的地板上。\n"
"\n"
"你浑身结满了冰，牙齿抖得直打架，却觉得好暖……好暖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Welcome back, child."
msgstr "回来了，孩子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Player Name]! Are you okay? You were here, there was a flash of light, and now "
"you're..."
msgstr "[Player Name]！你没事吧？你刚才还好好待在这儿，忽然闪了一道光，现在就……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A block of ice?"
msgstr "变成冰块了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr "……对。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know where we need to go."
msgstr "我知道该去哪儿了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know why we need to go there, but I know we do."
msgstr "虽然还不知道为什么非去不可，但我知道，咱们得去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll finally be able to read our children's book if we go risk our lives "
"somewhere?"
msgstr "你的意思是，再找个地方拼一回命，就能看懂那本儿童读物了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think so. And... so much more, possibly. You interested?"
msgstr "应该是吧。而且……说不定还能弄明白更多事。想去吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course I am!"
msgstr "那还用说！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'll finally be leaving us behind, hm?"
msgstr "终于要丢下我们，自己走了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aw. Are you feeling sentimental, dear?"
msgstr "哎呀。舍不得啦，亲爱的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, they did help me win that competition."
msgstr "毕竟，他们可是帮我赢了那场比赛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wasn't your win already foretold?"
msgstr "你会赢，不是早就预见到了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well yes, but it was foretold that I'd win because you two helped!"
msgstr "是啊，可预见到的就是你们两个帮我赢啊！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And look at us now."
msgstr "结果现在倒好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Was there something in those visions about... using a thrall to serve me breakfast in "
"bed?"
msgstr "那些幻象里，有没有说你会……派具尸仆把早饭端到我床边？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, that was a Talm original."
msgstr "没有，那是塔尔姆自己的主意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I know you two are rather squeamish, but you'll be seeing a lot more death before "
"you're through this all."
msgstr "我知道你们两个看不惯这些。不过，等这一切结束之前，你们还会见到更多死人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't mind corpses, or even making a few myself. But when they show up with a platter "
"of bacon, I might just lose my appetite."
msgstr ""
"尸体我倒不怕，真要动手杀几个也没什么。可它们要是端着一盘培根走过来，我大概就吃不下了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Era and Talm laugh at that, while you and [Companion Name] may feel a bit more "
"genuinely about the situation. Nevertheless, your goodbyes are heartfelt. The two of "
"them wish you well on your travels, and you get the feeling that this is the last of "
"them you'll see for quite some time.\n"
"\n"
"You and [Companion Name] head west, stopping in a small town by the name of Riverbend "
"to resupply, then make the trek north, to what the locals call Rimeriver Crevice. The "
"place is an uncharacteristically cold bit of land that stretches far into the mountains "
"with 'not much of note'.\n"
"\n"
"You are glad you stocked up, as green, grassy hillocks turn to freezing glaciers and "
"rolling snow dunes over the course of hours. There's doubtlessly something unnatural "
"about the weather, as even you can tell that the sleet is magically enhanced. Each "
"flake seems to chill you to the bone. Your bundled forms eventually reach the doorway "
"you saw, etched into the cliffside, shielded from the weather... mostly. The door "
"itself has immense braziers on either side, and seems to be frozen shut. You wager a "
"guess that it needs to be thawed."
msgstr ""
"艾拉和塔尔姆听得笑了起来。不过，你和[Companion Name]这话可不全是在开玩笑。尽管如此，到了"
"分别的时候，你们还是有些不舍。两人祝你们一路平安。你隐隐觉得，这一别，恐怕很久都见不到他"
"们了。\n"
"\n"
"你和[Companion Name]一路向西，在一个叫河湾镇的地方补充物资，随后跋涉北上，前往当地人所说"
"的霜河裂缝。那里冷得反常，一直延伸到群山深处。按当地人的说法，“没什么好看的”。\n"
"\n"
"才走了几个小时，满眼翠绿的小山丘便变成了冰川和连绵的雪丘。你庆幸自己备足了物资。这天气显"
"然不正常。连你都看得出来，魔法让这里的雨雪变得更加凶猛。每一片落在身上，那股寒冷几乎要钻"
"进你的骨头里。你们裹得严严实实，终于来到幻象里的那扇门前。门开在崖壁上，好歹能挡住……大部"
"分风雪。门两旁各有一座巨大的火盆，门本身似乎已经冻死了。看来，得先把冰化开。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good morning?"
msgstr "早上好？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good night."
msgstr "晚安。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The ice melts agonizingly slowly, but eventually, with some prodding with your pickaxes "
"between the two stone doors, you're able to push your way inside. Inside the cave is "
"comparatively balmy. The interior is well-furnished, but certainly abandoned. Many of "
"the doorways along the single stone hall you travel are shut and bound by some form of "
"magic that reminds you of the Abyssal Vault, but... much, much older. \n"
"\n"
"The few rooms that are open seem to have once been living quarters, built more for "
"capacity than for luxury. However, there's not a single hint of where anyone could have "
"gone. No bodies. No messages.\n"
"\n"
"You and [Companion Name] push further inside, to a room at the end of the hall that "
"opens up into a large open cavern that seems naturally made. You walk up and bump "
"[Companion Name] with your shoulder as you head deeper into the room."
msgstr ""
"冰融得慢得让人心焦。好在你们最后还是用镐头在两扇石门之间撬出了一点空隙，总算推开门，挤了"
"进去。比起外面，洞里暖和多了。里面的陈设一应俱全，不过，显然早已无人居住。你们沿着唯一的"
"石砌走廊前行。两侧大多数门都紧闭着，还被某种魔法封住。那魔法让你想起深渊宝库，只是……古老"
"得多。\n"
"\n"
"少数敞着门的房间，以前似乎是住人的。从布置来看，讲究的是能多住几个，舒不舒服倒在其次。可"
"这里的人去了哪里，半点线索也没有。没有尸体。也没有留言。\n"
"\n"
"你和[Companion Name]继续深入，来到走廊尽头的一间屋子。穿过那里，眼前是一处宽阔的大洞窟，"
"看起来像是天然形成的。往里走时，你凑到[Companion Name]身边，用肩膀轻轻撞了她一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"It feels like it's been a bit, since it was just you and I, doing something for "
"ourselves."
msgstr "好像很久没有这样了。就咱们两个，做点自己的事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I would never have guessed we'd have gotten wrapped up in something so... much bigger "
"than ourselves."
msgstr "真没想到，会卷进这么大一摊事里……大得远远超出了咱们能管的范围。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Neither would I. But it's cool, travelling the world together, no? We always talked "
"about how we wanted to."
msgstr "我也没想到。不过，能一起到处闯闯，不也挺好吗？咱们以前不是老念叨着想出来走走？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Maybe under different circumstances, but yeah. It's hard to think of just how much has "
"happened in so little time."
msgstr "虽然和当时想的不太一样，不过，也对。才过了这么点时间，居然就发生了这么多事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You can say that again. I missed this."
msgstr "可不是嘛。我还真想念这种感觉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"When this is all over, let's do a bit of travelling under better circumstances, hm?"
msgstr "等这些事都结束了，咱们再好好出去玩一趟，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd drink to that. Where would you want to go?"
msgstr "这话值得喝一杯。你想去哪儿？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Somewhere where it doesn't feel like something is going to eat me or stab me every "
"couple of minutes. How about-"
msgstr "找个不用隔三差五就担心被吃掉、被捅一刀的地方。那不如……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"With that, a loud rumbling roar tears through the cavern and sends the both of you to "
"your knees. You clamp your hands to your ears and turn your head up to see the call's "
"source. A yeti. The shaggy beast lumbers over, its blue knuckles dragging across the "
"floor as it seemingly wakes from a slumber that must have spanned countless years.\n"
"\n"
"[Companion Name] gives you one of her signature glares, as if your words brought the "
"creature into being. So much for wishful thinking."
msgstr ""
"话音未落，一声雷鸣般的怒吼响彻洞窟，震得你们双双跪倒在地。你死死捂住耳朵，抬头寻找声音的"
"来源。一只雪人。浑身长毛的野兽迈着沉重的步子走了过来，蓝色的指节拖在地上，像是刚从一场不"
"知持续了多少年的沉睡中醒来。\n"
"\n"
"[Companion Name]又拿她那熟悉的眼神瞪你，仿佛这东西是被你一句话说出来的。得，白日梦也该醒"
"了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The beast staggers back with a cry as your blows connect with its hard flesh. It falls "
"to the ground with a mighty crash, and slumps back against the cavern wall. It releases "
"a breath and begins to... fade away to crystals of ice that melt shortly afterward. "
"Whatever the beast was, it wasn't natural. As you begin to look over the murals etched "
"and painted into the wall, you feel quite sure of that assumption.\n"
"\n"
"The murals depict the group that once inhabited the cavern. Little blue figures of "
"people living in a beautiful blue forest. Then... the forest burning due to some "
"unknown red assailants riding on similarly colored creatures. After that, there are far "
"fewer blue figures in a blackened forest. The numbers dwindle further and further with "
"each section of wall. Until the blue figures leave the charred forest. The murals show "
"them travelling far... very far. Almost half the cavern wall depicts them travelling "
"from one place to another, in all manner of places. They settle for short periods of "
"time, with each move always predicated by a clash with some new color of figure. Brown, "
"grey, green, red, orange, and even a lighter color blue towards the end. These figures "
"are accompanied by beasts. All drawn simply in nature, but clearly terrifying to those "
"who lived here. You catch yourself wiping your eyes more than once as you spend over an "
"hour trying to follow their story.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, in the last tenth of the wall, it shows the figures... finding what you "
"presume to be this place. They find a book. They create their own creatures. The "
"figures leave the wall and travel across the floor, to spires of ice that jut out from "
"the ground, one nearly touching the ceiling.\n"
"\n"
"You realize, the center of the the room looks... similar to a page of the book you "
"cannot read. You lay it out and [Companion Name] holds the her lantern overhead as you "
"trace out places that line up. Two pages of the book, when lined up with the central "
"pillar of ice, resemble the eastern portion of the continent. And within that map, a "
"shining tower lays just off the coast. Comparing it to current maps, it'd be far north "
"of the capitol. Your next destination.\n"
"\n"
"You spare a last glance to the figures on the ground, crowded around the spire of ice. "
"It's the last of their journey, none left their last destination. You can only imagine "
"what the spire represents, but it's a mystery for another time."
msgstr ""
"你的攻击落在野兽坚硬的皮肉上。它痛吼一声，踉跄着往后退。随后，它轰然倒地，瘫靠在洞壁上。"
"它吐出一口气，身体开始……散成冰晶，没多久，那些冰晶也融化了。不管这东西到底是什么，都不是"
"自然生长出来的。你开始查看洞壁上雕刻、绘制的壁画，越看，越觉得自己的猜测没错。\n"
"\n"
"壁画讲的是曾经住在这里的那群人。小小的蓝色人影，生活在一片美丽的蓝色森林里。接着……一群来"
"历不明的红色人影，骑着同样颜色的生物袭来，森林燃起了大火。再往后，森林只剩一片焦黑，蓝色"
"人影也少了许多。每看过一段壁画，人影就更少一些。最后，蓝色人影离开了烧焦的森林。壁画里，"
"他们走了很……远。几乎半面洞壁，都在画他们从一个地方辗转到另一个地方，什么样的地方都有。每"
"到一处，他们只能短暂停留。每次又要离开，都是因为和一种新颜色的人影起了冲突。棕色、灰色、"
"绿色、红色、橙色，到了后面，甚至还有浅一些的蓝色。那些人影身边，都有野兽相伴。画得虽然简"
"单，却看得出来，对曾经住在这里的人来说，那些野兽都可怕极了。你花了一个多小时，沿着壁画读"
"他们的故事。回过神来，才发现自己已经抹了好几次眼睛。\n"
"\n"
"终于，在最后那一小段，大约只占整面壁画的十分之一，画里的人们……找到了一处地方。你猜，就是"
"这里。他们找到了一本书。他们创造出了自己的生物。那些人影从墙上延伸到地面，一直通向从地里"
"突起的冰柱，其中一根几乎顶到了洞顶。\n"
"\n"
"你忽然发现，洞窟中央的布局……很像那本读不懂的书里的某一页。你摊开书，[Companion Name]举高"
"提灯，让你逐一比对相互吻合的地方。书里的两页图画，和中央的冰柱对照起来，勾勒出的正是大陆"
"东部。在那幅地图上，离海岸不远的地方，立着一座闪闪发光的高塔。拿现在的地图一比，它应该在"
"都城很远的北边。下一个目的地找到了。\n"
"\n"
"你最后看了一眼地面上的人影。他们密密地围在冰柱四周。旅途到这里便结束了。再没有人离开这最"
"后的落脚处。冰柱代表什么，你也只能猜测。不过，这个谜只能留待以后再解。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ship Shape"
msgstr "修船出海"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"In their quest to find the shining tower shown to them by the history book stolen from "
"the Ivory Athenaeum, [Player Name] and [Companion Name] find themselves travelling far "
"north of the capitol, to a lonely little fishing village tucked into the coast."
msgstr ""
"为了找到从象牙藏书院偷来的历史书上那座闪光高塔，[Player Name]和[Companion Name]一路远赴"
"都城以北，来到海岸边一个偏僻的小渔村。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Head inland enough, should be able to grow something."
msgstr "往内陆多走一段，应该能种点东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That should be enough. Let's see our vessel."
msgstr "这些应该够了。去看看咱们的船吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Having made it to Tidebreak, PC seek the help of an young fisherman, who is willing to "
"trade his boat in exchange for helping him change his livelihood since he cannot stand "
"the sea or fish. PC help him plant fields of crops (Farming) and he trades them his "
"boat, a horrendously trashed little dingy. PC fix it up, with Player creating a new "
"keel for it to withstand the rocks (Smithing), along with a sail (Crafting). (3 Steps)\n"
"\n"
"An old cobbled road takes you and your companion far north, just outside of a town by "
"the name of Tidebreak. The population is said to be rather reclusively, mostly "
"prefering to keep to their own and subsist on what they can fish up. The sea breeze "
"goes from refreshing to... almost sour the further north you get. You get why not many "
"people decided to live up this way, and question the motives of those that do. You push "
"on ahead as the sun begins to set.\n"
"\n"
"The town itself is... quaint. You feel eyes on you everywhere you go, and kids are "
"pulled inside ahead of your path. You find yourself on the coast, where a lone young "
"man works a length of rope, hardly sparing you a glance. Another man, who almost seems "
"like he could be his brother, looks on and even gives you a smile, which you almost "
"find weirder. You try your chances with the rope worker first."
msgstr ""
"抵达破浪镇后，PC向一名年轻渔夫求助。他受够了大海和鱼，愿意用自己的船，换取玩家帮他改行谋"
"生。PC帮他种了几片田地（农务），他则把自己的船交给他们，那是一条破得不成样子的小艇。PC着"
"手修船，打造了一根新龙骨，让船能经得住礁石磕碰（锻造），又做了一面船帆（制造）。（3个步"
"骤）\n"
"\n"
"一条古老的石铺路带着你和同伴一路北上，来到一座叫破浪镇的小镇外。听说这里的人不太爱与外界"
"来往，大多只愿和自己人打交道，靠出海打捞、捕鱼过活。越往北走，原本清爽的海风里，越是带着"
"一股……近乎酸腐的味道。你算是明白为什么没多少人愿意住在这边了。至于还住在这里的那些人，你"
"倒想问问，他们到底图什么。太阳渐渐落下，你们继续往前走。\n"
"\n"
"小镇本身……倒挺古朴。可走到哪儿，你都觉得有人盯着自己。还没走近，路上的孩子就被大人拉回了"
"屋里。你们来到海边。一个年轻人正摆弄着一截绳子，几乎没抬头看你们。另一个男人在旁边看着，"
"两人长得像是兄弟。他甚至还冲你们笑了笑，反倒让你觉得更奇怪了。你决定先找摆弄绳子的那个碰"
"碰运气。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A pleasure."
msgstr "幸会。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye. I'm sure."
msgstr "对。确实。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You've got a lovely little town here, might I say."
msgstr "你们这小镇还真不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ya' might, if ya' blind."
msgstr "那你怕是眼神不太好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fortunate enough to still have my vision..."
msgstr "还好，我眼神还行……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Friendly lot, you are, hm?"
msgstr "你们这儿的人可真热情啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Oh, leave the poor boy be. Joshry's always grumpy when he gets shown up at the Hauling."
msgstr "行了，别为难这小子了。每次打捞会上被人比下去，乔什里就这副臭脾气。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't not. "
msgstr "才没有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes ya do, and the rest of 'em too."
msgstr "你就有，其他人也一个样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Shove off, Rommard."
msgstr "一边去，罗马德。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The what now?"
msgstr "什么会？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The Hauling. Weekly little get together when all us sailors show off whatever we "
"managed to scrape off the ocean floor."
msgstr "打捞会。每周聚一聚，我们这些跑船的，都把从海底捞上来的东西拿出来亮亮相。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not to inner-esting less you's an academic."
msgstr "除非是做学问的，不然也没什么好看的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's why everyone here cares so much. Bunch of scholars, we are."
msgstr "所以这儿的人才这么上心。我们可都是学者。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Bet our findings will get added to that big ivory building in the capitol, soon enough. "
"Should go take a look at it yourself someday, real purdy."
msgstr "用不了多久，我们的发现准能送进都城那栋象牙色的大楼。哪天你也该去看看，漂亮得很。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You could say we're... familiar."
msgstr "那地方嘛……我们还挺熟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How bout yourself, stranger?"
msgstr "你呢，这位朋友？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm quite over it all, myself. No one here seems to care much about pulling up "
"ten corpses for every half rusted spoon they can dredge out of the ocean."
msgstr ""
"我啊，早就受够这些破事了。为了捞半把生锈的勺子，先拖上来十具尸体，这里的人居然谁都不在"
"乎。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No one but yours truly. Can't stand it."
msgstr "除了我。我是真受不了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then why do you?"
msgstr "那为什么还干？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tidebreak look like a place where we've got an abundance of career diversity?"
msgstr "瞧破浪镇这模样，像是有一大堆活儿任我们挑吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Everyone that's been here has been doing what they do for more years than ol' Josh and "
"I put together."
msgstr "这里的人干现在这行的年头，比我和老乔加起来的岁数都长。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Opening comes up when they kick the bucket."
msgstr "等他们两腿一蹬，才轮得到别人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fancy making some gold by ferrying us around, then?"
msgstr "那载我们一程，赚点金币，怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What, you two come here for a bita sightseeing?"
msgstr "怎么，你们两个是来游山玩水的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Close. We want to go to the island way off the coast."
msgstr "差不多吧。我们想去远海的那座岛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...oh. We don't go other there. Gloomstone's a ba-"
msgstr "……哦。那边我们可不去。幽暗之石可不是什么好……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now now now, I'm sure our friends here are well aware of the risks."
msgstr "哎哎哎，我相信两位朋友早就知道有风险了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Just a bit of choppy water n' the like, of course. Couple beasties if you're tasty. "
"Nothin' they can't handle."
msgstr ""
"无非就是水急浪大之类的，当然啦。没准还有几只小野兽，想拿你们打打牙祭。都难不倒他们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But tell you what. You can have my boat, if you do me a lil' favor."
msgstr "不过，这样吧。帮我个小忙，我的船就归你们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Rommard goes into detail about grand visions for the town. All the little things he "
"wants to do to 'give back'. Neither you nor [Companion Name] buy it for a second, of "
"course, but you feel as though the man in front of you is the best option you'll get. "
"As dire as that sounds.\n"
"\n"
"His ire for having to fish out Gods know what from the sea seems true, as he'd rather "
"work the land and earn his keep that way. Only issue, Tidebreak has never bothered "
"trying to trade for seeds. 'The sea will provide' is something you hear around, often.'"
msgstr ""
"罗马德滔滔不绝地说起他对小镇的宏伟打算。还有他想为“回报乡亲”做的那些小事。当然，你和"
"[Companion Name]一个字都不信。但眼前这个人，恐怕已经是你们能找到的最佳人选了。虽然这话听"
"着就让人心凉。\n"
"\n"
"不过，他说自己受够了从海里捞那些鬼知道是什么的东西，这点倒像是真的。他更愿意种种地，靠这"
"个养活自己。唯一的问题是，破浪镇从来就没想过要买种子。“大海自会养活我们。”这句话，你在这"
"里听到了好几遍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll need to make something that'll help it weather the rocky shore."
msgstr "得做点东西，让它能经得住岸边礁石磕碰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This ought to do it. Let's see how [Companion Name] is coming along."
msgstr "这下应该行了。看看[Companion Name]那边怎么样了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] and you plant row after row of crops, then run through the details of "
"crop rotations and how to care for seedlings. To his credit, Rommard does actually pay "
"attention and even takes some pretty extensive notes. He does leave the two of you do "
"actually do all the work, though.\n"
"\n"
"Once you're done, Rommard jumps upright and brings you back over to the docks, "
"detailing how all deals are final, and that his boat's a bit of a fixer-upper, but will "
"get you to the island. Probably.\n"
"\n"
"The only 'boat' left on the docks could be mistaken for a wreck that someone tethered "
"to the pier. Rommard presents it with a flourish, then turns on his heel, setting off "
"into town. He calls out to you one last time."
msgstr ""
"你和[Companion Name]一排排地种好庄稼，又仔细讲了该怎么轮作，怎么照料幼苗。还算罗马德有点"
"良心，听得确实认真，甚至记了不少笔记。不过，动手干活的，自始至终还是你们两个。\n"
"\n"
"你们一忙完，罗马德就一跃而起，带着你们回到码头。一路上，他反复强调交易敲定了就不能反悔，"
"还说他的船是得修修，但肯定能把你们送到岛上。大概吧。\n"
"\n"
"码头仅剩的那条“船”，怎么看都像是有人把一堆残骸拴在了栈桥边。罗马德煞有介事地伸手一指，介"
"绍完，便转身往镇上走。走前，他还不忘冲你们喊最后一句。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The F.V. Not My Problem Anymore!"
msgstr "渔船“总算不归我管号”！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Enjoy!"
msgstr "你们慢慢折腾吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That slimy little..."
msgstr "这奸商……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's not... that bad. Is it?"
msgstr "也没……那么糟吧。对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Player Name], it might be easier to start from scratch. I'm shocked the thing's even "
"floating to begin with."
msgstr "[Player Name]，我看从头造一条都比修它省事。这东西居然还没沉，我都觉得稀奇。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's just... do our best."
msgstr "咱们就……尽力吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Judging by the coastline, the island's gonna be rocky. And, I don't fancy paddling to a "
"place I can't even see."
msgstr "看这海岸，岛边肯定也少不了礁石。而且，连岛影都看不见，我可不想一路划过去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll work on a keel and a sail."
msgstr "我来做龙骨和船帆。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll see what I can do about getting this thing... sea-worthy."
msgstr "……那我想想办法，至少让这东西……能出海。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's the spirit."
msgstr "这就对了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[Companion Name] grumbles to herself and begins prodding at the boat. It drops "
"concerningly low under the water when she puts her weight on it, which elicits a string "
"of curses."
msgstr ""
"[Companion Name]一边嘀咕，一边开始摆弄那条船。她刚把重量压上去，船就猛地往下一沉，眼看就"
"要进水，惹得她连骂了好几句。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It can't be that hard, can it?"
msgstr "应该没那么难吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It was."
msgstr "还真有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You arrive at the docks to see something akin to a miracle. The boat - if you could "
"even call it that - has been worked into a proper skiff. It wasn't fancy, but it looked "
"like it could support a couple of people and make it more than two minutes off the "
"shore without capsizing, which is leagues better than it used to be. [Companion Name] "
"beams with pride."
msgstr ""
"你回到码头，眼前简直是个奇迹。那堆勉强能叫作船的东西，已经被修成了一条像模像样的小艇。虽"
"说不气派，但看着至少能载两个人，不至于离岸两分钟就翻。这可比之前强太多了。[Companion "
"Name]满脸得意，笑得灿烂。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How's this?"
msgstr "怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how you made it down to the capitol and bought a proper boat, but I'm glad "
"you did!"
msgstr "我都不知道你什么时候跑去都城买了条正经船回来，这船真不赖！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As if I was going to let that gross little creature pull one over on us. He'll be "
"begging for this boat back when we're done."
msgstr "我还能让那恶心的小人把咱们耍了？等咱们弄完，他保准哭着喊着想把船要回去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Start thinking of a name, hm?"
msgstr "想想给它取个什么名字吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Spite is quite the motivator, ain't it?"
msgstr "看来，憋着一口气，干活都格外有劲啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The two of you get to work, fitting the keel to the boat. It takes ages, replacing the "
"scrap metal that used to serve the same purpose. Once the worst of it is over, "
"[Companion Name] waves you off, telling you to get to weaving or knitting or whatever "
"you need to do for creating a sail."
msgstr ""
"你们开始动手，把龙骨装到船上。原来顶在那个位置的，是一堆废铁。光把它换掉，就费了好半天。"
"最难的活儿干完后，[Companion Name]便挥手赶你去做船帆，至于是织是编还是怎么弄，她就不管"
"了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You bring you sail to the dock and find [Companion Name] floating in the water, "
"treating the boat with what you presume to be waterproofing. You set the sail on the "
"ground and help haul them out of the brine, to which they shake like a dog and get you "
"drenched. You threaten to shove them in, so they wrap their arms around you and "
"threaten to haul you both back in. You shove them off and roll your eyes, to which they "
"give one of the first genuinely laughs you've heard from them in a long while.\n"
"\n"
"Why they decided that smelling like stale water and rotting wood was their happy place, "
"you may never know, but you can't help but smile after seeing them happy. The two of "
"you fit the sail to your skiff and sit on the dock, admiring your handiwork. You each "
"carve your name into its railing, and give it a firm pat. It's ready for its journey. "
"Are you?"
msgstr ""
"你把船帆带回码头，看见[Companion Name]正泡在海水里，往船身上涂东西，估计是在做防水。你放"
"下船帆，把她从海水里拉上来。结果，她像狗一样抖了抖身子，甩了你一身水。你威胁要把她推回"
"去，她便一把抱住你，说要下水就一起下。你推开她，翻了个白眼。她笑出了声，你已经好久没听见"
"她笑得这么痛快了。\n"
"\n"
"为什么浑身沾着陈水和烂木头味，反倒能让她这么开心，你大概永远也想不明白。不过，看见她高"
"兴，你也忍不住地笑。你们给小艇装好船帆，坐在码头边，欣赏自己的成果。两人各自在船舷刻下名"
"字，又结结实实地拍了拍。它已经准备好启程了。你们呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Sunken Tower"
msgstr "沉没之塔"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"All signs point to Gloomstone, and you're as ready as you'll ever be. It's time to "
"learn what the Soulsmiths are after, or sink somewhere far off the coast."
msgstr ""
"所有线索都指向幽暗之石，能做的准备，你们也都做了。该去弄清炼魂师到底想干什么了。要不，就"
"沉在远海某个不知名的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Astrology (Following stars through rocks)"
msgstr "星象学 (循着星辰指引穿过礁石)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Glass shatters as you break a bottle of wine over the ship's bow. [Companion Name] "
"holds her steady as you jump aboard, cutting the rope loose and gracefully landing on "
"the deck, your momentum carrying the boat out into the water. The sheepish townsfolk of "
"Tidebreak silently watch as you set off, several of them actually tracing marks of good "
"fortune in the air. You're pleasantly surprised.\n"
"\n"
"The two of you move about the skiff, setting the sail and getting it as ready as you "
"can to sail."
msgstr ""
"你把一瓶葡萄酒砸在船头，玻璃应声碎裂。[Companion Name]稳住小艇，你跃上船，割断缆绳，利落"
"地落在甲板上。借着这股劲，船身滑进了水里。破浪镇的镇民有些局促，默默看着你们出发。几个人"
"居然还抬起手，在空中画了些祈求好运的符号。破浪镇的镇民有些局促，默默看着你们出发。几个人"
"居然还抬起手，在空中画了些祈求好运的符号。这倒让你有些受宠若惊了。\n"
"\n"
"你们在小艇上忙来忙去，升起船帆，把能准备的都准备妥当。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Guess they don't want to haul any fresh bodies out of the water, hm?"
msgstr "看来，他们也不想从海里捞上来两具新鲜尸体，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's anyone's guess. Maybe Rommard put in a good word for us?"
msgstr "谁知道呢。没准罗马德替咱们说了几句好话？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's probably your thing."
msgstr "还是你前面那个说法比较像真的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nice thought, though."
msgstr "不过，想得倒挺美。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So. How many days of stuff do we got?"
msgstr "说起来。咱们带的东西能撑几天？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A week, at least. I really hope it doesn't take that long though."
msgstr "至少一周。不过，我真希望用不了那么久。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope the tower is actually out there."
msgstr "我只希望那座塔真在海上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The cavern was fine, sure. But this is a bit more... hostile of an environment."
msgstr "洞窟那次是没错。可这回，地方就有点……不太好待了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll see when we get there!"
msgstr "到了不就知道了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...if we get there."
msgstr "……要是能到的话。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'lllllll get there."
msgstr "肯定能到啦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...In one piece is a maybe."
msgstr "……能不能全须全尾地到，就不好说了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You two chat back and forth, enjoying the pretty peaceful trip. The shore slowly fades "
"further... and further... and further away, until it's just the two of you gliding "
"across the dark blue water. You're long past the point of being able to swim back to "
"shore. Even without your gear on, the water is cold, and hypothermia would set in long "
"before you made it even a tenth of the way back, assuming the current was cooperating "
"with you.\n"
"\n"
"The two of you catch sleep in waves, each trading off, hoping that you're vaguely "
"headed in the right direction. From what you were able to find, Gloomstone is... quite "
"large but even still, half a day into sailing, you start to wonder if you missed it, or "
"if a children's book in a dead language may have not been the best reference material.\n"
"\n"
"You awake to [Companion Name] calling for you. Something is ahead. A lot of somethings. "
"Giant pillars jut from the icy waters like fingers of stone that threaten to pull you "
"into the depths. [Companion Name] mans the sails, and pleads for you to get them "
"through this safely. With the pillars being barely lit by the moon, you turn to the "
"stars."
msgstr ""
"你们有一搭没一搭地聊着，享受这段还算平静的航程。海岸渐渐远去……越来越远……越来越远，直到深"
"蓝的海面上，只剩你们两个乘着小艇前行。现在，早就不可能再游回岸边了。就算脱掉所有装备，海"
"水还是冷得要命。即使水流肯帮忙，恐怕连十分之一的路程都游不到，你就已经失温了。\n"
"\n"
"你们轮流打盹，换着掌船，只盼前进的方向没有偏得太离谱。按你查到的资料，幽暗之石应该……相当"
"大。可出海半天后，你还是开始怀疑，是不是已经错过了，又或者，拿一本用失传文字写成的儿童读"
"物当指引，本来就不是什么好主意。\n"
"\n"
"你被[Companion Name]的呼唤声叫醒。前面有东西。而且，有很多。巨大的石柱耸立在冰冷的海水"
"中，宛如一根根伸出的手指，仿佛随时都会将你们拖入深海。[Companion Name]忙着掌帆，急切地催"
"你找条安全的路穿过去。月光昏暗，只能勉强照出石柱的轮廓。你抬头望向群星，希望借星光找到出"
"路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we're doing them a favor."
msgstr "我觉得，这对它们来说也是种解脱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rest easy."
msgstr "安息吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Your boat bumps and scrapes against the rocks, and you're glad you spent so long "
"forging its keel. Wind whips at the sail, pulling the two of you through the stone "
"spires at a breakneck pace. While nothing like using Era's telescope, your skills in "
"astrology prove fruitful, guiding you through the pillars relatively unscathed.\n"
"\n"
"The two of you float further and further into the cluster of rocks until you can make "
"out... land. You scrape along the shore a bit harder than you're comfortable with, but "
"the two of you and your boat seem to be intact. [Companion Name] shouts with joy and "
"nervous energy leaving her body."
msgstr ""
"船身一路磕碰、刮擦着岩石。你庆幸自己花了那么多工夫锻造龙骨。狂风扯着船帆，带着你们在石柱"
"间飞驰，快得让人心惊。虽然和使用艾拉的望远镜时完全不同，你学来的星象学还是派上了用场，引"
"导你们穿过石柱，没受什么大损伤。\n"
"\n"
"你们乘着小艇继续驶入礁石群深处，终于看见了……陆地。船底擦上岸边，动静大得让你心里一紧。不"
"过，船和人似乎都没事。[Companion Name]欢呼起来，绷了一路的神经终于松了下来。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh by the Gods we made it! I can't believe it."
msgstr "诸神保佑，我们到了！真不敢相信。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "By the Gods? Not used to you referring to them."
msgstr "诸神保佑？难得听你提起他们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We've been talking with two immortals that play with the dead and fighting against a "
"force that creates monsters from darkness."
msgstr "咱们跟两个摆弄死人的不死之身聊过天，还跟一群能用黑暗造出怪物的家伙交过手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We fought a golbin horde and travelled across most of the continent. "
msgstr "打过成群的哥布林，走遍了大半个大陆。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We've saved dozens of people in our travels, and now, we just pulled off one of the "
"most miraculous feats of sailing I've ever seen or heard of."
msgstr ""
"一路上救了几十个人，现在又开着船闯过了这种地方。我见过的、听说过的航海奇迹，恐怕都没几个"
"比得上这回。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"We live in interesting times. If the Gods just so happened to pop out of the sea and "
"ask us for tea, I'd call that a boring day, at this point."
msgstr ""
"咱们这日子过得，可真够精彩的。事到如今，就算诸神突然从海里冒出来，请咱们喝杯茶，我大概都"
"不会觉得奇怪。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We... really did make it. That was some fine steering you did."
msgstr "我们……真的过来了。你掌舵的本事真不错。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You're the one that pulled it out of the stars. You pointed, I moved. Let's just call "
"it a joint effort, eh?"
msgstr "还不是你看着星星找到了路。你指哪儿，我就往哪儿开。算咱俩的功劳，好吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You nod and give out a shout of your own, happy to have your feet on dry land. You "
"anchor the boat and pull it as far ashore as you can. The skiff is large, and the "
"moment the majority of it leaves the water, you can't pull it any further.\n"
"\n"
"The two of you grab what you need and head inland. One spire stands out amongst them "
"all, and this one is much larger than the rest. After a small trek, you enter into the "
"old tower, its doors surprisingly open, as if something was waiting for you. And once "
"you're inside, you realize... something is. Piles of bodies shift towards you. It "
"reminds you of Talm's thralls on a much larger and more horrific scale. The "
"amalgamations of flesh and metal twist and moan in horrific fashion, and doubtlessly "
"hostile intent."
msgstr ""
"你点点头，也忍不住欢呼了一声。能重新脚踏实地，真好。你们下了锚，又尽力把船往岸上拖。这艘"
"小艇个头不小，大半个船身刚离开水面，你们就再也拖不动了。\n"
"\n"
"你们带上需要的东西，朝岛内走去。一座尖塔格外显眼，比周围的石柱都要高大得多。走了没多久，"
"你们便来到古塔前。塔门竟然敞开着，仿佛有什么东西正在等你们。进去后，你才发现……还真有。一"
"堆堆尸体蠕动着，向你们逼近。你想起了塔尔姆的尸仆，可眼前这些东西要庞大得多，也骇人得多。"
"血肉与金属拼凑成的怪物扭动着身体，发出令人毛骨悚然的呻吟，显然来者不善。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This feels... right."
msgstr "感觉……应该就是这样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bottoms up."
msgstr "干了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The piles of corpses stop moving, the which is as good to dead as you can imagine they "
"can get. It's not just the bodies, though. The whole tower seems... still. Stale. As if "
"it was frozen in time. \n"
"\n"
"Despite its incredible height, you can only see a single floor, the one you're on. The "
"two of you search high and low, finding... nothing. The place is decorated with stone "
"benches and tables and lit with pale yellow-green lights that make you feel sick, but "
"little else. You sit by the pool in the center of the room, watching the corpse piles "
"slowly turn to ash."
msgstr ""
"尸堆不再动弹。对这些东西来说，这大概就算是死透了。不过，静下来的不只是它们。整座塔似乎"
"都……沉寂了。透着一股陈腐的气息。仿佛时间在这里停住了。\n"
"\n"
"这座塔明明高得惊人，你却只能看见眼前这一层。你们把四下翻了个遍，结果……什么也没找到。这里"
"摆着些石桌石凳，泛黄的浅绿色光芒照着四周，让你隐隐作呕。除此之外，几乎再没有别的东西。你"
"在房间中央的水池旁坐下，看着那些尸堆慢慢化为灰烬。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They must be summoned beasts, like the Yeti we fought."
msgstr "它们肯定也是召唤兽，跟咱们之前打过的雪人一样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Reminds you of Talm, doesn't it?"
msgstr "让你想起塔尔姆了，对吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You read my mind. I wonder... Do you think this tower belonged to the..."
msgstr "我正想这么说。你说……这座塔以前会不会属于……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'd he call them?"
msgstr "他管那些人叫什么来着？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lifebinders..? Could be."
msgstr "生命缚誓者……？有可能。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How many ages have those miserable piles of souls haunted this place?"
msgstr "那些可怜的灵魂被拼成那副模样，也不知道在这里徘徊了多少年。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "At least they can rest now. Whoever or whatever they were."
msgstr "至少现在，它们能安息了。不管它们生前是什么人，或是什么东西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Can't say the same for us, though. I refuse to have come all this way just for a creepy "
"little tower with no answers."
msgstr "可咱们还歇不了。跑了这么远，总不能就找到这么座阴森森的小塔，什么答案也没捞着。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely not..."
msgstr "应该不至于吧……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"As you trail off, you take a deeper look into the pool. Unlike the rest of the tower, "
"it almost exudes warmth. It's inviting. You pull out the gilded black book and flip "
"through the pages of scrawl you cannot read. Several pages after the map shows the "
"tower. Several pages after that, an overhead view of a circular room. Within that room "
"a smaller circle of... paradise, is the only word that comes to mind.\n"
"\n"
"On the next page, the page is cut in half. On the top half, people stand in water on "
"the 'real' side of the world. These people seem sad, angry, and some even sport wounds "
"in a way that's a bit surprising for what's meant to be a children's book. Among them "
"are people holding purple vials, who seem to be in the process of passing out. Some of "
"the tables in the illustration seem to be open in the center.\n"
"\n"
"The other half of the page is lovely, mirroring the top half. These people are upside "
"down, holding hands and smiling with one another. You look to the sheet of placid water "
"in the center of the room once again, and motion for [Companion Name] to sit beside "
"you.\n"
"\n"
"You come to the same conclusion. You need to pass through. After splashing about in the "
"warm water for a while feeling no different - as crazy as it may be - you come to the "
"same conclusion. You need to find and make the purple vials. You wedge blades into the "
"center of tables around the room until one gives way, revealing the same vials as the "
"book held, along with herbs and ingredients you assume go inside."
msgstr ""
"你话音渐低，又仔细朝池中望去。与塔里的其他地方不同，这池水仿佛透着暖意。让人忍不住想靠"
"近。你取出那本镶金的黑皮书，翻过一页页看不懂的文字。地图后面隔了几页，画着这座塔。再往后"
"翻几页，是一个圆形房间的俯视图。房间里还有个小圆圈，里面的景象……你只能想到“乐园”这个"
"词。\n"
"\n"
"下一页的画面分为上下两半。上半页里，人们站在水中，身处这个世界“真实”的一面。他们有的悲"
"伤，有的愤怒，甚至还有人身上带着伤。这样的画面出现在一本儿童读物里，多少有些出人意料。其"
"中几个人手里拿着紫色的小瓶，看起来正要失去意识。图中有几张桌子，中央似乎是打开的。\n"
"\n"
"下半页的景象则美好得多，与上半页如同镜像。那里的人上下颠倒，彼此牵着手，脸上带着笑容。你"
"再次望向房间中央平静的水面，示意[Companion Name]到你身边坐下。\n"
"\n"
"你们得出了同样的结论。你们得穿过去。你们在温暖的池水里扑腾了一阵，却毫无变化。虽然这念头"
"有些疯狂，你们还是想到一块儿去了。得找到那些紫色小瓶，配出里面的药水。你们把刀刃插进一张"
"张桌子中央的缝隙，终于撬开了其中一张。里面放着书中画的那种小瓶，还有些草药和材料，想必就"
"是用来配药的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Exclusive Content Agility??] X/X [Exclusive Content Agility?]"
msgstr "[Exclusive Content Agility??] X/X [Exclusive Content Agility?]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The moment the liquid hits your tongue, you feel... nothing. Your body falls backward "
"into the water, but you're not in it any longer. You watch as the liquid washes over "
"you, then [Companion Name]. You scream, but hear nothing. You want to try to push "
"yourself back into your body, but cannot seem to will yourself forward. You feel still, "
"but your mind cries out over and over again that what's happening is wrong.\n"
"\n"
"Bit by bit you see your body wither away, like the rotting of a fruit sped up a hundred-"
"fold. You feel regret at everything you never got the chance to do. Bitter over falling "
"for such a stupid trick. Remorse for getting [Companion Name] involved. Calm, over "
"knowing that it's... out of your hands now. Warmth for the hundreds of happy memories "
"you've made through the years, even if it was cut short. Thankful for everyone you've "
"gotten to know, good and bad. You're a mixture of countless emotions, good and bad, but "
"this is all you've got. Nothing left to be done about it.\n"
"\n"
"You pass through the other side, your consciousness slamming back into your body. You "
"feel your body materialize and peel away from the sickly sweet membrane of the mirrored "
"pool. You fall through the air and weightlessly hit the stone ground. Feeling slowly "
"returns to your body as you remember how to move. How to breathe.\n"
"\n"
"You rub your eyes as you sit up... You're... in paradise.\n"
"\n"
"Grey flesh coats the walls and pulses like the beat of a heart. The stone beneath you "
"is an endless path of mottled bone held together with sinew. You hear screams echo out "
"around you as you move to your feet. But where is it-"
msgstr ""
"药液碰到舌尖的那一刻，你……什么感觉也没有了。你的身体向后倒入水中，可你已经不在那具身体"
"里。你看着池水漫过自己的身体，又漫过[Companion Name]。你尖叫起来，却听不到任何声音。你想"
"钻回自己的身体，却怎么也无法向前挪动。你动弹不得，脑海里却有个声音一遍遍地喊着：不该是这"
"样的。\n"
"\n"
"你眼看着自己的身体一点点枯萎、腐烂，就像一颗果子，却比正常腐烂快了上百倍。还有那么多事没"
"来得及做，你满心遗憾。竟然中了这么蠢的圈套，你又恨又不甘。还把[Companion Name]牵扯进来，"
"你愧疚不已。可想到如今已经……无能为力，你又渐渐平静下来。这些年留下的无数美好回忆，让你心"
"头泛起暖意，尽管这一生就这样匆匆结束了。那些与你相识的人，无论好坏，此刻你都心怀感激。种"
"种滋味涌上心头，有好有坏，如今你也只剩下这些了。再也做不了什么。\n"
"\n"
"你穿到了另一边，意识猛地撞回身体。你感觉自己的身体重新凝聚成形，从另一侧水池那层泛着甜腻"
"气息的薄膜上剥离。你从空中落下，轻飘飘地撞上石地。知觉慢慢回到身体里，你重新想起该怎么活"
"动。怎么呼吸。\n"
"\n"
"你揉着眼睛坐起身……你来到了……乐园。\n"
"\n"
"灰色的血肉覆满墙壁，像心脏一样一下一下地搏动。身下的“石地”，是一条望不到尽头的路，由筋腱"
"连着斑驳的骨头拼成。你站起身，四周回荡着声声惨叫。可它到底在哪……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name]!!!"
msgstr "[Player Name]！！！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "WE HAVE TO MOVE! NOW!"
msgstr "快跑！现在就跑！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "PLEASE! I WILL NOT LEAVE YOU HERE BUT YOU NEED TO GET UP!"
msgstr "求你了！我不会把你丢在这里，可你得站起来！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes snap open. [Companion Name]'s eyes are wide in fear, in a way you haven't "
"seen since the Soulsmiths first attacked Azamire.\n"
"\n"
"You look back and see it. A twisted being formed of... human matter. The creature drags "
"itself down pathway and towards you with frightening speed. Everything about it "
"seems... incompatible with life. With each movement its claws tear into the walls of "
"this hellscape and it pulls itself towards you. Closer. \n"
"\n"
"You grab [Companion Name] by the arm and drag her with you, knowing that if you opened "
"your mouth you'd fail to produce anything other than screams.\n"
"\n"
"You need to leave."
msgstr ""
"你猛地睁开眼。[Companion Name]惊恐地瞪大了双眼。自从炼魂师第一次袭击阿扎米尔以来，你就没"
"见她怕成这样。\n"
"\n"
"你回头，看见了那东西。一个由……人的血肉拼成的畸形怪物。它拖着身躯沿通道爬来，速度快得吓"
"人。怎么看，这东西都……不该是活的。它每动一下，利爪便撕进这地狱般的墙壁，把身体往你这边"
"拖。越来越近。\n"
"\n"
"你一把抓住[Companion Name]的胳膊，拉着她就跑。你知道，只要一张嘴，自己除了尖叫，什么声音"
"也发不出来。\n"
"\n"
"得逃出去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What happened to you..?"
msgstr "你到底经历了什么……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...is it dead?"
msgstr "……它死了吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Arms of gray skin and bone reach out to grab you from the corridor walls. You and "
"[Companion Name] run through the fetid halls along the only path laid out for you. "
"There's nothing else you can do. Each step becomes heavier and heavier as the bone "
"beneath you turns spongy and slick with blood that pours from the ceiling and walls.\n"
"\n"
"You lost track of time ages ago, and focus on your breathing. In. Out. In. Out. You "
"reach out to steady [Companion Name]. Flinch back as she cuts a hand away from your "
"throat.\n"
"\n"
"The tunnel grows more narrow, and all the while, the beast crawls towards you faster "
"and faster. Its breath curls down your back as you sprint through the halls, the "
"feeling reminds you of how you the purple vial touching your lips and bringing you to "
"this nightmare. You feel the beast's nails bite into your skin. Just a glancing blow, "
"but you know the next time it touches you, it will be fatal.\n"
"\n"
"You see light up ahead. You jump off the bridge.\n"
"\n"
"And then... it ends.\n"
"\n"
"You reach a large room made of the same stone as the tower that brought you here. Your "
"lungs burn and tears stream down your face. [Companion Name] lands beside you with a "
"thud.\n"
"\n"
"You look back, and the tunnel you came from isn't there.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe it never was.\n"
"\n"
"You turn back and see Talm, arm in arm with his wife Era. The two of them look at you "
"with so much hatred that you almost feel like you deserve it, though you haven't the "
"slightest idea on why. Their fingers elongate into claws that scrape against the stone "
"floor, while their bodies twist into malformed ideas of human anatomy."
msgstr ""
"一条条灰皮包骨的手臂从通道两侧伸出，想要抓住你们。你和[Companion Name]沿着眼前唯一的路，"
"在恶臭的通道里狂奔。你们别无选择。头顶和墙壁不断涌出鲜血，脚下的骨头变得松软湿滑，每迈一"
"步都比上一步更费力。\n"
"\n"
"你早已不知道跑了多久，只顾着调整呼吸。吸气。呼气。吸气。呼气。你伸手扶稳[Companion "
"Name]。她挥刃斩断了伸向你喉咙的一只手，你惊得猛地往后一缩。\n"
"\n"
"通道越来越窄，身后的野兽却越爬越快。你在通道中拼命奔跑，它的吐息已经拂上你的后背。那感觉"
"让你想起紫色小瓶碰上嘴唇的那一刻，正是那一口药水，把你带进了这场噩梦。野兽的指甲刺进了你"
"的皮肤。只是擦了一下，可你知道，再被它碰到一次，你就没命了。\n"
"\n"
"前方有光。你纵身跳下桥。\n"
"\n"
"然后……一切都结束了。\n"
"\n"
"你落进一间宽敞的房间，四周的石材与先前那座塔一模一样。你的肺像烧起来一样，眼泪止不住地往"
"下淌。[Companion Name]砰的一声落在你身旁。\n"
"\n"
"你回头望去，来时的通道已经不见了。\n"
"\n"
"也许它从来就不存在。\n"
"\n"
"转回头，你看见塔尔姆和他的妻子艾拉挽着手臂，站在面前。他们望着你，眼里满是恨意。那目光几"
"乎让你觉得自己罪有应得，可你根本不知道为什么。他们的手指不断伸长，化作刮擦石地的利爪，身"
"体也扭曲变形，渐渐没了人样。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is where my people went, all those years ago!"
msgstr "多年前，我的族人就是去了这里！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is the culmination of everything they worked towards."
msgstr "他们为之付出的一切，最后换来的就是这个。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Look upon it and weep."
msgstr "看吧，哭吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's all we have left."
msgstr "我们能做的，也只剩这些了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You pull [Companion Name] to her feet. She is breathless, but her body moves on "
"instinct as Era swipes towards her. You hear a clash of metal and hope it was enough. \n"
"\n"
"You barely have time to defend yourself as Talm's full weight slams into you, sending "
"the two of you careening towards the edge of the stone platform. You now see that you "
"stand on disk, and that over the edges of the platform lead to... nothing.\n"
"\n"
"You turn back towards Talm, ready to face him... it... head on."
msgstr ""
"你把[Companion Name]拉起来。她还没喘过气，艾拉已经挥爪扑来。她的身体本能地做出了反应。你"
"听见金属相撞的声音，只盼她挡住了这一击。\n"
"\n"
"你几乎来不及招架，塔尔姆便整个撞了上来，带着你一起冲向石台边缘。这时你才看清，脚下是一座"
"圆形平台，而平台之外……空无一物。\n"
"\n"
"你转向塔尔姆，准备正面迎战他……不，是它。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Talm's broken body lays before you. You hold your weapon in front of you, knowing that "
"the moment you look away, it'll lunge for you, looking to take advantage of your "
"weakness. Your breaths come in ragged heaves. The chance that you'd even be able to "
"fend off a casual swat of Talm's claws is bordering on zero, but you stand at the ready "
"regardless. You lost track of [Companion Name] ages ago, and can only hope that she was "
"able to hold Era off.\n"
"\n"
"You stare at the corpse as long as you can, your whole body threatening to collapse. "
"You risk a blink of your eyes... and he's gone. Replaced by the Talm you know. Mostly.\n"
"\n"
"The man before you wears a bright white crown of bone, and regal garb made of blackened "
"leather. You can tell that it's... alive. But life may be be a stretch for the "
"sorrowful creature wrapped around his body. He lets gives you a slow clap, before "
"turning to Era, who dons similar 'clothes'. He whispers something you cannot hear to "
"her, and she smiles slightly.\n"
"\n"
"You take a step back, consciousness fading. Your weapon wavers, but does not fall.\n"
"\n"
"The platform beneath you shifts and begins to descend into darkness."
msgstr ""
"塔尔姆残破的躯体倒在你面前。你把武器横在身前，知道只要移开视线，它就会趁虚而入，再次扑上"
"来。你大口喘着气，呼吸断断续续。此刻，塔尔姆哪怕随手挥上一爪，你恐怕都挡不住，可你仍然摆"
"着迎战的架势。你早已顾不上留意[Companion Name]，只能盼着她挡住了艾拉。\n"
"\n"
"你拼命盯着那具尸体，浑身却已经快撑不住了。你冒险眨了一下眼……他不见了。站在那里的，换成了"
"你熟悉的塔尔姆。至少大致还是那副模样。\n"
"\n"
"眼前的男人头戴莹白的骨冠，身披黑色皮革制成的华贵衣袍。你看得出来，那身衣服……是活的。可裹"
"在他身上的那个可悲生物，如今这样，恐怕也很难说是“活着”。他慢慢拍了几下手，随后转向艾拉。"
"她也穿着类似的“衣服”。他凑过去低声说了句什么，你听不清。艾拉微微一笑。\n"
"\n"
"你退了一步，意识渐渐模糊。手中的武器晃了晃，却始终没有放下。\n"
"\n"
"脚下的平台开始移动，缓缓沉入黑暗。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "MQ18"
msgstr "MQ18"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What Comes After - After surviving Talm's initial onslaught, what will become of you "
"next?"
msgstr "此后何往——你挺过了塔尔姆的第一轮猛攻，接下来又将面临什么？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What can you tell me? (Divination)"
msgstr "你能告诉我什么？（占卜）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I feel it coming to me. (Divination)"
msgstr "……我感觉到了。（占卜）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The chamber's walls shift as the platform you stand upon descends. Talm's regal form "
"slowly begins to bleed into the darkness as the ground shifts beneath you, descending "
"lower and lower. You try to keep your eyes trained on him, but without moving he fades "
"from your vision. Fatigue sets in as your tense body begins to give out without a "
"target in front of you.\n"
"\n"
"As the gloom begins to swallow you, you feel... warm. At peace. Mentally, you lash out, "
"knowing that something is wrong, but you've pushed yourself beyond your limits. Your "
"weapon slips from your grasp as you collapse sideways. You don't even feel the cold "
"stone floor as you fall. Only warmth.\n"
"\n"
"You dream.\n"
"\n"
"You wear dark grey robe made of a material that dances and swirls chaotically whenever "
"you take your eyes off of it. You stand amidst an endless sea of bodies. Your chest "
"wracks with silent sobs as you gaze upon them, not at all comforted by their peaceful "
"smiles. As you walk amongst them, you make it to your king and lift the pearly white "
"bone crown from his cold brow.\n"
"\n"
"The weight it holds is incomparable to that which still rests on your shoulders. "
"There's still so much work to do.\n"
"\n"
"You awaken with a start and find yourself warm... but not cloying so. You're wrapped in "
"devilishly silken sheets and buried in a bed so plush you fear your worn body won't be "
"able to rise. Era stands far on the opposite corner of the room, stoking a fireplace of "
"smooth, black stone.\n"
"\n"
"You try to move, but every inch of your body screams in protest, and your groan catches "
"her attention. She looks at you with... what'd seem to be genuine concern had she and "
"her husband not just tried to kill you. You involuntarily shudder as she drops her "
"bundle of wood and rushes to your side. She tries to begin speaking several times, "
"before sighing and offering a small chuckle."
msgstr ""
"脚下的平台缓缓下降，四周的墙壁也随之移动。平台越降越深，塔尔姆那身华贵的装束也渐渐隐入黑"
"暗。你竭力盯住他，可他明明站着没动，身影却从你眼前一点点消失了。眼前没了需要提防的敌人，"
"疲惫顿时涌了上来，紧绷的身体再也支撑不住。\n"
"\n"
"黑暗渐渐将你吞没，你却感到……温暖。安宁。你知道不对劲，拼命想要抗拒，可身体早已撑过了极"
"限。武器从手中滑落，你向一旁倒去。倒下时，你甚至感觉不到石地的冰冷。只有温暖。\n"
"\n"
"你做了一个梦。\n"
"\n"
"你穿着一件深灰色长袍。只要目光稍稍移开，袍子的布料便会疯狂地翻涌、旋动。你站在无数躺倒的"
"人中间，一眼望不到尽头。望着他们，你无声地抽泣，胸口阵阵痉挛。他们脸上安详的笑容丝毫不能"
"让你好受一些。你从他们之间走过，来到国王身边，从他冰冷的额上取下那顶珍珠般洁白的骨冠。\n"
"\n"
"骨冠的分量，远不及你肩上仍未卸下的重担。还有太多事等着你去做。你猛然惊醒，身上暖暖的……这"
"次却没有那种令人不适的感觉。裹着你的床单滑软得不可思议，床铺柔软得让你整个人都陷了进去。"
"你甚至担心，这副疲惫不堪的身体还能不能爬起来。艾拉站在房间另一头的角落，正在拨弄壁炉里的"
"火。壁炉由光滑的黑石砌成。\n"
"\n"
"你试着动了动，浑身上下却无一处不疼。你呻吟了一声，引起了她的注意。她望向你，眼神里透着……"
"关切。要不是她和丈夫刚刚还想杀了你，你几乎会相信那是真心的。她放下怀里的木柴，快步赶到床"
"边。你不由自主地打了个寒战。她几次欲言又止，最后叹了口气，轻轻笑了一声。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hello darling... How do you feel?"
msgstr "你醒了，亲爱的……感觉怎么样？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...what do you want? Why am I here? Is..."
msgstr "……你想干什么？我为什么会在这里？她……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is [Companion Name] still..?"
msgstr "[Companion Name]还……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Yes. She's alright. Recovering, like you, though she got it a bit rougher than you did."
msgstr "还活着。她没事。跟你一样，还在恢复。不过她伤得比你重些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Talm and I will explain in more detail as we can, but I know you must have several "
"thousand questions, my child. I will do my best to answer them, but you'll come to "
"learn more in time. Even here, there are laws that dictate against what I can and "
"cannot speak."
msgstr ""
"孩子，我知道你一定有无数个问题。能解释的，我和塔尔姆都会慢慢向你解释。我会尽力回答，剩下"
"的，你以后也会逐渐明白。即使在这里，我能说什么、不能说什么，也仍受法则约束。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to Respite. We're within the domain of the Lifebinders, a... world between "
"worlds, so-to-speak. It was created as a safe haven during the calamity that brought "
"Talm and I together."
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到安歇之境。这里是生命缚誓者的领域，可以说是……世界之间的另一个世界。当年那场灾难让"
"我和塔尔姆走到了一起，这里也是在那时建成的，为的是给人们一处避难之所。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"I presume you found the entrance from your pilfered book, yes? The book came from here, "
"and was written for Lifebinder children to act as a source of comfort while the world "
"fell apart around them."
msgstr ""
"我想，你们是从偷来的那本书里找到入口的，对吧？那本书出自这里，是写给生命缚誓者的孩子们"
"的。外面的世界正在分崩离析，大人们希望它多少能给孩子们一些安慰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How could that book, or this place, bring anyone comfort?"
msgstr "那本书，还有这个地方，到底哪里能让人觉得安慰了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"What you've seen of Respite was it's entrance. The beast at the front, its guardian. "
"There are many that would have wished to see Respite burn."
msgstr ""
"你们先前看到的，只是安歇之境的入口。入口处的那头野兽，是这里的守卫。当年，想毁掉安歇之境"
"的人可不少。"

