#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_view.tscn
msgid ""
"Happy Animals, happy farm.\n"
"[ul]Calculated based on the three other stats.\n"
"[b]Skill XP[/b] & [b]Produce[/b] is multiplied by the Animal's [b]Happiness[/b].\n"
"Cannot go below [color=orange]0%[/color].[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"[i]Happiness = Hunger * 0.3 + Comfort * 0.3 + Satisfaction * 0.4[/i]\n"
"Note: [b]Comfort[/b] is [color=green]1[/color] if >= [color=orange]75%[/color]"
msgstr ""
"动物开心，牧场舒心。[ul]根据另外三项属性计算。\n"
"[b]技能经验[/b]和[b]产出[/b]均乘以动物的[b]幸福度[/b]。最低为[color=orange]0%[/color]。"
"[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"[i]幸福度 = 饱食度 * 0.3 + 舒适度 * 0.3 + 满足度 * 0.4[/i]\n"
"注意：[b]舒适度[/b] >= [color=orange]75%[/color]时，按[color=green]1[/color]计算"

#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_view.tscn Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "Hunger"
msgstr "饱食度"

#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_view.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Keep your animals fed every hour.\n"
"Reduces by [color=orange]10%[/color] every hour an animal is not fed :(\n"
"Replenish to [color=orange]100%[/color] when fed :D\n"
"Some animals don't need food (Like Sheep or Cows).\n"
"Your animal won't die at [color=orange]0%[/color] [b]Hunger[/b], but my goodness it "
"will be STARVING.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]记得每小时喂一次动物。\n"
"每有一小时没喂食，就降低[color=orange]10%[/color] :(b喂食后恢复至[color=orange]100%[/"
"color] :D\n"
"有些动物不需要喂食，比如绵羊和奶牛。\n"
"[b]饱食度[/b]降到[color=orange]0%[/color]时，动物不会死，可怜的小家伙却要饿得前胸贴后背"
"了。[/ul]"

#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_view.tscn Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "Comfort"
msgstr "舒适度"

#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_view.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Equals the [b]Maintenance[/b] value of this Enclosure.\n"
"Repair the Enclosure to maintain this stat, simple.\n"
"Has no effect on [b]Happiness[/b] until it falls below [color=orange]75%[/color][/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]等于所在围栏的[b]完好度[/b]。\n"
"修理围栏就能维持这项数值，就这么简单。\n"
"只有降至[color=orange]75%[/color]以下时，才会影响[b]幸福度[/b]。[/ul]"

#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_view.tscn Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "Satisfaction"
msgstr "满足度"

#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_view.tscn
