"[ul]Animals have needs & wants that provide [b]Satisfaction[/b].\n"
"Maintain these, and you'll be rewarded with very happy animals.[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"Hover over an animal to see their [b]Satisfaction Checklist[/b]. Every animal of the "
"same type has the same list."
msgstr ""
"[ul]照顾动物的需求和喜好，可以提升[b]满足度[/b]。\n"
"把这些照顾好了，动物们自然就会开开心心。[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"将鼠标移到动物上方，即可查看其[b]满足度需求清单[/b]。同种动物的清单相同。"

