#: MainMenu/steam_next_fest_popup.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#E9DFC1]Thank you for trying our Demo!\n"
"\n"
"Melvor Idle 2 is still in active development, and the version you're about to play is "
"an [color=FFD16D]early limited look at the game[/color]. Many systems, features, "
"visuals, and balance are still being developed and refined as we work towards an Early "
"Access release.\n"
"\n"
"For this demo, progression is limited to [color=FFD16D]Level 60[/color], with only a "
"limited selection of Skills and content available to test out. The Early Access release "
"will have far more content available!\n"
"\n"
"As this is an early build, you may encounter unfinished content, balance that isn't "
"quite right, missing features, or bugs.\n"
"\n"
"Your feedback during this Demo period is incredibly valuable to us. We'd love to hear "
"about your experience, any bugs you may have encountered, or general discussions around "
"the game.\n"
"\n"
"Most importantly, have fun, explore, experiment, and enjoy your first steps into Melvor "
"Idle 2!\n"
"\n"
"And remember - [color=FFD16D]Melvor Idle 2 is an idle game![/color] You can set your "
"character on a task, let them make progress in the background, and check out some of "
"the other great games that have a Demo for you to try. Melvor will be here when you get "
"back!\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for being part of the journey![/color]\n"
"\n"
"- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs, Coolrox, Prat, Tapi & Ash[/color][/i]"
msgstr ""
"[color=#E9DFC1]感谢你体验我们的试玩版！《梅尔沃放置2》仍在开发中，你即将体验的版本仅展示"
"了[color=FFD16D]游戏早期的一部分内容[/color]。为了迎接抢先体验版的推出，我们还在持续开发"
"和完善各项系统、功能、画面及平衡性。\n"
"\n"
"本试玩版的等级上限为[color=FFD16D]60级[/color]，仅开放部分技能和内容供你体验。抢先体验版"
"将带来丰富得多的内容！\n"
"\n"
"由于这还是早期版本，你可能会遇到尚未完成的内容、不够合理的平衡性、缺失的功能或程序错"
"误。\n"
"\n"
"试玩期间，你的反馈对我们非常宝贵。欢迎分享游玩感受、反馈遇到的错误，也欢迎聊聊你对游戏的"
"看法。\n"
"\n"
"最重要的是玩得开心！尽情探索，大胆尝试，好好享受你在《梅尔沃放置2》中迈出的第一步吧！\n"
"\n"
"别忘了，[color=FFD16D]《梅尔沃放置2》是一款放置游戏！[/color]你可以给角色安排一项任务，"
"让角色在后台继续忙碌，自己去体验其他精彩游戏的试玩版。等你回来，梅尔沃还在这里等着你！\n"
"\n"
"感谢你一路相伴！[/color]\n"
"\n"
"- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs、Coolrox、Prat、Tapi 和Ash[/color][/i]"

