msgstr "技能难度："

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Specialised Equipment"
msgstr "制造专用装备"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use materials obtained from Hunting and Combat to create various types of specialised "
"equipment."
msgstr "使用狩猎和战斗中获得的材料，制作各类专用装备。"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Slayer Equipment"
msgstr "屠杀者装备"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Craft powerful Slayer weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness during Slayer "
"training for all Melee, Ranged and Magic"
msgstr "制造强力的屠杀者武器和盔甲，提升近战、远程和魔法流派在屠杀者训练中的战斗表现"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Consumables & Accessories"
msgstr "消耗品和饰品"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Consumables and Accessories that provide useful bonuses to various skills."
msgstr "制作消耗品和饰品，为各项技能提供实用加成。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Difficulty: "
msgstr "难度："

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "to"
msgstr "至"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "General Info"
msgstr "基本信息"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Fight Enemies"
msgstr "与敌人战斗"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Battle enemies to gain [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] and collect valuable "
"rewards as loot. [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] is granted based on the "
"[color=#FFD16D]weapon damage[/color] you deal."
msgstr ""
"与敌人战斗，获得[color=#FFD16D]战斗技能经验[/color]并收集珍贵奖励作为战利品。获得的"
"[color=#FFD16D]战斗技能经验[/color]取决于你造成的[color=#FFD16D]武器伤害[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Choose a Combat Area"
msgstr "选择战斗区域"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Select from [color=#FFD16D]Combat Areas, Slayer Zones[/color] or "
"[color=#FFD16D]Dungeons[/color] to find different enemies to battle."
msgstr ""
"选择[color=#FFD16D]战斗区域、屠杀者区域[/color]或[color=#FFD16D]地牢[/color]，挑战不同的"
"敌人。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Automatic Healing via Auto Eat"
msgstr "通过自动进食恢复生命值"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Equip [u]Food[/u][/color] to automatically restore Health when it falls "
"below a set threshold, helping you survive longer battles.\n"
"\n"
"More information is contained by hovering over the [color=#FFD16D]Auto Eat icon on your "
"Health Bar[/color]."
msgstr ""
"[color=#FFD16D]装备[u]食物[/u][/color]后，生命值低于设定阈值时会自动恢复，帮助你应对更持"
"久的战斗。\n"
"\n"
"将鼠标移到[color=#FFD16D]生命条上的自动进食图标[/color]上，即可查看详细说明。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Combat Styles"
msgstr "战斗风格"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"There are three Combat Styles: [color=#FFD16D]Melee, Ranged[/color] and "
"[color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]. Your equipped [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] determines "
"which style you use.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color]\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color]\n"
"\n"
"Beating a Combat Style [color=green]increases your Max Hit by 10%[/color], while losing "
"[color=orange_red]decreases it by 10%[/color]. This is only applied to you, and never "
"the Enemy."
msgstr ""
"战斗风格分为三种：[color=#FFD16D]近战、远程[/color]和[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]。\n"
"你使用哪种风格，取决于所装备的[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]。\n"
"\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]近战[/color]克制[color=#FFD16D]远程[/color][color=#FFD16D]远程[/color]克"
"制[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color][color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]克制[color=#FFD16D]近战[/"
"color]\n"
"\n"
"克制敌人的战斗风格时，你的[color=green]最大伤害提高10%[/color]；被克制时则"
"[color=orange_red]降低10%[/color]。此效果仅对你生效，不对敌人生效。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Ranged required Ammunition"
msgstr "远程需要弹药"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Using the [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Ranged "
"Weapon[/color] plus its [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]. For example, using a [u]Bow[/"
"u] requires [u]Arrows[/u] as ammunition primarily obtained from Fletching.\n"
"\n"
"Some [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapons[/color] like [u]Javelins[/u] can be their own "
"[color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]."
msgstr ""
"使用[color=#FFD16D]远程战斗风格[/color]需要装备[color=#FFD16D]远程武器[/color]及其对应的"
"[color=#FFD16D]弹药[/color]。例如，[u]弓[/u]需要用[u]箭矢[/u]作为弹药，箭矢主要通过弓匠"
"技能获取。\n"
"\n"
"某些[color=#FFD16D]远程武器[/color]本身也可充当[color=#FFD16D]弹药[/color]，例如[u]标枪"
"[/u]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Magic requires Runes"
msgstr "魔法需要符文"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"The [color=#FFD16D]Magic Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapon[/"
"color] in combination with the the use of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color]. These cost "
"[u]Runes[/u] primarily obtained from Runecrafting."
msgstr ""
"使用[color=#FFD16D]魔法战斗风格[/color]需要装备[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]，并配合"
"[color=aqua]魔法咒语[/color]。施放咒语会消耗[u]符文[/u]，符文主要通过符文锻造获取。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Stances"
msgstr "姿态"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Combat Stances"
msgstr "战斗姿态"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each weapon has different [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] to choose from. Your selected "
"[color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color] determines which Combat Skills gain XP."
msgstr ""
"每种武器都有不同的[color=#FFD16D]姿态[/color]可选。你选择的[color=#FFD16D]姿态[/color]决"
"定哪些战斗技能获得经验。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Weapon choice matters"
msgstr "武器选择很重要"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"The [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] you use determines the [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] "
"available to choose from. Not all [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color] have access to all "
"[color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color]."
msgstr ""
"可选的[color=#FFD16D]姿态[/color]取决于你使用的[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]。并非每种"
"[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]都能使用全部[color=#FFD16D]姿态[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn Entities/Combat/offensive_stats_container.tscn
msgid "Chance to Hit"
msgstr "命中几率"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Take a look at the [color=#FFD16D]Equipment Stats[/color] tab to see how this is "
"calculated in relation to your [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color]."
msgstr ""
"查看[color=#FFD16D]装备属性[/color]面板，了解命中几率如何根据你的[color=#FFD16D]姿态[/"
"color]计算。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn Entities/Combat/view_player_stats_panel.tscn
msgid "Equipment Stats"
msgstr "装备属性"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Accuracy & Evasion"
msgstr "精准和躲避"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Your [color=#FFD16D]chance to hit[/color] depends on your [color=#FFD16D]Stance's "
"Accuracy[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Evasion[/color] against that "
"same [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color].\n"
"\n"
"When fighting an Enemy, aim to have a higher [color=#FFD16D]Accuracy Rating[/color] "
"than their [color=#FFD16D]Evasion Rating[/color]."
msgstr ""
"你的[color=#FFD16D]命中几率[/color]取决于当前[color=#FFD16D]姿态的精准值[/color]，以及"
"[color=#FFD16D]敌人[/color]针对该[color=#FFD16D]姿态[/color]的[color=#FFD16D]躲避值[/"
"color]。与敌人战斗时，尽量让你的[color=#FFD16D]精准值[/color]高于对方的[color=#FFD16D]躲"
"避值[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Power & Protection"
msgstr "战力和防护"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Damage from attacks is reduced by a percentage depending on [color=#FFD16D]Power[/"
"color] and [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n"
"\n"
"Your [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Protection[/"
"color] determines how much of your damage is reduced. Higher [color=#FFD16D]Power[/"
"color] helps overcome enemy [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n"
"\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] is primarily obtained from [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/"
"color].\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color] is primarily obtained from other gear.\n"
"\n"
"You can reduce an Enemy's damage dealt to you by increasing your "
"[color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color]."
msgstr ""
"攻击伤害会按一定比例减免，减免幅度取决于[color=#FFD16D]战力[/color]和[color=#FFD16D]防护"
"[/color]。你的[color=#FFD16D]战力[/color]和[color=#FFD16D]敌人防护[/color]的对比，决定你"
"造成的伤害会被减免多少。提高[color=#FFD16D]战力[/color]有助于突破敌人的[color=#FFD16D]防"
"护[/color]。[color=#FFD16D]战力[/color]主要来自[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]。\n"
"\n"
"[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]主要来自其他装备。\n"
"\n"
"提高[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]可以减少敌人对你造成的伤害。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Magic Elements"
msgstr "魔法元素"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapons[/color] have [color=#FFD16D]Elements[/color] attached to "
"them which determine what type of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color] you can use in "
"Combat.\n"
"\n"
"Monsters may also have an [color=#FFD16D]Element[/color], which can either buff or "
"debuff your character.\n"
"\n"
"Beating an Element grants you with [color=green]+15% Max Hit[/color].\n"
"Losing to an Element debuffs you with [color=orange_red]-15% Max Hit[/color].\n"
"\n"
"This is only applied to you, and never to the Enemy."
msgstr ""
"[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]带有[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，决定你在战斗中可以使用哪"
"类[color=aqua]魔法咒语[/color]。\n"
"\n"
"怪物也可能带有[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，从而使你的角色获得增益或减益。\n"
"\n"
"元素克制对方时，你的[color=green]最大伤害 +15%[/color]。\n"
"元素克制失败时，你会受到[color=orange_red]最大伤害-15%[/color]的减益。\n"
"\n"
"此效果仅对你生效，不对敌人生效。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Air:\n"
"[ul]Beats Earth\n"
"Loses to Fire[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"大气：\n"
"[ul]克制大地\n"
"被火焰克制[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Earth:\n"
"[ul]Beats Water\n"
"Loses to Air[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"大地：\n"
"[ul]克制水域\n"
"被大气克制[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Water:\n"
"[ul]Beats Fire\n"
"Loses to Earth[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"水域：\n"
"[ul]克制火焰\n"
"被大地克制[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Fire:\n"
"[ul]Beats Air\n"
"Loses to Water[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"火焰：\n"
"[ul]克制大气\n"
"被水域克制[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Neutral has no effect."
msgstr "中性无影响。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Using Prayers"
msgstr "使用祝祭"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color] are toggleable passive effects that can buff your "
"Character. These cost [color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] to remain active."
msgstr ""
"[color=#FFD16D]祝祭[/color]是可以开启或关闭的被动效果，能为角色提供增益。\n"
"维持祝祭需要消耗[color=#FFD16D]祝祭点[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Obtaining Prayer Points"
msgstr "获取祝祭点"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] are obtained by burying [u]Bones[/u] dropped from "
"slain Enemies (via your Bank), or through other methods such as Firemaking."
msgstr ""
"在仓库中埋葬击杀敌人后掉落的[u]骨头[/u]，即可获得[color=#FFD16D]祝祭点[/color]。生火等其"
"他途径也能提供祝祭点。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Prayer XP"
msgstr "祝祭经验"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=#FFD16D]Prayer XP[/color] is gained while actively using [color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/"
"color]. Your damage dealt and cost of the Prayer determines the XP gained, with higher "
"cost Prayers providing more XP per damage."
msgstr ""
"使用[color=#FFD16D]祝祭[/color]时可获得[color=#FFD16D]祝祭经验[/color]。\n"
"经验获取量取决于你造成的伤害和祝祭的消耗；祝祭消耗越高，每点伤害带来的经验就越多。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cook Food"
msgstr "烹饪食物"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Cook various types of Food to restore Health when consumed. Some Food also provides "
"special bonuses when used."
msgstr ""
"烹饪各类食物，食用后可恢复生命值。\n"
"部分食物在使用时还能提供特殊加成。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cooking Success Chance"
msgstr "烹饪成功几率"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Your chance to successfully cook Food depends on your Cooking Proficiency compared to "
"the Food's Difficulty.\n"
"\n"
"Cooking Proficiency can be increased by leveling Cooking, equipping Items, or via the "
"Shop or other Skills."
msgstr ""
"烹饪成功几率取决于你的烹饪精通和食物难度的对比。\n"
"\n"
"提升烹饪等级、装备物品，或利用商店及其他技能，都能提高烹饪精通。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Bait"
msgstr "制作诱饵"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Cooking to create Bait that helps with Fishing and Hunting."
msgstr "通过烹饪制作诱饵，辅助钓鱼和狩猎。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Skill Synergies"
msgstr "技能协同"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Ranged Armour"
msgstr "制造远程盔甲"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Leather-based armour for use in Ranged Combat."
msgstr "制作以皮革为主要材料的盔甲，用于远程战斗。"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Materials"
msgstr "制作材料"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft materials and components used in other skills."
msgstr "制造其他技能所需的材料和部件。"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Hunting Traps"
msgstr "制作狩猎陷阱"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Traps used to catch creatures in Hunting."
msgstr "制造陷阱，用于在狩猎中捕捉生物。"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Jewellery"
msgstr "制造珠宝"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Jewellery that provides various bonuses when equipped."
msgstr "制作珠宝，装备后可获得各种加成。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "This is a Passive Skill which progresses while you play the game."
msgstr "这是一项被动技能，会在你游玩时持续推进。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Grow Crops"
msgstr "种植作物"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Purchase Farming Plots and plant Seeds to grow various types of Crops."
msgstr "购买农务田地，播下种子，种植各类作物。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crop Care"
msgstr "作物养护"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Protect Crops from Pests and Disease, and keep them Watered to maximise their rewards."
msgstr "为作物防治害虫和疾病，并及时浇水，以获得最大收益。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crop Types"
msgstr "作物类型"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Grow Allotments for Cooking, Herbs for Herblore, Trees for Skill XP, and Orchard Trees "
"for Fruit."
msgstr ""
"种植农作物可供烹饪使用，种植草药可供草药学使用，种植树木可获得技能经验，种植果树则可收获"
"水果。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Composting"
msgstr "施肥"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use Compost Bins to create Compost, which can be applied to Crops to increase their "
"output."
msgstr "使用堆肥箱制造肥料，为作物施肥以提高产量。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Grain Mill"
msgstr "谷物磨坊"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use the Grain Mill to produce Grain for Ranching, and Flour and Sugar for Cooking."
msgstr "使用谷物磨坊生产畜牧所需的谷物，以及烹饪所需的面粉和糖。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Farming Automation"
msgstr "农务自动化"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Automate Planting, Harvesting, Watering and Composting to manage your Crops "
"automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Automation consumes Wine to operate."
msgstr ""
"开启自动种植、收获、浇水和施肥，自动管理作物。\n"
"\n"
"自动化运行需要消耗葡萄酒。"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Burn Logs"
msgstr "燃烧原木"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Burn Logs to gain Firemaking XP and a chance to receive random item rewards."
msgstr "燃烧原木可获得生火经验，还有几率获得随机物品奖励。"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Light Lanterns"
msgstr "点亮提灯"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Use Firemaking to light Lanterns, providing you with Light to take on Dark Combat Areas."
msgstr "通过生火点亮提灯，为挑战黑暗战斗区域提供照明。"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Gain Prayer Points"
msgstr "获取祝祭点"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Burn special Prayer-related items obtained from Combat to gain Prayer Points (used to "
"train the Prayer Skill)."
msgstr "燃烧战斗中获得的祝祭相关特殊物品，可获得祝祭点，用于训练祝祭技能。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select a location and a fishing spot to begin catching Fish."
msgstr "选择地点和钓点，即可开始钓鱼。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Random Catches"
msgstr "随机鱼获"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Many fishing spots contain multiple types of Fish. Each catch randomly determines which "
"Fish you receive."
msgstr "许多钓点都有多种鱼类。每次钓到哪种鱼由随机判定决定。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "There is a chance to catch Junk instead of Fish."
msgstr "也有可能钓到垃圾，而不是鱼。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Some fishing spots offer special items that you can collect while fishing."
msgstr "在部分钓点钓鱼时，还能获得特殊物品。"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Ranged Equipment"
msgstr "制造远程装备"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Create various types of Ranged weapons and ammunition for use in Combat.\n"
"\n"
"Some weapons require a certain type of ammunition, while others can be used "
"individually."
msgstr ""
"制作各类远程武器和弹药，用于战斗。\n"
"\n"
"部分武器需要搭配特定弹药，另一些则可单独使用。"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crafting Steps"
msgstr "制造步骤"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each item requires a set number of steps to complete. Ingredients are consumed and "
"rewards are granted upon completion."
msgstr ""
"每件物品都需要经过一定数量的步骤才能完成制作。\n"
"制作完成时消耗材料，并发放奖励。"

#: Tutorials/header_tutorial_button.tscn
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "指南"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn Entities/Hunting/hunting_tracking_view.tscn
msgid "Hunt Animals"
msgstr "狩猎动物"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Hunt various animals to collect rewards. Each animal requires a specific type of Trap, "
"created through Crafting."
msgstr "狩猎各类动物以获取奖励。捕捉每种动物都需要特定类型的陷阱，可通过制造技能制作。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "The Hunting Process"
msgstr "狩猎流程"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Hunting is automatic and involves three stages: Surveying an area, Tracking an animal, "
"and attempting to Trap it.\n"
"\n"
"If trapping fails, the animal flees and must be tracked again."
msgstr ""
"狩猎会自动进行，分为三个阶段：调查区域、追踪动物，以及布置陷阱尝试捕捉。若捕捉失败，动物"
"就会逃走，需要重新追踪。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Levels"
msgstr "动物等级"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each animal has its own Level and XP. Successfully hunting an animal increases its XP, "
"unlocking bonuses as it levels up."
msgstr "每种动物都有独立的等级和经验。成功狩猎可增加对应动物的经验，升级后可解锁加成。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Size & Weight"
msgstr "动物体型和体重"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Animals come in different Sizes and Weights. Larger and heavier animals provide greater "
"rewards when caught."
msgstr "动物的体型和体重各不相同。捕获的动物越大、越重，奖励就越丰厚。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Rare Discoveries"
msgstr "稀有发现"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Discover rare animal species and collect special rewards while Hunting."
msgstr "狩猎时可发现稀有动物品种，并获得特殊奖励。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What is Hunting?"
msgstr "什么是狩猎？"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Hunting is a Skill that tasks you to hunt a variety of wild Animals & Beasts in order "
"to acquire their rewards.\n"
"\n"
"Hunting feeds directly into [b]Beastcrafting[/b] as its primary use, while also "
"rewarding you with various other Items such as [b]Herb Seeds[/b] and [b]Bones[/b]"
msgstr ""
"狩猎是一项通过猎捕各种野生动物和野兽来获取奖励的技能。\n"
"\n"
"狩猎主要为[b]兽工造物[/b]提供材料，同时也能获得[b]草药种子[/b]、[b]骨头[/b]等其他物品"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What do I do?"
msgstr "我该怎么做？"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Before you can hunt, you must craft a Trap in Crafting.\n"
"\n"
"Each Animal requires a specific Trap, which is listed in Hunting when you select the "
"Animal.\n"
"\n"
"You can then hunt the Animal, which is an automatic 3-step process, rewarding you with "
"Skill XP and Items upon successfully trapping the Animal."
msgstr ""
"开始狩猎前，必须先通过制造技能制作陷阱。\n"
"\n"
"每种动物都需要特定陷阱。在狩猎界面选中动物，即可查看所需陷阱。\n"
"\n"
"随后便可开始狩猎。整个过程分为三个步骤，均会自动进行；成功捕获动物后，即可获得技能经验和"
"物品。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "The automatic 3-step Hunting process"
msgstr "自动狩猎的三个步骤"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Step 1 - Surveying\n"
"[ul]Search the location to find the Animal’s tracks.[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"Step 2 - Tracking\n"
"[ul]YFollow the tracks to locate the Animal.[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"Step 3 - Trapping\n"
"[ul]Use your crafted Trap and attempt to catch it.\n"
"Failing sends the Animal fleeing, returning you to Tracking.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"步骤1 - 调查\n"
"[ul]搜索当前地点，寻找动物的踪迹。[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"步骤2 - 追踪\n"
"[ul]沿着踪迹找到动物。[/ul]\n"
"\n"
"步骤3 - 陷阱布置\n"
"[ul]使用制作好的陷阱，尝试捕捉动物。\n"
"若捕捉失败，动物会逃走，你将返回追踪阶段。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] "
"[b]Happiness[/b] is calculated as the average of these 3 substats:"
msgstr ""
"[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]"
"取以下三项数值的平均值："

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Keep your Animals fed every hour.\n"
"Lose 10% every hour an Animal is not fed.\n"
"Replenish to 100% when fed.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]记得每小时喂一次动物。\n"
"每有一小时没喂食，就降低10%。\n"
"喂食后恢复至100%。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Keep Enclosures repaired as they degrade by 1% every hour.\n"
"This does not affect Animal's Happiness until it falls below 75%.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]围栏的完好度每小时降低1%，记得及时修理。\n"
"只有降至75%以下时，才会影响动物的幸福度。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[ul]Animals have unique needs that can be met to boost Satisfaction.\n"
"Managing this allows Happiness to increase above 100%.[/ul]"
msgstr ""
"[ul]每种动物都有各自的需求，满足这些需求可提升满足度。\n"
"照顾好这些需求，可以让幸福度超过100%。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"[color=green]Begin the Skill by purchasing your first plot of [b][color=white]Land[/"
"color][/b] and building an [b][color=white]Enclosure[/color][/b].[/color]"
msgstr ""
"[color=green]购买第一块[b][color=white]地块[/color][/b]，并建造[b][color=white]围栏[/"
"color][/b]，即可开始训练此技能。[/color]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
#: Entities/Quests/act_progressed_popup.tscn
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select a rock to begin mining for Ore, Essence, Gems and other rewards."
msgstr "选择岩石开始采矿，获取矿石、精华、宝石和其他奖励。"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Breaking Rocks"
msgstr "击碎岩石"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Each hit has a chance to break the rock. If the Rock Break Bar reaches 100%, the rock "
"automatically breaks."
msgstr "每次敲击都有几率击碎岩石。当矿石碎裂进度条达到100%时，岩石会自动碎裂。"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Mining Rewards"
msgstr "采矿奖励"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Breaking a rock grants its rewards."
msgstr "击碎岩石即可获得对应奖励。"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Rewards Per Hit"
msgstr "每次敲击的奖励"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Some rocks also provide rewards with every hit, even before they break."
msgstr "部分岩石即使尚未碎裂，每次敲击也会提供奖励。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Raise Animals"
msgstr "饲养动物"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Purchase Land, build Enclosures, and buy Animals using Gold Pieces. Each Animal has a "
"limited lifespan before it moves on."
msgstr "使用金币购买地块、建造围栏并购买动物。每只动物在离开前寿命有限。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Feed Your Animals"
msgstr "喂养动物"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Most Animals require Food to stay healthy, while some can survive without being fed."
msgstr "大多数动物需要食物来保持健康，但有些动物无需喂食也能生存。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Happiness"
msgstr "动物幸福度"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Maintain your Animals' Comfort and increase their Satisfaction to improve the rewards "
"they produce."
msgstr "维持动物的舒适度并提高满足度，可增加它们提供的奖励。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Enclosure Maintenance"
msgstr "围栏维护"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Repair Enclosures to keep them in good condition, and give your Animals Pets to meet "
"their needs."
msgstr "修理围栏，使其保持完好，并抚摸动物以满足它们的需求。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Ranching Rewards"
msgstr "畜牧奖励"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Animals automatically produce XP and item rewards every hour. Proper care increases "
"their output."
msgstr "动物每小时会自动提供经验和物品奖励。悉心照料可提高产出。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What is Ranching?"
msgstr "什么是畜牧？"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"Ranching is a [b]Passive[/b] Skill designed to provide important raw resources used "
"around the game in a passive manner.\n"
"\n"
"It is not designed to be the primary source of these resources, but instead be a source "
"that can produce as you work on other Skills."
msgstr ""
"畜牧是一项[b]被动[/b]技能，可自动提供游戏各处所需的重要原材料。\n"
"\n"
"它并非这些资源的主要获取途径，而是让你在训练其他技能时，也能持续获得一些产出。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid ""
"You are tasked to purchase plots of [b]Land[/b] to build [b]Enclosures[/b] and look "
"after various types of [b]Animals[/b].\n"
"\n"
"Each [b]Animal[/b] has a [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/"
"happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] stat that needs to be managed, where your primary "
"goal is to keep this at or above 100%.\n"
"\n"
"[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]Skill XP[/b] and resources "
"are generated every 1 hour, multiplied by [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/"
"AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b]."
msgstr ""
"你需要购买[b]地块[/b]、建造[b]围栏[/b]，并照顾各种[b]动物[/b]。\n"
"\n"
"每只[b]动物[/b]都有需要照顾的[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/"
"happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]数值，你的主要目标是将其维持在100%或以上。\n"
"\n"
"每1小时提供一次[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]技能经验[/b]"
"和资源，数量均乘以[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/"
"img] [b]幸福度[/b]。"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Runes"
msgstr "锻造符文"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Runes required to cast Magic spells in Combat."
msgstr "制作符文，用于在战斗中施放魔法咒语。"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Magic Equipment"
msgstr "制作魔法装备"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Magic weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness in Combat."
msgstr "制造魔法武器和盔甲，提升战斗表现。"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Smelt Bars"
msgstr "熔炼矿石锭"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid ""
"Smelt Ores obtained from Mining into Bars used for crafting equipment and other items."
msgstr "将采矿获得的矿石熔炼成矿石锭，用于制造装备和其他物品。"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
